(1, '2015-02-18 23:15:50', 89, 'EMT', 'Found transformer was burnt', 'Removed the transformer & given to vendor for repair on 11th Feb. Vendor confirmed that secondary winding burnt.', 'Sushil', 'Yes', '', '', '', 'Transformer rewinding', 'Rs. 9500 approx.', '7 days', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Once repaired transformer is received, EMT will connect to the system & do dummy run.', '', '', ''),
(1, '2015-02-19 10:32:25', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Installed the repaired transformer. One successful dummy run done by Amit Ranshevare (co-SO).\r\nSystem is Up for usage.', 'Sushil', 'Raj Electric. Interaction was good', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Email for system Up has been sent by operator'),
(2, '2015-02-19 10:39:40', 89, 'EMT / Process', 'Process temperature is incorrect', 'Interacting with service engineer for the issue.\r\nHistorical file already sent as per engineer\'s request', 'Pradeep', 'Mr. Franck (Annealsys) & Amaresh (Elcamino)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Waiting for engineer\'s reply on the issue', '', '', 'Once reply received, EMT will troubleshoot further with operator (Pijush)'),
(3, '2015-02-19 13:03:50', 89, 'EMT', 'When checked the system, vacuum line was found loose', 'Reconnected back the vacuum line pipes (mask plate holder & main vacuum line) with teflon tape', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'System checked by Jayashree madam. It is working fine'),
