(11, '2015-02-20 11:49:45', 89, 'EMT', 'Rotary pump issue. Oil seen in the suction side', 'Pump has been already sent for repair 5th Feb 2015', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Once repaired pump is received it will be checked by EMT & then installed in the system', '', '', 'Pump will be received by 23rd Feb as per vendor\'s response'),
