(7, '2015-02-20 12:50:49', 89, 'EMT & Process', 'System down.\r\n1. Specimen mount is not rotating even rotation is 3 rpm.\r\n2. When timer is set, it is not showing any current in both guns.\r\n3. Also beam energy is 0 KeV (set energy value_ 4 Kev)', 'Email sent to engineer for solution on 19th Feb.\r\nEngineer replied. Work done on 2oth Feb at 11am (as per plan)\r\n\r\nWith the help of engineer over phone issue is solved.\r\nAr cylinder was empty & after replacement with new one, system is up', 'Punam', 'Harley instruments, quick response', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Email for system up is sent by Poonam Murkute'),
(14, '2015-02-23 12:30:26', 89, 'EMT & Process', '', 'System will be checked as per engineer\'s suggestion', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
