(18, '2015-02-26 13:00:42', 297, 'Electrical facility Team', 'this fault is seen last time when power failure was there. normally the UPS faults get reset once the UPS is switched off and restarted again.', 'UPS has been restarted thrice but fault is still there.\r\nUPS is in maintenance bypass mode', 'Rajendra, sanjay, irwin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Team is following this with the vendor.', '', '', 'irwin need to follow up this with vendor via email as well as phone'),
(15, '2015-02-26 16:18:41', 89, 'EMT', 'Cryo pump making noise due to phase issue. Cryo pump requires 3 phase motor controller, but now it is connected to 1 phase motor.', '3 phase motor controller ordered from APP systems. PO done. Details as follows:\r\nQuote received on 19th Dec\r\nPO process started on 27th Dec 2014\r\nPO sent to vendor on 22nd Jan 2015\r\nOrder acknowledgement done on 27th Jan 2015\r\nPayment done on 11th Feb 2015\r\nWaiting for material\r\nReminder sent to vendor', 'Pradeep, Vijay', 'APP systems', 'Mr. Jambunath', 'Good', '', '3 phase motor controller', 'USD 5050', '', '2015-03-15 00:00:00', 'Once parts are received, installation will be done', '', '', ''),
