(16, '2015-02-26 20:41:07', 89, 'EMT', '1. Baratron gauge not working\r\n2. View port broken', 'View port ordered.\r\nParts (view port) received & installed on 24th Feb 2015.\r\nOld baratron from Etch tuned as per manual & connected to system\r\nTool is up from hardware side. Dummy run will be done & tool will be released for processing.', '', 'AMAT', 'Applied Materials', 'Not Satisfactory', 'Procurement of parts takes a long time. \r\nFor this order, delivery took long', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Release the tool for processing.', '', '', ''),
