(12, '2015-02-26 21:41:13', 89, 'Process & Purchase', 'Issue: Scanners laser beam stops during the scan. Laser gets switched OFF after every 5 mins.\r\nScanners need repairing', 'Scanners sent to Agilent for repair.\r\nIt was received by vendor on 28th July 2014\r\nPO for repair was sent on 23rd Jan 2015\r\nPayment done\r\n\r\nAs per vendor\'s information, repaired scanners will be shipped in next 2 days (28th Feb 2015)', 'Neha, Vijay Ahire', 'Agilent Technologies', 'support_india@agilent.com, USA\r\nafm-support@agilent.com', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Repair of scanners', '4 lakhs', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Once repaired scanners are received, installation will be done with help of engineer', '', '', ''),
