(10, '2015-02-26 21:51:37', 89, '', '', 'As per vendor\'s suggestion, spinner sent to kolkatta office (SIMCO) on 30th Jan 2015\r\nOn diagnosis vendor confirmed that motor & motor controller need replacement\r\nHe will send quote for the parts', '', 'M/s Simco Global Technology & Systems Ltd.', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Once quote is received PO process will be started', '', '', ''),
