(284, '2016-04-06 09:28:03', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'There is degassing problem in PIPS,  because of this sample is no longer stay in the system, it\'s automatically vent.\r\nThinning of samples in PIPS is taking long time ( nearly 2 days for one sample). Earlier it was taking 2-3 hrs for GaAs samples and 6-8 hrs for Si samples and the samples also become black but there is no sign of perforation until the 2nd day', 'Vendor visited & given below comments.\r\nAMC visit from Harley Instruments for PIPS in which it was found that the bellow seal is not working anymore. It was informed by the engineer that this problem arises once in every 5-6 years; which is the life of this part.\r\nThus we need to issue a separate order for the below mentioned part urgently', 'Bhimraj, Sonali', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Order for the required part is in PO processing.', '', '', ''),
