(272, '2016-04-15 10:23:32', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Below troubleshooting was done for making dielectric sputter up:\r\n1. Gate valve leak issue solved\r\n2. He leak testing of complete chamber was done. No leak found at the base of chamber.\r\n3. Leak in the substrate rotate assembly was found.\r\nDismantled the complete assembly. Found the o-rings were damaged. Replaced with new ones in Amat stock\r\n4. Chamber cleaned with vacuum cleaner & IPA.\r\nNow vacuum reached 2.3 E-5 mbar in 45 mins.\r\nOvernight vacuum (2 days is 9.0 E-1mbar.\r\nSystem is working fine', 'Vinayak, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2016-04-15 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'The substrate rotating assembly was never opened in last 10 years. EMT has done successful repair of the leak issue.'),
