(294, '2016-04-26 09:34:08', 89, 'EMT', 'Found that the heater trips above 700deg C\r\nIt is also found that at 700deg C also, heater trips when chamber is put online', 'Troubleshooting done & found inner zone is shorted (open fault). \r\nHeater has been replaced with a one in spare (earlier used) on 25th April. Resistance of both inner & outer zone is showing 2.8 Ohm\r\nIt has been checked at 50deg C & 200deg C. It will ok as per the dual zone monitor page', 'Satish, Pradeep, Sushil, Ravi', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2016-04-26 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(294, '2016-04-27 12:15:14', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The replaced heater also trips above 600degC as the outer zone is taking high voltage.\r\nToday it will be replaced with High k heater and checked', 'Satish, Rahul', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
