(487, '2016-12-02 11:48:21', 89, '', '', 'Found the electrode position was disturbed a bit.\r\nCleaned the chamber & electrode assembly.\r\nSystem checked by LIC, working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
