(526, '2017-01-13 12:12:22', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Parts are ready, work for swap is planned on 17th & 18th Jan 2017', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-18 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(527, '2017-01-13 12:15:48', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'Troubleshooting done till now with the help of vendor (AJA).\r\nAfter troubleshooting it was found that the HV unit & genius controller are faulty and need replacement.\r\nHV unit & genius controller sent to vendor for warranty replacement and have reached their factory on 12th Jan (genius controller) and HV unit on 5th Jan 2017.\r\nVendor has sent email, they will send the replacement parts by early next week.', 'Pradeep, Sushil, Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-25 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(527, '2017-01-16 18:15:29', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Shipment intimation given by AJA.\r\nPurchase team has initiated documentation procedure', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(517, '2017-01-16 18:17:42', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'On heating only the filament, there is no breakage of filament even for 2-3 runs without any gas.\r\nToday, new made shower head connected. Filament used the same old.\r\nFilament testing done.\r\nTomorrow gas will be flown & checked if filament breaks as reported', 'Vinayak, Anjum', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(529, '2017-01-16 18:19:00', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Software restarted.\r\nSystem working fine', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(530, '2017-01-19 18:24:15', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Capacitor found faulty.\r\nReplaced with a new one.\r\nPump & system working fine.\r\nChecked by LIC', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-19 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(528, '2017-01-19 18:26:20', 89, 'EMT', 'Computer gets hanged when profilometer system cable is connected', 'Replaced the cable with a new one, but issue same. Found spike guard burnt due to which some files got corrupted. Installed new one and checked.\r\nSystem working fine checked by LIC', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-19 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(517, '2017-01-19 18:28:39', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Ceramic bead replaced with new one.\r\nSystem working fine & checked by LIC', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-19 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(509, '2017-01-19 18:32:11', 89, 'EMT', '', 'O-ring between high vacuum valve & chamber found faulty.\r\nReplaced with another one. With dummy flange over DP & high vacuum valve, vacuum reached 6E-6mbar.\r\nDP will be connected back to system & checked', 'Bhimraj, Satish, Sushil, Rahul', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-20 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(533, '2017-01-20 15:43:28', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Issue as reported by LIC::\r\nToday when Shradhha was performing her experiment on ALD LL there was issue observed with plasma. \r\n\r\nPlasma was not striking with nitrogen. She did one process last night which went correctly. Plasma was striking for both oxygen and nitrogen properly. \r\n\r\nToday oxygen plasma was striking but now plasma generation has stopped.\r\nOur plasma is generated at 300watts. While in the dummy run we observed that reflected power and forward power were 58watts.\r\n\r\nWe also faced issue in turbo pump. Turbo was found off twice and when we are trying to start system it does not pump down. We have to shutdown entire system and restart it again.', 'Email sent to vendor for solution', 'Neha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-24 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(527, '2017-01-20 15:45:20', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'Email from Ferrotec, shipment has been picked up on Monday (16th Jan)\r\nAs per purchase team, shipment will be delivered to IITB by 25th Jan 2017', 'Pradeep, Sushil, Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-25 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(526, '2017-01-20 15:45:53', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vendor is visiting on 23rd Jan 2017 to work on this issue', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-25 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(525, '2017-01-20 15:46:25', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vendor is coming on 23rd Jan 2017 to work on this issue', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-25 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(536, '2017-01-23 12:41:52', 89, 'EMT', 'Software gets hanged while running recipe.', 'Email sent to vendor.\r\nQueries & answers as below:\r\nSystem serial number: 94- 814852\r\n\r\nÂ·Please could system be Virus checked\r\nAns: How to check this?\r\n\r\nÂ·When did this start.\r\nAns: Since 18th Jan 2017\r\n\r\nÂ·Has any new software been added to the Pc\r\nAns: No\r\n\r\nÂ·Is the Pc on a network.\r\nAns: No. There is a interlock relay connected to mouse & keyboard, but computer is not connected to any network / internet.\r\n\r\nÂ·Has the Pc ever been on a network\r\nAns: No\r\n\r\nÂ·Have they had any software updateâ€™s for windows after Pc was installed.\r\nAns: No. Except when Oxford only installed new H2 line.\r\n\r\nÂ·Is there virus software on the Pc\r\nAns: We have not installed any. If it has, how to check & confirm?\r\n\r\nÂ·How often do they turn there system off\r\nAns: We turn off the system after our process is done. But system is never powered off, unless there is long power shut down beyond the capacity of main UPS backup.\r\n\r\nÂ·Can we have data logs for system and process from last week and from 6 months ago  or before issue started\r\nAns: Attached are the photos. As CD drive is not working, sending you the images.\r\n\r\nÂ·What password mode is being used\r\nAns: The standard password which was given by Oxford at the time of tool installation.\r\n\r\nÂ·Please ask customer to run check below. Forward results to me.\r\nAns: Attached are the photos', 'Pradeep', 'Oxford Instruments', 'Mr. Gurpal Singh\r\n7506092817', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(533, '2017-01-23 13:00:07', 89, 'EMT', 'Nitrogen & Oxygen plasma not striking in the process mode after 7 cycles.\r\nIn manual mode, it is working for 2-3 times.', 'Email received & reply from EMT as follows:\r\nSorry about this problem.\r\nThe problems are probably related. With the turbo off, the plasma conditions are much different which can lead to the plasma not turning on. Can you compare the pressure data from a good plasma run with a recent failed plasma run to see if the pressures are different indicating the turbo pump was inoperative?\r\nCan you remind me the model turbo pump on your system?\r\n\r\nMark\r\n\r\nDear Mark,\r\n   We tried running the Al2O3 recipe at 250 degc O2 plasma at 300w and observed that out of 200 cycles, the plasma is working fine with forward 300 & reflected power 0 for 6-7 cycles. But after that forward power is 57 and reflected power is 52.\r\nSo we aborted the recipe.\r\nDuring the run when O2 is not flowing chamber pressure is 1.42 E-1 and when O2 flows (50sccm), chamber pressure is 1.75 E-1.\r\nWe did 3runs & the issue is same for all the runs as explained above.', 'Pradeep, Sushil', 'Ultratech', 'Mark J. Sowa, Ph.D.\r\nSenior Research Scientist\r\nUltratech-CNT\r\n130 Turner Street, Building 2\r\nWaltham, MA 02453\r\n\r\nPhone: 1-781-907-8998\r\nWebsite:  www.cambridgenanotechald.com\r\nSupport: aldsupport@ultratech.com\r\nSales: aldsales@ultratech.com\r\nInfo: aldinfo@ultratech.com', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(537, '2017-01-23 16:55:03', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Users facing issue while unloading', 'While unloading, the angle of the rotating knob needs to be adjusted properly.', 'Pijush', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-23 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(531, '2017-01-23 16:55:54', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Email sent to vendor for AMC visit. The issues will be taken care of during AMC visit.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-02-01 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(536, '2017-01-23 16:57:56', 89, '', '', 'Email communication with vendor going on.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(533, '2017-01-25 11:05:39', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Turbo water flow switch was replaced with a new one as there was water clogging.\r\nShraddha did 2 dummy runs which went as expected.\r\nSystem running fine.', 'Vinayak, Neha, Shraddha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(509, '2017-01-25 11:06:36', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'System working fine. High vacuum issue resolved.\r\nDummy run check done by SO & Operator.\r\nSystem up for usage', 'Bhimraj, Amit R', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(538, '2017-01-25 17:13:14', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Lamp has been replaced with a new one.\r\nSystem checked by operator and it is working fine', 'Hitesh, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(525, '2017-01-25 17:18:09', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The controller is out of repair as per vendor.\r\nReceived quote for new controller & has been approved by Prof Anil.\r\nInventory / Purchase team processing for PO', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(526, '2017-01-25 17:19:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'There is overshoot of 10deg C.\r\nProcess team is requested to check process.\r\nSystem can be used fro EMT side.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(536, '2017-01-27 10:37:05', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Vendor has asked to install antivirus & scan the pc.\r\nMay be there is virus which is causing software to crash\r\nIf not solved, oxford will do it in remote mode.', 'Pradeep, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(537, '2017-01-27 11:44:23', 89, '', 'There is leak in LL-process chamber gate valve.', 'EMT is working on the issue.\r\nUser training will be done till the issue is permanently solved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(527, '2017-01-27 11:44:51', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Material delivered on 27th Jan as per purchase team', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', '');
