(537, '2017-02-03 11:03:51', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Original chuck is heavy in weight which is suspected to be causing issue.\r\nEMT,SO,SRC & FIC checked with Al chuck which is lighter in weight. There is no unloading issue now.\r\nApproval for new chuck given by FIC.\r\nLIC is working on this to get the new chuck', 'Pradeep, Arnab', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(543, '2017-02-03 11:08:50', 89, 'Process', '', 'There was some setting issue.\r\nOperator made setting correct.\r\nSystem is working fine.', 'Amit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-03-03 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(531, '2017-02-03 11:09:29', 89, '', '', 'AMC visit done.\r\nIssues resolved from EMT side.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(523, '2017-02-03 11:10:40', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Replaced relay with another from Drive-in furnace.\r\nDummy runs 2 times, there is no overshoot issue.\r\nIssue solved.\r\nLIC checked the same.', 'Sushil, Neha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-02-03 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(536, '2017-02-03 17:55:42', 89, '', '', 'EMT sent the required folder to vendor today.\r\nWaiting for further reply on this.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(542, '2017-02-08 11:31:41', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Cleaning of the chamber, replacing of faulty / old o-rings done.\r\nChamber tested for vacuum. Results as follows:\r\nRough vacuum time = 15 mins to reach 5E-2mbar\r\nHigh vacuum time = <2hours after opening high vacuum valve\r\nLIC has been requested to add few points in SOP to note down\r\nvacuum (rough & high)\r\nmetals deposited\r\nChamber cleaning frequency\r\nIf the vacuum is not attained in the stipulated time with a buffer to 30mins, issue should be raised to EMT', 'Bhimraj, AmitR', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Work completed on 3rd Feb'),
(537, '2017-02-08 11:32:39', 89, '', '', 'Spare Al chuck available.\r\nSO / Operator to check tool with 5-6 runs before releasing the tool for everyone..', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-01-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(525, '2017-02-08 11:35:03', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sent to the vendor on 7th Feb\r\nWaiting for the material.\r\nECD is 3weeks.', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(522, '2017-02-08 11:36:28', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Dummy run planned on 8th Feb by LIC.\r\nThere were other issues in this week (6th Feb-8th Feb).\r\nWater flow issue, venting issue. EMT solved all the issue.', 'Vinayak, Satish, Neha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(550, '2017-02-08 12:10:34', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Sushil is working on this on 8th Feb\r\nThere is issue in distance between electrode & substrate which is leading to less etch rate.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-02-09 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
