(644, '2017-05-17 15:14:20', 89, '', '', 'Water line flushing has been done. Inlet and outlet line from tool side flushing with High pressure N2. From manifold Both line flushing has been done. Issue is resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
