(638, '2017-05-17 15:18:44', 89, '', '', 'RF matching unit cooling water flushing has been done. Water flow switch cleaning has been done. \r\nHigh reflected power issue resolved by water line and water flow switch flushing.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(574, '2017-05-17 15:29:45', 89, '', 'Advice from EVG engineer found that the cover movement during initialization was not getting completed and that was a basic cause. It was found that the position of the limiting screw of the cover was disturbed and that was causing incomplete movement of the cover.', 'The subject screw was than adjusted to the correct position  and with this the issue got resolved.Initializing was functioning fine and all operation in high level was working fine. \r\nSO has then checked the system completely with these old cards and also taken two UV exposures that ware successfully performed', '', 'Norinco Private Ltd (Chandrashekhar Kulkarni)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/574_8.pdf', ''),
(643, '2017-05-17 15:43:57', 89, '', '', 'After changing Ar regulator issue is resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(647, '2017-05-19 16:21:17', 89, '', 'Gate valve O ring was damage', 'replaced gate valve O ring and checked it is working fine. Tool is up for process', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(650, '2017-05-24 11:40:32', 89, '', '', 'PPR found in vacuum line. Cleaning has been done. Now it is working fine. As same checked by Nimisha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
