(653, '2017-05-30 11:05:00', 89, '', '', 'As per vendor instruction we have done following steps\r\n1. cooling line was touching inductor coil. We have separated it and tied.\r\n2. cleaning of coil was done using IPA.\r\n\r\nWe checked the system for plasma and it is working fine now.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
