(677, '2017-06-05 11:05:37', 89, 'EMT, HiteshK', '', 'Email sent to vendor. \r\nVendor\'s response:\r\nSoftware does not sees arm is extended , one possibility is arm is actually is not extended and stuck mechanically , 2nd is sensor has failed.\r\nVent the chamber and load lock and try moving arm in service mode and see if it is hitting anything chamber , there is a hole on the belt which should be in the middle of sensor detect position . sensor is underneath the cover plat in load lock.', 'Pradeep, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-06-06 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
