(677, '2017-06-06 17:03:28', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Arm was stuck due to slit valve.\r\nIn service mode, slit valve opened, arm back to load lock.\r\nChecked loading & unloading wafer in process chamber several times.\r\nSystem working fine.', 'Pradeep, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-06-06 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
