(715, '2017-08-02 14:12:36', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vacuum fluctuates from 5E-6mbar to 8E-6mbar, while loading sample (substrate height up / down)\r\nThere is no issue in the system.\r\nSystem checked by SO. Working fine.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(712, '2017-08-02 15:05:59', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Crucible rotating assembly is not working.\r\nFaulty part is given to inventory for procurement.\r\nDuring deposition, beam assembly gets evaporated materials deposited on it. Hence HHV vendor had suggested to cover the same with SS. Material (ss plate) has been procured. It has been given to workshop for making.\r\n\r\nSystem can be used for single layer (one one material at a time) deposition.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(714, '2017-08-02 15:07:22', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Quote has been received from Oxford.\r\nSent for faculty approval.\r\n\r\nEMT is trying to make the belt locally', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(713, '2017-08-04 10:40:58', 89, 'Process, Purchase', '', 'PO is in process for procurement of 2 new ion gun filament.\r\nLocal vendor has ordered 2nos in parallel. It will reach mumbai in 3rd week of August. It will be installed and the one ordered by IITB will be returned to local vendor (Icon Analytical)', 'Anjum, Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-08-25 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(708, '2017-08-04 10:45:57', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Local vendor visited to check the system and given following report:\r\n\r\n1. The contact lever adjustment is misaligned from the pin inside the stage. This needs the stage to be removed and adjusted. The condition of the locking mechanism will determine if it needs replacing of the parts. \r\n \r\nThere is a risk of the settings not to be exactly reproduced as per the factory standards. As it is a very critical job. We will be in touch with the German factory during the repair process.\r\n \r\n2. Front left shock absorber pad is cracked so the system is not vibration free. \r\n\r\n3. The regulator for CDA and N2 needs to be replaced by IIT as it is not proper. \r\n\r\n4. Vacuum knob on the system panel is non functional. \r\nNeeds to be replaced. \r\n\r\nThe time taken for the repairs of the chuck will be 2 days. The cost will be Rs. 30000/- excluding taxes', 'Sushil, Nikhilendu', 'Om Scientific', 'Mr. Chintan', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(707, '2017-08-04 10:50:18', 297, 'purchse team', '', 'funds for Half brdige IGBT has been approved. procurement under process', 'sunitha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(712, '2017-08-04 10:53:39', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Crucible rotating assembly received from inventory. Installation being done.\r\nFor covering the electrode assembly SS sheet has been procured. Chandrakant is making the required part. ECD 8th August.\r\nSystem will be up for usage by 10th August.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-08-10 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
