(716, '2017-08-04 11:06:57', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT checked electrode distance and RF. One process run was done.\r\nProcess team to check & data and update if any issue is there.', 'Vinayak, Sarannya TS', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2017-08-04 11:09:21', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Local Vendor suggested 2 options:\r\n1. check the system in manual mode - 50K\r\n2. system modification to semiautomatic mode - ~7lakh\r\n\r\nEMT is communicating with Gareth in parallel, trying to solve the issue', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
