(720, '2017-08-11 10:55:10', 89, 'Process', '', 'As per vendor\'s suggestion:\r\n You can use the instrument by bypassing the bypass box and connecting the Water tubing directly to the instrument\r\nFrom the log file Rigaku has confirmed the problem in HV Unit CPU PCB . Same will be supply to you free of cost\r\nLocal vendor will update IITB on the status of shipment.', 'Kankat', 'IRTECH', 'Sharad Ahire\r\nM: 09320395663', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
