(723, '2017-08-16 14:13:38', 89, 'EMT', 'Issue with Penning gauge, thickness monitor seen.\\r\\nFilament selected used to change when power off was done', '1. cleaning of penning gauge done, as some deposition was seen inside the gauge.\\r\\n2. temporarily Al evaporator thickness monitor display has been connected.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'SO / AU has been asked to do a dummy run and report for any issue.'),
(722, '2017-08-16 14:18:24', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Issue as reported by user:\\r\\n1. old laser KrF pressure is going down very fast. After filling system shows the maximum 3400 mbar pressure, and this pressure should maintain for 1 month. Even after 2-3 months, the pressure should not drop less than 3000 mbar. It was observed that within 10 days after the KrF filling, system is showing around 2900 mbar pressure, which is very less.\\r\\n2. facing problem in measuring the laser energy using new energy\\r\\n> meters. Probably energy meters are not measuring the exact energy value.', 'Email sent to vendor.\\r\\nVendor had asked to check the orings in spare. Same has been checked & details sent.\\r\\nWaiting for reply\\r\\n', 'Bhimraj, Manisha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(721, '2017-08-16 14:19:49', 89, 'EMT', 'Movement of the bellow for gun-7 was not seen as per other guns.\\r\\n', 'Shutter ss bellow lock screw was not connected properly (might be it had slipped),same lock screw was connected', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Shutter open/close operation checked by Pijush.\\r\\n'),
(720, '2017-08-16 14:20:57', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Water pipes have been bypassed (from the bypass box) & connected directly to the system.\\r\\n', 'Bhimraj, Kankat', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(712, '2017-08-16 14:26:46', 89, 'EMT', '', 'All the required parts have been installed in the system.\\r\\nTi deposition was done.\\r\\nSystem base vacuum now reaching to 5E-7mbar.\\r\\nSystem is ready for use with 3 crucibles. (1,3 & 4)\\r\\nCrucible rotating assembly for 2 is not working.\\r\\nEMT is working on this to replace the part.', 'Sushil, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Process team has been informed about the same.\\r\\nDummy process run to be done by process team before releasing the tool for all. If any issue faced, update the same to EMT.'),
(706, '2017-08-16 14:28:52', 89, '', '', 'ICs have been ordered on 14th Aug.\\r\\nWaiting for the same to be received at IITB.\\r\\nIn parallel, documents for sending the power supply box back for repair is in process.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2017-08-16 14:29:53', 89, '', '', 'Quote for repair has been received from Pfeiffer.\\r\\n~ Euro 13000.\\r\\nVendor has been asked to send cost for buyback / new pump.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2017-08-16 14:34:23', 89, '', '', 'As per Gareth, \\r\\nwe have to make a new cable to communicate from computer to the system (AMC1 module).\\r\\n3pin DIN connector is required.\\r\\nrequest has been sent to inventory.\\r\\nWaiting for parts.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
