(722, '2017-08-21 12:04:41', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Visit by Laser science person done on Saturday.\\r\\nThere was leak in one of the o-ring and the same has been replaced by new one in spare.\\r\\nLaser working fine now.\\r\\nIt will be under observation for any leak for next 1week.', 'Sushil, Senthil, Varun', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Company has asked to keep few required parts in spares. Quote will be send by 22nd Aug'),
