(716, '2017-08-29 14:14:04', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Distance between 2 electrodes adjusted to 15-17 mm.\\r\\nO2 cylinder was suspected empty as primary gauge was not showing value. Replaced with new one.\\r\\nCHF3 cylinder also replaced with another (from Amat tool).\\r\\n2 process runs at 0.2mbar and 0.5mbar done. Results awaiting.\\r\\n\\r\\nAwaiting results of the runs.', 'Sushil, Sharannya', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(728, '2017-08-29 14:15:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Issue with the thickness monitor display, \\r\\nReplaced with another from Al thermal evaporator.\\r\\nThe faulty display needs to be sent for repair to HHV', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(716, '2017-08-29 17:53:07', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Today run at 0.2mbar and 0.5mbar pressure was done.\\r\\nat 0.2mbar etch rate result is 10nm/min\\r\\nno etching result at 0.5mbar\\r\\n\\r\\nAs per prof suddho, runs at 75w & 90W to be done and compare the results. and see the trend.\\r\\nProcess team (Sharannya T.S) will be doing the run today.', 'Sushil, Sharannya', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-08-31 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(706, '2017-08-29 17:54:18', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'We received the IGBTs and the ICs and the old faulty were replaced with new one, but the issue is same.\\r\\nSwitched ON the E illumination controller, now the MCB is not tripping, but the lamp is not getting powered ON. \\r\\nEmail sent to vendor for any further troubleshooting steps.', 'Sushil, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(727, '2017-08-31 11:30:18', 89, 'Process', '', 'Vendor has been contacted for the issue.\\r\\nHe will be visiting IITB on 31st Aug for checking the issue', 'Gayatri, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(716, '2017-08-31 11:32:30', 89, '', '', 'Etch rate at 60W, 75W, & 90W is coming to be same 10nm/min.\\r\\nEMT & process teams are working with Prof SUddho Mahapatra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(729, '2017-08-31 11:38:04', 297, 'Facility Team', 'checked the battery and found 4 batteries have gone bad and 15 under warning alarm.', 'Informed MMIC to procure 5 batteries on urgent basis', 'Rajendra, hitesh, irwin, amit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2 days', '2017-09-02 00:00:00', 'replace all the faulty batteries with new one', 'Rajendra', '', ''),
(626, '2017-08-31 11:40:39', 725, '', 'Gas Leak Detector [GLD] Panel is having some software issue and controller PC is not starting up so please do not run any toxic gas related proces in AMAT, Nano & Micro 2 Labs till further notice.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(706, '2017-08-31 11:46:05', 89, '', '', 'Prof Suddho will be checking the controller if anything more can be done.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(730, '2017-08-31 12:21:17', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Turbo cooling water switch was not working. Water switch cleaning has been done. Now it is working fine.Â \\r\\nÂ  Â  Â  Turbo controller is not power up. Checked power cable output it was 230V.\\r\\nOpen Fuse holder and seen one of the 4Amp fuse was blown. Same replaced with new one, and switched ON controller. It is working fine. Turbo Speed 42KRPM\\r\\nI= 0.8A, P=16W, Temp. = 22Deg C. Process chamber Vacuum is 4.5E-07 Torr with process Ch. gate valve open.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-08-31 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2017-08-31 12:24:21', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Quote for new turbo pump from Edwards received. ~GBP15000\\r\\nWaiting for Prof Dipankar\\\'s approval which option to go ahead with.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2017-08-31 12:25:48', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Made new cable and connected from AMC1 module to the computer directly and checked the software, but there is nothing in the UTILS\\r\\nWhen opened the AMC1 module box to check the fuses, found some of the components burnt. The fuses are ok\\r\\nEmail sent to Gareth.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2017-08-31 12:26:39', 89, '', '', 'Reply from Gareth as below:\\r\\nOk so the components all look like the area that is the 24v power supply. I would suggest you try and repair items locally if the tracks are not broken\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2017-08-31 12:27:58', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Gareth\\\'s reply:\\r\\nI do not know what caused this but what I advise is I send the drawings I have and you try fixing it but when initially refitting only plug in serial in and serial out plus 24v power lead.\\r\\nCheck all test points 5v +15v -15v and of course +24v\\r\\n\\r\\nRe check that serial coms is now working with the test leads\\r\\n\\r\\nThen last plug in matching unit and mag phase.\\r\\n\\r\\nI will see if I can send you the drawings later.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you fix this module I think all should work again.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou will then have to remove all shorting links we tried before.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Parts procurement needs to be done.'),
(727, '2017-08-31 12:31:06', 89, 'EMT, process', '', 'Kaeser representative (Luft power engineering) visited and checked the compressor.\\r\\nFound there is no oil in the compressor and needs refilling.\\r\\nThey will send us quote and delivery time for oil procurement.', 'Pradeep, HiteshK, Gayatri', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(4, '2017-09-01 10:13:30', 89, 'EMT', '', '7/16DIN adapter cable ordered from pasternack website.\\r\\nCost ~25000Rs.\\r\\nDelivery will be done on 1st September.\\r\\nOnce it is received, will be installed in the system and checked.', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-09-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(713, '2017-09-01 10:25:03', 89, 'Process', '', 'Icon Analytical Â has received the Ion gun filament and they will be starting the work from Monday (4th Sept).\\r\\nFollowing work will be carried out:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Replacing the ion gun filament.\\r\\n2. Replacing the view port of UPS\\r\\n3. Changing the rotary pump oil.', 'Anjum', 'Icon Analytical', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-09-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(731, '2017-09-01 10:26:07', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Inside the controller SSR gone bad and need to be replace. Sample handover to Pankaj for procurement', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Once the required part is procured, EMT will install the same.'),
(4, '2017-09-04 11:54:46', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Cable received on 1st September.\\r\\nInstalled on the system and checked.\\r\\nRF reflected power is high. On troubleshooting, found the matching unit is not working.\\r\\nEmail sent to sentech for solution.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(732, '2017-09-04 12:24:20', 89, 'EMT', '', 'SO has been asked to blackout the tool.\\r\\nEMT is working on this', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-09-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2017-09-04 12:25:18', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Email sent to Pfeiffer for revised quote for repair & new pump after consultation with Prof Dipankar', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(732, '2017-09-05 10:51:03', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Heater is gone bad.\\r\\nExcel Instruments will send a new one', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-09-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(732, '2017-09-05 11:35:07', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Excel Instrument\\\'s reply:\\r\\nI am not sure what is happening. heaters are tested to 800C before despatch. With so many heaters being in use why only this heater is going bad is not clear. \\r\\nif this is the same heater sent to you few days back please send it back. I need you to check the following:\\r\\n\\r\\nwhether the K type T/C is selected in the PID.\\r\\nyou can send me pictures of the PID from the time you switch on. as soon as you switch on the PID a screen comes up where all LED lights are on. Then scrreen changes automatically to Input on top display and CK5 in bottom display\\r\\ncan you confirm what you see?', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(732, '2017-09-05 11:37:09', 89, '', '', 'Reply from EMT:\\r\\nVideo & photo attached.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/732_3.jpg', ''),
(732, '2017-09-05 11:37:55', 89, '', '', 'video', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/732_4.mp4', ''),
(732, '2017-09-05 11:46:49', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Excel Instruments had asked to check 6amps fuse. Checked, it is ok.\\r\\nBelow reply from them:\\r\\nI have taken another heater for production.\\r\\nBefore connecting I also want to check the transformer to make sure that not more than 28V going into the heater.\\r\\n\\r\\nHeater going bad in the same system so soon has never happened before.\\r\\n\\r\\nSince heaters are expensive I need to make sure the next replacement keeps working\\r\\n', 'Vinayak, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(732, '2017-09-06 11:16:42', 89, '', '', 'Mr. Pai from excel instruments will be visiting on Monday (11th Sept) to work on the issue', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(706, '2017-09-06 11:29:23', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Email sent to vendor if the board can be repaired and checked at IITB to make sure, it cannot be repaired here.\\r\\nThis is regarding the power supply for the lamp of the DSA system. We replaced the IGBTs and the ICs as instructed, but we still face the same issue. When we switch the E-illumination controller on, the lamp is still not switching on. However, we do not have the issue of the MCB tripping. Could you please provide some troubleshooting advice, after consulting with EVG, which we can try at our end to bring the system back to working condition?\\r\\nIn particular, it will be helpful to know the voltage checks that we could perform on the card to ascertain if there are other components which need replacement. It would also help if we could get the circuit diagram for the card(s). We\\\'ll be glad to have a Skype meeting with engineers from EVG, should it be possible to arrange that from your end. Prof. S. Mahapatra (in cc), who is following the developments has requested for a meeting, if that would be possible.\\r\\n \\r\\nPlease note that this is an extremely important tool for us as all photo-lithography processes depend on it. Several users are  complaining about the delay and the inability to take their work forward. We seek your advise and co-operation on his.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(706, '2017-09-06 11:31:28', 89, '', '', 'Reply from vendor to check the tool as follows:\\r\\nPlease check the Pneumatic pressure switch inside the LPS, simply with an Ohmmeter. And please check the fuse.\\r\\nDisconnect the bulb and check for a short circuit.\\r\\nWhen the Bulb is installed, the resistance between LPS and Lampsocket has to be less than 3Ohm.\\r\\n \\r\\nDisconnect the LPS from any electrical power source before you open the cover\\r\\nPlease provide some photos from the opened LPS.\\r\\n \\r\\nÃ„Ã„Ã„HM the Lamp is in good condition? Can you try another bulb as well?\\r\\nIs the mercury in the bulb in one drop collected?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/706_9.png', ''),
(727, '2017-09-06 17:27:30', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO for the oil sent today by purchase team.\\r\\nWaiting for vendor\\\'s reply for delivery date', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
