(738, '2017-09-08 12:10:50', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Issue reported as:\\r\\nDolar was trying to use QCM software for measurement of NiOx deposition. \\r\\nBut he is facing issue while running recipe. \\r\\nAfter incorporating QCM steps recipe stops and gives error of communication.\\r\\nKindly find attached images.\\r\\nWithout QCM steps recipe works fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(738, '2017-09-08 12:11:37', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT worked on the issue, below is the details:\\r\\nWe have notice STM2 Inficon communicator not power ON. So the QCM software uninstalled and reinstalled again .After reinstallation of QCM software. we found same error on main screen (Image attached) and the STM-2 rate/thickness monitor USB and PWR led was not glow.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(738, '2017-09-08 12:17:23', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Email sent to vendor:\\r\\nWe are facing issue with QCM assembly at ALL without loadlock system.\\r\\nThe STM USB to sensor box is not getting power supply. Please see attached image of software and box.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe tried new USB cable but still box is not getting power.\\r\\nKindly let us know what could be the reason.\\r\\nOur QCM assembly is under warranty.', 'Neha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(738, '2017-09-08 12:17:58', 89, '', '', 'Vendor\\\'s suggestion below:\\r\\nWould it be possible to try installing the software on and running the QCM from a different computer just for testing purposes? It sounds like the STM2 is bad, but I just want to make sure there is not any strange device driver issues with the Fiji computer. I don\\\'t want to waste time assuming the STM2 is bad if it is a computer driver issue.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(738, '2017-09-08 12:18:47', 89, '', '', 'Replied to vendor:\\r\\nWe tried installing the software to another computer, but the issue is same.\\r\\nPlease let us know further plan for the same.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(738, '2017-09-08 12:19:16', 89, '', '', 'Vendor\\\'s reply:\\r\\nI have concluded that the STM-2 box has failed. We are ordering a replacement and will ship it to you when it is received. I will let you know a shipping estimate when I have it.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-09-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
