(706, '2017-09-14 17:55:58', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Reply from vendor for further troubleshooting / checks:\\r\\n\\r\\nHello, pease check the interlock status LED on the backside of the LPC: (INLK)\\r\\n\\r\\nThis is the status from the savety interlock from the lamphouse.\\r\\nIn the AUX 1 port is the savety interlock circuit conncted to the lamphouse. When this circuit is open, itÂ´s not possible to start the lamp.\\r\\n \\r\\nBest would be to check the status of this LED and than unplug AUX 1 connector on the backside of the controller.(changes status during unplugging?)\\r\\n \\r\\nAnd please also check the 24volt transformator in the power supply(where the mouse arrow is located)\\r\\n\\r\\n \\r\\nIf we canÂ´t find the solution at all, we can make a repair quotation.\\r\\nTherefore we have to take a look on the LPS and you have to send it to Austria.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
