(312, '2017-10-13 10:41:21', 89, '', '', 'received the new part, today we had replaced and connected the AMC 1 module box to system with new cable and checked the software, In UTILS directory we run diag300.exe on the screen we seen AMC 7. That means AMC1 module directly communicating with software successfully. Please see the attached photo.Â \\r\\n\\r\\nKindly suggest what to do next.Â \\r\\n\\r\\nBut there is one more issue facing, after restarting computer it was not display anything it was totally blank. We checked power cable and VGA cable also, power is there computer is working fine but no display shown. We try to resolve this issue first.Â ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
