(312, '2017-10-23 17:34:54', 89, '', '', 'We changed burnt component again, But there is one more issue facing with our computer, when we switched ON computer it was not shown any display it was totally blank. We checked power cable and VGA cable also, power is there, computer is working fine but no display shown. Without switching ON computer we are not able to check further test.Â \\r\\nIs it possible to change another computer using current hard disk?\\r\\n\\r\\nReply come from Mr. Gareth \\r\\n\\r\\nYes you could change but you need a slow speed old computer 286 pentium or similar.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnything after windows xp will not run the dos software.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
