(764, '2017-11-03 11:50:36', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Servicing of DP pump, and penning gauge is done.\\r\\nOne of the o-ring in the electrode port found bad, replaced with new one.\\r\\nHigh vacuum issue resolved.\\r\\nNow, 3.6E-6mbar vacuum reached.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
