(760, '2017-11-03 12:02:39', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Reply from AJA:\\r\\nAs there has been no preventive maintenance on the compressor, since commissioned, you will need to replace the adsorber.  With the compressor operating, if the pressure is 270 psi or below you will need to add helium.  I have attached the manual for the compressor which will give you all the information you need.\\r\\nHe recharge will be done on 3rd Nov.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
