(769, '2017-11-23 14:42:50', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Reply from AJA engineer:\\r\\nDear Sushil,\\r\\n \\r\\nThanks for getting me the answers.\\r\\n \\r\\nI have passed them on to FerroTec and I should have a corrective action from them shortly.\\r\\n \\r\\nAs I told you in the last email FerroTec says you can operate the E-Beam at this time as long as it is not generating other issues or error messages.\\r\\n \\r\\nBest Regards,\\r\\n \\r\\nJoe Cronin\\r\\nService Engineer\\r\\nAJA International, INC\\r\\n809 Country Way\\r\\nScituate, MA 02066\\r\\n781-545-7365\\r\\nE-mail: topgun@ajaint.com\\r\\nWeb: www.ajaint.com', 'Sushil, premsai', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
