(776, '2017-11-23 16:45:09', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Today troubleshooting, it was found the rotary pump fuse was blown off.\\r\\nReplaced the fuse & try to start, again fuse blown off.\\r\\nTomorrow detailed troubleshooting will be done to check if there is any short / what is the reason for fuse blown off.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2017-11-24 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
