(769, '2017-11-27 14:09:38', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As per reply from Ferrotec, the system cannot be used. Genius controller & carrerra units needs to be sent for repair to ferrotec.\\r\\n\\Dear Joe,\\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nWe have reviewed this and we think there is some damage to the equipment. We do not recommend to operate the system at this moment .\\r\\nThis precautions is to make sure you do not damage the evaporator because the displayed high voltage seems to be not correct.\\r\\n \\r\\nWe think the  defect could be a at the interface of the CARRERA or at the input from the Genius.\\r\\n \\r\\nWe recommend to ship the Genius and the CARRERA to us for repair.\\r\\n \\r\\nWith best regards\\r\\n \\r\\nAlfred Mutscheller\\r\\nProduct Specialist EB Gun\\', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
