(807, '2018-02-06 17:44:31', 297, 'facility AHU Team', 'Fan motor stuck', 'replaced the faulty fan motor with the 1.1 AHU compressor 3 unit', 'amit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'need to procure the fan motor.maintain the stock of fan motor', 'MMIC', '', 'hand over the spec of motor fan to MMIC of each AHU. ensure stock is maintained'),
(804, '2018-02-07 11:11:46', 297, 'Thomas & Facility Team', 'There is a leak - most probably - in the low side suction port service valve.', 'Top up of R-407 C refrigerant gas was done until suction pressure achieved was 65 psi.', 'Amit Das, Rajendra S', 'Thomas', '', 'Satisfactory', 'To remove/evacuate all the refrigerant gas from old chiller, fill N2 till 150 - 200 PSI do a standing pressure test for 24 hours. If the pressure drops then leak test  with soap solution to identify leak. Then do brazing and put for N2 pressure test again. If no more pressure drop, then evacuate N2 gas, vaccumize & fill R407C again. Min 2 day chiller shutdown required.', 'R407C refrigerant gas', 'Rs. 20,000/- approved by FIC', 'To be clubbed with Chiller PM', '2018-02-28 00:00:00', 'Follow the plan given by vendor. Time frame - 2 days depending on status after each N2 standing pressure test. Chiller PM & RO Water change, Electrical checking etc will be clubbed with this activity.', 'Amit Das', '', 'Vendor\\\'s quote has been approved by Faculty In-Charge [FIC] yesterday afternoon.'),
(809, '2018-02-07 11:21:56', 297, 'Facility Team', 'We suspect that the cable supplying power to the AHU is under-rated in size because on previous occasion we found insulation burnt / peeled off.', 'New cable of 50 sq mm (higher/better current carrying capacity) is being laid from Distribution Board to AHU Control Panel today by Facility Team. Tomorrow afternoon 4 - 5 pm one hour shut down will be taken to do the cable end connections at both sides.', 'Rajendra S, Hitesh B', '', '', '', '', '15 meter of 4 Core x 50 sq mm Flexible Insulated Copper Cable', 'Awaiting info from MMIC', 'Completed - Made available to FT', '2018-02-08 00:00:00', 'Today - Cable laying & dressing \\r\\nTomorrow - AHU Shut Down for both sides cable termination & connection, Test Run, etc.', 'Irwin', '', 'This shut down has to be taken urgently on electrical safety grounds and also to avoid further un-needed process disruptins due to fluctuations of clean room parameters [Temp & %RH]'),
(811, '2018-02-12 11:21:14', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Cracked N2 line has been replaced with a new one.\\r\\nChecked rotary pump running for full day.\\r\\nIssue is resolved.\\r\\n', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
