(828, '2018-03-07 11:31:27', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Toxic gases not flowing, whereas non toxic gases are flowing', 'Checked MFC can module of both toxic & non toxic gases, and found that in non-toxic the status is shown green, but for toxic it is showing orange.\\r\\nChecked fuse, 1A fuse was misbehaving. Replaced with a new one.\\r\\nDisconnected the connector in the gas pod can module and connected back.\\r\\nSystem restarted,\\r\\nAll the gases are flowing normally.', 'Pradeep, Hitesh K', 'Oxford Instruments', 'Mr. Kambar Chandrashekhar\\r\\n08884416907', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'The fuse might have seen voltage fluctuation due to power shut down and no ups back u['),
