(841, '2018-03-27 11:12:47', 297, 'amit das', 'Low pressure fault seen on the MPD. liquid can be seen on the compressor line.', 'vendor has been called today at 2pm to attain the leak', 'amit das', '', '', '', '', 'R22 gas, oxygen cylinder, N2 cylinder, LPG gas', '', '', '2018-03-29 00:00:00', '1. identify the source of leak. \\r\\n2. Attend the leak by brazing the copper line\\r\\n3. putting the line on leak check for 24 hrs\\r\\n4. if no leak seen, then evacuate the N2 gas.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n', 'amit das', '', ''),
(840, '2018-03-27 12:13:09', 89, 'EMT', 'Combination valve not operating properly due to which vacuum is not reaching below 4E-1mbar as reported by user.', 'Checked the combination valve. Setting done temporarily.\\r\\nSystem checked in backing & roughing modes, vacuum reaching 5E-2 mbar as required.\\r\\n', 'Sushil, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'The issue is there due to mishandling by someone. The locking screw is broken and will be replaced by EMT'),
(769, '2018-03-27 12:15:26', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As per Ferrotec, the issue of Genius controller is due to grounding issue.\\r\\nOn checking with AJA, they said the high voltage filament grounding connection is in wrong place. \\r\\nQuote has been forwarded to purchase team for PO processing and payment.\\r\\n', 'Pradeep, Sushil', 'AJA, and Ferrotec', 'Mr. Joe from AJA\\r\\nMr. Alfred from Ferrotec', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '2018-04-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(4, '2018-03-27 12:16:45', 89, '', '', 'The faulty part has been replaced with new one.\\r\\nSystem is working now. The issue of computer & software not starting has been solved.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(4, '2018-03-27 12:19:00', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Rotary pump servicing and fomblin oil replacement has been done.\\r\\nNew oil top up done in turbo pump.\\r\\nThis was done as the turbo pump current was increasing from 1.4A (std required) to 4A without any load.\\r\\nAfter servicing & oil replacement the issue is solved, and there is no increase in turbo current. It is stable at 1.4 - 1.7A and chamber vacuum is 5E-6mbar.', 'Sushil, Vinayak, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(840, '2018-03-27 16:08:26', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Broken part replaced with a new one.\\r\\nSystem working fine.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-03-27 00:00:00', '', '', '', '');
