(841, '2018-03-28 12:32:53', 297, '', 'Due to the construction work ( 1st floor computer centre, EE annex), lot of  waste material is being dumped on top of the Nano AHU condenser unit and exhaust blower.\\r\\nConstruction work needs to be put on hold till solution is found \\r\\nThis has affected our NANO compressor- one of the copper pipe has broke and gas got leaked. Due to this compressor is down from yesterday.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
