(312, '2018-04-04 11:20:16', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vendor has dismantled all the cable connections with proper labeling.\\r\\nThey are working on making some of the hardware in their workshop.\\r\\nVendor will be sending work update by today evening.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
