(841, '2018-04-04 11:56:34', 297, 'amit', 'leak seen in both suction and discharge line', 'both line has been brazed and pressure test carried out with N2 gas. pass N2 test and line pumped down and R22 top up with 50 psi gas', 'vendor', 'prasad', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
