(849, '2018-04-17 22:22:04', 89, 'EMT', 'Found chamber vacuum not reaching below 8E-5mbar even after 30 mins. It should be reaching 4E-6mbar in 40-45 mins.', 'DP pump servicing done. New DP oil filled.\\r\\nFound o-ring of electrodes damaged. Replaced with new one.\\r\\nSystem checked. Vacuum reached 4E-6mbar in 40mins.\\r\\nAu boat glow at 40A and Cr boat glow at 48A.', 'sushil, vinayak, pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(851, '2018-04-18 11:13:06', 89, '', '', 'There is separate complaint form for AC in facility.\\r\\nInformed to Sandeepm about the issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
