(855, '2018-05-04 16:43:22', 89, '', '', 'Substrate rotate issue resolved. The substrate rotator bearing was rusted and jam. bearing cleaned with Acetone. It is working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-09-04 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2018-05-07 14:38:37', 89, '', '', 'Vendor had delivered Gas Box Interface (PO1).\\r\\nThey tested everything in situ, all valves were operated and they are working fine.\\r\\nAll 5-MFC\\\'s are tested, we found one MFC (N2 at the bottom) is not working.\\r\\nAlso noticed Compress Air leaking from the manifold which is to be attended.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey will deliver (PO2) next week and will start testing Vacuum system, etc.\\r\\nWill inform IITB about next visit.\\r\\n\\r\\nThere was no manual for Automatic Pressure Control (APC) unit.\\r\\nAfter reverse engineering they found what it is and will be able to control it.\\r\\nIt will require one more control interface module, Vendor will start work on that also.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2018-05-07 14:42:56', 89, '', '', 'Third PO has been sent to vendor today', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
