(857, '2018-05-09 09:04:22', 725, '', 'executed two baseline runs, a non uniform development might be due to non uniform beam intensity.', '1. awaiting for vendor response.\\r\\n2. will discuss with FIC for further plan', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(858, '2018-05-09 10:46:19', 297, 'Amit Das, Irwin', 'Shut Down MBE AHU for 10 minutes. Opened the AHU heater bank section and found the insulation of heater bank wire was peeled in one place and was touching with the internal metallic structure.', 'After covering the bare wire and addressing the issue, then the mcb tripping stopped and lab.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Nil', 'N.A.', 'N.A.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Shut Down AHU', 'Sandeep M', 'uploads/858_0.jpg', ''),
(859, '2018-05-09 10:54:19', 297, 'Amit Das', 'Need to be carried out', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-05-10 00:00:00', 'Check suction, discharge & standing pressure of the unit in running condition having ice formation. Further action to be decided after that.', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(856, '2018-05-09 10:58:29', 297, 'Facility + Vendor [Dew Point]', 'Checked the drain line and found it was choked so drain line was cleaned.', 'Vendor came on 7/5/2018 to attend the issue. Same day issue got resolved and AC was put on again.', '', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. P. Nambiar [09819159472]', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Nil', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(860, '2018-05-09 11:07:44', 297, 'Amit Das, Rajendra S, Irwin', 'Checked Compressor 1. Found it is taking unequal current in each phase due to unequal resistance reading of the compressor winding. This was the root cause of the compressor tripping.', 'Called the Vendor [Rotex Enterprizes]', 'Rotex Enterprizes', 'Rotex Enterprizes', 'Mr. Anand Bankar', 'Satisfactory', '', '8.5 TR Compressor', '45,000/-', '2 Days', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Shut Down Comp 1, changed the compressor and filter dryer made unit up on 3/5/2018', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
