(862, '2018-05-15 10:19:40', 89, '', '', 'Gate valve open & close extension rod stuck due to over tighten. Gate valve servicing has been done. It is working fine.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-07-15 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(769, '2018-05-16 11:44:08', 89, '', '', 'Yesterday 15th may, SO Prem sai and EMT Vinayak were went to custom for there technical clarification. After clarification they sign the paper and expected delivery from DHL end of this week.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-06-16 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(870, '2018-05-16 11:58:27', 89, '', '', 'Crystal has been changed. Issue resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(706, '2018-05-18 10:40:47', 89, '', '', 'Engineer has visited to IITB on 17th may 2018 for DSA lamp power supply installation and repaired controller has been installed and tool is working.\\r\\n\\r\\n3times tool On-Off procedure tested.\\r\\n2 dummy runs done at different Exposure energy and patterns were come properly.\\r\\n\\r\\nCurrently we\\\'re using existing lamp and  intensity is 10.02mW/cm2 with uniformaty +/-7.01% across 4\\ Chuck size at constant power 300W.', 'Tesscorn Service engineer & EMT', 'Mr. Amaresh', '', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(869, '2018-05-18 12:12:06', 297, 'AHU team', '', 'XPS needs sufficient cooling other wise condensation takes place at the tool end. There has been cases that ac was not working and process were cancel due to the AC issue. So call has been taken to connect one more AC near XPS to ensure redundancy in the AC. AC near CMP has been shifted near XPS.', 'Amit', 'Dew point', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'This AC is working fine and same has been confirmed by the LIC'),
(871, '2018-05-18 12:17:40', 297, 'Facility', 'there was no gas in the AC, which indicates there are some leak in the line', 'Leak has been identified by the vendor. Leak has been sealed and gas has been top up in the AC.', 'Hitesh', 'Shagun', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'This AC will be handed over to Shagun under CMC.', 'sandeep', '', ''),
(868, '2018-05-18 12:37:00', 297, 'Facility', 'motor has gone bad and  need replacement', 'vendor has procured the motor and same has been installed in the AC unit. work has been completed successfully and AC is working fine', 'Hitesh', 'Modern HVAC', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(873, '2018-05-22 17:15:29', 89, '', 'Target rotating bearings needs to be replaced with new one.', 'PLD- III target rotating assembly bearing warn out, it was not functioning well, it rotates in clockwise direction while rotating in anticlockwise direction it was not rotates. Target rotating bearings needs to be replaced with new one.\\r\\nmail sent to the vendor for troubleshooting.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(874, '2018-05-23 17:43:59', 89, '', '', 'Leak in combination valve\\r\\nLeak in vent valve.\\r\\nTool is made up for usage.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(873, '2018-05-28 12:00:16', 89, '', '', 'Excel instrument person has came on Friday for troubleshooting, they were change the 6 bearing of the target rotating assembly. \\r\\nNow it is working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
