(878, '2018-05-30 11:25:44', 297, 'Facility', 'Compressor 4 faulty, compressor showing ground', 'New compressor has been ordered on 21st may\\r\\nCompressor delivered on 24th may\\r\\nInstallation started on 25th May,\\r\\n28th wire issue was solved and found one of the LP cut out was faulty, which needs to be replaced\\r\\n29th May the LP cut out was procured \\r\\n30th may LP cut out installed \\r\\n\\r\\n', 'Amit', 'Rotex', '', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2018-07-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
