(880, '2018-05-30 11:42:47', 89, '', 'Chamber is not pumpdown below 10 pascal', 'Checked pump is working or not, vacuum checked on pump mouth it is 4E-04 mbar is in specs. \\r\\nvacuum Checked with bellow it is 2.5E-01 mbar. Leak in bellow and need to be replace.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'mail sent to inventory for procurement.'),
