(896, '2018-06-13 08:05:05', 297, 'Amit Das, Hitesh B, Irwin', 'Single Phase issue came due to loose connection of HP LP Wire to terminal strip', 'Step wise trouble shooting carried out after wet cleaning was done in the morning. Issue attended and resolved same day [8/6/2018] by 12:30 pm', 'Facility Team', 'Rotex', 'Mr. Anand Bankar', 'Good', 'Guided during troubleshooting', 'None', 'None', 'N.A.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'SOP of troubleshooting to be made as learning for future', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(897, '2018-06-13 08:09:34', 297, 'Amit Das, Hitesh B, Irwin', 'Found root cause was water dripped inside the unit during heavy rain and caused short of phase and neutral wire giving supply to condenser fans. Issue started on 9/6/2018.', 'Due to heavy rain over the weekend could not open the out door unit to troubleshoot. On 11/6/2018 the issue was resolved by doing removing the burnt out wiring and did re-wiring again. MPD also found faulty.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'MPD [ Motor Protection Device ] to be changed and plan to be made to prevent rain water getting inside the unit and causing problems', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(898, '2018-06-13 08:13:49', 297, 'Amit Das, Dew Point', 'Found discharge pipe got crack due to vibration of unit in running condition and all gas escaped. Current reading found less so concluded there is less/no gas in the compressor. Put off compressor mcb in AHU Panel.', 'Called Dew Point to do brazing and overnight standing pressure test', 'Facility Team', 'Dew point', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Good', 'Pressure test is still underway. Unit to be made up by today.', 'R-22', '', '', '2018-06-13 00:00:00', 'Ensure no pressure drop after standing pressure test, then vaccummize the system and fill R-22 first in off condition then later with compressor in running condition', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary]', '', 'Plan to be made to avoid / minimize the occurence of such kind of incidents in future.'),
(891, '2018-06-13 08:22:01', 297, 'Facility Team', '1] On 8/6/2018 shut down taken to re-distribute the heater banks to prevent power supply tripping in main panel\\r\\n2] During night time shift [11/6/2018] temperature went high. Put off heater banks', 'On 12/6/2018 after troubleshooting found the Compressor 2 fan motor jammed so removed that fan motor and replaced by identical one from MBE AHU 8.5 TR Compressor', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Godrej Lawkim condenser motor needed in spare', 'Rs. 15000/-', 'Not easily available in market/Obsolete', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Plan to change the condenser fan motors to the same type as used in Chillers which have a much lower failure rate', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary]', 'uploads/891_0.jpg', ''),
(890, '2018-06-13 09:23:48', 297, '', 'Issue in LP HP cut out, leak in one of the line', 'LP HP cutout has been replaced, Gas top up has been done', '', 'weltech', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '2018-07-13 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'chiller is working fine'),
