(312, '2018-06-18 15:18:52', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vendor took ENI power supply for checking interface, but it is not getting powered up.\\r\\nEMT sent AE power supply specs details as ENI power supply will be replaced with AE power supply due to service support issues.', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'This week vendor will be coming for further installatin work'),
(901, '2018-06-19 10:22:53', 297, 'Amit/Rajendra/Hitesh B/Irwin', 'Found R & Y Phase of main incoming cable to condenser unit was shorted due to problem in terminal strip connector', 'Replaced with new connector and did the wiring again', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'One terminal connector strip', '', 'Not Needed - already in spare', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Weekly/Periodic checking of electrical connections in condenser units needed as situation changes very fast from day to day.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/901_0.jpg', '1] Removed the condenser unit cable from output of mcb in ahu control panel and checked all components - found ok\\r\\n2] Checked compressor all phase to phase winding shows 1.8 ohms and phase to earth no continuity so compressor is OK \\r\\n3] Reconnected only condenser fans and power supply and checked - keeping compressor power supply isolated - found mcb does not trip\\r\\n4] Reconnected compressor 3 phase power supply with new terminal connector strip. Then put on the mcb. \\r\\n5] No more tripping'),
(902, '2018-06-19 17:26:49', 297, 'Amit Das, Raju Khanvilkar', 'Went on top of the false ceiling of Nano Lab and found water accumulated due to condensation/sweating around the hepa filter where the duct connects to it.', 'Cleaned up all the water accumulated around the hepa filters.', 'Amit Das, Raju Khanvilkar', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Will ask ducting vendor to have a look within this week and give us a roadmap to tackle the issue.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'No Vendor Interaction'),
(903, '2018-06-19 17:34:41', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Issue was flagged by LIC. Earlier on 9/6/2018 removed all the water with vacuum cleaner. Went above false ceiling on Friday last week - i.e. 15/6/2018 and found water accumulated due to sweating/condensation at the point where duct connects with lab supply grille.', 'Removed the water to bucket and kept under observation. No water dripping observed on Monday - 18/6/2018 whole day.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Silicone Gun required', 'MMIC to get', 'ASAP/At The Earliest', '2018-06-29 00:00:00', 'Plan made to do the following \\r\\na] Facility Team to use silicone sealant to seal around all the screws where water is/was dripping [Short Term]\\r\\nb] Call ducting vendor to show the issue & plan to ', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'No vendor interaction till now but in future ducting vendor will be called'),
