(857, '2018-06-20 12:20:02', 725, '', '1.	Tool, developers and mask have no issue\\r\\n2.	Lab conditions (Temp. and Humidity out of specs) have issues with exposure due condensation on lens.\\r\\n3.	 Tool is up for use, if temp. & Humidity with in specs.\\r\\n4.	 Log hrs writing may have issue, if temp. & Humidity out of specs during writing hrs.\\r\\n    \\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/857_3.docx', ''),
