(911, '2018-06-27 11:56:29', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Wafer arm getting stuck in process chamber during automatic wafer transfer.', 'During PM oxford engineer checked the system & found that the Pulley drive, Belt and Rail Guide were damaged.\\r\\nReceived new parts from Oxford.\\r\\nReplacement of faulty parts has been done by Oxford engineer.\\r\\n94-MD00C17699 Pully Drive\\r\\n94-G-SUN-BEL-0013 BELT S/S 6.35W X 0.075THK X 731 LG\\r\\n94-G-SUN-BRG-903 RAIL GUIDE MIN LM Type HRW12\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem checked by HiteshK, working fine. More than 20times wafer transfer done, no issue found.', 'Pradeep, HiteshK', 'Oxford Instruments', 'Mr. Chandrashekhar Kambar', 'Good', '', 'Load Lock pulley & belt assembly', 'RS.251630', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
