(912, '2018-07-03 10:29:48', 297, 'Rajendra, Irwin', 'Thermostat setting not adequate', 'Checked chiller tank water level found OK. \\r\\nCleaned temperature sensor and checked condenser fan operation. Found OK. Then checked setting of thermostat and found bit high which was the reason for compressor cycling. Hence thermostat setting reduced and operation became smooth.', '', '', '', '', '', 'None', 'NA', '', '2018-07-03 00:00:00', 'Chiller is under AMC.', 'Facility Team', '', 'Facility Team was first responder in this case.'),
(904, '2018-07-03 10:47:46', 297, 'Facility Team', '', '', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. Deepak Sharma - Proprietor', 'Good', 'For sourcing the motor', 'Godrej Motor', 'Rs. 3500/-', '3 to 4 days', '2018-07-04 00:00:00', 'Install motor with fan blade, connect power supply, take test run and ensure that motor is working fine.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'Motor has been received yesterday but due to heavy rain its installation and testing could not be started. Work to be completed within today/tomorrow.'),
