(696, '2018-07-04 12:24:41', 89, '', '', 'Vendor has asked for 100% LC payment as per their quote payment terms.\\r\\nAs per email from DRMM, director approval is required for 100% advance payment.\\r\\nProf Dipankar is following up with Department stores.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
