(904, '2018-07-10 09:44:27', 297, 'Amit/Rajendra/Hitesh B/Irwin', '', 'Installed new second hand motor in 8.5 TR Condenser Unit of MBE AHU, did connection and put on.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(907, '2018-07-10 09:49:44', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Took Current Readings and found that in R Phase with all heater on the total current is coming nearly 100 Amperes but the mccb in out going feeder is rated for 63 Amps max.', '1] Requested MMIC to procure new mccb of 125 Amps max rating\\r\\n2] Complaint logged with IIT EMD side by side to attend this issue\\r\\n3] Changed AHU running mode from Star Delta to VFD since it takes less current \\r\\n4] Kept Heater Bank 3 off since it takes high current (14 Amps) and causes lab temperature to rise beyond 24 deg C', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'MCCB', 'Rs. 3500/-', 'By MMIC', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Working with MMIC to source a spare MCCB of 125 Amps rating to replace the present one.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/907_2.jpg', ''),
(914, '2018-07-10 09:54:29', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found leak in compressor discharge line in 2 places and no R-22 gas in the system. N2 filled in the system and leak was found with soap solution.', 'Kept mcb/power supply isolated. Removed N2 gas after finding both the leaks. Did brazing and put for N2 standing pressure test overnight. Next day found no pressure drop so vaccuum taken and R-22 filled into the system.', 'Amit Das, Irwin', 'Dew point', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Plan to check compressor anti vibration bushing and mounting on regular basis going forward', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(916, '2018-07-10 09:58:51', 297, 'Amit, Irwin', 'Found the mcb in Comp 5 control panel tripping. Found issue is in mcb.', 'Replaced with identical rated 3 Pole C 32 mcb on Monday morning [9/7/2018]', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '3 Pole C32 MCB', 'NIL - was in spare', 'Not Needed - already in spare', '2018-07-10 00:00:00', 'Plan & SOP is already is in place to deal with such situations', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(917, '2018-07-10 10:00:00', 297, 'Amit, Irwin', 'Seen water on the wires inside the unit', 'Kept mcb off due to heavy rain. Unable to take action till now due to rain outside.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(919, '2018-07-10 10:17:31', 297, 'Hitesh B', 'Vibration / SPM readings have gone into red zone', 'This air compressor is being used sparingly - only for standby in case of sudden dip in N2 Plant pressure of if there is any issue with GA30 [Big Air Compressor]', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Ashish More', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Plan to replace with GA 30 (new)', 'Rs. 650000/- already approved', 'Purchase underway. 3rd Time Re-Tendered', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Once New GA 30 comes then this unit will be dismantled.', 'Hitesh B [Primary Owner], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary Owners]', 'uploads/919_0.jpg', ''),
(919, '2018-07-10 10:18:30', 297, 'Hitesh B', '', '', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Ashish More', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2018-08-31 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(918, '2018-07-10 10:26:17', 297, 'Hitesh B', 'Big Air Compressor [Atlas Copco GA 30] readings have gone into yellow zone.', 'Requested vendor to give estimate. \\r\\nForwarded estimate to FIC [Laha Sir] for Fund Approval. \\r\\nFIC has advised to get fund approval in FOC. \\r\\nFund Approval being requested in FOC [11 July 2018]', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Ashish More / Mr. Satish Utekar / Mr. Pranav Nagle', 'Satisfactory', 'Requested fresh quotation from vendor due to few errors in present quotation.', 'New Motor, Compressor, Screw Element', 'Rs. 375000/-', '4 - 5 weeks from receipt of PO', '2018-08-31 00:00:00', 'Once new compressor, motor & screw element are received at site then AMC Vendor [Enercare] will be asked to install these new components and make the system functional. Then recondition old parts.', 'Hitesh B [Primary Owner], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary Owners]', '', 'Needed Urgently since procurement of GA 30 as replacement of GA 18 [Small Air Compressor] has run into some hurdles and will take longer than expected.'),
(917, '2018-07-11 11:06:13', 297, 'AHU Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-07-13 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(919, '2018-07-11 11:44:41', 297, '', '', '22/10/17- budgetary quote has been received\\r\\n12/1/18- Approval received to go ahead from prof. laha -funds were approved from INUP\\r\\n1/3/18- fresh quote has been received by MMIC and handed over to Purchase team to start PO.\\r\\nIts almost 4 month now but no PO has been made....', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(921, '2018-07-16 14:24:12', 89, 'EMT', 'Found camera is not working', 'Camera usb driver was found to be corrupted.\\r\\nUninstalled the driver & reinstalled it.\\r\\nNow the camera is working fine.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(920, '2018-07-17 17:00:36', 297, 'Rajendra, Amit, Irwin', 'Condenser Fan making noise in running condition on 12/7/2018', 'Condenser Fan replaced with the one kept in spare', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Condenser Fan', 'NIL - was in spare', 'Not Needed - already in spare', '2018-07-17 00:00:00', 'Send the faulty condenser fan for repair and then keep as spare for immediate replacement', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'Action Item completed on 13/7/2018 in second half taking shut down of Micro 1 Lab'),
(917, '2018-07-17 17:03:18', 297, 'Amit, Irwin', 'Found the neutral wire of MPD was loose', 'Neutral wire was reconnected to N terminal of MPD [Motor Protection Device]', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Nil', 'Nil', 'Nil', '2018-07-17 00:00:00', '', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'Work completed and issue resolved on 11/7/2018'),
