(924, '2018-07-23 09:15:09', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT had video telephonic conversation with Ferrotec (Alfred & Cristian). They had complete view of the system and confirmed all the connections & grounidng is fine.\\r\\nOn troubleshooting found there is issue in one of the IC of CPU card. Replaced the faulty IC with a new one. \\r\\nChecked system, there is no issue as reported seen.\\r\\nSystem was under observation for 3days, no issue.\\r\\nSO has to check the system and update if any issue is there.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', 'Ferrotec', 'Alfred, Cristian,\\r\\n\\r\\nAlfred Mutscheller\\r\\nProduct Specialist EB Gun\\r\\nFerrotec Europe GmbH, SeerosenstraÃŸe 1, 72669 Unterensingen - Germany\\r\\nt: +49 7022-9270-300 â€“ m: +49 174 34 67 049\\r\\ne:  amutscheller@de.ferrotec.com - www.ferrotec-global.com', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'System can be used for process'),
(922, '2018-07-23 09:19:55', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Calibration is working for a single scanner (say 400microns). If another is selected (say 200microns), the value is not shown correct, and is calibrate wrt this, then previous scanner calibration goes off.\\r\\nEmail sent to OEM for help.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
