(960, '2018-09-12 11:44:58', 712, '', 'CFM seems less', '1] Gas Pressure checked found normal \\r\\n2] Expansion valve checked on 3/8/2018\\r\\n3] Filter Dryer changed on 6/8/2018 but still ice formation was coming\\r\\n4] So unit was being run only from 9 am to 6 pm each day\\r\\n5] Fresh Air opened 50% to increase CFM across DX Coil inside AHU \\r\\n6] 11/9/2018 - Nano AHU shut down for 10 minutes and Comp 4 evaporator coil was blanked off and kept off\\r\\n7] 12/9/2018 - Till today morning no ice formation or tripping of Comp 5 has been observed. Unit will be under observation till Friday evening 6 pm \\r\\n', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. Deepak Verma', 'Good', '', 'Filter Dryer changed', '0', 'Was already in spare with MMIC', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Expansion Valve has been ordered. If ice formation is observed yet again then Expansion Valve will be changed in next upcoming PM Shut Down', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(961, '2018-09-12 11:55:27', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Work in progress', '1] Fan motor sent for varnishing and brought back and connected \\r\\n2] Both units electronic controllers was swapped but then HP LP issue came in Condenser 1 \\r\\n3] New electronic controllers were installed for both condenser units \\r\\n4] R-22 gas pressure readings were checked and found OK in both condenser units\\r\\n5] On 11/9/2018 took opinion of vendor during a short site visit. Plan was made to change filter dryer but then realized that filter dryer was already changed when expansion valve was changed during shut down on 14/7/2018 so not needed. \\r\\n6] Today i.e. 12/9/2018 - Vendor\\\'s service engineer will be coming to check both compressors esp. Compressor 2 which is giving issue', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. Deepak Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2018-09-17 00:00:00', 'Trouble shooting to be carried out to check Comp 2 today. Based upon the results of this trouble shooting further action to be taken', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(963, '2018-09-12 12:02:35', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor due to age is now pulling higher amps than normal', '1] Water supply given from MBE 1O TR Chiller on Saturday\\r\\n2] Trouble Shooting done first suspicion was condenser fan issue but after loose connection issue sorted this was eliminated as cause of failure \\r\\n3] On Monday - 10/9/2018 Compressor was checked. Found its pulling higher amps than normal. Around 12 Amp per phase but overload relay max setting is 10 Amps so comp trips on OL and water temperature is going high. \\r\\n4] Vendor visited on 11/9/2018 and confirmed the same. So short term fix is to change OL Relay of compressor/medium term fix is to replace the compressor/long term fix is to have standby condenser unit \\r\\n', 'Facility Team', 'weltech', 'Mr. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', 'OL Relay of higher range than 10 Amps to be supplied by vendor', '', '', '2018-09-14 00:00:00', '1] Short Term - Change OL Relay\\r\\n2] Mid Term - Change Compressor \\r\\n3] Long Term - Add Standby Condenser Unit of same capacity', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(962, '2018-09-12 12:06:43', 712, '', '12 Sep 2018 12:02 PM 	Compressor due to age is now pulling higher amps than normal', '1] Water supply given from MBE 1O TR Chiller on Saturday\\r\\n2] Trouble Shooting done first suspicion was condenser fan issue but after loose connection issue sorted this was eliminated as cause of failure \\r\\n3] On Monday - 10/9/2018 Compressor was checked. Found its pulling higher amps than normal. Around 12 Amp per phase but overload relay max setting is 10 Amps so comp trips on OL and water temperature is going high. \\r\\n4] Vendor visited on 11/9/2018 and confirmed the same. So short term fix is to change OL Relay of compressor/medium term fix is to replace the compressor/long term fix is to have standby compressor', 'Facility Team', 'weltech', 'Mr. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', 'OL Relay of higher range than 10 Amps to be supplied by vendor', '', '', '2018-09-14 00:00:00', '1] Short Term - change OL Relay\\r\\n2] Mid Term - change compressor \\r\\n3] Long Term - have a standby condenser unit of same capacity as existing one', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(964, '2018-09-12 12:11:29', 712, 'Facility Team', 'LP alarm was coming in control panel', 'Checked R-22 gas pressure found 0 psi suction in running condition. Called vendor to check.', 'Facility Team', 'weltech', 'Mr. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Awaiting Quote from Vendor', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'After cost approved the unit will be taken to vendor\\\'s premises for checking', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(954, '2018-09-17 09:58:14', 89, 'EMT', '', 'After replacing the ICs, still issue was not resolve.\\r\\nFurther troubleshooting was done on capacitors as it was found that the ICP capacitors\\\' movement was not seen in software.\\r\\nOne of the capacitor found to be faulty. \\r\\nRepair of the same was done.\\r\\nSystem checked, reflected power is now as expected. 4-5W for 1000W\\r\\nProcess run check done for Ar clean recipe & SiO2 deposition, issue resolved.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(816, '2018-09-17 10:01:38', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor on 12th Sept 2018.\\r\\nLC payment in process.\\r\\nWaiting for material.', 'Jomon', 'APP system', 'Mr. Jambunath\\r\\n#08, Ground and First floor, VK Commerce Building, KSSIDC Rajajinagar Industrial Estate,\\r\\nBangalore-560010\\r\\nLand: 080-23300080\\r\\nHP: 9916244645', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2018-10-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2018-09-17 10:07:09', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Latest update as per vendor\\\'s last visit on 12th Sept 2018:\\r\\nThe following have been successfully tested:\\r\\n1. Rotary pump ON\\r\\n2. Chamber Rough vacuum Ok\\r\\n3. Chamber vacuum through foreline ok\\r\\n4. Turbo ON with full speed & standby\\r\\n5. Chamber vacuum with turbo in 2.8E-4mbar\\r\\n6. Gas flow for all MFC checked. One SF6 MFC not working\\r\\n7. Chamber vent Ok\\r\\n8. Chamber lid up & down ok.\\r\\n9. APC working checked \\r\\nFurther action: Automatic chamber pressure control with gas flow, RF working & plasma strike', 'Sushil, Pradeep', 'Dynamic Controls', 'Mr. Ansari\\r\\nDynamic Control Systems\\r\\n923L- Navjivan Commercial Society, Dr D B Marg, Mumbai Central, Mumbai 400 008.\\r\\nTel/Fax:+ 91 22 23073543, Cell: 9869364594, 9930399310\\r\\nwww.DynamicControlSystems.IN', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '2018-09-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
