(964, '2018-09-25 17:47:07', 712, 'Amit Das, Hitesh B', '350 PSI N2 found filled in the compressor on 24/9/2018 so overnight standing pressure test taken. Today found no drop in pressure. Hence No Leak now.', 'Vacuum taken and R-22 Filled and unit switched on.', 'Facility Team + Vendor Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-09-28 00:00:00', 'Will be kept under observation till 28/9/2018', 'Amit Das', '', 'Further action plan made to modify the duct connection of Fresh Air Unit to AHU and the Fresh Air filter loading location will be place @ input to the Treated Fresh Air Unit for ease of change out.'),
(965, '2018-09-25 17:52:52', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Checked out door unit yesterday. Found contactor stuck.', 'Spare contactor identified for change out', 'Facility Team + Vendor Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Contactor required', 'Nil -already in stock', 'Nil - already in stock', '2018-09-27 00:00:00', 'Contactor to be changed on 26/9/2018 & then after checking in running condition then further action will be decided.', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(919, '2018-09-25 18:03:30', 712, 'Facility Team', 'On 17/9/2018 GA30 motor winding failed due to bearing jammed', 'Kept off the power to GA30 air compressor. Dismantled the motor from compressor and screw element and sent for repair', 'Facility Team + Vendor Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Ashish More - Enercare [AMC Vendor]', 'Satisfactory', '', 'New motor and compressor screw element awaited', 'Rs. 4,00,000/-', '6 - 8 weeks', '2018-10-08 00:00:00', 'Following up with vendor for new motor and compressor screw element for which PO has already been sent in the month of August. \\r\\n\\r\\nMeanwhile failed motor repair also being followed up side by side', 'Hitesh B [Primary]/Sandeep M [Secondary]', '', ''),
(966, '2018-09-26 09:32:47', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Vendor has been called for breakdown visit to handle the issue.', 'Bhimraj, SarannyaT', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-10-01 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2018-09-26 09:36:50', 89, 'EMT', '', 'All the electrical connections have been completed.\\r\\nToday, testing of all the components in manual mode will be done.\\r\\nSoftware has been installed in IITB computer. Testing will be done with software.\\r\\nFurther updates on system working status will be provided by 28th Sept.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-10-01 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
