(968, '2018-10-03 09:47:09', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Increased HP Cut Out setting from 250 to 300 PSI and Comp 4 started running', 'Checked all wiring, mpd, sub zero temp controller found no issue', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Nil', 'Nil', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Under observation till Friday 5 October 2018', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(967, '2018-10-03 09:50:29', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Leak found in suction line of compressor by LP Cut Out after checking with 250 PSI Nitrogen filled into the system', 'After finding the leak, all N2 evacuated and copper brazing done at leak. Again pressurized to 250 PSI found no leak/pressure drop. Kept for overnight standing pressure test.', 'Facility Team', 'Mr. Prasad N', 'Dew Point', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Nil', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Check today the N2 pressure. If no pressure drop then remove N2, evacuate/vacuumize the line and fill R22 and put the system on', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(965, '2018-10-03 09:56:48', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor winding found short with body', 'Took 5 to 10 minutes shutdown on 2/10/2018 around 4:30 pm. Checked compressor winding after removing power cable connection. Found winding short with body/ground. Hence this is the cause of OL [Over Load] coming. No issue found in contactor which was suspected earlier.', 'Facility Team', 'Mr. Prasad N', 'Dew Point', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Compressor required', 'Rs. 60,000/-', '2 - 3 weeks', '2018-10-26 00:00:00', 'Replace the compressor when new compressor is made available', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(964, '2018-10-03 10:00:06', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Work still in progress', 'Ducting was modified last week. \\r\\nUnit put on on Monday 1/10/2018 but still showing 32 deg C Temperature. So put off the unit. \\r\\n\\r\\nOn 2/10/2018 standing pressure checked. Found to be 130 psi which is OK. Hence do not suspect any R-22 gas leak again.', 'Facility Team', 'Mr. Lal Bihar', 'J P Air Systems', 'Satisfactory', 'Ducting Modification', 'Material for Ducting', 'Rs. 25,000/-', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Silicone will be filled at all the gaps where duct enters the plant room', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(969, '2018-10-03 10:05:57', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Suspecting main chiller controller motherboard faulty, getting hanged. Due to some mal-function the chiller display shows low temperature error.', 'Changed sensor 3 times, swapped to New Standby Chiller still the same problem came. \\r\\n\\r\\nCalled SO [System Owners] to have PPMS SET UP shut down while vendor attends to the chiller issue.', 'Facility Team', 'Thomas', 'BluBerg / Weltech Refrigeration', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Vendor due to come today and check the issue in Chiller Control Panel.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(970, '2018-10-03 10:10:15', 297, 'electrical facility team', 'All Batteries of Raith UPS Battery Bank gone bad.', 'Checked all power connections, checked batteries with battery tester and found all readings are out of spec. \\r\\n\\r\\nAll batteries replaced by new batteries on 2/10/2018', 'Rajendra', '', '', '', '', 'All 40 batteries replaced', 'Rs. 40,000/- approx', '1 Day', '2018-10-03 00:00:00', 'Plan to monitor temperature in Nano Service Corridor going forward', 'Facility Team', '', ''),
(966, '2018-10-03 11:31:36', 89, 'Process', '', 'Spare part 04847 Solenoid Valve 3-Way required for the system. Vendor had asked to confirm availability.\\r\\nThe part is available with IITB.', 'Saranya T', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-10-03 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
