(1005, '2018-11-20 07:55:22', 297, '', 'Earlier issue was found in contactor which was not passing yellow phase properly', 'Contactor in outdoor unit was replaced on 15/11/2018. Still the same issue started coming again.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'CHNT Contactor', 'NIL - was in spare', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Full check to be conducted today morning 10:00 am onwards', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/1005_0.pdf', 'Long Term Plan: Standby 8.5 TR Condenser Unit to be added'),
