(1004, '2018-11-20 07:58:24', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found only condenser fan running and no cooling from the unit. Checked outside unit and found refrigerant oil leakage from service valve.', 'Put the unit off till further inspection', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-23 00:00:00', 'To be checked today', '', '', ''),
(1003, '2018-11-20 08:00:13', 297, '', '', 'Contactor change completed yesterday. AHU shut down for 10 minutes from 3:20 pm till about 3:35 pm and new contactor fixed', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-23 00:00:00', 'Keep unit under observation till Friday this week. Check if SPP [Single Phase Preventor] is functioning fine/properly.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1002, '2018-11-20 08:04:17', 297, '', 'Found unit not turning on. Found the reason to be LP interlock came into picture due to R-22 gas leak from the system on suction line', 'Removed the R-22 from the entire system. Cut off and blanked the section of suction pipeline which has frequent leakages in this section. New copper pipe to be brought and connected back today by brazing.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad N, Mr. Shah Rukh', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-22 00:00:00', 'Fix back the copper pipe and braze. Do leak test with soap bubbles. If no leak found put for overnight standing pressure test. If no pressure drop then evacuate the system and fill R-22', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/1002_0.pdf', ''),
(1001, '2018-11-20 08:06:40', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor makes abnormal sound in running condition', 'Call taken to replace the compressor with spare 8.5 TR compressor.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad N, Mr. Shah Rukh', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Compressor 8.5 TR', '', '', '2018-11-23 00:00:00', 'Unit will be under observation till Friday this week before this complaint is closed out', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/1001_0.pdf', ''),
(995, '2018-11-20 08:08:33', 297, '', '', 'Contactor changed on 15/11/2018', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Still the same issue observed since 19/11/2018 so this complaint will be closed and new one opened for compressor issue. Its not a contactor issue now.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1006, '2018-11-20 08:14:36', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Checked inside AHU Panel and found compressor mcb on. Then checked out door unit and found that after main power terminal strip the R phase wire was burnt and disconnected so put off the supply to this compressor. MPD [Motor Protection Device] sensed the missing phase and protected the entire system by cutting of the power supply of the power contactor for compressor. So compressor was protected.', 'Checked compressor winding and found 3.8 ohms in all windings and no short with body so compressor is fine. Re-wiring of terminal strip was carried out on 11 Nov 2018', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-23 00:00:00', 'Unit under observation since 11/11/2018. No further issue observed till now after re-wiring carried out on 11th Nov 2018', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', 'uploads/1006_0.pdf', ''),
(1000, '2018-11-22 09:50:59', 89, '', '', 'EMT is busy with PM schedule...\\r\\nThis issue will be handled on 22nd Nov', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-23 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(997, '2018-11-22 09:54:02', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sen to vendor on 20th Nov 2018 by purchase team (Jomon)', 'Jomon', 'Raith GmbH', 'Raith, Germany..', 'Good', '', 'Column chamber valve', 'Euro 2499', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/997_1.pdf', ''),
(979, '2018-11-22 19:17:14', 699, '', 'The request cannot be considered as process issue, as  in this case AZO\\r\\ndeposition is carried out AZO at room temperature (RT) using Dielectric\\r\\nsputter system and the results are compared  with deposition carried\\r\\nout high substrate temperature by another user in Nordiko set up in 2013.\\r\\nWe can consider it as process complaint if you/any user have deposited AZO\\r\\nfilm at RT earlier and its poly-crystalline nature not having\\r\\nrepeat-ability', 'Checked with Prasenjit Ray(the reference mentioned), he confirmed that he has done the deposition in Nordiko sputter at higher substrate temperature.\\r\\n\\r\\nMy suggestions for the process would be :\\r\\nFor first case Si/SiO2 we can try higher substrate temperature and check XRD. For second case Si/SiO2/SU-8 the temperature cannot be increased to a greater extent considering the resist. We can finalize the temperature in that case by checking the resist chart.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn this case, considering AZO as a user specific target, the parameters\\r\\nfor poly-crystalline nature of  AZO needs to be optimized. This was discussed with the faculty in-charge and the FOC members about considering the optimization as IITBNF baseline runs, it was decided that\\r\\nfor any user specific targets, the user should bear the optimization charges.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'In this case, considering AZO as a user specific target, the parameters for poly-crystalline nature of  AZO needs to be optimized. This was discussed with the faculty in-charge and the FOC members about considering the optimization as IITBNF baseline runs, it was decided that for any user specific targets, the user should bear the optimization charges.'),
(1007, '2018-11-26 09:23:49', 89, 'EMT', 'Found plasma is not striking. Reflected power is 50W for any power.', 'EMT did troubleshooting on ALD W/L. Plasma striking issue has been resolved. EMT has cleaned Inductor and matching unit. We checked on 300w plasma is striking.\\r\\n', 'Sushil, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1008, '2018-11-27 14:45:39', 89, 'Process', '', 'Email sent to vendor.\\r\\nVendor will visit to check the issue on 28th Nov', 'Gayatri', 'Karl Zeiss', 'Karambelkar, Vasudeo\\ <vasudeo.karambelkar@zeiss.com>,\\r\\nRamesh Hegde <ramesh.hegde@zeiss.com>', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '2018-11-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1000, '2018-11-27 14:47:56', 89, 'EMT', 'Substrate loading issue was found.\\r\\nHeater overshoot issue', 'Substrate holder was found to be little tight for operating.\\r\\nDue to improper handling, substrate holder was little bent. \\r\\nTemperature overshoot was happening due to some setting changed by some user.\\r\\nAll the issues have been rectified.\\r\\nSystem is working fine. Checked by operator (minita)', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
