(1012, '2018-12-12 08:20:54', 297, 'Facility Team', '', 'MCB was tripping on Saturday [8/12/2018]. Removed compressor connection and checked only condenser fans - that time mcb did not trip. Hence suspected compressor gone bad', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC System', 'Mr. D. Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', '11 TR Copeland Scroll Compressor', 'Rs. 60,000/-', 'In spare / In stock', '2018-12-14 00:00:00', 'Remove old compressor, fix new compressor, connect suction and discharge lines with brazing torch, pressure test for 24 hours, evacuation of pressure test passed, and R-22 filing', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
