(1019, '2018-12-26 10:49:19', 89, 'EMT', 'Found that the load lock vacuum is not able to reach below E-1 Torr, with turbo also it goes to E-6 but again falls down to E-1 Torr', 'Checked the system and found turbo vent valve was found in loose connection. This has been tightened and checked load lock pumping. \\r\\nVacuum is able to reach E-6 Torr.\\r\\nIssue resolved, system working fine', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1020, '2018-12-26 10:52:42', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Troubleshooting done as per email from vendor to disasemble the heater assembly. \\r\\nFound Al deposition on different parts of heater. \\r\\nRemoved the assembly and cleaned all the parts.\\r\\nCeramic isolation bead for power connection to heater coil is broken. Needs to be replaced.\\r\\nEMT will get the part.', 'Amita, Prof UG, Vinayak, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2018-12-27 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1020, '2018-12-28 15:46:24', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Modified ceramic washers from EMT stock have been fitted in the system.\\r\\nHeater was still not working.\\r\\nHeater controller was opened for checking the fuse, and found one of the fuse was blown OFF. Replaced with a new one in system spares.\\r\\nHeater is working fine, checked by Amita till 650degC.', 'Vinayak,Amita, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'New ceramic washers (as per original sample) to be procured and installed in place of the modified washers (circular). This decision has been taken in discussion with Prof UG on 28th Dec.', '', '', 'Inventory is procuring the part.'),
(1024, '2018-12-31 16:44:31', 89, 'EMT', '', 'MFC controller unit in the system has ports for 5 MFC.\\r\\n5th MFC port has been connected to QCM MFC.\\r\\nChecked MFC flow, working fine.\\r\\nThe same has been informed to SO (Jayeeta)', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
