(1023, '2018-12-31 16:48:31', 89, 'EMT', '', 'System restarted and checked. All switches started again.\\r\\nChecked gas flow, working fine.\\r\\nRecipe of NH3 & O2 separately checked, worked without error.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
