(1028, '2019-01-08 18:47:07', 297, '', 'LP alarm in Compressor 2', 'Checked compressor suction pressure found low only about 20 psi. Did R-22 top up till 55 psi.', 'Amit, Hitesh B, Irwin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Keep under observation till tomorrow evening', 'Amit Das', '', 'No more CP Alarm came after R-22 gas top up was done'),
