(1027, '2019-01-08 18:51:17', 297, '', 'SPD [Single Phase Preventor] changed', 'Trouble shooting done. Found OL signal was coming from SPD. Decided to change SPD. Now no OL coming but ice formation observed on suction line.', 'Amit, Hitesh B, Irwin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-11 00:00:00', 'OL issue resolved but R-22 Standing/Suction/Discharge pressures need to be checked to find out why there is ice formation.', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(1018, '2019-01-08 18:53:22', 297, '', 'Vibration due to rusted cover panels of out door unit', 'Vendor came yesterday and installed new panels, removed the old rusted panels.', 'Amit, Irwin', 'Mr. Thomas', 'Weltech Refrigeration', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', 'Chiller test run taken yesterday and today. Found no vibration issue.', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(992, '2019-01-08 18:55:58', 297, '', '', '', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-11 00:00:00', 'UPS under observation to see if display goes blank again. If display goes blank again need to think to replace the UPS as per Raith Engineer\\\'s recommendations. This is last and final try.', 'Rajendra S, A Irwin', '', ''),
(1029, '2019-01-09 10:08:44', 297, '', '', 'Informed LIC & SO to black out the system. Vendor expected to come tomorrow to check the UPS', 'Facility Electrical Team', 'Techser UPS', 'Mr. Mandar Joshi', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-10 00:00:00', 'Vendor will come tomorrow and assess the cost of repair and submit detailed report of what has gone bad. Accordingly we will plan the repair.', 'Irwin, Rajendra S', '', 'AMC Quotation under study to see terms and conditions ok before submitting for fund approval'),
(1020, '2019-01-12 19:46:41', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New insulating washers (Al2O3) received from Excel Instruments and installed in the heater assembly.\\r\\nHeater checked at 750degC by SO (Amita).\\r\\nIt is working fine.', 'Vinayak, Amita, Pradeep', 'Excel Instruments', 'Mr Subhash Pai\\r\\n9867312962', 'Good', '', 'Al2O3 insulating washers for heater power connections', 'Rs. 1500 + 28% GST', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1035, '2019-01-15 14:35:27', 297, 'Amit, Rajendra, Irwin', 'Wire Burn - Y Phase', 'Checked and found wire burn at MCB in supply cable side just before condenser unit.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-15 00:00:00', 'Put off power supply from AHU control panel and rectified the issue', 'Amit Das', '', 'Unit will be under observation for next 2 - 3 days.'),
(1034, '2019-01-15 14:38:39', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Weak start capacitor was found to be the root cause of the issue', 'Put off power supply to condenser units, changed capacitor and did greasing of motor shaft.', 'Amit, Irwin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-15 00:00:00', 'Heater Bank to be installed in Micro 2 AHU for for humidity control', 'Amit Das, Irwin', '', ''),
