(1037, '2019-01-20 23:24:31', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the issue, error 117 is for water cooling. Checked water cooling, no issue found.\\r\\nReset alarm done, system is working fine.', 'Bhimraj, Pijush', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1039, '2019-01-20 23:25:59', 89, 'Facility', 'Bubble seen in the return flow meters of all the systems.', 'Informed to facility team. Facility team removed the air bubble trapped in the line. Cause not known, may be due to water level low.\\r\\nIssue resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1041, '2019-01-22 17:19:05', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found R-22 gas leak in 2 - 3 places.', 'Brazing done and put for pressure test with N2 at 230 psi but the pressure did not hold. When checked on 21/1/2019 the gauge showed 0 psi. So again got the whole line checked and found issue in suction line service valve. \\r\\n\\r\\nAfter suction line service valve changed found issue in threading of discharge line service valve and thermostatic expansion valve also needs to be changed.', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. D. Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Suction Line Service Valve, Thermostatic Expansion Valve', 'Rs. 15,000/-', 'PO need to be made', '2019-02-05 00:00:00', 'Awaiting quote from the vendor & second quote from MMIC then after quote comparison call will be taken', 'Amit Das, Irwin', '', ''),
(1040, '2019-01-22 17:24:04', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor has gone bad. Needs to be replaced.', 'Checked compressor windings found 1.9 ohms between all three phases and no continuity with earth/ground so no electrical issue.', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. D. Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', '11 TR Scroll Compressor', 'Compressor failed in warranty', '2 weeks', '2019-02-05 00:00:00', 'Compressor and filter dryer to be replaced together. Need to check feasibility of installing liquid line filter dryer before the compressor in the suction line. \\r\\n', 'Amit Das, Irwin', '', ''),
(1038, '2019-01-23 09:29:14', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Chamber cleaning done and baking done by heating the chamber.\\r\\nNow vacuum reaching 5E-6 mbar in 2hours.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1032, '2019-01-23 10:01:23', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Pending gauge display issue resolved, there might be some loose connection. It shows vacuum now.\\r\\n\\r\\nDeposition rate changing issue did not occur after cleaning the chamber & electric assembly. All the connection tightened properly.\\r\\n', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1042, '2019-01-23 10:07:41', 89, 'EMT', 'Process running fine at room temperature.\\r\\nBut at high temperature, when plasma is switched ON, there is arcing inside the chamber and heater trips (fuse blow off)', 'This issue occurred after Al Chuck had melted in the chamber.\\r\\nIssue same after replacing the fuse.\\r\\nVendor suggested replacement of insulator washer in the heater assembly. EMT did this with locally made washers, but issue is there.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1042, '2019-01-23 10:09:59', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked if grounding is the issue, tried changing the grounding connection of the frame & chamber, still issue persists.\\r\\nOEM vendor suggested to replace all the insulators & heater power cable inside the chamber.\\r\\nWaiting for quote.', 'Pradeep, vinayak, Amita', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'System is working for room temperature processes.'),
(1041, '2019-01-29 09:38:43', 297, 'Irwin, Sandeep', '', 'Replaced faulty discharge & suction line service valves, replaced thermostatic expansion valve & filter dryer. Put for overnight pressure test with Nitrogen.', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. D Verma, Mr. M Sheikh', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2019-01-30 00:00:00', 'Check the standing pressure today. If no pressure drop seen, then take vacuum for 1 hour and fill R-22 & put on the unit and check the running currents amps each phase and top up remaining gas', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1040, '2019-01-29 09:50:12', 297, 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-14 00:00:00', 'Put on hold as we are awaiting vendor\\\'s quotation to upgrade the unit to R410a [Env. Friendly]. Need plan to add suction line accumulator ahead of compressor. CFM measurements need to be done.', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', 'Full Root Cause Analysis report awaited from vendor'),
(1044, '2019-01-30 11:46:19', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Replaced the lamp with new one.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1043, '2019-01-30 11:48:28', 89, 'EMT', '', 'DP heater wire was found burnt. Replaced with new one.\\r\\nChecked the system. It is working fine.\\r\\nAble to reach 5 E-6 mbar in 1 hour.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-01-30 12:23:04', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Checked the system:\\r\\n1. Issue of system start due to UPS issue\\r\\n2. LW1 error due to which no process can be done\\r\\n3. Beam issue', 'System UPS - batteries gone bad - swell seen\\r\\nPlan to either bypass the UPS or connect new batteries\\r\\nFor beam issue, troubleshooting is being done.', 'Sushil, Pradeep, Madhuri', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-06 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1046, '2019-02-05 09:44:48', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked the CDA regulator was OFF due to which solenoid valves were not operating.\\r\\nAfter turning ON CDA, system checked, reached high vacuum.\\r\\nSystem working fine', 'Pradeep, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-05 09:48:06', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'UPS issue resolved by replacing the batteries with Raith UPS batteries (on temporary basis, till new received)\\r\\nOne mask was kept for writing, but there were errors displayed.\\r\\nEmail sent to vendor for solution.', 'Sushil, Pradeep, Madhuri', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1047, '2019-02-05 09:50:39', 89, '', '', 'Water flushing done, System working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1042, '2019-02-05 09:55:36', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'On discussion with Dr. Aldrin & Prof Anil kulkarni, the issue is resolved.\\r\\nThere was a short between the power cable (harness) inside the chamber and chamber body which could be found using meggar tool (from power electronics lab, EE).\\r\\nInsulation applied at the point where wire contacts with chamber body.\\r\\nHeater tested after that as follows and is working fine:\\r\\nWith & without plasma, heater set point change during plasma.', 'Vinayak,Amita, Dr. Aldrin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Troubleshooting report:\\r\\nhttp://iitbnf.iitb.ac.in/emt_blog/index.php/2019/01/31/sputter-atc-2200-heater-diagnosis-and-treatment/'),
(1048, '2019-02-06 11:55:07', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked all the RF connections from RF generator, matching network to chamber, no issue found.\\r\\nPlasma strike done, system working fine.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1049, '2019-02-06 11:55:38', 297, 'electrical team', 'No feed back coming from temperature sensor to the compressor', 'we have provided alternate power to the 1 of the compressor . temperature and humidity is under control. Team is working on it today.', 'irwin, raju', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1049, '2019-02-06 11:55:56', 297, 'electrical team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-07 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-07 17:30:32', 89, '', '', 'As per vendor\\\'s email, LW1 card needs to be replaced.\\r\\nVendor is checking if they have in spare.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1051, '2019-02-08 13:00:50', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New turbo pump received from Agilent has been installed on the system.\\r\\nNew parts installed: gate valve, adapter to connect gate valve & chamber.\\r\\nToday, baseline process run is being checked.', 'All', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1052, '2019-02-08 13:04:52', 89, 'EMT', '', 'During troubleshooting found that the plasma intensity for O2 & NH3 is low as compared to previous runs, whereas for N2 it is bright.\\r\\nWhen contacted vendor, they suggested replacing quartz plasma tube assembly or send for service.\\r\\nEMT did the cleaning of plasma coil and replaced the quartz tube with a new one.', 'Vinayak, Sushil, Pradeep', 'Mr. Mark', 'ALD support, FIJI', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1052, '2019-02-08 13:19:35', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Testing of the system was done.\\r\\nPlasam intensity for all the three gases O2, NH3 & N2 are bright - working fine now.\\r\\nProcess check was done for Al2O3 & TiO2 films, both results are fine as compared to previous good results.\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem is working fine.', 'EMT, Kartikey', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1052, '2019-02-08 13:22:14', 89, '', '', 'Troubleshooting report is attached.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1052_2.doc', ''),
(1051, '2019-02-12 09:43:04', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Installation of turbo pump is done.\\r\\nChecked the system, it is working fine.\\r\\n2 process runs done.\\r\\nRetraining of AUs has been done.\\r\\nSystem is up for usage', 'Pradeep, Vinayak, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-12 15:36:27', 89, '', '', 'LW1 board is available with the vendor.\\r\\nCost is Euro 750.\\r\\nQuote has been sent to purchase team for PO processing.\\r\\n\\r\\nTool will be down till new board is received.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(312, '2019-02-12 15:37:58', 89, '', '', 'System is working fine after upgradation.\\r\\nAttached is the installation & testing report prepared by EMT.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/312_51.pptx', 'System is being used for etching.'),
(1049, '2019-02-12 18:24:19', 297, 'Facility Team', '', 'HP Cut Out short with body in 8.5 TR Chiller. Also timer was affected. This was the root cause.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Timer, Plug In Relay', '', '', '2019-02-12 00:00:00', 'Kept under observation. No issue came till now.', '', '', ''),
(1055, '2019-02-12 22:54:16', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'DSA old lamp replaced with new one in spare.\\r\\nChecked Lamp intensity it is:- 12.48 mW/cm Sq\\r\\nUniformity is: +- 1.20%\\r\\nCMOS battery replaced with new one received from inventory.\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem is working fine.', 'Sushil, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1054, '2019-02-12 22:55:54', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Servicing of the flow meter done.\\r\\nFlow meter is working fine, checked by Pankaj Kumar', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1053, '2019-02-12 22:56:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Servicing of the flow meter done.\\r\\nFlow meter is working fine, checked by Pankaj Kumar', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(945, '2019-02-13 11:18:02', 297, '', '', 'retendering process has been started', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1050, '2019-02-13 11:26:54', 89, 'EMT', 'The LED bulb is shorted. Needs to be replaced with new one', 'Order for new one in process', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `trouble_track` (`complaint_id`, `timestamp`, `status_mark_by`, `working_team`, `diagnosis`, `action_taken`, `work_done_by`, `vendor_name`, `vendor_contact`, `vendor_interaction`, `vendor_comments`, `spare_parts`, `cost_spare_parts`, `procurement_time_spares`, `expected_completion_date`, `action_plan`, `action_item_owner`, `file`, `comments`) VALUES
(982, '2019-02-13 12:12:12', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'As per vendor new pumps will be dispatched in last week of Jan 2019 or 1st week of Feb 2019.\\r\\nReminder sent for the status', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(782, '2019-02-13 12:12:33', 89, '', '', 'As per vendor new pumps will be dispatched in last week of Jan 2019 or 1st week of Feb 2019. \\r\\nReminder sent for the status', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1056, '2019-02-18 22:37:12', 89, '', '', 'Email sent to vendor for solution.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1057, '2019-02-19 15:19:33', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Leak found on discharge line of Compressor', 'Checked the unit and found gas leaked. Put 100 psi Nitrogen in the system and did soap bubble test. Found leak in the discharge line. 1 Foot section of copper pipe needs to be changed.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew point', 'Mr. Prasad N', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-21 00:00:00', 'Cut out the weak section of discharge line copper pipe. Fix new one and do brazing. Put for 24 hour standing pressure test with N2. Check if no pressure drop then vacuumize the system and fill R-22', 'Rajendra (Primary), Irwin (Secondary)', '', ''),
(1040, '2019-02-19 15:29:23', 297, 'Facility Team', '', 'Call has been taken to replace the outdoor unit. Budgetary quotation has been technically approved in facility meeting.', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. D. Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Full new condenser unit', '2.5 Lakhs', '3 months', '2019-05-19 00:00:00', 'It is standby condenser unit. Right now AHU is running on 3 compressor without issue. Once Comp 5 is fixed it will be put into usage.', 'Rajendra (Primary), Irwin (Secondary)', '', ''),
(1050, '2019-02-20 12:47:18', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New LED lamp procured and kept near the system.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-20 12:49:22', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'PO will be ready & will be sent to vendor today (20th Feb 2019).\\r\\nEmail has been sent to vendor for shipping the board.', 'Vijay, Pradeep', 'Mr. Jithin', 'Microtech', 'Good', '', '', 'Euros 750', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1056, '2019-02-20 13:03:54', 89, '', '', 'Vendor sent troubleshooting steps:\\r\\n\\ If nothing changed from Hardware and no Settings in Software, I would suggest to re-train the mask pattern in software as described in the usermanual: \\r\\n(clear and bright camera image required)\\r\\nAttached image file for your reference.\\', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1056_1.png', 'EMT is busy with Raith & Orion. Work on DSA will be done on 22nd Feb 2019'),
(1058, '2019-02-20 13:09:05', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Vendor is working on this issue.\\r\\nAs per troubleshooting done by vendor, load lock motor is not working and needs to be replaced.\\r\\nMotor is in spare, will be replaced today.', '', 'Raith GmbH, India', 'Mr. Pandurangiah', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '2019-02-22 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(945, '2019-02-20 13:21:06', 297, 'Purchase team', '', 'retendoring', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-06-20 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(992, '2019-02-20 13:21:38', 297, 'process', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-20 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-21 16:40:44', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor.\\r\\nEmail has been sent to the vendor for shipment details.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1045_5.pdf', ''),
(1058, '2019-02-25 13:36:56', 89, '', '', 'Issue still found after replacing the motor.\\r\\nOn troubleshooting further, it was found that the sensors was not working.\\r\\nEngineer opened the robort arm assembly, found one resistor & one of the control wiring loose.\\r\\nRepaired the same\\r\\nSystem is working fine now. Checked by SO', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1056, '2019-02-25 13:38:14', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT checked all the connections, removed & reconnected back (computer to system connections)\\r\\nChecked, the issue got resolved.\\r\\nSystem is working fine.\\r\\nChecked by Hitesh K', 'Sushil, HiteshK', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-25 13:39:20', 89, '', '', 'The required board has been shipped by the vendor.\\r\\nIt is in Mumbai customs, and is being cleared.\\r\\nExpected delivery is Wednesday (27th Feb 2019)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1059, '2019-02-26 09:34:59', 89, 'EMT', '', 'ot plate issue has been resolved. One heater wire found in  open condition. connected it in his respective place properly. Checked the hotplate on 100,120,150,180,200,250 degree c. Now  no issue observed there.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-02-27 11:19:49', 89, '', '', 'Material is under customs clearance.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1060, '2019-02-28 12:21:28', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Total 3 RF connectors and 2 RF cables burnt.\\r\\nOn checking, found that the cable was not installed properly.\\r\\nAs per email from vendor, the cause is loose connection only.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey have sent quote for new connector & RF cable.\\r\\nTotal cost is USD 625.\\r\\n\\r\\n2 new connectors and 1 RF cable (repaired) has been procured from Excel Instruments.', '', 'AJA', 'Joe Cornin', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2019-03-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1060, '2019-02-28 12:22:11', 89, '', '', 'Quote from AJA is attached', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1060_1.pdf', ''),
(1060, '2019-02-28 12:22:55', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New connectors and RF cable will be installed today and system will be checked.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1061, '2019-03-06 11:27:22', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Checked compressor windings found short with body all three phases.', 'Vendor has come and taken the spec of compressor to get new one quote', 'Facility Team', 'Mr. Prasad N', '', '', '', 'Compressor', '60,000/-', '', '2019-04-03 00:00:00', 'Awaiting quotation from vendor for new compressor', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(992, '2019-03-06 11:28:09', 297, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Sent inquiry to Raith for new ups - awaiting reply from their side', '', '', ''),
(1060, '2019-03-06 11:43:18', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Received 2 new RF connectors from Excel and awaiting one more RF cable.\\r\\nSystem checked with new RF connectors, working fine.\\r\\n', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1060, '2019-03-06 11:51:19', 89, '', '', 'Communication with AJA for finding out the root cause is attached.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1060_4.doc', ''),
(1045, '2019-03-13 12:22:36', 89, '', '', 'Part arrived & has been installed.\\r\\nSystem is being checked for baseline test', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1062, '2019-03-13 12:51:28', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Troubleshooting done:\\r\\n\\r\\nRemoved Encoder and cleaned.\\r\\nRemoved reader and checked it is good.\\r\\nCleaned motor shaft, found lots of PPR inside the motor.\\r\\nAfter cleaning checked the process but the issue is the same.\\r\\n The motor is malfunctioning and needs to be replaced.\\r\\n\\r\\nNote:- Motor is not in spare, need to be procured.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'New spinner in spare has been installed in place of this faulty spinner.\\r\\nPart procurement will be done.'),
(696, '2019-03-14 14:42:05', 89, '', '', 'The parts received from Pfeiffer Germany sent to Pfeiffer India in Dec 2018 first week.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-03-14 14:43:45', 89, '', '', 'On checking the parts, they found one part missing. This was a mistake from vendor\\\'s side as they did not provide complete required part details to IITB.\\r\\nNow pfeiffer India will procure the part on their own from Germany and repair the pump.\\r\\nECD as per vendor is by end of March 2019', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-03-14 14:47:45', 89, '', '', 'The missing part (turbo pump oil-pump for circulation within the pump) will be received by Pfeiffer India in the next week ~20th March.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs per today\\\'s conversation with vendor, repaired turbo pump will be delivered by end of March 2019', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1063, '2019-03-14 14:48:54', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Cleaned water line, found mud in water.\\r\\nSystem is working fine', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Email sent to facilities team to install filters for ICPCVD water lines.'),
(1045, '2019-03-15 12:47:23', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'The new LW1 board was installed on 13th March 2019. One dummy run was done, but the computer restarted after some time (exact time not known) due to which 1st mask writing was not completed.\\r\\n2nd mask was kept for writing and it tool ~4hrs to complete, during this process no beam seen. After developing found there was no writing done, as no pattern seen.\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue reported to vendor.', 'Sushil,Madhuri', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-03-22 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1066, '2019-03-19 15:08:36', 89, '', '', 'Same issue reported twice, hence closed this one', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1065, '2019-03-19 23:20:21', 89, 'EMT', '', 'ICPRF reflected power issue has been resolved. We observed, on ICPRF AMU board +24 VDC not coming. While troubleshooting we found power supply connector was loose.  Connector is fixed properly.  System checked by Hitesh it is working fine.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-03-20 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-03-19 23:21:04', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Troubleshooting in process with vendor helping online remotely.', 'Sushil, Madhuri, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1064, '2019-03-20 11:37:32', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Troubleshooting is being done with help from vendor.\\r\\nEMT tried all the possible troubleshooting tests - inductor coil cleaned, plasma tube assembly servicing done.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs per vendor, inductor coil is faulty & needs to be replaced with a new one. They will send us quote for new one.', 'Vinayak, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-03-25 22:57:01', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'After changing E drive from old LW1 board to new LW1 board, the issue of beam is solved.\\r\\nOne mask was written and completed successfully.\\r\\nPatterns are seen after development.\\r\\nTool will be under observation for next 1 week, after that will be opened for use to all AUs', 'Sushil, Madhuri', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1045, '2019-03-27 11:01:34', 89, '', '', 'Tool is working and will be opened for use for all after one more baseline run which will be done on 27th March 2019.\\r\\n\\r\\nReport attached, prepared by Sushil (EMT)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1045_12.docx', ''),
(1067, '2019-03-27 12:22:38', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT is working on this today.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1067, '2019-04-03 11:51:59', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT did troubleshooting on this and found APC VAT controller position is not getting stable at a given pressure, in pressure mode. But when position mode is selected, pressure gets stabilized.\\r\\nSystem was kept ON overnight, and process run was checked by operator, system is working fine.\\r\\nFew process runs were also done, these were successfully completed.', 'Sushil, HiteshK, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Tool is working fine now.\\r\\nWe have one cm gauge from Amat lab, if required will be changed.'),
(1040, '2019-04-03 11:53:07', 297, '', '', 'compressor has been replaced yesterday, unit will be up today', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-03 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1061, '2019-04-03 11:54:36', 297, '', '', 'purchase on hold due to ERP', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-17 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-04-03 20:04:55', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Repaired turbo pump is received at IITB on 1st April 2019.\\r\\nEmail was sent to pfieffer about the same.\\r\\nOne of the pfeiffer engineer will be coming for installing & testing the pump on the system on 4th April 2019', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1064, '2019-04-09 14:48:27', 89, 'EMT', '', 'vendor had asked to clean all the joints in the matching network and see if the issue gets resolved.\\r\\nEMT did as per suggestion, still issue is same.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn parallel, APP systems, SEREN indian representative has been contacted for resolving this issue', 'Sushil, Vinayak, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1068, '2019-04-09 15:39:18', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found suction pressure was higher than of other condenser unit.', 'Reduced the suction pressure from 70 to 65 psi. Wet cleaning also carried out. Contactor changed 2 - 3 times because it was causing mcb to trip. Compressor over heating also seen due to mcb output side issue. So mcb was also changed.', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. Muslim S', 'Satisfactory', '', '3 Pole 35 Amp Contactor, 3 Pole 32 / 40 Amp MCB', 'Nil - items were in stock', 'Nil', '2019-04-12 00:00:00', 'Monitor over next 1 week. Success Criteria: Laser Writer process should go smoothly for mask writing', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(1061, '2019-04-09 15:40:42', 297, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-18 00:00:00', 'Compressor will be received by next week.', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-04-09 16:24:40', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Pfeiffer engineer was here for installation. After opening the box, it was found one of the block screw for oil is missing.\\r\\nThe missing part was received on 7th April.\\r\\nEMT refilled oil & tried to do further connections, and found the connector to connect N2 purge valve is missing.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt was raised to pfeiffer. They have couriered it on 9th April. Once it is received, pump will be checked.', 'Vinayak, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Pump has been physically installed on the system.'),
(1069, '2019-04-09 16:26:51', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked the system and found both the ICP capacitors are not moving. They are saturated at extreme 100% position.\\r\\nManually adjusted, C2 is working. But C1 is still same.\\r\\n\\r\\nEMT is doing troubleshooting on this.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'There was continuous water flow error in ICP RF'),
(1069, '2019-04-11 14:36:06', 89, '', '', 'Troubleshooting on hold till Monday due to lab shut down', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1070, '2019-04-24 11:10:01', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Contactor found burnt and wire found burnt R Phase', 'Rectified wiring and changed the contactor', 'Rajendra, Sanjay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Now the unit is in working condition. \\r\\n', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1071, '2019-04-24 11:13:51', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found compressor gone bad - not pumping gas', 'Got the compressor, expansion valve orifice and filter dryer changed', 'Amit Das', 'Weltech Refrigeration', 'Mr. S. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '1 - 2 days', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Monthly Gas Pressure Checking', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1040, '2019-04-24 11:17:23', 297, '', 'Compressor gone bad', 'Compressor replaced but again had to be replaced', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. D. Verma', 'Satisfactory', 'Lot of follow up given to vendor', '', '', '', '2019-04-24 00:00:00', 'Ensure all safety interlocks are in place to trip compressor in case of abnormal operating conditions like HP, LP, Single Phasing, Reverse Phasing, Over Load', 'Amit (Primary Owner), Irwin/Sandeep (Secondary Owners)', '', ''),
(1069, '2019-04-24 11:58:16', 89, 'EMT', '', 'After replacing IC for capacitors, reflected power has come down to 4 / 5 W as compared to previous 355W for 1000W forward power. While running recipe, initially manually plasma needs to be strike, and then put back in auto mode. Still capacitor 1 is movement is not displayed in the software\\r\\nSO & Operator have been informed about this.\\r\\nEMT did process runs for Ar plasma clean, CF4 clean, SiO2, SiN runs.\\r\\nWaiting for 3 more ICs, after which we think the above issue will be solved. It is under procurement by inventory', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-05-03 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1064, '2019-04-24 12:01:59', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Matching networks of ALD non LL & ALD LL were swapped with each other and systems were checked.\\r\\nNow:\\r\\n1. ALD non LL is working fine for plasma & thermal processes\\r\\n2. ALD LL thermal & plasma process working fine. During recipe run, in the 1st cycle plasma strike, load capacitor position needs to be adjusted, after which the system runs fine. System is being run with Load in manual & Tune in auto mode.\\r\\n\\r\\nCouple of process runs were done and all of them worked fine without any issue.', 'Vinayak, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Vendor has been asked for new matching network quote.'),
(1074, '2019-04-30 18:55:33', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found fan blade gone loose so tightened again with allen key, fixed back the fan cover to condenser unit and put on - now no issue. But oil leakage from service valve below filter dryer need to be checked.', 'Shut off power, did wet cleaning, waited 10 minutes - after switch on found the motor had vibration and some wobbling', 'Amit, Irwin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-04-30 00:00:00', 'Condenser fan motor spec given to MMIC to procure spare motor for standby/emergency. Asked Dew Point Refrigeration to check out the oil leakage issue from service valve of liquid line filter dryer.', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep, Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(1073, '2019-04-30 18:59:39', 297, 'Facility Team', 'OL [Over Load] Alarm came in Control Panel of MBE AHU. Checked and found contactor burnt.', 'Spec given to MMIC to procure new contactor for replacement', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'CHNT Contactor', 'Rs. 2000/-', '2 Days', '2019-05-02 00:00:00', 'Replace the contactor keeping power to this unit off & isolated. Then put on and check fan motor and compressor functioning in running condition, R-22 gas pressure to be checked, Running current Amps', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep, Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(1061, '2019-04-30 19:00:12', 297, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Gone for Advance Payment, Awaiting Delivery by end of this week', '', '', ''),
(1069, '2019-05-01 11:26:49', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Remaining IC received.\\r\\nReplaced with new one.\\r\\nSystem is working fine. Checked by SO.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1064, '2019-05-01 11:27:47', 89, 'EMT', '', 'System is working fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nEMT is working with local vendor for new matching network procurement.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-05-01 11:29:23', 89, '', '', 'Turbo installed on the system with all the parts in place.\\r\\nTried to run the system, but rotary pump is tripping. Due to long down duration, pump internal parts are sticker. Rough pump needs service.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-05-01 11:31:38', 89, 'EMT', '', 'On 30April EMT tried to run the system with another RIE buy system is detecting no backing pump.\\r\\n\\r\\nThere is a new rough pump available. It is being connected today.', 'Sushil, bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-05-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1072, '2019-05-05 13:39:57', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked the system and found issue with SiO2 recipe only. \\r\\nOther recipes and gas flows working fine.\\r\\nN2O gas flow checked, cm overpressure was due to high cylinder gas line pressure. It was kept at 3bar, instead of less than 1bar. Pressure was adjusted to less than 1 bar and checked, System is working fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nSiO2 recipe run checked, working fine.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2019-05-05 13:41:51', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Rotary pump servicing done, but vacuum not able to reach below 200mbar.\\r\\nSo installed new pump and checked, pump giving vacuum 1E-3mbar.\\r\\nConnected to system, but there is CDA issue in the system.\\r\\n\\r\\nEMT will work on this on Monday 6th May 2019', 'sushil, vinayak, pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1074, '2019-05-06 18:41:27', 297, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'No further issue with fan motor, fan motor blade or compressor noticed in last 1 week when unit was under observation'),
