(696, '2019-05-09 11:35:40', 89, '', '', 'CDA issue has been resolved. After installation of the new rotary pump, the system shows the same error there is no foreline pump. Suspect with the PLC not responding. SO called to PLC vendor for checking, PLC person will come on Monday (13th May)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1061, '2019-05-14 19:44:57', 297, '', '', 'Compressor replaced, filled with N2 for pressure test at 250 psi. Pressure holding.', '', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad N', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Liquid Line Filter Dryer', 'Nil', 'Nil - In Stock', '2019-05-17 00:00:00', 'Remove N2 filled in the refrigerant circuit, take vacuum, fill R-22 in off condition then fill R-22 in running/on condition, take running current readings', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1075, '2019-05-14 19:54:27', 297, '', 'Found root cause bottom 11 TR unit right hand side fan motor bearing failed', 'Replaced fan motor and capacitor with new one in stock. Checked thermostat and found signal going, checked contactor wiring to ensure contactor picks as expected when signal comes from thermostat of compressor by connecting CP wire coming from control panel to contactor coil input. Changed liquid line filter dryer of 8.5 TR condenser unit', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad N', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Marathon Motor & Capacitor', 'Nil', 'Nil - in stock', '2019-05-18 00:00:00', 'Make SOP for dealing with such issues when they arise again. Need to check whether AHU and Condenser Units are operating fine in manual mode as well. Right now working in PLC Mode.', 'Irwin', '', 'Shut Down for checking AHU & Condenser Unit operation in Manual Mode will be taken after consultation with MBE Groups Students.'),
(696, '2019-05-16 17:15:55', 89, '', '', 'PLC engineer has came today and checked the PLC and its module. It is working fine and there is no fault with PLC.\\r\\nWe contact to Syntac person Mr. Chintan to look into the issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
