(1080, '2019-06-11 20:03:53', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Found Unit 4 condenser fans running but suction and discharge lines at normal temperature and compressor not showing any current draw. Put off the power supply.', 'Concluded compressor stop on internal over load. Checked with refrigerant gauge and found standing pressure zero. Noticed oil trace on suction line near to compressor inlet. Concluded that R22 has leaked.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-06-15 00:00:00', 'Tomorrow morning remove electrical connection to compressor and fill N2 till 300 psi and do leak check to locate the point of leak. Then braze, the again leak test for 24 hours.', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep, Irwin [Secondary]', '', 'Need to blank off DX Coil section of Comp 4 inside the AHU to avoid untreated air carry over to clean room area.'),
(1076, '2019-06-11 20:05:03', 297, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-06-15 00:00:00', 'No further mcb tripping noticed till now. Do IR Scan of panel again as part of health check up.', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep, Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(1077, '2019-06-11 20:09:39', 297, 'Facility Team', 'Water condensation above false ceiling & HEPA Filters choked (need to be replaced)', 'Earlier 2 day shut down taken to tighten all ducting joints from where air was leaking and those joints sealed by silicone. All other places like light fixtures and edges around HEPA Filters sealed by silicone wherever possible', 'Amit, Raju K', 'J P Air System', 'Mr. Lal Bihari', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2019-06-16 00:00:00', 'Further 3 day shut down taken for putting foam insulation on top of all the exposed metallic parts of HEPA filters and duct connections to prevent the formation of water due to condensation.', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep, Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(1083, '2019-06-14 22:52:14', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked the system and found SF6 gas is not working above 30sccm.\\r\\nReplaced the MFC with another MKS make MFC and new cable connected.\\r\\nSF6 gas checked from 0 to 50 sccm, working fine.', 'Bhimraj, pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
