(1095, '2019-07-23 11:48:48', 89, 'EMT', '', 'on initial troubleshooting found, MFC is not flowing 100% of the set value\\r\\nIf we set 100, it shows 30..\\r\\n\\r\\nIt seems MFC is gone bad. Cylinder line pressure is 120psi, which should be 10-15 psi. May be this high pressure has caused MFC failure', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2019-08-27 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
