(1097, '2019-07-23 15:01:42', 89, 'EMT', 'After running 3-4 mins of cleaning recipe, ICP power goes off to zero.', 'Checked water lines for ICPCVD tool was OFF, due to which this error has happened.\\r\\nTurned ON all the water lines.\\r\\nSystem checked by running chamber cleaning recipe. It is working fine now', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1094, '2019-07-23 18:42:56', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Motor shaft/axle found jammed', 'Disconnected power cable of non working pump motor and dismantled the connection through axle to the water pump\\r\\nFound the axle of pump motor jammed.', 'Amit, Irwin', '', '', '', '', 'Checking in inventory for spare pump', '', '', '2019-07-31 00:00:00', 'Locate spare pump motor and do no load test. If successful then assemble to water pump and do electrical connection. If not successful, then send for repair and install after being brought from repair', 'Amit, Irwin', '', ''),
