(1108, '2019-08-13 20:19:05', 712, '', 'After doing IR Gun Scanning found power supply cable overheated. After removing DB then found insulation peeled off.', 'Requested urgent shut down to attend the issue asap', 'Rajendra, Amit', '', '', '', '', 'None', '', '', '2019-08-14 00:00:00', 'Attended the issue and re-did the cable connection. Now cable temperature is OK.', 'Rajendra S , Irwin', '', ''),
