(1103, '2019-08-14 11:53:40', 712, '', '', 'Checked earthing of all earth pits. \\r\\n\\r\\nFor XPS Dedicated Earthing reading = 0.00 ohms \\r\\n\\r\\nFor all other Micro 2 Lab Tools reading = 1.85 ohms\\r\\n\\r\\nConclusion: No danger to any critical tools.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Inquiry sent online for Electro-Static Discharge Tester [ESD] to be able to measure / quantify the amount of static charge', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
