(1152, '2020-01-22 11:05:00', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Here is the details of compressor failure data.\\r\\n1) Continuity Reading\\r\\nRY- 1.1\\r\\nRB- 1.2\\r\\nBY-  1.1\\r\\n2) Grounding Reading\\r\\nR to E - OK\\r\\nY to E - OK\\r\\nB to E - OK\\r\\nFinally check amps of compressor, its take 120 amps and suddenly compressor trip. \\r\\n\\r\\nConcluded that compressor needs to be replaced.', 'Checked on 7/1/2020. Compressor takes high amps and then mcb trips.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Satisfactory', '', '8.5 TR Compressor', 'Nil - in stock in AMAT AHU', 'Nil', '2020-01-24 00:00:00', 'Compressor replacement done on 18/1/2020. Kept for N2 standing pressure leak test at 250 psi till today. If pressure holds then evacuate, fill R-22 and switch on.', 'Amit', 'uploads/1152_0.png', ''),
(1133, '2020-01-22 12:30:06', 297, 'MMIC', '', 'Received some of the material. waiting for remaining material to start the work', 'sunitha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2020-01-22 14:15:40', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As per update from vendor on 14th Jan, turbo pump repair will be done under warranty. They are waiting for part from Germany. ECD for turbo repair is Feb 2020 4th week.\\r\\n\\r\\nreply from vendor:\\r\\nDear Pradeep,\\r\\nPlease refer to our several telephonic discussions over the past few weeks.\\r\\nWe understand your urgency to get the pump repaired. Kindly note that the decision for free of cost repairs has to be done at our HQ in Germany.\\r\\nWe have already provided all the necessary data to Mr. Andreas(the one who visited our lab) and the decision for rotor stator/bearing replacement is still pending.\\r\\nOur service team is closely following up with HQ to expedite however it still takes some time.\\r\\nWe thank you for your patience and we will shortly revert with a workable solution. The delay is also due to factory being closed for Christmas and new year which effectively increased 2-3 weeks of response time.', '', 'Pfeiffer', '', 'Not Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2020-02-28 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1150, '2020-01-22 14:27:12', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Cu wire inside tool matching network was removed (desoldered).\\r\\nResoldering done, tool checked, working fine.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1114, '2020-01-22 14:39:01', 89, '', '', 'Part will be delivered by 24th Jan', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1153, '2020-01-22 15:00:50', 297, '', '', 'Today when EMT has flag that there was condensation seen in 4TEBE of M1 lab. Following issue has been observed my me.\\r\\n\\r\\n1.  There was a PP fault  in the chiller early in the morning which has been noticed by Ajay.  This fault has not been seen on facility desk due to ICMS OFF. \\r\\nICMS has been off from long inspite of repeated reminders from me.\\r\\nSolution : Get the ICMS of M1 chiller up as early as possible.\\r\\n\\r\\n2.  Water in the M 1 chiller tank was low  in the morning ( 4-5 coil low water has been seen by ajay while responding to PP fault). Leak has been seen in  one of the pump .\\r\\nSolution :  Leak has been seen in  one of the pump . Pump leakage need to be solved ASAP. Manual checks of water level in the tank need to be done weekly once.\\r\\n\\r\\n3. When ever any AC is having  issue,report it to LIC and explain them the alternate plan. This should be our action hence forth when ever any AC is not working. \\r\\nSolution: Email to concern LIC need to be send \\r\\n\\r\\n4. While troubleshooting the condensation issue it has been noticed that there is ice formation on the coil inside the water tank of the chiller and water sensor  was surrounded by ice.  On measuring the water tank temperature it  came around 10 degree C. which was the reason for the condensation. Chiller display was reading 21 degree. \\r\\nSolution: Might be there is issue with the controller, we need to check the same.\\r\\n\\r\\nLets take up this as a learning and lets make the necessary changes in the troubleshooting policy and check list\\r\\n \\r\\nTools has been turned off with the help of LIC and EMT and users are informed not to plan any process till further notice.\\r\\n\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1152, '2020-01-28 20:01:27', 712, 'Facility Team', '', 'Found fan motor supply wire in disconnected condition near motor winding side. Sent motor for checking/repair.', '', 'A L Prajapati', 'A L Prajapati -', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2020-01-31 00:00:00', 'Reconnect the condenser fan motor after it comes back from repair, check rpm with tachometer and then connect compressor power supply and put on the unit', 'Amit Das [Primary], Sandeep/Irwin [Secondary]', '', ''),
(1153, '2020-01-28 20:05:41', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Failure of temperature sensor and failure of gasket led to water level going low and once water level went low the temperature sensor remained in air causing the compressor to remain on without tripping on temperature. This caused water temperature to go too low resultantly.', 'New gasket installed in water pump suction/inlet side at flange section on 25/1/2020 and temperature sensor placed in water tank was changed. Now issue is resolved.', 'Facility Team', 'Weltech Refrigeration', 'S. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2020-01-31 00:00:00', 'Connect chiller monitoring system for Micro 1 10 TR Chiller', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
(1133, '2020-01-28 20:15:54', 712, 'Facility Team', '', 'Activated alumina arrived yesterday which was the only remaining/pending item. Switched to standby dryer and took out all old [spoilt] activated alumina and put in new alumina. Changed all filters and silencers. Again swapped back to CDX Dryer. No pressure drop noticed in last 24 hours.', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Satish Utekar', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Activated Alumina [130 Kgs], filters, silencer', 'Rs. 1,50,000/- approx', '2 months', '2020-01-28 00:00:00', 'Plan being made for after cooler for N2 Plant which will be installed after air compressor. Design details are to be worked out. Process has been kick started.', 'Irwin', '', 'Need to top up oil level only as required. Any extra oil topped up will get carried over to other parts of the system.'),
