(1133, '2020-02-04 19:13:15', 712, 'FT', '', 'Shut Down of CDX Dryer done on 27/1/2020 and all old/spoilt activated alumina, filter and silencer replaced. No pressure drop noticed after this.', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Satish Warang, Mr. Satish Utekar', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2020-02-04 00:00:00', '', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1154, '2020-02-04 19:19:41', 712, 'FT', '', 'Chemical cleaning carried out on 29/1/2020 but during this shut down 4 new issues identified: Drain Valve not working, contactor burn, fan motor 2 phases winding failed. Given motor for repair, gave new 1/2\\ drain valve connection for now', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Satish Warang, Mr. Satish Utekar', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Fan Motor & Fan Blade, Contactor, Drain Valve', 'Rs. 27,800/-', '1 week from receipt of PO', '2020-02-18 00:00:00', 'Refit the fan motor and blade and assemble inside the compressor cabinet, fix new contactor and drain valve and take test run', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1155, '2020-02-04 19:23:36', 712, 'Amit, Ajay B', 'Checked and found short in OL relay of Compressor 2.', 'Replaced the same on 1/2/2020 from AMAT 16 TR Chiller which is not in use right now', 'Facility Team', 'Weltech Refrigeration', 'Mr. S. Thomas', '', '', 'OL Relay Section', '', 'Nil - item in stock', '2020-02-04 00:00:00', 'Request MMIC to order the same part to re-install in AMAT 16 TR Chiller', 'Amit Das', '', ''),
