(1154, '2020-02-11 08:15:59', 712, 'Ajay, Rajendra, Irwin', 'Ventilation Fan Motor winding had failed', 'Re-fitted the fan motor after it came from repair, assembled to fan blade, fixed and connected new contactor and made unit functional on 6/2/2020. Some oil leakage was noticed. Found one of the pipe thread connections gone bad on 10/2/2020. Refitted with teflon tape and now the leakage is very very less.', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. Satish U', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2020-02-14 00:00:00', 'Unit is under observation till the end of this week', 'Irwin', '', ''),
