(1156, '2020-02-12 14:49:03', 89, 'EMT', 'Upto 200degC process, there is no issue in the tool.\\r\\nAbove 200degC, wafer arm gets stuck sometimes.\\r\\nThe issue is more, for processes above 300degC', 'EMT is working on this with Oxford help.\\r\\nOxford engineer is not free till March 2nd week for visit. Till that time they are supporting remotely.', 'Pradeep, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2020-03-20 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
