(1207, '2020-12-28 21:08:52', 89, 'EMT', '', 'N2 purge done for Cryo pump.\\r\\nPump started. Now the temperature is 16k', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1209, '2020-12-28 21:10:17', 89, 'EMT', '', 'One of the fuse found blown off.\\r\\nReplaced it with N2 anneal fuse.\\r\\nNew fuse procurement request sent to inventory.\\r\\nPankaj will check the furnace and update.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2020-12-29 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1206, '2020-12-29 22:50:40', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT worked further and the issue is resolved now.\\r\\nAttached is the troubleshooting report', 'Vinayak, Mayur', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1206_2.pptx', ''),
(1209, '2020-12-29 22:52:21', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT did further troubleshooting today and found 2 wires burnt. These need replacement with new ones. As these are special types of wires with connectors, we will need to procure.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have sent the parts details to Inventory for procurement.\\r\\nOnce these are received, further work will be carried out.', 'Sushil, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-06 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1209_1.jpeg', ''),
(1187, '2020-12-29 22:54:30', 89, '', '', 'Process team did 4 RCA runs and there is no spots seen on the wafers as previously seen.\\r\\nAll the processes went fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1186, '2020-12-29 22:54:50', 89, 'Process', '', 'Process team did 4 RCA runs and there is no spots seen on the wafers as previously seen.\\r\\nAll the processes went fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue resolved.', 'Minita, Shilpa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1210, '2020-12-30 13:50:36', 89, 'EMT', 'Actual RPM fluctuates as compared to set value\\r\\nset=500, Actual=1000\\r\\nset=3500, Actual=3400-4000', 'EMT serviced the spinner, but same issue seen after 2 runs.\\r\\nIssue has been reported to OEM', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1209, '2020-12-30 13:51:53', 89, '', '', 'Image of the burnt wire is attached', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1209_2.jpeg', ''),
(1208, '2020-12-30 13:52:28', 89, 'EMT', '', 'In parallel the issue has been reported to OEM', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2020-12-30 13:53:13', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Email received from local vendor, the ion gun controller is being shipped soon. Jomon is communicating with vendor for making the documents ready for clearing the material from Mumbai Customs once it arrives', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2020-12-30 13:53:59', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'As per email from freight forwarder, DC power supply will be collected on 4th Jan 2021 and delivered after 7th Jan 2021 - due to holidays', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1212, '2021-01-09 20:46:11', 89, 'Process', '', 'Communication with vendor is going on', 'Deepti', 'Hirokazu Amamori', 'Manager, South-East Asia & India Region \\r\\nInternational Sales Division\\r\\nSamco Inc. Head Office\\r\\n36 Waraya-cho, Takeda, Fushimi-ku, Kyoto 612-8443 Japan\\r\\nTEL: +81-75-621-7841(Office)\\r\\nMobile: +81-90-3064-6398\\r\\nSKYPE User Name: HIROKAZU AMAMORI\\r\\nFAX: +81-75-621-0936\\r\\ne-mail: amamori-hiro@samco.co.jp\\r\\nURL: http://www.samcointl.com', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-15 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1211, '2021-01-09 20:47:18', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT checked the system and found the couple of springs are broken, which need to be replaced.\\r\\nRequest sent to Inventory for procurement', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1210, '2021-01-09 20:50:48', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'The issue was reported to Simco / Laurel.\\r\\nThey suggested for motor and controller replacement with new one.\\r\\nQuote for new required parts is USD 2400.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe same has been approved by Prof Dipankar and FOC (on 6th Jan 2021)\\r\\n\\r\\nQuote forwarded to purchase team for PO processing', 'Pradeep, Vijay', 'Amar Nath Gupta', 'Manager, Sales & Customer Support\\r\\nSimco Global Technology & Systems Ltd.', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2021-02-26 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Once new parts are received, further work will be carried out'),
(1208, '2021-01-09 20:52:39', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'The issue was reported to Simco / Laurel.\\r\\nThey suggested for the display unit replacement\\r\\n\\r\\nQuote for new required parts is USD 30000.\\r\\nThe same has been approved by Prof Dipankar and FOC (on 6th Jan 2021)\\r\\nQuote forwarded to purchase team for PO processing', 'Pradeep, Vijay', 'Amar Nath Gupta', 'Manager, Sales & Customer Support\\r\\nSimco Global Technology & Systems Ltd.', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2021-02-26 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1204, '2021-01-09 20:53:58', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'The unit has been sent today to Bangalore by Gati transporter\\r\\nDocket number is 359528511', 'Pradeep, Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-03-31 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1171, '2021-01-09 20:55:48', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor on 9th Jan 2021', 'Vijay', '', 'rupali.pednekar@perkinelmer.com,\\r\\nIndia.Spares@perkinelmer.com,\\r\\narun.jain@perkinelmer.com', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1171_1.pdf', 'PO is attached'),
(1156, '2021-01-09 20:57:14', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Service visit PO sent to vendor on 31st Dec 2020', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-20 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1156_13.pdf', 'PO attached'),
(696, '2021-01-09 20:58:30', 89, '', '', 'Repaired turbo pump received on 5th Jan 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Waiting for vendor\\\'s further reply for testing & installation at site'),
(1217, '2021-01-13 16:52:46', 89, '', '', 'Same issue reported twice. So closed this', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1216, '2021-01-13 16:56:26', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Water flushing done. Checked in manual mode, water flow switch worked fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nLater when process recipe was run, again alarm was there.\\r\\nEMT reported to OEM. Suggestion from OEM is attached.\\r\\n\\r\\nEMT worked as per suggestion - to flush water line & clean the water sensor.\\r\\nWater switch operating in manual mode.\\r\\nOne baseline run checked by Mayur.\\r\\n\\r\\nTool is working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1216_0.pdf', 'Reply from OEM:\\r\\nThe water flow is not enough or the water flow switch (WFS) is stuck.\\r\\n\\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\nFor cleaning the WFS you have to purge the water circuit first.\\r\\n\\r\\n-              Close water valves on facilities,\\r\\n\\r\\n-              Prepare and place a bucket or any adequate recipient to collect purged water (around 5 liters)\\r\\n\\r\\n-              Unplug the pipes that supply the water and drain the machine\\r\\n\\r\\n-              Open the water valve in manual mode\\r\\n\\r\\n-         '),
(1214, '2021-01-13 16:59:34', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked and found the mask is not getting focused.\\r\\nSomeone might have disturbed the setting.\\r\\n\\r\\nReadjusted the focus knob (Microscope up/down movement knob), and focused. Focusing done.\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked by Hemant.\\r\\nTool working fine', 'Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1213, '2021-01-13 17:03:31', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'checked for the reported issue - Crucible found ok - it did not seemed to be misaligned. Instead, the beam is not at the center.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith help of Prem Sai, checked the beam alignment & by adjusting the hand held device, adjusted beam to the center of the crucible.\\r\\nIt was also found the crucible is low filled. Opened the chamber & refilling done.\\r\\n\\r\\nMayur will check the system & report the issue if not resolved.', 'Pradeep, Premsai, Mayur', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'New position has been marked on the crucible movement position tray'),
(1171, '2021-01-13 17:24:04', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor on 9th Jan  2021', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1171_2.pdf', ''),
(1209, '2021-01-15 20:58:48', 89, '', '', 'New material received on 11th Jan.\\r\\nWork planned on 14th & 15th Jan', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1209, '2021-01-15 21:04:27', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The faulty cable replaced with new ones.\\r\\nStill the fuse was blown OFF.\\r\\n\\r\\nNext cause was suspected to be Transformer.\\r\\nSo checked & found one of the transformer faulty.\\r\\nThe faulty transformer replaced with another from N2 anneal furnace.\\r\\n\\r\\nFirst temperature ramp up checked till 500degC, worked fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen operator checked at 1050 degC for 3.5 hours, it worked without any issue.\\r\\n\\r\\nReported issue has been resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem will be released for use after a baseline run by process team', 'Sushil, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1218, '2021-01-18 11:02:23', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT checked the hot plate and found the coil is gone bad, it needs to be replaced with a new one\\r\\n\\r\\nNew procurement request has been submitted to Inventory', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-22 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1218, '2021-01-19 21:04:47', 89, 'Inventory', '', 'Reminder sent to Inventory for update on procurement of the coil', 'Sunitha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1220, '2021-01-20 08:55:26', 89, '', '', 'The system is not down, but due to the light intensity focus marks visibility is dim.\\r\\n\\r\\nOnce new bulb is procured, EMT will replace it', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1219, '2021-01-20 08:57:32', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT worked on it.\\r\\nServiced the spinner. Checked pump, it is working fine in another spinner.\\r\\n\\r\\nCleaned the o-rings, now vacuum is ok (16). One spinning dummy process checked, worked fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nOperator will check & report if any issue found', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1196, '2021-01-20 09:09:27', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the tool. Computer is working fine after resetting it.\\r\\nHemant did one dummy process without using lamp, worked fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem is up for process', 'Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Computer will be kept ON 24X7'),
(1195, '2021-01-20 09:11:52', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the tool and found the following:\\r\\n1. Temperature ramp up checked for 700 degC. It worked fine till 450 degC\\r\\n2. There is an issue with N2 flow.\\r\\nDue to this the ramp up test was aborted.\\r\\n\\r\\nNeeds further troubleshooting on this', 'Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-29 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-01-20 09:14:40', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the tool and following is the update:\\r\\n1. Pump checked, cleaning done, no water visible in the pump\\r\\n2. Tried to run the pump, but it gives several alarms (water flow, roots pump breaker) and stops automatically\\r\\n3. Ramp up test tried till 300 degC, worked fine.\\r\\n4. As the pump is not working, pumping test could not be done\\r\\n\\r\\nTool needs further detailed troubleshooting and vendor\\\'s help to resolve these issues', 'Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-01-29 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-01-20 09:19:32', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the tool and following is the update:\\r\\n1. Pump checked, cleaning done, little water visible at the pump base. All electrical connections dried with N2 as a precautionary measure\\r\\n2. Tried to run the pump, but it gives several alarms (water flow, roots pump breaker) and stops automatically. After starting it for several times, pumped worked for ~half hour, but tripped again.\\r\\n3. Ramp up test tried till 300 degC, worked fine.\\r\\n4. As the pump is not working, pumping test could not be done\\r\\n\\r\\nTool needs further detailed troubleshooting and vendor\\\'s help to resolve these issues', 'Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-01-21 22:15:24', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Attached is the tracking document for sending the DC power supply from IITB to Sairem, France. \\r\\nThis is prepared by Jomon', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1168_9.xlsx', ''),
(1194, '2021-01-27 14:05:54', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Email was sent to SVCS local vendor, but all the emails bounced back and the phone numbers are not reachable. Now we have directly written to SVCS company. In parallel the pump issue will be shown to Pfeiffer engineer during his visit to IITB for ICPRIE turbo pump', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
