(1246, '2021-03-19 11:47:32', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Issue has been resolved by Bhimraj, \\r\\nthis issue occurred due to target material was poured extra in crucible. it\\\'s need to filled 60 to 80%', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1212, '2021-03-19 11:52:56', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', ', Feb : Samco suggested to replace the lift pins as they are found to be bent. They have sent the procedure for doing this. We will have a meeting with FIC regarding this', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1212, '2021-03-19 11:55:13', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'March 10, 2021:\\r\\nAfter Prof SSM sent detailed email asking Samco what is the root cause of this He leak issue & any other solution to resolve this issue without replacing the lift pins:\\r\\nSamco suggested to repair the pins (straighten the pins) and see, this should solve the issue. We need not buy the new pin assembly. Work is planned on 11th March', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-03-19 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1212, '2021-03-19 11:55:37', 89, '', '', 'March 16, 2021:\\r\\nWe worked on the system with Samco engineer\\\'s remote video call support. After that process runs were done & the tool is working in manual / service mode. We will discuss the possibility of opening the tool for use in today\\\'s FOC', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1212, '2021-03-19 11:58:00', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'As discussed in FOC on 17th March 2021, system will be opened for use for all in manual / service mode as per request from user. But the tool will be used only in operator based.\\r\\nThis will be observed for next 1 month & relooked on more AUs.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Any user submitting the process request needs to also send email to Prof SSM, Deepti, Pradeep'),
(1208, '2021-03-19 12:00:06', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Purchase team has given clearance for material pick up to the freight forwarder.\\r\\nECD 2 weeks', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-05 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1245, '2021-03-19 12:01:57', 89, '', '', 'EMT is working on this.\\r\\nECD 23rd March 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-03-23 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
