(1247, '2021-03-19 12:03:28', 89, '', '', 'Same issue published twice so closed it', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:04:34', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '10 Feb 2021: \\r\\nReply received from SVCS for the pump errors. Water, N2 checked all are fine. Still the pump is not working & every time new error occurs. The same has been reported to Pfeiffer. This week during their visit for ICPRIE turbo pump check, LPCVD pump issue will also be shown', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-03-19 12:05:19', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Pfeiffer engineer checked the pumps and suggested the pump needs repair as the motor is jammed. They will be able to give the cost of repair after inspecting the pump at service center', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-03-19 12:05:47', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '24 Feb 2021: \\r\\nPfeiffer has sent a repair cost of Rs. 8 Lakhs for the pump', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-03-19 12:07:10', 89, 'EMT', '', 'March 3, 2021:\\r\\nAfter discussing in last FOC, cost of new pump needed.\\r\\ncost of new pump quoted by Pfeiffer is Euro 23500 (~Rs. 20.7 lakhs)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-03-19 12:09:25', 89, '', '', 'During discussion in FOC, an issue was raised, one of the reason for pump gone bad is due to rain water leakage from roof during lock down rainy season.\\r\\n\\r\\nFacility / building maintenance needs to get the roof repaired by Institute estate office before this year\\\'s monsoon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-03-19 12:10:32', 89, '', '', 'Reply received from SVCS for the pump errors. Water, N2 checked all are fine. Still the pump is not working & every time new error occurs. The same has been reported to Pfeiffer. This week during their visit for ICPRIE turbo pump check, LPCVD pump issue will also be shown', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-03-19 12:47:54', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Feb 17, 2021:\\r\\nPfeiffer engineer checked the pumps and suggested the pump needs repair as the motor is jammed. They will be able to give the cost of repair after inspecting the pump at service center', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-03-19 12:49:15', 89, '', '', 'Feb 24, 2021:\\r\\nPfeiffer has sent a repair cost of Rs. 8 Lakhs for the pump', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-03-19 12:49:48', 89, 'EMT', '', 'March 3, 2021: \\r\\nAfter discussing in last FOC, cost of new pump needed.\\r\\ncost of new pump quoted by Pfeiffer is Euro 23500 (~Rs. 20.7 lakhs)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-03-19 12:50:28', 89, '', '', 'During discussion in FOC, an issue was raised, one of the reason for pump gone bad is due to rain water leakage from roof during lock down rainy season.\\r\\nFacility / building maintenance needs to get the roof repaired by Institute estate office before this year\\\\\\\'s monsoon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:52:19', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Feb 3, 2021: \\r\\nEmail was sent to SVCS local vendor, but all the emails bounced back and the phone numbers are not reachable. Now we have directly written to SVCS company.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:52:42', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Feb 10, 2021:\\r\\nAs per reply from SVCS, N2 valve / N2 gas needs to be checked. We will check & do a dummy process run in the next week', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:53:02', 89, '', '', 'March 17, 2021: \\r\\nWe will check & do a dummy process run in the coming week', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:53:32', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Feb 24, 2021:\\r\\nDuring the dummy run check, N2 was not flowing. On troubleshooting EMT found one of the EV not working due to which CDA was not getting supplied to pneumatic valve resulting in no N2 flow. This EV was swapped with another one, after which N2 started flowing. The dummy run was successfully completed', 'Hemant, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:55:07', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Macrh 3, 2021:\\r\\nFrom EMT side tool can be used. Baseline run needs to be done before opening the tool for use', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1195, '2021-03-19 12:55:42', 89, 'Process', '', 'Baseline run done by process team.\\r\\nTool is opened for use', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1171, '2021-03-19 12:56:32', 89, '', '', 'Material received on 5th March 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1171, '2021-03-19 12:57:48', 89, 'Process', '', 'FTIR detector has been successfully replaced by a vendor.\\r\\nSystem initialised successfully.\\r\\nWe did the test run as well for confirmation of the report with our standard polystyrene samples.\\r\\nNow we can up the system for use.\\r\\nNote: Vendor has suggested maintaining the humidity of the lab using a dehumidifier or keeping the instrument in a humidity control environment.', 'Pankaj', 'Perkinelmer', '', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1204, '2021-03-22 10:35:11', 89, '', '', 'Ankit talked to vendor for the high repair cost.\\r\\nVendor had asked about the budget we have, after discussing Ankit informed them 2.5 to 3 Lakhs.\\r\\n\\r\\nVendor will get back to us with an update', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1250, '2021-03-23 09:38:35', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Connectors need to be changed and connections need to be re-done with cable adjustment and re-lugging', 'Took shut down of 1.1&1.2 LAB from second half 3 pm to 6 pm and rectified the issue. Replaced the faulty connector with new mccb.', 'Rajendra, Sanjay, Anil & Chandu from House Keeping Team', '', '', '', '', 'MCCB', 'Rs. 5000', '3 Days', '2021-03-23 00:00:00', 'Keep under observation till end of this week.', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1252, '2021-03-23 09:42:12', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Standby Unit Condenser Fan Motor not working even when power was applied it did not rotate.', 'Checked outdoor condenser unit found the fan motor has gone bad.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-03-31 00:00:00', 'Remove the fan motor and give for re-winding / repair', '', '', ''),
(1251, '2021-03-23 09:46:01', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor suction and discharge service valves need to be changed. There is no possibility of attending the leak by doing brazing there.', 'Checked with soap solution and pressurized with commercial N2 to 250 psi. Found the leak in suction and discharge valves.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Suction and Discharge Service Valves', 'Rs. 10,000/-', '2 Days', '2021-03-26 00:00:00', 'Replace the suction and discharge valves, do brazing and pressurize with commercial nitrogen to 250 to 300 psi for night leak test. If no pressure drop then evacuate the N2 and fill R-22', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1253, '2021-03-29 21:51:38', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked and found the vacuum pump was not working.\\r\\nReplaced the pump with a new one from EMT spare.\\r\\nSystem checked, working fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nReported issue resolved.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-03-29 21:54:54', 89, '', 'Cryo pump temperature already installed in the system does not go below 17K (standard 12-13K)', 'It has been observed the cryo temperature is not reaching 12-13K as expected. This was observed after the system was started using (after covid lockdown) from end of December 2020.\\r\\n\\r\\nSeveral regeneration were done, still temperature does not go below 17K and after opening the gate valve it rises & is stable at 19K. \\r\\nThere is no change is chamber base pressure (~9E-8Torr)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1255, '2021-03-30 09:08:23', 712, 'Facility Team', 'MPV Kit has gone bad since similar issue was taking place in Old Compressor at the beginning of this month.', '', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'MPV Kit', 'Rs. 6000/-', '2 weeks', '2021-04-09 00:00:00', 'Awaiting MPV Kit from PO already issued to Enercare. Need to follow up to expedite the delivery for replacement.', 'MMIC', '', ''),
(1252, '2021-03-30 09:14:54', 712, '', '8.5 TR Compressor has gone bad. Need to be replaced.', 'Put on the unit and saw fan motor and compressor not running. Checked the mcb voltage and found 400 volts not coming in all 3 phases. Replaced MCB. Then fan motor and compressor started running. But now mcb started tripping again. Removed the compressor wire and checked - mcb does not trip. Checked the compressor winding and found the following: R - Y : 98.4 ohms, R - B : 97.8 ohms, Y - B: 1.9 ohms (ideal), R - E : 130.6 ohms, Y - E: 40.2 ohms, B - E : 40.6 ohms', 'Facility Team', 'Modern HVAC', 'Mr. Deepak Verma', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-09 00:00:00', 'As the unit (compressor) is under warranty, so requested Modern HVAC to supply replacement compressor of same capacity.', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1254, '2021-03-30 09:17:48', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Compressor pumping mechanism has gone bad.', 'Checked the suction line it was hot where as it should be cold. Checked standing pressure it was 140 PSI but when compressor comes on the reading does not come down and there is no cooling.', 'Facility Team', 'Dew Point Refrigeration', 'Mr. Prasad Nambiar', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-02 00:00:00', 'Compressor has been given for repair. Once received from repair it will be installed, tested and chiller made UP again.', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1251, '2021-03-30 09:20:28', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Following the pressure test at 300 PSI still there was pressure drop. Minute leaks have been found in the coil inside the chiller water tank for which brazing is not possible.', 'Called Weltech Refrigeration to take the chiller for repair on high priority', 'Facility Team', 'Weltech Refrigeration', 'Mr. Thomas', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-09 00:00:00', 'Follow up with the vendor for status of chiller repair and for re-installation', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1256, '2021-03-30 09:23:41', 712, 'Facility Team (Rajendra S)', 'Found Red Phase wire insulation peeling off due to heat during 1st(Morning) Shift', 'Took a quick shut down of the AHU and rectified the issue immediately.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-16 00:00:00', 'Take IR Gun Scan on weekly basis till 16th of April', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1252, '2021-03-30 09:29:55', 712, 'Facility Team (Irwin)', 'Compressor 2 was sometimes working and sometimes not working. Checking the contactor revealed the B phase continuity was not consistent. Changed the contactor. Compressor has been working since Sunday afternoon (28/3/2021)', 'Checked the outdoor unit contactor and found continuity reading ok in R & Y Phase but fluctuates in B phase.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', '32 Amp Contactor', 'Nil', 'Nil - In Stock', '2021-04-02 00:00:00', 'Take regular current readings of the compressor and keep under observation till the end of this week', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-04-05 10:36:46', 89, 'EMT', '', 'March 2021: Spare cryo pump (removed from ATC in 2017) was sent for repair to Bangalore (advanced Scientific)\\r\\nReceived repaired Cryo Pump and new adsorber.\\r\\nNew adsorber installed with old cryo pump to confirm if there is issue in the adsorber. But same status - old cryo temperature does not go below 17K\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-04-05 10:40:48', 89, '', '', 'Repaired cryo pump installed on the system. Regeneration, hot N2 purge and He flushing done.\\r\\nCryo pump started.\\r\\nBut the temperature is not reaching below 14K and starts increasing & gets stable at 16K.\\r\\nSeveral tests were done but same issue.\\r\\nCryo tested with a blank flange, but same issue.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-04-05 10:42:40', 89, '', '', 'Suspected leak in the chamber. Did He leak test.\\r\\nNo leak found at the cryo gasket, chamber external parts.\\r\\nLeak found in the chamber gate valve o-ring. But this will not affect the cryo pump functioning as the process chamber is always in vacuum.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-04-05 10:49:51', 89, 'EMT, Inventory', '', 'Process chamber gate valve o-ring replaced with another from spares (similar o-ring 0.1mm thickness lesser than original). Leak detected with He leak check.\\r\\nO-ring given to inventory for procurement on 25th March 2021\\r\\nETA for o-ring 10th April 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1249, '2021-04-05 10:54:13', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As the repaired cryo pump was not working as per the required spec (12K), it has been sent back to the vendor for service and it is expected to be shipped back to IITB by 10th April 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nATC system has been made up by connecting the old (existing) cryo pump', 'EMT team, Paritosh', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-23 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1255, '2021-04-07 10:15:34', 712, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'MPV Kit received. Vendor is expected to come by Sunday this week to fix it in the system (11/4/2021)', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1251, '2021-04-07 10:16:41', 712, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Chiller is under repair. Should be ready by Thursday/Friday next week.', '', '', ''),
(1254, '2021-04-07 10:17:18', 712, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-04-09 00:00:00', 'Chiller is working now. Under observation till the end of this week.', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1262, '2021-04-10 17:26:52', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Checked the tool and found the temperature of left zone fluctuating. When the controller is touched, the PV value is continuously fluctuate & not stable at one point.', 'As a safety precaution, operator was told to switch OFF the furnace.\\r\\nTemperature controller suspected to faulty', 'Shilpa, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1262, '2021-04-10 17:29:36', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Replaced the temperature controller of left zone with the one from N2 anneal furnace.\\r\\nChecked ramp up till 1050 degC (required process temperature). No fluctuation seen and it is stable.\\r\\nIssue resolved.', 'Vinayak, Shilpa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1262_1.jpeg', ''),
(1261, '2021-04-10 17:30:51', 89, 'Process', '', 'This issue has been raised to the vendor.\\r\\nAwaiting response', 'Minita', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1259, '2021-04-10 17:32:15', 89, '', '', 'DIMPLER: Earlier dimpling process use to take a maximum of 45 minutes to dimple thickness from 80-90 micron to 25-micron sample with as usual 20 gm weight of the tool, but now even after using for four hours, dimple does not form and this over timing will affect the sample surface. \\r\\nNOTE: One of the Authorized user (Navneet B.) did a test run of the Si sample (90 microns) by changing the weight of the tool to 21gm and dimpling completed within 10 minutes. But here I have concern that will this work for any kind of sample or not by changing weight. \\r\\n\\r\\nThis issue has been raised with vendor.\\r\\nAwaiting response', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1245, '2021-04-10 17:34:07', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'The Plasma Asher tool is open for use. There was an issue of high reflecting power on plasma asher. Now the issue has been resolved by EMT with slight changes in the process flow.\\r\\n\\r\\nSo the only change is that, bring the gas pressure to 0.5 mbar instead of 0.2 mbar pressure and start the Rf power. Plasma will strike at 0.5 mbar and then gradually bring it between 0.2 to 0.1mbar. By doing this way, Reflecting power can be controlled.', 'Sushil, Bhimrja, Vinayak, Minita', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:36:33', 89, '', '', '20Jan2021:\\r\\nNew ion gun controller arrived at Mumbai Customs on 18th Jan 2021. Customs clearance documents prepared & sent to clearing agent (Balmer) on 18th Jan by Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:37:03', 89, '', '', '22Jan2021:\\r\\nIon Gun controller received on 22nd Jan 2021. Local engineer is here today to install the same', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:37:39', 89, '', '', '3Feb2021: There is issue with main UPS of M1 & M2, it is temporarily up. Hence facility team suggested not to wait till the UPS gets fixed permanently. ECD 8th Feb 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:38:00', 89, '', '', '10Feb2021: XPS engineer is working on the tool from today. ECD for the tool to get ready is 2 weeks', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:38:21', 89, '', '', '17Feb2021: XPS engineer is working on the tool. ECD for the tool to get ready is 1 week. One of the rotary pump connected to UPS is not working. EMT serviced it, but still not working, capacitors are suspected faulty, inventory is procuring the same. Another pump from EMT spare is connected to UPS.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:38:42', 89, '', '', '24 Feb 2021: XPS engineer has detected some issues today in the vacuum gauge controller. He will communicate this to PHI and let us know about their feedback. Chamber baking started today. After that tunning will be done. ECD 2 weeks', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:39:16', 89, '', '', '3 March 2021: System baking and tuning is done. Standard sample is being checked. System status will be updated by this week.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:39:42', 89, '', '', '17 March 2021: (1) Vacuum gauge controller & (2) UPS power supply LCD are not working. Waiting for quote from PHI.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:40:07', 89, '', '', '24 March 2021: (1) Vacuum gauge controller & (2) UPS power supply LCD are not working. Waiting for quote from PHI. These parts are obsolete, so they need to be repaired. PHI will send us quote for repair. (3) Z align error seen during sample measurement. Engineer is not available this week. He will look into this next week', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-04-10 17:40:34', 89, '', '', '7 April 2021: (1) Vacuum gauge controller & (2) UPS power supply LCD are not working. Waiting for quote from PHI. These parts are obsolete, so they need to be repaired. PHI will send us quote for repair. (3) Z align error seen during sample measurement. Engineer will look into this week. (4) XPS UPS was down (resolved today 7th April) so vendor did not come. Jayeeta will call the vendor in this week', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1122, '2021-04-10 17:44:41', 89, '', '', 'FOC on 24Feb 2021 approved the purchase of Piccolo card. Cost is ~Rs. 20200 + GST\\r\\nPankaj kumar will proceed with ordering the same', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
