(1177, '2021-04-10 17:53:10', 89, '', 'System is not able to reach the required vacuum (</= 15) for process', 'Dec 2020: Issue in the pump\\r\\nPump service required', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1177, '2021-04-10 17:55:04', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '13 Jan 2021: The rotary pump was serviced, oil replaced with new one. Pump working fine now. At mouth of the pump vacuum reached < 3E-2 mbar within few minutes.\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue in the chamber o rings. Email sent to vendor for quote of the o-ring & gasket.\\r\\nAwaiting quote from vendor', 'Vinayak, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1177, '2021-04-10 17:55:27', 89, '', '', '20 Jan 2021: As there is no reply from vendor, EMT removed the chamber o-rings and given to inventory for procurement locally.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1177, '2021-04-10 17:56:14', 89, 'Inventory', '', '27 Jan 2021: Quote received from tool vendor. Rs. 68750/- for 1 gasket & 1 o-ring. Inventory is trying to get the same locally as the cost quoted by tool vendor seems to be expensive. ECD 29th Jan 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
