(1177, '2021-04-10 17:58:39', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '24 March 2021: Gasket & O-ring received on 19the March. Installed new gasket & o-ring. System is under testing. ECD 26March2021', 'Vinayak, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1177, '2021-04-10 17:59:10', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '31 March 2021: Vacuum issue at room temperature is resolved. At high temperature vacuum reached 19 (expected 15). Email sent to vendor for further troubleshooting. As per the manual, chamber & other internal parts cleaning is required & the same has been already done', 'Vinayak, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1177, '2021-04-10 18:00:50', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', '7 April 2021: Again recleaning of all the parts of the chamber, vaporizer, etc was done. After this system was tested for vacuum at high temperature. Vacuum issue resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter resolving vacuum issue, one dummy process run without any sample was done & completed successfully. Another process run with a sample was done, awaiting thickness measurement details', 'Vinayak, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-04-10 20:15:54', 89, '', '', '24 March 2021: (1) cost of new pump quoted by Pfeiffer is Euro 23500 (~Rs. 20.7 lakhs). Repair cost is 7 lakhs for 1 pump. (2) In parallel, EMT is working on the possibilities to get another from IITBNF. ECT 2 weeks', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1194, '2021-04-10 20:17:22', 89, '', '', '7 April 2021: (1) cost of new pump quoted by Pfeiffer is Euro 23500 (~Rs. 20.7 lakhs). Repair cost is 7 lakhs for 1 pump. (2) In parallel, EMT is working on the possibilities to get another pump from IITBNF. ECT 2 weeks. One of the Ultech Furnace pump voltage change (low to high) done. Testing planned in this week', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
