(1156, '2021-04-11 11:38:16', 89, '', '', '24 Feb 2021: Oxford engineer worked on the tool. Checked load / unload at high temperature, was working fine, but today while checking the tool there is again issue of load unload at room temperature also. This issue has been reported. There is another issue wih the tool, ICP reflected power is high. EMT is working on this. Oxford has suggested for PLC upgrade as the existing ones are obsolete and this will cost around 30 Lakhs.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1156, '2021-04-11 11:38:41', 89, '', '', '3 March 2021: ICP high reflected power issue is resolved after replacing the PLC. Process team is doing baseline run after which tool will be opened for use.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1156, '2021-04-11 11:39:08', 89, '', '', '17 March 2021: Tool is working fine. It is being operated in manual mode. Reminder sent to vendor for the LL CAN module PCB', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
