(1263, '2021-04-21 09:09:16', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Batteries are 5 years old. Need to be replaced. This has already been flagged.', 'Spare Batteries removed from Micro 1 & 2 300 KVA UPS have been re-charged. One remaining set of 19 batteries due to have charging completed today', 'Facility Electrical Team', 'Ganesh Batteries', '', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Battery Charger and Charging Cost', 'Rs. 30,000', '2 days', '2021-04-30 00:00:00', 'Need to take shut down of MBE 300 KVA UPS and install the batteries which have been full charged.', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1264, '2021-04-21 09:13:20', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Heard unusual noise from 11 TR compressor at the time of switching on - on 15/4/2021', 'Shut down the compressor immediately. checked and found fan blade has come loose. Re-fixed the fan blade to the base and refitted to motor shaft.', 'Facility Electrical Team', '', '', '', '', 'Need anti clock wise fan blade to be ordered at least 4', 'Rs. 10,000', 'Not Known - cannot see in GEM Portal', '2021-04-23 00:00:00', 'Under observation till the end of this week', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1263, '2021-04-26 16:38:18', 712, 'Facility Team', '', '54 batteries replaced on 22nd April 2021 from 6 pm to 11 pm by Facility Team. Today (26/04/2021) battery back up was checked. Back Up showing is 168 minutes (>2 hours)', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Nil', 'Rs. 25,000/-', 'Nil', '2021-04-30 00:00:00', 'UPS will be under observation till the end of this week. Need to speed up new battery bank procurement (120 Batteries).', 'Rajendra, Irwin', '', ''),
(1261, '2021-05-08 21:13:19', 89, 'Process', '', 'Vendor tried to help via video call, but the issue could not be solved.\\r\\nVendor suggested for engineer\\\'s visit for AMC', 'Minita', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1261, '2021-05-08 21:14:49', 89, '', '', 'May4, 2021:\\r\\nLeft gun cleaning was done with help from Bhimraj (video call) by Pradeep, Minita & Shilpa.\\r\\nAfter cleaning, system kept for purging with Ar gas.\\r\\nNow left beam visible', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
