(1258, '2021-05-10 11:22:32', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The issue was resolved after reset of the Genius controller.\\r\\nNew parameters entered in the Genius controller.\\r\\nPt deposition check, working fine.\\r\\nTi/Au - 10/30nm baseline run done\\r\\nSystem working fine', 'Pradeep, Premsai, Mayur', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
