(1273, '2021-06-28 14:08:57', 89, '', '', 'Spinner working checked it is working fine.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1208, '2021-06-28 14:11:41', 89, '', '', 'Replaced display with spare one faulty spinner.\\r\\nIt is working fine.', 'sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1282, '2021-06-30 12:02:51', 89, '', '', 'Approval received for Prof. Laha sir, mail forwarded to Purchase team. (Mr. Jomon)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-07-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1257, '2021-06-30 12:04:08', 89, '', '', 'Facility connected CDA line for lamp cooling.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1286, '2021-08-18 13:14:57', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'We are able to use the system after pressing OK / Cancel on the error window.\\r\\nThis issue was raised to vendor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1286, '2021-08-18 13:17:25', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EVG vendor sent a new code for the system, but that also did not work.\\r\\nAgain after communicating with the vendor, again a new code was sent on 18th Aug 2021. After entering this new code, there is no error seen in the software.\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked restarting the system twice & dummy runs were done successfully.', 'EMT, Akshata, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2021-08-18 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1285, '2021-09-06 10:05:22', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'RF and MFC error issue has been resolved, there was issue with RF cable and MFC cable, both are replaced with spare. After that checked the system with both gases (O2- 10 sccm and CHF4 - 35 sccm) at RF power 40 W. The system is working fine, checked with Shilpa.', 'Bhimraj, Shilpa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1284, '2021-09-06 10:08:51', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Servicing of the spinner done.\\r\\nIssue resolved.\\r\\nChecked by Akshata.\\r\\n', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'Complaint resolved on 5th Aug 2021'),
(1283, '2021-09-06 10:11:18', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT did troubleshooting yesterday on the issues reported.\\r\\nWe have replaced the RF cable connected to ZnMgO target after which reflected power is 1W for 100W & 150W forward power.\\r\\n\\r\\nHeater is also checked till 400degC.\\r\\n\\r\\nMadhuri was also present during troubleshooting.', 'Bhimraj, Sushil, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1283, '2021-09-06 10:12:09', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Madhuri did the dummy run after we changed the target positions. Following are the observations:\\r\\n\\r\\nZnMgO-\\r\\n@100W RF - reflected power was less than 5 W. It is fluctuating between 1-5 W.\\r\\n@150W RF - reflected power was 15 W at first but then reduced to 10W. After adjusting the matching network manually, It is fluctuating between 1-5 W.\\r\\nZnO-\\r\\n@100W RF - t is between 1-5 W.\\r\\n@150W RF - It is between 1-5 W.', 'EMT, Madhuri, Minita', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1272, '2021-09-06 10:13:14', 89, '', '', 'This is NMPF RTP system', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1272, '2021-09-06 10:17:27', 89, '', '', 'PO sent to vendor on 27th July 2021 and payment in process.\\r\\nExpected delivery date is 1st week of Sept 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1272_2.pdf', ''),
(1272, '2021-09-06 10:18:13', 89, '', '', 'Email received from Annealsys about the part shipment:\\r\\nWe inform you of the shipment today by Fedex of your PO : 4500021077 already paid regarding 1 water flow controller D060-7045.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Fedex tracking number is 7747 0826 8253\\r\\n\\r\\nThe delivery is scheduled on Monday 6th\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease find attached our delivery note ABL13601, our invoice AFC13511 as well as the Fedex air waybill document.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1272, '2021-09-20 23:10:20', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New water flow switch received & installed in the system.\\r\\nSystem will be checked this week', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1287, '2021-09-28 20:35:48', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT checked the tool and found system shows lamp cooling error due to low N2 flow.\\r\\nOn troubleshooting it was found the issue is with N2 regulator.\\r\\nFacility team replaced the regulator with new one.\\r\\nSystem is working fine.\\r\\nOperator will be checking a baseline run.', 'Sushil, Bhimraj, Akshata', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1272, '2021-09-28 20:36:54', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Tool has been checked.\\r\\nOne dummy process run was done at 400degC, no issues found. System worked fine.\\r\\nProcess team to do a baseline run', 'Pradeep, Bhanu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1290, '2021-11-02 11:35:41', 89, 'EMT, Process, Facility', '', 'There was error in N2 gas flow which has been resolved.\\r\\nTool is working fine, checked by Hemant & Akshata.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1289, '2021-11-02 11:37:47', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Log files cleared. \\r\\nThere is no issue with tool.\\r\\nThere is no issue with process.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1288, '2021-11-02 11:38:44', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Lamp replaced with a new one.\\r\\nAnd lamp hours reset done.\\r\\nTool is working fine now. Checked by Akshata & Hemant', 'Sushil, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1202, '2021-11-03 15:32:54', 89, 'Process, Purchase', '', 'Both the parts (gauge controller & UPS controller).\\r\\nGauge controller has been installed & working fine.\\r\\nUPS controller is having connection interface issue. Vendor will send the required interface card', 'Anjum, Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1193, '2021-11-03 15:35:33', 89, 'EMT, Facility', '', 'Edwards pump from ALD system has been shifted to NMPF gas pad area. Electrical connections done.\\r\\nFacility team is doing water, CDA & Exhaust cleaning work', 'Sushil, Bhimraj, Vinayak, RajendraS', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1291, '2021-11-10 11:08:17', 89, 'EMT', 'At speed less than 500 rpm, it is not working properly.', 'Spinner servicing done.\\r\\nChecked at different speeds starting from 200 rpm, it is working fine.\\r\\nChecked by Akshata', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1292, '2021-12-09 16:01:50', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vacuum pump shifted outside the lab as it was causing the vibration.\\r\\nChecked by Akshata, there is no vibration now.\\r\\nReported issue is resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1282, '2021-12-12 11:49:46', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'PO for the cold cathode board sent to AJA on 16th Nov 2021.\\r\\nMaterial is under customs clearance', 'Vijay', 'Joe', 'AJA International', 'Good', '', 'Cold Cathode Gauge & Board', 'USD 2320', '4weeks', '2021-12-15 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1282_3.pdf', ''),
(1204, '2021-12-12 11:52:08', 89, '', '', 'The unit has been received after repair on 24th Aug, 2021.\\r\\nEmail from Wasi \\We have received B1500 with WGFMU on 24th Aug.\\', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 11:56:07', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Service PO sent to Sairem on 14th July 2021', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 11:56:54', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Service order has been sent to the vendor today 14th July 2021. Mail received from vendor \\ material will not be ready before November 5th as some components to repair it have very long delivery times.\\ (2) In parallel, an used DC power supply ie being purchased from AJA. Purchase team is processing PO. Cost is USD 3250', 'Jomon, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 11:58:13', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'Sept 28, 2021:\\r\\n Repaired DC power supply received on 21st Sept 2021. Installation planned in this week. The DC power supply has been installed on the system. Co-ordinating with SO for checking the same', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 11:59:04', 89, '', '', 'Oct 20, 2021:\\r\\nThe DC power supply has been installed on the system. The power supply checked with Ti, it is working fine. SO / AUs will do baseline run & update', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 12:00:25', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'Nov 3, 2021:\\r\\nPO sent to AJA for a refurbished DC power supply. Awaiting material. \\r\\n\\r\\nThe repaired DC power supply has been installed on the system. The power supply checked with Ti, it is working fine. SO / AUs did baseline with Ti deposition, the results are comparable with the previous data.', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1168, '2021-12-12 12:01:05', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Dec 3, 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\n(1) An used DC power supply is being purchased from AJA. Purchase team is processing PO. Cost is USD 3250. PO sent to AJA. Awaiting material.', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, '2021-12-12 12:11:03', 89, '', '', 'Aug 2021\\r\\nProcurement of New pump for ALD non LL has not been successful due to high cost & GTE and other purchase related issues', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, '2021-12-12 12:12:11', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Sept 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs discussed with Prof Saurabh, EMT connected a spare Edwards pump after confirmation from ALD engineer. Below is the status as on 18th Sept 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. All the connections - vacuum pipe from pump to system, water, exhaust - done\\r\\n2. Pump switched ON without connecting to chamber for ~ 10 mins\\r\\n3. ALD no LL switched ON. Chamber pump down started. Initially vacuum was not going below 1.9 E-1 Torr. Did pump purge. System heaters turned ON & after 30 mins chamber vacuum reached 7E-2 Torr.\\r\\n4. Plasma strike checked manually with N2 & O2, worked but sometimes high reflected power issue seen\\r\\n5. Plasma test run with N2 & O2 for 10 cycles each tested, worked well for N2, but high reflected power for O2. We will work on this on Monday.\\r\\n6. Process pressure for N2 run is ~ 2.3 E-1 Torr. We will check the previous data and compare.\\r\\n7. We have planned to keep the chamber in pumping mode for Monday full day & see how much vacuum improves.\\r\\n8. After that one baseline run should be done & compared with previous results. This will confirm this pump will work till we get a new pump.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, '2021-12-12 12:13:07', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Oct 9, 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe high reflected power in the ALD non LL has been resolved yesterday (by Vinayak), and today one process was done for HfO2 (100 cycles) and thickness obtained is 10nm (as expected).\\r\\n\\r\\nIt took us quite a time for tuning the matching network and resolve the high reflected power issue.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe will need to do couple of more runs & characterize to confirm this pump will work till we get new pump\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, '2021-12-12 12:14:19', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Oct 12, 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have been able to connect the iH600 pump to ALD non LL system.\\r\\nBelow are the updates on the same:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Chamber pump down started. Initially vacuum was not going below 1.9 E-1 Torr. Did pump purge. System heaters turned ON & after couple of hours chamber vacuum reached 7E-2 Torr. The pump is able to pump down to this vacuum only.\\r\\n2. We faced high reflected power issue with both O2 & N2 gas recipes. We could resolve this by adjusting the Phase & Mag of the matching network.\\r\\n3. For HfO2 process, chamber process pressure is 2.06E-1 Torr. One process run for 100 cycles was done, and thickness measured is 10nm (as expected)\\r\\n4. For HfNx process, chamber process pressure is 2.797E-1 Torr.\\r\\n5. For Al2O3 process, chamber process pressure is 1.937E-1 Torr.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have opened the system for use and have plans to characterize the film quality. Will keep you posted.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith the previous pump, chamber base pressure used to be around 2E-2 Torr.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1176, '2021-12-12 12:15:28', 89, '', '', 'Oct 13, 2021:\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail sent by SO to all\\r\\n\\r\\nThe ALD non-loadlock system was turned on after the long shut down and the pump connected to the system was found not to be working. The EMT and Facility teams have worked on the issue. The EMT team has connected another iH600 pump to the system and following are the updates on this:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Currently the base pressure of the system with the new pump connected is 7e-2 Torr. Earlier the base pressure used to be 2e-2 Torr.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. High reflected power issues were observed for plasma-based recipes with both O2 and N2 gases. This has been resolved by EMT by tuning the matching network.\\r\\n\\r\\n3. A baseline process has been performed successfully for HfO2 deposition using O2-plasma at 250 C for 100 cycles. Ellipsometry results show 10 nm deposition with R. I. of 1.9, which is as expected. \\r\\n\\r\\n4. Other test runs have also been performed for HfNx using N2-plasma and Al2O3 using O2-plasma to confirm that the high reflected power issue has got resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe ALD system is now up for use. Users can plan to get their processes done using operator\\\'s help. We want to closely monitor the process runs and request users to keep me updated on the characterization results of the deposited films.\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks a lot to the EMT and Facility teams for all their support in bringing the system up.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1294, '2022-03-03 22:59:08', 89, '', '', 'The issue is resolved.\\r\\nEMT increased the flow of N2 for lamp cooling from 2.8 to 4.0', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1296, '2022-03-30 10:01:11', 89, 'EMT', '', 'This issue was reported to EVG.\\r\\nThe battery of the jenytec controller for y motor drained out.\\r\\nThe battery has been replaced with new one and firmware updated.\\r\\nSystem is working fine now.\\r\\nEMT recommended to keep the system ON 24X7. SO will update the SOP accordingly and train the users', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1301, '2022-06-07 20:52:21', 89, 'E', '', 'The tool was restarted after which the error did not occur.\\r\\nChecked by Akshata, system is working fine.', 'Akshata, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1300, '2022-06-07 21:01:33', 89, 'E', '', 'Temperature controller found to be faulty, replaced with a new one.\\r\\nChecked, it is working fine.\\r\\nConfirmed by Akshata.', 'Akshata, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'New temperature controller was procured by inventory.'),
(1299, '2022-06-07 21:02:53', 89, 'EMT', '', 'On troubleshooting it was found the vacuum pump diaphragm went bad. Replaced with new one from EMT stock.\\r\\nChecked spinner vacuum, it reaches 21.\\r\\nIssue resolved', 'Vinayak, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1303, '2022-06-27 12:49:41', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'EMT worked on it and found the lens movement with the joystick is not happening properly. Through software, it moves.\\r\\nIssue was raised to EVG.\\r\\nLocal vendor Tesscorn\\\'s engineer will visit on 27th June 2022 for this issue', 'Sushil, Akshata', 'EVG & Tesscorn', 'EV Group\\r\\ninvent â€¢ innovate â€¢ implement\\r\\nWeb: www.EVGroup.com\\r\\nEV Group Europe & Asia/Pacific GmbH, DI Erich Thallner Str. 1, 4782 St. Florian am Inn, Austria\\r\\nRechtsform: GmbH, Sitz: St. Florian am Inn, FN 316392h, LG Ried im Innkreis\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPurushothaman\\r\\nGeneral Manager â€“ Sales\\r\\nTesscorn Nano Science Inc.\\r\\n+91 7760998592\\r\\npurusho@tesscorn-nanoscience.com', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1297, '2022-06-27 12:51:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'April 2022:\\r\\nThe gear for the lens movement railing was found shifted from its position.\\r\\nThe same was adjusted.\\r\\nSystem checked working fine. \\r\\nreported issue is resolved, checked by SO', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1295, '2022-06-27 12:55:17', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Spinner servicing done for ppr cleaning in the vacuum line.\\r\\nAlso, the dry pump diaphragm replaced with new one.\\r\\nSystem is working fine, checked by SO.\\r\\nReported issue resolved', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1305, '2022-06-27 20:37:56', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Found 1 service valve defective due to which there was ice build up on the discharge line.', 'Replaced the faulty service valve on 25/6/2022. Chiller under observation for 1 week.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Service Valve', 'Nil - In Stock', 'Nil - In Stock', '2022-06-30 00:00:00', 'Take IR Gun Readings every 2 weeks in running condition to pick up any such issues.', 'Amit Das', '', 'Chiller will be under observation till the end of this week.'),
(1304, '2022-06-27 20:41:41', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Found Temperature & %RH was out of spec on Friday morning around 7:00 am.', 'Facility Team took quick shut down of Nano AHU and found the AHU Belts had broken all of a sudden. Replaced the belts and issue got resolved. Temperature & %RH restored to within spec within 1 hour.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'AHU Belts', 'Nil - In Stock', 'Nil - In Stock', '2022-06-30 00:00:00', 'Check for Icing on Condenser Units daily and alert Team Leader in such case', 'Amit Das, Ajay B, Raju K', '', 'AHU will be under observation till the end of this week. Side by Side stock of AHU Belts of this particular type/number for Nano AHU needs to be replenished asap.'),
(1306, '2022-06-27 20:49:17', 712, 'Facility Team', 'New GA30 Air Compressor Vibration Readings have gone to Red Zone.', 'On 25/6/2022 the full motor & element set was removed from the New GA30 Compressor and another motor & element set which was kept on standby was installed into the air compressor system.', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. S. Warang/Mr. Julian C', 'Satisfactory', '', '30 KW Motor & Element', '3 Lakhs', 'Nil since both were in Stock', '2022-07-09 00:00:00', 'Get Enercare (AMC Vendor) to do 1 new set of SPM Readings by/before the end of next week to ensure the Readings are once again in the Green Zone.', 'Irwin', '', '1. Follow up with Enercare for SPM Meter and Site Visit for New SPM Readings. \\r\\n2. Follow up for the Motor & Element Set removed from the running system to be sent for Re-Conditioning'),
(1307, '2022-06-27 20:56:44', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Found N2 Plant Pressure drops down gradually when Atlas Copco CDX-120 Dryer is used.', 'Vendor came for AMC Service Visit on 24/5/2022 and replaced all the 130 Kg Activated Alumina, DD, PD & QD Filters but still pressure drop was there. Upon further trouble-shooting it was found that there is air leakage in the pneumatic actuator. So pneumatic actuator needs to be replaced for the Right Hand Side Cycle to work properly.', 'Facility Team', 'Enercare', 'Mr. S. Warang/Mr. Julian C', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Pneumatic Actuator / Butterfly Valve', 'Rs. 35,430/- incl Transport', '3 - 4 weeks', '2022-07-30 00:00:00', 'Replace the Pneumatic Actuator/Butterfly Valve with new one and ensure there is no Pressure Drop when this Dryer is in service/use.', 'Irwin [N2 Plant SO]', '', 'PO has been issued. Follow up with Enercare is going on to expedite the delivery so that Stand-By Dryer is ready for emergency use. \\r\\n'),
(1308, '2022-06-28 20:41:32', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Got call from Nano Lab that Sputter water supply stopped/tripped @ around 6:45 to 6:50 pm on 22/6/2022', 'Checked and found Chiller Control Panel Main Display was blank/off. Checked and found 1 mcb in the power supply chain was tripped. Reset that mcb and the issue was resolved.', 'Facility Team', '', '', '', '', 'Nil', 'Nil', 'Nil since both were in Stock', '2022-06-30 00:00:00', 'Take IR Gun Reading of mcb in the power supply chain to the Chiller Control Panel and inside the Control Panel.', 'Amit Das', '', 'Keep 1 mcb in spare of same rating and spec to change immediately incase this mcb trips again.'),
(1303, '2022-06-30 15:21:39', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Tesscorn engineer worked on the issue as planned. \\r\\nThere was one of the setting for limiting the optics movement clicked by some user by mistake. This has been corrected with help from EVG & Tesscorn.\\r\\nIssue has been resolved, system checked multiple times.', 'Sushil, Akshata', 'EVG & Tesscorn', '', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1302, '2022-06-30 15:24:01', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'It was observed, the mask vacuum error pops up.', 'EMT checked the pump, it is working fine.\\r\\nOne of the o-ring of mask holder was found missing, it has been fixed.\\r\\nAfter that, the issue did not repeat.\\r\\nSystem checked by SO, working fine.', 'Sushil, Akshata', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
