(1156, '2022-08-29 12:35:56', 89, '', '', '2nd June 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nLL CAN module PCB has been installed in the system and checked. Wafer loading / unloading is working fine in automatic mode in Room temperature. High temperature loading / unloading is still an issue. Vendor has suggested for electrode replacement. Awaiting quote.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
