(696, '2022-08-29 12:52:10', 89, 'EMT', '', '3rd March 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nN2, O2 MFC were malfunctioning and were not working above 10sccm. High pressure N2 purge was done for both the MFCs several times after which both are working fine for all the values from 10 sccm to 90 sccm. This week gas flow check with non toxic gases will be done. The repaired matching network will be installed & plasma check is planned', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
