(696, '2022-08-29 12:53:50', 89, 'EMT / Facility', '', '17th March 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nFacility team were checking the exhaust blower for proper functioning. The same has been completed today morning. Further work on tool will be carried out from tomorrow', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:54:25', 89, 'EMT', '', '24th March 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nMatching netwrk installation done. Ar MFC found faulty. 3 solenoid valve found leaky. Faulty parts will be replaced with new ones & leak check (vacuum) will be done before flowing gases in the chamber', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:55:09', 89, 'EMT', '', '31st March 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nAr MFC replaced with a new one. 4 solenoid valves found faulty. 3 replaced with new one & 2 repaired. Vacuum testing of these valves is done half & remaining is planned in this week. This is for non toxic. Once this is done, toxic gas work will be done. ECD 9th April 2021', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:56:01', 89, 'EMT', '', '7th April 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nAr MFC replaced with a new one. 4 solenoid valves found faulty. 3 replaced with new one & 2 repaired. Vacuum testing of these valves is done half & remaining is planned in this week. This is for non toxic. Once this is done, toxic gas work will be done. ECD 9th April 2021. New issue faced on the system Server could not be reached\\. Email sent to Sentech for support', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:56:33', 89, 'EMT', '', '21st April 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nAr MFC replaced with a new one. 4 solenoid valves found faulty. 3 replaced with new one & 2 repaired. Vacuum testing of these valves is done half & remaining is planned in this week. This is for non toxic. Once this is done, toxic gas work will be done. ECD 9th April 2021. New issue faced on the system \\Server could not be reached\\. Email sent to Sentech for support. Awaiting vendor\\\'s reply', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:57:17', 89, 'EMT', '', '27th April 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nAr MFC replaced with a new one. 4 solenoid valves found faulty. 3 replaced with new one & 2 repaired. Vacuum testing of these valves is done half & remaining is planned in this week. This is for non toxic. Once this is done, toxic gas work will be done. Received reply from Sentect for login details. Now server error is resolved, and we are able to login to the software. Chamber pumped down checked. Further troubleshooting will be done in this week', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:58:35', 89, 'EMT', '', '16th June 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nAr MFC replaced with a new one. 4 solenoid valves found faulty. 3 replaced with new one & 2 repaired. Vacuum testing of these valves is done half & remaining is planned in this week. This is for non toxic. Once this is done, toxic gas work will be done. Received reply from Sentect for login details. Now server error is resolved, and we are able to login to the software. Chamber pumped down checked. Further troubleshooting will be done once EMT man power is available', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 12:59:22', 89, 'EMT', '', '23rd June 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChamber pumped down checked. Pump service is required. It was not pumping below 18 Pa.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:01:08', 89, 'EMT', '', '7th July 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChamber pumped down checked. Rotary Pump service is required. It was not pumping below 18 Pa. Rotary pump is have servicing will be done once EMT man power is available', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:02:15', 89, 'EMT', '', '28th July 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nPump servicing has been done. Checked the vacuum on pump port and till forline valve. Vacuum is OK. Still rough vacuum not showing on software suspected with baratron gauge. Planned to replace with old ICPRIE baratron gauge for confirmation. Waiting for SO (Bhanu) feedback.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:02:47', 89, 'EMT', '', '18th Aug 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked the system vacuum by swapping the Baratron gauge with Old ICPRIE system, there is no issue with the Baratron gauge. Cleaning & He leak testing of the chamber will be done this week', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:03:21', 89, 'EMT', '', '25th Aug 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked the system vacuum by swapping the Baratron gauge with Old ICPRIE system, there is no issue with the Baratron gauge. Cleaning & He leak testing of the chamber will be done this week. Issue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump has not gave desire vacuum and MCB got tripped. Today EMT has  been working on it', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:03:56', 89, 'EMT', '', '1st Sep 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked the system vacuum by swapping the Baratron gauge with Old ICPRIE system, there is no issue with the Baratron gauge. Cleaning & He leak testing of the chamber will be done this week. Issue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump has not gave desire vacuum and MCB got tripped. Today EMT has  been working on it. Rotary pump has been gone bad.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:04:20', 89, 'EMT', '', '8th Sep 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked the system vacuum by swapping the Baratron gauge with Old ICPRIE system, there is no issue with the Baratron gauge. Cleaning & He leak testing of the chamber will be done this week. Issue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump has not gave desire vacuum and MCB got tripped. Today EMT has  been working on it. Rotary pump has gone bad. Email sent to Leybold for service.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:04:50', 89, 'EMT', '', '28th Sep 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked the system vacuum by swapping the Baratron gauge with Old ICPRIE system, there is no issue with the Baratron gauge. Cleaning & He leak testing of the chamber will be done this week. Issue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump has not gave desire vacuum and MCB got tripped. Rotary pump has gone bad. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:05:25', 89, 'EMT', '', '3rd Nov 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:05:52', 89, 'EMT', '', '7th Nov 2021\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service. As per vendor\\\'s email, parts are to be imported from Germany, hence there is a delay of 4weeks', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:06:30', 89, 'EMT', '', '5th Jan 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service. As per vendor\\\'s email, parts are to be imported from Germany, hence there is a delay of 4weeks. Delivery is shedule in Feb 2022', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:07:01', 89, 'EMT', '', '2nd Feb 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service. As per vendor\\\'s email, parts are to be imported from Germany, hence there is a delay of 4weeks. Delivery is shedule in Feb 2022. Reminder email sent to the venddor.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `trouble_track` (`complaint_id`, `timestamp`, `status_mark_by`, `working_team`, `diagnosis`, `action_taken`, `work_done_by`, `vendor_name`, `vendor_contact`, `vendor_interaction`, `vendor_comments`, `spare_parts`, `cost_spare_parts`, `procurement_time_spares`, `expected_completion_date`, `action_plan`, `action_item_owner`, `file`, `comments`) VALUES
(696, '2022-08-29 13:07:34', 89, 'EMT', '', '2nd March 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service. As per vendor\\\'s email, parts are to be imported from Germany, hence there is a delay of 4weeks. Delivery is shedule in Feb 2022. Reminder email sent to the vendor. New ECD is 2nd week of March 2022', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:07:55', 89, 'EMT', '', '16th March 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Email sent to Leybold for service. Quote received from Leybold, sent to purchase team for PO processing on 24th Sept 2021. PO sent to vendor, awating spares & vendor\\\'s visit for pump service. Parts received at Bangalore factory on 15th March. Will be shipped to IITB', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:08:29', 89, 'EMT', '', '30th March 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue with Rotary pump. Rotary pump is not giving desired vacuum and MCB gets tripped. Rotary pump needs overhaul service. Leybold service engineer is servicing the pump', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:09:18', 89, 'EMT', '', '13th April 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nRotary Pump service complete. Rough vacuum issue is resolved. Turbo switched ON and checked high vacuum, able to reach 1E-6 mbar. Next week, MFC test, pneumatic valve operation and substrate transfer from LL to PC. The solenoid valves procurement is in process.', 'Sushil, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:10:10', 89, 'EMT', '', '27th April 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nRotary Pump service complete. Rough vacuum issue is resolved. Turbo switched ON and checked high vacuum, able to reach 1E-6 mbar. MFC test, pneumatic valve operation and substrate transfer from LL to PC has been done. Its working fine. Some of the soleniod valves is leaky need to be replace. The solenoid valves procurement is in process.', 'Bhimraj, Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:10:44', 89, 'EMT', '', '25th May 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nRotary Pump service complete. Rough vacuum issue is resolved. Turbo switched ON and checked high vacuum, able to reach 1E-6 mbar. MFC test, pneumatic valve operation and substrate transfer from LL to PC has been done. Its working fine. Non toxic gas flow vs chamber pressure checked. Some of the soleniod valves is leaky need to be replace. Revised quotation received $3310. Sent to purchase team for PO process.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(696, '2022-08-29 13:12:00', 89, 'EMT', '', '17th Aug 2022\\r\\n\\r\\nRotary Pump service complete. Rough vacuum issue is resolved. Turbo switched ON and checked high vacuum, able to reach 1E-6 mbar. MFC test, pneumatic valve operation and substrate transfer from LL to PC has been done. Its working fine. Non toxic gas flow vs chamber pressure checked. Some of the soleniod valves is leaky need to be replace. Revised quotation received $3310. Sent to purchase team for PO process.', 'Sushil, Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1314, '2022-11-16 11:52:52', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The WEC setting was disturbed.\\r\\nThis has been resolved by Sushil. Checked by Akshata, system is working fine\\r\\nReported issue resolved.', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2022-11-16 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1313, '2022-11-16 11:57:03', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'The LL arm not getting initialization. The arm position should be 2mm, software reads 0mm.\\r\\nOne of the IC in the Load Lock controller has been replaced with a new one.\\r\\nNow the robot arm initialization error is resolved. Position of the arm at outer initialization is showing 2mm', 'Pradeep, Vinayak, Akshata', 'Raith India Pvt. Ltd', 'Pandurangaiah SV <Pandurangaiah.SV@raith.com>', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
