(1331, '2022-11-30 12:36:47', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Issue with the lower electrode heat exchanger. \\r\\nAfter troubleshooting found the SSRs (4nos) are faulty. These need to be replaced with new one.\\r\\n\\r\\nNeed to replace all of them. Samco sent quote JPY 50000 (~INR 28000).\\r\\nPO sent to vendor as per INR quote.\\r\\nSamco updated, they sent the parts to Indian vendor on 22nd Dec. Indian vendor is getting it cleared through customs.', '', 'Samco, Japan', 'Hirokazu Amamori\\r\\nManager, South-East Asia & India Region\\r\\nInternational Sales Division\\r\\nSamco Inc. Head Office\\r\\n 36 Waraya-cho, Takeda, Fushimi-ku, Kyoto 612-8443 Japan\\r\\nTEL: +81-75-621-7841(Office)\\r\\nMobile: +81-90-3064-6398\\r\\nSKYPE User Name: HIROKAZU AMAMORI\\r\\nFAX: +81-75-621-0936\\r\\ne-mail: amamori-hiro@samco.co.jp\\r\\nURL: http://www.samcointl.com', 'Very good', '', 'SSRs', '55696', '4 weeks after PO', '2022-12-06 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1331_0.pdf', ''),
(1330, '2022-11-30 15:05:42', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Lamp power oscillations issue resolved after replacing 3 relays (K6, K7 & K8) as suggested by vendor.\\r\\nCalibration & baseline run was done\\r\\nTool is up till 900degC. \\r\\nVendor will visit on 5th Dec for PM', 'Sushil', 'Elcamino, Bangalore', 'Raghvendra Kumar \\r\\nSr. Technical Sales & Service Engineer\\r\\nEL CAMINO TECHNOLOGIES PVT LTD\\r\\nMob No : +91 9606028705\\r\\nTel  No : 080-23640503\\r\\nFax No : 080-23641170\\r\\ne-mail  : sales4@elcamino.in\\r\\nWeb : www.elcamino.in', 'Good', '', 'Relays', '', '', '2022-12-07 00:00:00', 'Relays swapped from NMPF RTP', '', '', ''),
