(1326, '2022-11-30 15:11:20', 89, 'EMT, Inventory', '', 'The existing lamp controller needs repair. Sunitha is finding the vendor for repair.\\r\\nNew lamp controller from Amazon needs to be ordered. Cost is Rs. 34995. Credit / debit card is required for paying', 'Sushil, Sunitha', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', 'https://www.amazon.in/Source-Display-Laparoscopy-Endoscopy-Microscopy/dp/B07GBT2JTV/ref=sr_1_8?crid=2TYTSCXLHCQWQ&keywords=led+light+source+for+microscope&qid=1669015382&qu=eyJxc2MiOiIyLjAyIiwicXNhIjoiMC4wMCIsInFzcCI6IjAuMDAifQ%3D%3D&sprefix=led+light+source+%2Caps%2C333&sr=8-8'),
(1325, '2022-11-30 15:14:30', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New stepper motor received and installed. Still the stepper motor error issue persists.\\r\\nMotor is getting heated up.\\r\\nSentech suspected there is issue with the power supply, and this needs to be sent to Germany for repair.\\r\\nEMT requested LabIndia for meeting with Sentech engineer Mr. Roland', 'Sushil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
