(1319, '2022-11-30 15:39:29', 89, 'EMT, facility', '', 'Gas Purifiers for Ar & O2 replaced with new ones.\\r\\nPump purge of all the gas lines (Ar, O2, N2 & NH3) done.\\r\\nDummy run done without precursor, system hardware is working.\\r\\nPooja will be doing AlN process and XPS characterization to see presence of N in the film', '', 'Mark sowa', 'Mark Sowa <msowa@veeco.com>\\r\\nALDSUPPORT <ALDSUPPORT@veeco.com>', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '2022-12-09 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
