(1331, '2022-12-06 16:34:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As per update from Samco local vendor, the SSRs have been received by them in Delhi. It will be shipped to IITB today 6th Dec 2022', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
