(1331, '2022-12-12 17:35:37', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'SSRs received at IITB on 7th Dec 2022.\\r\\nInstallation on the system done on 8th December 2022.\\r\\nNo error on the heat exchanger seen.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne chamber clean & one high etch rate recipe run checked, completed successfully without any errors.', 'Vinayak, Pradeep, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1331_2.pdf', 'Report is attached.'),
(1330, '2022-12-12 17:37:22', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Vendor visit done. \\r\\nPreventive maintenance on the tool done.\\r\\nSystem is up for usage.\\r\\n\\r\\nNew status of the system as updated by SO:\\r\\nRTP tool is open for use now. For pyro-1 maximum allowed temp is 1000Â°C and for pyro-2 maximum allowed temperature is 850Â°C.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease use the following calibration table for the process:\\r\\n\\r\\nPyro-1: Cal_4inch_Pyro1_22112022\\r\\n              PID table: Si-06122022\\r\\n\\r\\nPyro-2: Cal-Pyro2_28022022\\r\\n              PID table: SUI50Py_Bt_PID_slow2', 'Sushil, Pankaj, Arpit', 'Elcamino, Bangalore', '', 'Good', '', 'AMC maintenance', '248000', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1329, '2022-12-12 17:41:03', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Modified LN2 trap with a tank received on 9th December 2022.\\r\\nInstalled on the system and checked one process run for 5um.\\r\\nPowder seen on the chamber view port, no powder seen on the sample.\\r\\nPramod will do thickness measurement and update.', 'Vinayak, Pramod (INUP user)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
