(1320, '2022-12-19 15:51:30', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Jomon sent email to MMD for GR Waiver for exporting the RF generator.\\r\\n\\r\\nDear MMD Team,\\r\\nAttn: Gajanan Sir,\\r\\nNeeded GR Waiver / Bank NOC document for the Export of part named \\ RF Generator (RFG 3001) \\ (Qty:1) to M/s. Advanced Energy Industries GmbH, Germany through Carrier (M/s. Balmer Lawrie & Co. Ltd.).\\r\\n\\r\\nPresently, the RF Generator is not functional, so it has to be exported to M/s. Advanced Energy for repair purposes.\\r\\nThis RF Generator is part of our procured ICPECVD system vide PO no. 200700309 from M/s. Oxford Instrument Plasma Technology, UK (thro- M/s. AIMIL Ltd., Vashi))\\r\\n\\r\\nM/s. Oxford had stated that they had assembled the RF Generator in ICPECVD system by availing it from M/s. Advanced Energy so execute the repair work from M/s. Advanced Energy, as per vide letter dt. 01.11.2022 (attached).\\r\\n\\r\\nAttached- System PO, Snaps of the RF Generator RFG 3001\\r\\n              - Raised Export Invoice\\r\\n              - Consignee\\\'s Mail with RMA Number\\r\\n\\r\\nSo kindly do the needful by raising GR waiver through the Bank and call if any assistance is needed.', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
