(1343, '2023-01-18 12:54:43', 89, 'EMT', '', 'As per email from OEM, LW0 board is ready for shipment to IITB. It has been tested and working fine at Microtek factory, Italy.\\r\\nOEM will ship the board free of cost, IITB will have to bear the shipping charges of ~150USD.\\r\\n', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
