(1325, '2023-01-18 13:08:13', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'The components have been ordered and ETA is 20th Jan 2023. Once part is received, will be installed on the board.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn parallel,awaiting further reply from Sentech / Lab India as per Jomon\\\'s email: \\r\\nSubject to the Export of Power Supply unit (Qty:1)  [part of  our Fast Spectroscopic Ellipsometer procured vide PO 20030426 (attached) from Sentech Instruments GmbH, Germany] to Sentech, Germany.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor the execution of export of above part through our carrier (Balmer Lawrie), needed below details from your side:-\\r\\n\\r\\na. Mail confirmation from Snetech, Germany about the acceptance of the above part export and RMA no (if any)\\r\\nb. Exact Consignee address with the concerned person (Email id & Telephone no.)\\r\\nc. Power Supply Unit [HSN code, Value to be specified for Export]\\r\\nd. Nearest Port of Discharge\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease share your inputs against the above 4 points.', 'Pradeep, Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1325_3.pdf', ''),
