(1358, '2023-02-07 10:53:42', 89, '', '', 'Checked by EMT and found the turbopump showing too high load.\\r\\nBacking pump is working fine as it is able to achieve rough vacuum of ~2e-2Torr.\\r\\nIssue raised with Agilent', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
