(1358, '2023-02-28 11:55:06', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New turbo pump (warranty replacement) received from Agilent on 24th Feb.\\r\\nIt has been installed in the system and tested. It is working fine.\\r\\nThe old one kept in EMT spare', 'Vinayak, Bhimraj', 'Agilent Technologies, Bangalore', '', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'The old faulty pump will be sent to Agilent Bangalore.', '', '', ''),
