(1343, '2023-02-28 12:04:35', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'All the hardware related issues are resolved.\\r\\nOne dummy mask was written for ~18hrs, completed without system getting restarted.\\r\\nAnother mask with variable gain was written.\\r\\n1% filter, Gain 35-54\\r\\n3% filter, Gain 30.\\r\\nProcess team is doing development and further process', 'AUs, SO, EMT', 'Microtek, Italy', 'Prof Arnone.\\r\\ncarnone@microtechweb.com', 'Very good', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1351, '2023-02-28 12:21:56', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor on 28 Jan 2023\\r\\nCPU board was shipped by Ferrotec on Feb 7, 2023\\r\\nThe board was under customs clearance by UPS. \\r\\nIITB made payment for the customs clearance charges on Feb 27, 2023.\\r\\nVijay sent reminder email to UPS for sending the part to IITB.', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1325, '2023-02-28 12:36:47', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Tried repairing the board, but no success.\\r\\nAs per suggestion from Prof Kasturi, it was shown to WEL lab, but they cannot repair it.\\r\\nThe power supply unit has to be sent to Sentech Germany.\\r\\nAll the required details has been sent to Jomon for making the paper work', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1324, '2023-03-01 15:37:34', 89, '', '', 'Service visits done by pfeiffer.\\r\\nThe pump needs to be sent to service center.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1322, '2023-03-01 15:38:40', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Waiting for parts from Leybold.\\r\\nVendor sent email, the new parts on hold due to old payment pending from IITB side.\\r\\nHemangi & Nitin following up', 'Hemangi, Nitin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1320, '2023-03-01 15:52:33', 89, 'EMT, Purchase', '', 'The RF Generator is repaired. - \\r\\nQuote received from the Advanced Energy. Cost is 4706 Eur (~INR 4.2L)\\r\\nPurchase indent form filled for PO processing after FICs approval', 'Pradeep, Vijay', 'Advanced Energy', 'Ali Emruli\\r\\nManager, Customer Advocacy\\r\\nHotline: +49 7123 969 015\\r\\nDirect: +49 7123 969 126\\r\\nCell: +49 172 564 7498\\r\\nali.emruli@aei.com', 'Good', '', 'RF Generator repair', 'Eur 4706', '', '2023-04-14 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1320_5.pdf', ''),
(1360, '2023-03-02 12:14:25', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'PO sent to vendor on March 1, 2023.\\r\\nPO is attached', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1360_2.pdf', ''),
(1351, '2023-03-02 12:17:24', 89, '', '', 'After grounding troubleshooting was done, repaired board was installed in the Genius controller. But it was found the CARRERA unit is not turning ON.\\r\\nOn further investigation (after FICs) approval, it was found one of the 3-phase fuse was blown OFF in the main power box.\\r\\nRequest for new procurement sent to Inventory.\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Quote received for new fuse (6nos) on March 2, 2023\\r\\nSunitha is processing PO for the same.', '', 'uploads/1351_6.pdf', ''),
(1351, '2023-03-02 12:19:00', 89, 'EMT, Facility', '', 'Troubleshooting ppt - Grounding issue is attached', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'uploads/1351_7.ppt', ''),
(1367, '2023-03-06 21:06:22', 712, 'Facility Team', 'Found radial play in the screw element due to which temperature rise was observed', 'Replaced the screw element with spare screw element on 6/3/2023 and kept the unit under observation but sill the issue persisted. On 8/3/2022 did radiator coil cleaning and after that the temperature did not go beyond 99 Deg C.', '', 'Enercare Solutions', 'Satish W', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Need Re-Conditioning of Element & Motor', 'Rs. 300000/-', '8 weeks', '2023-04-27 00:00:00', 'Send spare screw element and motor as full set for re-conditioning. Then once received back keep in spare for emergency.', 'Irwin', '', ''),
(1368, '2023-03-24 12:49:55', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Gate valve serviced.\\r\\nIt is working fine now.\\r\\nChecked by Manisha.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1369, '2023-04-05 08:06:24', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Issue was with the vacuum pump.\\r\\nVacuum pipe was found broken, replaced with another one.\\r\\nChecked, system is working fine.\\r\\nReported issue resolved.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
