(1360, '2023-04-18 12:55:37', 89, 'EMT', '', 'The micrometer gauge received on April 17.\\r\\nThe same has been installed on the tool on April 18. Stage movement is working checked by EMT (Vinayak)\\r\\nSO has been requested to check the tool, do a dummy run and update the status.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1351, '2023-04-18 12:58:10', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Fuse received on April 16. The same was installed on April 17.\\r\\nNow the CARRERA is getting input power of 394VAC w.r.t each phase.\\r\\nBut the CARRERA is not getting turned ON.\\r\\nEmail sent to Ferrotec for further troubleshooting help.', 'Vinayak, Siddharth', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
