(1384, '2023-04-27 10:10:19', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked and found flow meter is working fine if the output line is opened.\\r\\nAfter connecting the line, same issue seen.\\r\\nReplaced the old faulty teflon tube.\\r\\nChecked by Pankaj, working fine.\\r\\nReported issue resolved.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
