(1351, '2023-07-05 11:10:19', 89, '', '', 'The issue has been resolved after replacing the old CPU board in the Genius controller.\\r\\nBeam alignment done by SO.\\r\\nSystem is working fine.\\r\\nBaseline run is being done by SO', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
