(1325, '2023-08-01 10:40:08', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Sentech has repaired the power supply and sent to IITB.\\r\\nIt is under Mumbai customs clearance since July 4, 2023\\r\\nPurchase team is working on this', 'Hemangi, Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1322, '2023-08-01 10:43:25', 89, 'EMT', '', 'After servicing the rotary pump on June 8, 2023, the vacuum pump is working fine. Rough vacuum issue is resolved.', 'Bhimraj, vendor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1402, '2023-08-27 12:49:04', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Checked the pump, vacuum takes time from 6E-2 to 2E-2 torr half hour.\\r\\nSystem can be used.\\r\\nThis is not an issue as such', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1401, '2023-08-27 12:50:34', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Another RF Generator from Prof Apurba laha\\\'s MBE taken.\\r\\nRepaired the old RF Generator from Plasma Asher with taking parts between Plasma Asher & MBE RF Generator.\\r\\nSystem checked, its working fine', 'Bhimraj, Arpit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1394, '2023-08-27 12:51:38', 89, '', '', 'Maintenance was done in July 2023. During maintenance one of the lamp broke and the cooling water supply pipe leak.\\r\\nNew lamp ordered\\r\\nWater cooling assembly sent for repair to Excel Instrumnets.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1394, '2023-08-27 12:53:18', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'New lamp received.\\r\\nLamp Water cooling assembly received after repair.\\r\\nEngineer visited for further troubleshooting and work from Aug 21-23 2023\\r\\nAfter maintenance system is working fine.\\r\\nProcess runs checked by Shahiroze, Minita & Pankaj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1389, '2023-08-27 13:00:27', 89, '', '', 'Issue resolved after maintenance visit by vendor on Aug 21-23, 2023', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1386, '2023-08-27 13:01:54', 89, 'EMT', '', 'This issue was checked.\\r\\nEMT checked and found no issue with the system.\\r\\nUsers are keeping Turbo purge ON when the backing valve is closed. The purge valve has to be closed during this time.\\r\\nSO will retrain all the AUs for the same.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1390, '2023-08-27 13:03:16', 89, '', '', 'This issue was checked by EMT and found no issue.\\r\\nSO will educate the AUs - turbo purge valve should be closed when backing valve is closed.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1404, '2023-08-27 13:21:33', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the gate valve and found the bellow inside the gate valve is cracked.\\r\\nThe assembly has been sent to Excel Instruments for repair', 'Bhimraj, Arpit', 'Subhash Pai', 'Excel Instruments, Vasai', 'Satisfactory', '', '', '', '', '2023-08-30 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1371, '2023-08-27 13:22:12', 89, '', '', 'Transformer received.\\r\\nWaiting for fuse connector from Inventory team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1318, '2023-08-27 13:22:38', 89, '', '', 'Issue resolved after maintenance by vendor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1400, '2023-08-30 14:59:24', 89, '', '', 'Vendor did troubleshooting and found the following issues with the system:\\r\\n1. Ion gun controller issue\\r\\n2. Ion pump issue\\r\\nQuote sent by vendor Rs. 25L\\r\\nFIC is working with vendor for price negotiation. Awaiting final quote from vendor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1385, '2023-08-30 15:00:38', 89, '', '', 'System is down due to gate valve issue. \\r\\nOnce gate valve is received and installed, further troubleshooting on the reported issue will be done.\\r\\nECD Sept 1', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1405, '2023-09-26 17:17:01', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'There was issue with the vacuum pump. \\r\\nIt has been replaced with another (from NMPF spinner - not being used)\\r\\nVacuum Issue resolved.', 'Vinayak, Bhimraj, Hemant, Mansi', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1404, '2023-09-26 17:18:22', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'After service, the gate valve has been connected to the system and checked.\\r\\nIt is working fine.\\r\\nReported issue resolved.', 'Bhimraj, Arpit', 'Excel Instruments', '', 'Satisfactory', '', 'Gate valve repair', 'Rs. 17500', '1.5 weeks', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1406, '2023-09-26 17:20:22', 89, 'EMT', '', 'There was issue with the chiller.\\r\\nOn troubleshooting found the fuse inside the chiller is blowing OFF.\\r\\nChiller vendor checked and found the water flow sensor and indicator LED are short.\\r\\nTemporarily it has been bypassed and chliler started for use.\\r\\n\\r\\nHRXRD system checked, it is working fine.\\r\\n', 'Pradeep, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'Vendor will send quote for the required parts.', '', '', ''),
(1385, '2023-10-10 09:44:38', 89, 'EMT', '', 'After Preventive Maintenance of the tool by EMT in Sept 2023 last week, vacuum time is 2hr 30mins.', 'Bhimraj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1403, '2023-10-10 09:45:12', 89, '', '', 'One of the fuse was blown off.\\r\\nReplaced with another one.\\r\\nFurnace working fine', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', '', ''),
(1428, '2025-03-19 11:34:28', 89, '', '', 'Test to check', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1426, '2025-03-20 06:32:00', 89, 'EMT', '', 'There was an issue of software key dongle not working due to non working of the USB port.\\r\\nThe dongle has been installed in another port.\\r\\nNow the issue is resolved.', 'Pradeep, Mandar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Issue resolved on the next day and system made functional'),
(1424, '2025-03-20 06:33:57', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Troubleshooting on the reported issue was done\\r\\nMisalignment correction was done, but the misalignment increased.\\r\\nSo rolled back to the calibration files of Jan 30 -31 which was done by DMO\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter that checked the system, misalignment of 0.7um max seen in X & Y axis.', 'Pradeep, Karuna, Manshi', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Tool is up for use since Feb 13'),
(1424, '2025-03-20 06:34:23', 89, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Correction in the dates for tool is up. \\r\\nIt is March 13'),
(1431, '2025-03-25 08:17:04', 89, 'EMT, Process', '', 'Checked the system and found no error seen for 10-24degC electrode temperature, but error display while running 2degC recipe.\\r\\nCoolant level in the heat exchanger found to be little low, top up done.\\r\\nRecipe run checked - 3 times, no error found', 'Pradeep, Shilpa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2025/03/25', '', '', '', 'Reported error resolved. System is working fine'),
