(1546, '2025-05-27 10:24:15', 297, 'AHU Chiller Team', 'Finding while troubleshooting  the nano 2 chiller high temperature  issue1) compressor 1 working ok with the suction pressure 65 psig.2) compressor 2 gas leak pressure 0( required nitrogen pressure testing, vacuum and Gas change)3) compressor 3 hand shutoff valve stuck ( not working) ( required replacement of hand shutoff valve, nitrogen pressure testing vacuum and Gas change)\\r\\n', 'Troubleshooting\\r\\nNano2 chiller.1) Compressor 1 working ok with 65/70 running pressure .( Replace subzero sensor of antifreeze from old nano 1 chiller which is currently not in used. Since it was showing PP alarm)2) Compressor 2 nitrogen pressure leak testing done leakage find in newly installed condenser coil, coil removed for the rectification vendor agree to rectification work without cost as  coil in warranty period)3) compressor 3 , dryer replacement work, hand shutoff valve replacement work, TEV replacement work done nitrogen pressure testing done, vaccum and Gas change R22 done.unit working with 65 running pressure.Material used by the vendor a) hand shutoff valve b) Dryer C) TEV taken from MBE chiller unit.Now compressor 1 and 3 is in working condition. We have kept the chiller compressor 1 and compressors  3 on under observation till. \\r\\n', 'Prashant', 'Dew point', '9819159472', 'Satisfactory', 'coil will be replaced free of cast', 'Dyer, Hand valve and expansion valve', 'NA', 'NA', '', '15 days coil will replaced', 'prashant', '', ''),
