(1547, '2025-06-09 09:30:29', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Updated by Vinayak:\\r\\nPlasma Asher gate valve \\\'O\\\' ring came out from its original position\\r\\nModel GV CF 63 M\\r\\nSR NO. 102022770', 'Right now we don\\\'t have spare \\\'O\\\' ring so \\r\\nSame \\\'O\\\' ring cleaned with IPA and connect back to gate valve\\r\\n\\r\\nGate valve connects to the process chamber\\r\\nOperation check functioning fine\\r\\nChamber cleaning done by Shilpa\\r\\n\\r\\n', 'Vinayak, Shilpa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
