(1500, '2025-06-10 06:38:55', 279, '', 'Slit valve not close properly due to some flex are on the slit valve \\\'O\\\' ring', 'Both chamber vented, Slit valve dismantle, So much flex are on the slit valve \\\'O; ring. All flex cleaned by using IPA and Lint free cloth, Slit valve assembled, Operation checked. Chamber pumped down for high vacuum.\\r\\nInform to Shilpa to do a test run. As per Shilpa no leak observed during loading/unloading the sample\\r\\n\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1474, '2025-06-10 06:51:26', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Pump labelled properly and inform to Safety team.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1449, '2025-06-10 06:58:28', 279, '', 'Leak observed in the cooling ware out manifold', '1. New manifold procured and fixed in the system.\\r\\n2. No leak observed .\\r\\n3. Inform to Minita to check and update', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1565, '2025-06-11 05:01:15', 89, 'EMT, Process, Facility', 'System trips due to CDA error while system start up procedure', 'SO (Hemant) reported DRIE system getting tripped due to CDA error. Facility team worked on this and a separate CDA compressor (bought for VOYAGER) was connected, but still the CDA error in the system was there.\\r\\n\\r\\nYesterday EMT (Pradeep & Avinash) along with Facility (Tejas & Rajendra K) and Process (Hemant) worked on this and the following observations and changes in the system was done:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. There was a common CDA connection with a \\T\\ for DRIE main system and Vacuum pump (Dry pump). The system was reading 0.52 MPa CDA pressure\\r\\n2. The common CDA connection was removed and separate CDA lines for the system at 6 kg and for the vacuum pump at 3 bar was made\\r\\nAfter this change, the system is reading 0.63 MPa CDA pressure. The vacuum pump is reading 46.2 LPM\\r\\n3. System was started by Hemant yesterday and was under observation for 24 hrs till today morning 11am. There is no CDA error seen till now.\\r\\n\\r\\nHemant did dummy', 'Pradeep, Avinash, Tejas,Rajendra K, Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1565, '2025-06-11 05:07:24', 89, 'Process', 'Dummy run to be preformed by Hemant', 'Update from Hemant:\\r\\nToday after24hrs turning on vacuum pump no error popup.It was observed that CDA pressure on System gauge is 0.61Mpa & on pannel gauge 6bar. System turbo pump stable at full speed so I have done Plasma chamber cleaning recipe for 20min.It was working fine.Thank you Facility & EMT team for your support to resolve the issue.\\r\\nImages attached for your reference.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1565_1.doc', 'Reported issue is resolved and system is up for use.\\r\\n\\r\\nInitiative taken by EMT (Pradeep) and resolved the issue'),
(1564, '2025-06-11 05:08:12', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Vinayak will work on this', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1563, '2025-06-11 05:08:51', 89, '', '', 'This issue has been raised in facility complaints as facility team will be working on this.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1427, '2025-06-11 05:51:39', 2217, 'EMT', 'Removed SiO2 target from chamber.', 'As discussed with FIC, we need to change the baseline and hold the target procurement till tool modification.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1427, '2025-06-11 05:53:51', 2217, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'SiO2 Target is not available till further notice in the tool.'),
(1438, '2025-06-11 05:55:04', 2268, 'Process', 'System was restarted and now its working fine.', 'Some times system shows a glitch when restarted it works fine. The tool was restarted and no error popped up.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Now tool is working fine.'),
(1557, '2025-06-11 05:57:50', 2217, 'EMT', 'RF selector switch removed from the system.', 'Now system can be used with wire directly connecting from matching network to gun.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Now system can be used with wire directly connecting from matching network to gun.'),
(1562, '2025-06-11 06:25:45', 189, 'Process', 'clip got detached from the stage assembly\\r\\n', 'Day 1: 30th April 2025\\r\\n* Vented and opened the main chamber\\r\\n* Removed the 60mm platen with samples\\r\\n* Removed the clip which got detached from the stage assembly (the clip is used for heating the   hot and cold platen)\\r\\n•The opposite side of the clip is still attached with the stage assembly\\r\\n* Main chamber pumping started through the intro chamber turbo pump.\\r\\n \\r\\nDay 2:1st May 2025\\r\\n •After overnight pumping from load lock\\r\\n* Turned on the ion pump, main chamber vacuum is 7.1E-5 Pa\\r\\n* Loaded a 25mm platen and tried loading into the main chamber twice, went fine.\\r\\n* Unloaded the platen\\r\\n* Turned off the ion pump\\r\\n* Removed all the power cables and water lines\\r\\n* started the bake out with 4 heaters by applying voltage and reached approx. 130 deg temp. for 24 hrs followed by natural cooling.\\r\\n \\r\\nDay 3: 2nd May 2025\\r\\n* Vacuum after cool down was 6.9e-8Pa\\r\\n* Conditioning of the filament started\\r\\n \\r\\nDay 4: 5th May 2025\\r\\n*Loaded the standard sample with Cu, Ag, Au\\r\\n* Sputtering the surface and taking narrow scan\\r\\n* X-ray tuning, Ion gun tuning with the standard sample.\\r\\n* But in evening we got this error\\r\\n\\r\\n*Error “Detected X-ray Pressure/Water Flow Interlock interrupted. X-ray Egun will not work in this state.”\\r\\n* Problem in water flow. HV is not green, we need to adjust the water flow\\r\\n\\r\\nDay 5: 6th May 2025\\r\\n*Adjust the water flow, HV turned ON.\\r\\n* Standard sample measurement completed with no issue of water flow.\\r\\n\\r\\nDay 6 and 7: 7th and 8th May 2025\\r\\n* Loaded multiple sample of the user and contamination check samples  to check for the tool performance\\r\\n\\r\\n', 'Engineer', 'Tushar', 'Icon Analytical', 'Satisfactory', '', 'No', '-', '-', '', '', '', '', 'The issue has been resolved by the engineer.'),
(1561, '2025-06-11 06:44:17', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Email will be sent to AJA for cleaning the chamber flakes and other precautionary measures, if any to be followed regarding this', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1560, '2025-06-11 06:47:51', 89, 'EMT', '', 'This issue was reported to OEM (Ferrotec). As per suggestion by OEM, capacitor was added in the CPU board in 1st week of May 2025\\r\\nThe issue was again reported by SO in first week of June 2025.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis will be reported to OEM for further troubleshooting', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1486, '2025-06-11 06:50:47', 89, 'Process', 'PXL error observed at the time of system start or sometimes during system shut down\\r\\n', 'This issue was raised with vendor and after replacing the chiller filter the issue was resolved, but reappeared after couple of days.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe error details / troubleshooting is not mentioned in manual.\\r\\nEmail will be sent to vendor by SO for troubleshooting help', 'Gopika, Pankaj', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2025/06/20', '', '', '', ''),
(1558, '2025-06-11 06:57:37', 89, '', '', 'After last target change, vacuum reached 9 E-8 Torr.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs updated by SO (Hemant) after yesterday target change, vacuum overnight is 1.6E-7 Torr.\\r\\nDegassing of the IG will be done today to check if vacuum improves. \\r\\nFuture plan: \\r\\n1. Chamber degass with substrate heater\\r\\n2. Ti deposition\\r\\n3. He leak check', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1485, '2025-06-11 06:59:41', 89, '', '', 'As per update from SO, baseline run was done and there is no change in the result.\\r\\nSystem is working fine.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf the PV is less than 1000degC, or the baseline is not working, EMT will do troubleshooting', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
