(1484, '2025-06-11 08:08:26', 89, 'EMT', '', 'On troubleshooting it was found the issue with the DTM, It has bee replaced with another from spares.\\r\\n\\r\\nStandard settings entered and tested for 2days, no issue seen.\\r\\n\\r\\nReported issue resolved', 'Bhimraj, Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
