(1572, '2025-06-19 10:03:33', 279, 'EMT', 'Cooling water from crucible rotator assembly', 'Crucible rotator assembly disconnected from the chamber, top \\\'O\\\' ring gone bad, faulty \\\'O\\\' ring replaced with new one.\\r\\nAnother leak is from rotator gear shaft. One of the allen key screw got damage. Assembly given to Mr.Chandrakant to remove the allen key screw  \\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1564, '2025-06-19 10:10:05', 279, 'EMT', 'The CDA pressure switch not functioning properly', 'CDA pressure switch removed froth spinner, disconnected all the push fit from the pressure switch. Pressure switch cleaned by using high pressure CDA. After cleaning pressure switch connect back to the spinner.\\r\\nCDA line connected with pressure 5 bar. Spinner main power ON \\r\\nThere was no Need CDA error on display.\\r\\nSpinner test run done. Spinner functioning smoothly without any error.\\r\\nInform to Hemant.\\r\\nThis all troubleshooting done by Avinash\\r\\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
