(1588, '2025-06-20 11:51:56', 279, 'EMT', 'While closing gate valve, Gate valve not closing properly because of this  there was leak in gate valve.', 'B2H6 chamber gate valve dismantle form the chamber. Gate valve base plate opened, and the top \\\'O\\\' ring was in good condition. The 8mm SS balls are not in good  condition and also the base plate has getting scratch marks.\\r\\nThe SS balls need to be replaced with new one. 8mm SS ball sample given to inventory team. Once we get new SS balls we will update.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1585, '2025-06-20 12:09:17', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Chamber vented. Open the lead. Gas shower metal plate dismantle, Main ceramic plate dismantle. Both plates cleaning by using IPA. RF cable connections check RF cable was in good condition, After cleaning both plates installed. RF cable connected. Chamber pump down. Did one N2 cleanig recipe still high reflected power is there. Troubleshooting going on', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
