(1683, '2025-07-30 11:04:09', 89, 'EMT', '', 'EMT, safety and facility team will work on the immediate and permanent solution for this issue.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail sent to Excel Instruments for the system modification proposal', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2025/08/01', '', '', '', 'Expected time for completion is for a temporary solution'),
