(1572, '2025-07-31 11:00:36', 279, 'EMT', '', 'EB3 \\\'O\\\' rings received and installed in crucible rotating assembly. Cooling water lines connected to crucible assembly. Cooling water valves open. Still leak in the rotating shaft. Called to HHV Engg. Mr. Shirish he will ask his technician team and revert back.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
