(1691, '2025-07-31 11:19:21', 279, 'EMT', '', 'As per Pankaj check STSRIE system\\r\\n1. System main incoming power checked it was okay\\r\\n2. Contactor relay reset\\r\\n3. System power ON but there was no power in gas panel.\\r\\n4. Checked all electric relays and connectors all are in good conditions.\\r\\n5. System gas checked gas was coming properly.\\r\\n6.There is one MCB found in off condition we made it ON but after 10 minutes that MCB getting OFF. Nothing is written and no any label on that MCB. We try to trace that MCB but the wiring is so complicated that we cannot find the root cause of that MCB. \\r\\n8. Called to Mr Ansari who made the system in automatic mode, He replied this was done so many years back so he don\\\'t have any idea about the system, He sail i will try to call the technician and if i get any information i will share with you', '', 'Mr. Ansari', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Waiting for Mr. Ansari replay'),
