(1738, '2025-08-18 15:39:25', 279, '', '', 'The substrate holder up/down pneumatic valve disconnected, Valve operation checked the valve shaft functioning fine. The pneumatic valve connected to the substrate holder assembly. Operation checked still the substrate holder not moving to up direction.\\r\\nSuspect - The Substare holder up/down internal assembly having some issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'No further troubleshooting will be done for this issue'),
(1734, '2025-08-18 15:41:36', 279, '', '', 'No issue observed. System working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1696, '2025-08-18 15:48:01', 279, '', '', 'RF matching unit cable disconnected from the system. RF matching unit top cover opened. The inductor coil is very dirty. Inductor coil cleaned by using scotch brite. After inductor coil cleaning top cover closed. RF matching cable connection connected. SiO2 300 watts plasma test run for 100 cycles done. Test run completed without high reflected power issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
