(1486, '2025-08-18 16:02:17', 279, '', '', 'Vendor (Sharad) visited on August 14\\r\\nChanged HV cable, cleaned X ray tube housing.\\r\\nSystem turned ON, still PXL error was there. He will contact OEM and get back to us.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2025/09/15', '', '', '', ''),
(1619, '2025-08-18 16:04:43', 279, '', '', 'As per plan leak testing of chamber and gas lines done from EMT side.\\r\\nProcess team (Shilpa) is doing process runs for checking powder/ particle issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1618, '2025-08-18 16:12:45', 279, '', '', 'After doing multiple Ti, Pt, Ti runs the system is running properly without error in the genius controller.\\r\\nAfter approval from FIC the following runs were done for one hour each.\\r\\n1. Ti 63 mA \\r\\n2. Pt 143 mA\\r\\n3. Ti 63 mA - Au 93 mA', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Process team will do a base line runs and update', '', '', 'Substrate shutter issue  is faced'),
(1697, '2025-08-18 16:14:39', 279, '', '', 'RF matching unit cable disconnected from the system. RF matching unit top cover opened. The inductor coil is very dirty. Inductor coil cleaned by using scotch brite. After inductor coil cleaning top cover closed. RF matching cable connection connected. SiO2 300 watts plasma test run for 100 cycles done. Test run completed without high reflected power issue.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1691, '2025-08-18 16:22:46', 279, '', '', 'With a help of Mandar all the electronic opened and checked, found one of the single phase MCB output voltage was fluctuating  between 4 and 30 volt. It should be 24VDC. \\r\\nOpened electronic but nothing was found. System switched ON and checked the gas panel leds are blinking. Observed for one hour.\\r\\nNext day morning system again powered ON gas panel is getting ON. Pankaj turned on the system ( Vacuum pump, turbo pump etc.) and did one plasma test run, System working fine.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
