(1833, '2025-09-19 20:35:46', 2019, 'Ajay mane, and all staff.', 'Micro-01 due to AC Burn fire alarm trigger.', '1.On 18th October 2025 at 12:16 PM, Process team member Pankaj and student Lokesh Patra were working in the Dicer Room when they noticed fire and smoke coming from the Air Conditioner (Split AC) located behind the HRXRD tool in Micro 1 Lab. As there was no one inside the Micro 1 Lab, both immediately ran out of the area.\\r\\n2. I (Ajay M) noticed, while exiting Pankaj pressed the Manual Call Point (MCP) in the Nano corridor. At the same time  Annexe and Nano ebuilding Fire Alarm triggered which showed the location of micro one lab.Pankaj informed there is fire in Micro-1 AC.Ajay M. confirmed the location of the fire from the Annex main fire panel and rushed to the Micro 1 Lab.\\r\\n3. AjayM, Pawan went towards M-1 lab to see the reported affected area.It was observed the M-1 lab was full of smoke. AjayM went inside the lab, a large fire with heavy smoke was observed behind the HRXRD  tool Air Conditioner. To control the fire, Ajay M wore a Self Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA) and used two CO2 fire extinguishers (No. 2759 & No. 1802) and the fire was suppressed\\r\\n4. Simultaneously, Ajay M. & Tejas switched off all electrical mains panels inside the Micro 1 Lab, while Sandeep M. Pradeep & Omkar switched off the electrical supply in the Micro 1 UPS room. This was later cross-verified by Pawan, who also entered the lab with SCBA for confirmation that the fire is contained.\\r\\n5. As the lab was filled with smoke, the Micro 1 Lab emergency exit window (opening towards Infinity corridor) was opened. The fire was successfully extinguished, and the affected area was checked by Tejas A., Pawan, Pradeep N., Sandeep M., and Mandar, Prof Dipankar, Dr. Deepti\\r\\n6. 2 standing Fans were kept for removing the smoke from the lab towards emergency exit window Chemical storage room door was opened and exhaust fan was turned ON by Mandar.MYR AHU emergency exit door was opened for clearing the exhaust from Micro-1 corridor. Exhaust pipe of Electroplating system, Furnaces were removed for smoke suction through exhaust blower. Tube washer room exhaust blower was turned ON by SandeepM.\\r\\n7. Team conducted a headcount outside the Nano building and Annex building.', 'Ajay mane, and all staff.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1673, '2025-09-19 20:37:51', 2019, 'Ajay mane, and Prakash.M', 'Annex Fire panel showing fault we need Safety Eng for programing the fire panel.', 'Annex and new Building both panel intigration work done and programing also done both panel is in normal condition.', 'Ajay mane, and Prakash.M', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
