(1847, '2025-09-26 00:57:05', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra,Hemant sir,S.S', 'Nano-2 DRIE tools showing alarm on display.', 'Today i Take safety round in nano-2 inside lab i found DRIE tool showing alarm on display, I video called to hemant sir, with the help of hemant sir i muted buzzer and checked alarm, in alarm we found 2 point.\\r\\n1) cooling water flow low.\\r\\n2.) circulator alarm.\\r\\nI checked back side of water flow in tool it show zero. after that i help to facility team member sanjay sir. checking manifold of DRIE water sandeep sir given guide in call.\\r\\n1. first we off both line of DRIE tools inlet and outlet after that i removed out let pipe line and down side we kpt bucket if water is leakage from manifold. first step no water is coming.\\r\\n2. we put wire inside of manifold to checked water is coming or not but water is coming and metal part is going UP.', 'Prakash Mehra,Hemant sir,S.S', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
