(1854, '2025-10-03 10:39:54', 2457, 'EMT and Facility', 'As observed, 3 out of 1 fan was faulty, and 2nd fan was making noise.', 'replaced both the fan with spare one and tested the system in  the presence of Pankaj ji.\\r\\n\\r\\nNeed the help from the facility side as 2 inch dry oxidation furnace has cooling water line, so for not any damage to the cooling water line needed help from the facility team and Amit ji was present.', 'Avinash (EMT) and Amit ji (Facility)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1853, '2025-10-03 14:35:23', 279, 'EMT', '', 'LL chamber vented Small silicon sample found on LL chamber \\\'O\\\' ring \\r\\nSample removed, LL chamber and lead cleaned by IPA\\r\\nChamber pumped down for high vacuum.\\r\\n[8:01 pm, 1/10/2025] Vinayak Shimpi: Same time Agilent IDP 15 dry pump vacuum check 3.96 E-02 Torr in 2 min with no noise\\r\\nShilpa will update for LL chamber vacuum issue', 'Vinayak, Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1852, '2025-10-03 14:39:59', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Troubleshooting did -\\r\\nMain chamber pressure\\r\\n1.59E-02 Torr\\r\\nLoad Lock chamber pressure\\r\\n9.82E-02 Torr\\r\\nTurbo pump speed 48000rpm\\r\\nTemperature 59 degree C\\r\\nGo to the vacuum page, click on the Transfer sample\\r\\nArm going with chuck but chuck is not the process chamber,\\r\\nIt was coming in Load Lock\\r\\n\\r\\nToday we tried to transfer the chuck with both chambers in the atmosphere. observed the same issue. The chuck is not going to the process chamber and coming back to home position. \\r\\n Request to Pradeep please suggest if any more internal checks are required.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1825, '2025-10-03 14:44:05', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Dr. Pandu visited IITBNF to resolve the issue. The issue has been resolved service report attached.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1825_0.pdf', ''),
(1560, '2025-10-03 16:20:25', 89, 'EMT', '', 'New part has been received from purchase team. Plan to install it. Need 1 day tool black out\\r\\nEmail sent to SO for the same', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '10-10-2025', '', '', '', ''),
(1824, '2025-10-03 16:23:52', 89, '', 'Icon engineer visited, filament is broken, needs replacement', 'Filament replaced with a new one. \\r\\nChamber baking and conditioning going on.\\r\\nDue to issue in CDA, the main chamber got vented. This has been resolved & further testing is being done', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '10-10-2025', '', '', '', 'This is being taken care of by Anjum'),
(1486, '2025-10-03 16:25:54', 89, '', '', 'System has been made partially made up after multiple test runs carried out by SOs & after approval from FIC since Aug 20\\r\\nThe PXL error occurs during shut down of the tool.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '28-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
(1486, '2025-10-03 16:31:35', 89, 'EMT', '', 'Engineer after confirmation from OEM (Rigaku) send email that the HV power supply & shutter needs to be replaced.\\r\\nFor now, shutter quote has been received & sent for PO processing on 17 Sept 2025 (PID filled)', 'Pradeep', 'I R Technology Services Pvt Ltd', 'Sharad', 'Not Satisfactory', 'Slow response', '4601M224 / Common Shutter SmartLab A959-0027', '450000', '12-14 weeks', '28-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
(1458, '2025-10-03 16:35:44', 89, 'Purchase', '', 'Email received from OEM on Sept 22, that the material is packed and ready for pick up\\r\\n\\r\\nSept 23 - Purchase team forwarded the email to freight forwarder for material pick up and delivery to IITB\\r\\n\\r\\nOct 1 - Email from freight forwarder, material reached Mumbai customs late night of Sept 30 and is under clearance', 'Vijay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '31-10-2025', '', '', '', ''),
