(1619, '2025-10-06 11:55:17', 2457, 'EMT', 'White particles observed on the sample.', 'Following are the update for PECVD performed on 11-09-2025.\\r\\n* Plasma cleaning with CF4+02 for 1 hour at RT - No particle observed.\\r\\n* 02 plasma clean for 30 mins for RT - No particle observed. \\r\\n* Heat the chamber for 1.30 hrs - at 345 degC. \\r\\n* Flow N2 at 500sccm for 1.30 hrs with wafer loaded in the chamber - check for any particles on the sample No particle observed.\\r\\n* N2 plasma run for 5mins 10mins / 15/mins and check for any particle - No particle observed (1Omin run was done) \\r\\n* SiH4+N2 process run (without NH3) for 10mins done A white particle observed on sample.', 'Avinash (EMT).', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1619, '2025-10-06 11:58:40', 2457, 'EMT', 'White particles observed on the sample.', 'Following are the update for PECVD performed on 19-09-2025.\\r\\n* Plasma cleaning recipe with CF4+02 for 1 hour at RT - Particles observed. \\r\\n* 02 plasma clean recipe for 30 min at RT - particles observed.', 'Avinash (EMT).', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
