(1949, '2025-10-19 13:10:31', 2457, 'EMT', 'substrate arm magnet repels at some point making it to loose polarity and gets substrate arm to stuck in between while loading sample to process chamber.', 'There are 2 magnets attach to substrate arm which helps substrate arm to move in and out between Load Lock and Process chamber. At some point when arm is pulled in to process chamber magnets repels and looses its polarity to which arm got stuck in-between. we are into it to find the root cause of it.\\r\\nFurther troubleshooting is onto it', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
