(1967, '2025-10-27 11:50:59', 726, 'Facility AHU And ChillerTeam', '', 'Compressor is working fine since increase refrigerant from 48 Psig to 53  Psig', 'prashant, raj, Amit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1852, '2025-10-27 11:57:37', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Sample holder flat test done. Check parallel to flat surfaces in and out edges. Adjust the sample holder gap. Placed the sample sample holder in LL chamber. Sample load/unload done successfully without any error', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1861, '2025-10-27 12:08:09', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Carrying out the deposition at 5.12 V, but at this voltage, the electron beam was falling completely out of the crucible. To bring the beam back into position, the voltage was increased to 5.90V. As per Mr. Shirish increase the HV voltage from 5.12 Kv to 5.90 Kv  the electron beam is falling partially on the target and partially on the crucible. The target is melting at this voltage, but it now requires a higher current than before for the target to melt. All four targets run done at HV 5.90Kv.\\r\\nTargets melting and deposition done.', 'Vinayak, Shahi Roze', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1881, '2025-10-27 12:16:26', 726, 'Facility team', 'Chiller water temperature is increasing and condenser fan is not working', 'Removed faulty motor and repaired inhouse, replaced filter drier, top up gas in system now compressor is working fine.', 'prashant, raj, Amit', '', '', '', '', 'Drier', 'Approx 2000/-', 'spare part is available in stock', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1744, '2025-10-27 12:19:41', 726, 'Facility team', 'New chiller procurement', 'No responce from PPMS user or management', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Need to to discuss with team heads and PPMS users'),
(1949, '2025-10-27 16:39:35', 2457, 'EMT', 'Substrate holder plate was tilted little bit.', 'Closed the gate valve and vented both the chambers i.e L.L and Process chamber and inspected the mechanical part and found substrate holding plate was slightly tilted, done the adjustment of the substrate holding plate and checked its working in vacuum condition in -1 range, issue is resolved from EMT side, process team member shilpa ji will verify it.', 'Avinash, Vikas and Rhifa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1619, '2025-10-27 16:59:53', 2457, 'EMT', '', 'After running the recipe at parameters given by the OEM side, white particles was observed on the sample, OEM has send the  process parameters through mail and further action will be carried out by process team member Shilpa ji.', 'Avinash and Pradeep sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1458, '2025-10-27 17:07:57', 2457, 'EMT team', '', 'Installed the new Throttle valve received form the ultech and checked it working. New Throttle valve is operating fine at given set positions.\\r\\nDetails of the New Throttle valve.\\r\\nModel number: ISO160SC\\r\\nSerial number: I25I40N', 'Vinayak sir, Avinash, Rhifa and Vikas', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
