(1899, '2025-10-29 14:31:59', 2521, 'AHU', '1.Continuous start stop of DX unit when PLC is on Auto mode\\r\\n2.If humidity will raise above 60 percentage , All 6 outdoor (DX) unit will turn on', '1.Called Selec make PLC engineer to understand the logic and we implemented new logic.\\r\\n2. If humidity will raise above 60 percentage , only first 3 outdoor (DX) unit will turn on. Which is sufficient to maintain the humidity as well as temperature in the range.\\r\\n3.We changed temperature set points for all DX unit is S1:20.8, S2:20.8, S3:21, S4:22, S5:22.5, S6:23.5. with hysteresis was 0.2 and Humidity setpoint is 58 percentage.\\r\\n4. To avoid sudden start and stop of DX unit we implement 2 time delay for each compressor once they run on temperature set points.\\r\\n5.We have also implement new logic for heater. When temperature reach at 21.4 degree Celsius Hitter will stop and below 21.3 Hitter will on to maintain the temperature.\\r\\n6.Cycle time for each compressor is same 24 hrs. (Rest)', 'FACILITY TEAM', '', '', '', '', 'AC-USB-RS485-03 CABLE', '2000 RS', '2 WEEK', '', 'working on AHU condensate drain', '', '', ''),
(1982, '2025-10-29 17:50:20', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Nano new Building Total 09 fire panel checking work.', 'Yesterday i checked 2.1 and 2.2 lab fire panel. today I checked 3.1,3.2,3.3,1.2,1.1,MBE-1,MBE-2, Main fire panels. All fire panel is in normal mode Status update in safety portal.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1982_0.jfif', ''),
(1981, '2025-10-29 17:52:29', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'N2 plant, electrical panel, MBE AHU area, service corridor, main corridor, main lift side smoke detector checking work.', 'Today I checked All smoke detector red light blinking or not location:-N2 plant, electrical panel, MBE AHU area, service corridor, main corridor, main lift side. All sd working fine status update in safety portal device list in comment section.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1981_0.jfif', ''),
