(1904, '2025-10-30 11:02:56', 89, '', '', 'Oct 28:\\r\\nQuote for the dummy plug received\\r\\nOnline Purchase request form submitted for PO processing', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1904_4.pdf', ''),
(1904, '2025-10-30 11:08:09', 89, '', '', 'Oct 29:\\r\\nPurchase team required proprietary certificate for the part, but Ferrotec is not able to provide the same. Below is their reply:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"We manufacture the parts shown in the picture in-house, but we cannot provide proof of manufacturer exclusivity in the form of a PAC certificate. The costs compared to the benefits would be so high for us that we do not process PAC applications in India. We have thousands of items for the electron beam evaporators sector alone. That would be way beyond our scope.\\r\\nWe ask for your understanding that we are unable to provide you with a PAC certificate or similar certificates. We only can write you a statement that we manufacture this part in our company.\\r\\nWe cannot say whether there is another one of these items in the world, and therefore we cannot confirm that this is not the case.\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nInformed the same to purchase team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1954, '2025-10-30 14:31:29', 2495, 'EMT', '1. Hot Plate No. 2 is performing normally and stably.rn2. Temperate control and uniformity are within acceptable tolerance.', '1. Divided the Hot Plate surface into 3 rows &amp; 3 columns using thermal tape to calibrate. rn2. Set the controller value temperature to 50&deg;C. rn3. Set the controller value temperature to 100&deg;C. rn4. Set the controller value temperature to 150&deg;C.rn 5. All three set points (50&deg;C, 100&deg;C, 150&deg;C) show small deviations within &plusmn;2&deg;C. rn6. Heating uniformity across 9 sections is good. rn7. Hot plate no. 2 is performing normally and stably.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad, Rhifa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
