(1546, '2025-11-06 17:24:53', 1787, 'AHU Chiller team', 'Compressor 1& 2 not working.', 'checked and found compressor 1 is tripping due to outdoor unit wire sort, found o\\r\\nthe wire is burnt and touched with body due to which compressor is tripping, and unit notworking/ found compressor is running but suction pressure going under vacuum (0 Pressure), Replaced the hand valve, filter dried, Expansion valve and Orifice, run the system and top up refrigerant after both system is working fine.', 'Amit/Prashant/Raj/ Abhay', '', '', '', '', 'Hand valve, filter Drier, Expansion Valve and Orifice', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1530, '2025-11-06 17:29:57', 1787, 'AHu and chiller Team', 'Gas leakage from condenser coil', 'Installed the outdoor unit from 1.1 ahu outdoor/ which unit was dismantled and kept in NMPF/ joint the copper line with system, leak test, filter drier replaced, Suction discharge service valve replaced, gas top up and run the system after system is working fine.', '', 'Ashraf and sahid', 'Modern HVAc System', 'Good', 'Na', '', '', '', '06-11-2025', '', '', '', ''),
