(1458, '2025-11-10 12:04:26', 2457, 'EMT', 'VC412 is not working properly for the MFC (Ar, PH3, B2H6, and SiH4) controls which is connected to the chamber. and GVC2200 vacuum gauge controller is also not working as the process chamber vacuum reading  is not matching with the software.', 'We have cross check the VC412 with GMC1200 MFC controller and it is observed that in VC412 when we set the Ar MFC to 10sccm, but it reads 0 sccm. sometimes all the MFCsin the software reads different values while the MFCs are set to 0sccm.\\r\\nAnd about GVC2200, Process Chamber vacuum reading is not showing in the GVC2200 gauge controller for that we have connected our Pfeiffer gauge in parallel with a controller to monitor the Chamber vacuum. we have mailed this to OEM waiting for there reply.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1683, '2025-11-10 12:40:44', 89, 'Process', '', '2 sets of Prof Sandip\\\'s requested process runs are done by SO.\\r\\nThird set will be done on Wed-Friday (Nov 12-14)\\r\\n\\r\\nOnce that is done, after discussing with team heads, further action will be done', 'SO (Karuna)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
