(2016, '2025-11-14 09:50:21', 2457, 'EMT', 'RIE APC set pressure is not matching with current pressure to which process was stuck in the 2nd step.', 'as observed apc was set and was running at 0.1000 torr in 2nd and 3rd step. So we set the pressure to 0.150 torr and the recipe ran successfully. We checked the pressure to 0.120 torr and the recipe ran successfully at this pressure also. We checked the pressure to 0.116 torr and the recipe ran successfully at this pressure. But APC set pressure has a threshold of 0.116 torr to which it will not move to the next step while running the recipe. So, minimum APC set pressure is 0.120 torr to which process can be run without stuck at 2nd step.', 'Avinash and Pradeep sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2017, '2025-11-14 12:47:30', 297, 'AHU Chiller Team', 'filter looks choke and need replacement', 'Note down the PDS water flow reading before filter replacing. Change the filter and note down the flow meter reading after replacing filter', 'Sandeep Mane', '', '', '', '', 'One water filter', '', '', '', '', 'amit', '', ''),
