(2026, '2025-11-17 18:05:56', 2019, 'prakash,akshy team,R.G sir', '7.1 lab inside smoke detector and cable removing work done for temporary base with the help of akshay enterprise team beause of ceiling work is going on.', 'due to 7.1inside lab ceiling work is going on from FSO department Akshy team came and removing the smoke detector one by one ( 176 to 183). all smoke detector are hanging for temproary base ones We will reinstall the smoke detector once the roof is complete. safety work permit form filled work done. work starting time 02.00pm to end time:-05.00pm. right now panels is ok.', 'prakash,akshy team,R.G sir', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2026_0.jfif', ''),
(2027, '2025-11-17 18:27:11', 2019, 'Prakash', 'BMS room telephone calling issue raised by sera maam.', 'Today telephone checking worker came from institute dep. name:-Parshuram. He checked the telephone and told that the telephone is in don\\\'t not disturb mode. Parshuram sir removed the dnd mode *79. To cross check, we asked the student to call from Nano lab and the call was ringing in the BMS room.', 'Prakash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2027_0.jfif', ''),
(2017, '2025-11-18 13:03:56', 297, 'AHU Chiller Team', 'water Filter Choke', '1. Check the PDS Chiller working or not-     PDS Chiller was working fine with 19C chiller Temperature.2. Note down the Chiller Manifold pressure.    Pressure  3 bar   at Chiller manifold found 3. Check the tool side sensor ( working or not)    Sensor LED was off from tool side4. Is any other tool supported by PDS chiller showing the same  water alarm?     None of the tools supported by the PDS chiller triggered any water fault.5. If No- then check the PDS tool flow meter   It was  showing  4 LPM6. Check the filter condition- is it choke   Yes- it looks a bit choke 7. If Yes then change the filter   Yes- we asked to put off the tools so that we can change the filter.8. Ask for the shutdown and change the filter   Yes we have requested Shilpa to turn off the PDS tool for filter change work9. Once the filter is replaced, note down the flow meter reading ______   Filter has been replaced and  flow meter is showing 4 LPM 10. Inform the  group and let the tool start and check the water sensor again if any fault is there.   Informed the group about the filter change and PDS has been put on and the water sensor LED was blinking.  EMT as confirmed the same and Request has been closed', 'Amit', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '18-11-2025', '', '', '', ''),
(2025, '2025-11-18 15:05:56', 89, '', '', 'Email sent to OEM by SO (Mayank)\\r\\nAwaiting reply for further troubleshooting', 'Mayank (Student SO)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '12-12-2025', '', '', '', ''),
(1992, '2025-11-18 18:08:36', 2457, 'EMT', 'Push botton switch and 1 Cooling fan is faulty.', 'we need one cooling fan and one push button switch to procure, details have mailed to jomon sir.', 'Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2023, '2025-11-18 18:14:40', 2515, 'EMT', '', 'Existing dry pump of the PHOENIX Probe Station has been replace with our spare Diaphragm pump for temporary used.', 'Vikas kumar nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2023_1.jpeg', ''),
(2004, '2025-11-18 18:18:55', 2515, 'EMT', '', 'The Thermal Evaporator Cr/Au, Au current display panel had a flickering issue. Inspected all electrical connections and found a loose connection at the terminal blocks. Tightened all the screws and, in the presence of Gopika ma’am, powered on the display panel. Au display turned on and the issue was resolved.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2004_2.jpeg', ''),
(1458, '2025-11-18 18:25:40', 2457, 'EMT', 'working of the process recipe manually after installation of the new parts from the OEM.', 'new throttle valve installed, new controller (VC412) for throttle valve, MFC\\\'s installed, new Roughing gauge installed, Now Throttle valve position is working with respect to set valve as previously there was no change in throttle valve position for any set valve. we have run CHF3 clean recipe for 20 minutes, SiO2 deposition recipe and CHF3 cleaning recipe and at last we run the PH3 doping recipe. All recipes ran successfully.', 'Pradeep sir, Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1504, '2025-11-18 22:32:23', 788, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Waiting for materials'),
