(1458, '2025-11-24 17:04:22', 89, '', '', 'Email sent to process team about the status of the system on Nov 18 2025 - Manual SOP is done and system has been tested for recipes of chamber clean, SiO2, PH3 doping\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail sent to carry out dummy test runs:\\r\\nEMT team will be there for next 2 runs for training and dummy runs.\\r\\nPlease discuss with @Ajit Kumar  and @Deepti Rukade  & let us know your availability to carry out the test runs', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '05-12-2025', 'Please find the google docs link for updated SOP for manual operation.\\r\\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1M8uF2rlNGRLLRVUNTnIDS8YSlVikQ0JStjobOGFu4i0/edit?usp=sharing', '', '', 'The following are the APC positions as per the last test run.\\r\\nAPC position reference values for each run. \\r\\nCHF3 plasma clean recipe: APC position to be kept 10%\\r\\nSiO2 recipe: This recipe needs modification as the existing recipe is not working, high reflected power (17W) for 600W is seen. The gas flow rates to be reduced  to half and APC position to be set at 80%. With this for 600W set RF, reflected power is 3-4W\\r\\nPH3 doping (n-doping): APC position to be kept 10%'),
