(2067, '2025-11-26 13:47:20', 89, '', '', 'process trail runs done on Nov 25 as per plan:\\r\\n\\r\\nTrial 1 SiC main etch sample SiC on fresh sapphire wafer\\r\\n1.Cl2 surface treatment with APC 15.6%\\r\\nReflected power also less than 5%\\r\\n  Chamber pressure =3mtorr\\r\\n   He fluctuating upto 14 sccm and reflected power in Table rf \\r\\nThis was unstable and wafer was wobbling\\r\\n2. Cl2 surface treatment with APC pressure\\r\\n    Reflected power also less than 5%\\r\\n  Chamber pressure =5mtorr\\r\\n   He was stable and process was stable no wafer wobble \\r\\n3.For both trial SiC main etch was highly stable\\r\\n\\r\\n Trial run 2 \\r\\n   GaN etch 1 with GaN sample 1 with APC pressure mode on used sapphire wafer\\r\\nChamber pressure=15mTorr\\r\\nHe flow was fluctuating upto 15 sccm and also wafer was wobbling it was unstable\\r\\n   GaN etch 1 with GaN sample 1 with APC in position mode(18.1%) used sapphire wafer\\r\\nChamber pressure=15mtorr\\r\\nHe flow was stable and also this was stable \\r\\n   GaN etch 2 with GaN sample 2 with APC pressure mode on old used sapphire wafer\\r\\nChamber pressure=15mTorr\\r\\nHe flow was fluctuating upto 15 sccm and also wafer was wobbling it was unstable\\r\\n   GaN etch 2 with GaN sample 2 with APC in position mode(18.1%) on old used sapphire wafer\\r\\nChamber pressure=15mtorr\\r\\nHe flow was fluctuating 14mtorr  and also this was unstable and wobbling\\r\\n   GaN etch 3 with SiC sample with apc in pressure mode on old  used sapphire wafer\\r\\n  reflected power less than 5%\\r\\n   Chamber pressure=15mtorr\\r\\n   He flow was fluctuating to 10sccm and the wafer was wobbling\\r\\n  GaN etch 3 with SiC sample with apc in position mode(18.1%) on old used sapphire wafer\\r\\n   Reflected power less than 5%\\r\\n   Chamber pressure=15mtorr\\r\\n   He flow was fluctuating to 7 sccm and the wafer was wobbling in start but stable after 2-3 minutes of time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2059, '2025-11-26 15:24:00', 726, 'AHU & Chiller', 'Temperature and humidity fluctuation', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Need to be discuss with LIC'),
(2074, '2025-11-26 18:35:28', 2515, 'EMT', 'found a Au current display seven segment centre LED is faulty.', 'Remove the all connection on Au current display. Remove the controller lock strip and remove the controller in the panel. Mounted the new current display on the panel with the help of a lock strip and connected all the wires in the current display terminal points.        \\r\\nSwitch On the Mains MCB and rotate selector  LT1 knob, current display is ON, Rotate the variac changed display value. Display working fine, work completed on the EMT side.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2074_0.pdf', ''),
