(2100, '2025-11-28 18:32:17', 2457, 'EMT', 'He and Table Rf fluctuation while running the actual etching recipe \\\"Ox SiC trial 1 conductive pre-stable with apc position\\\"', 'on 27-11-2025 Thursday, with SO anurag, we checked the actual recipe \\\"Ox SiC trial 1 conductive pre-stable with apc position\\\" with chamber pressure 3mtorr and 5mtorr in both runs he and Table Rf fluctuates but wafer was stable.\\r\\nafter lunch \\r\\nwe change the recipe and ran \\\"Ox Gan etch post SiC via etch (2)\\\" recipe on same wafer helium was stable but table rf and chamber pressure was changing. changes seen in table rf and in chamber pressure and no wobbling seen on the sample wafer\\r\\nat 5 pm, we changed the sample wafer and ran the  \\\"Ox Gan etch post SiC via etch (2)\\\" recipe helium got stuck to 15.8 sccm but wafer didnt wobbled after skipping the step and transfer the Sample wafer to L.L wafer go slightly burn at the edg side. stop the process for today. will continued with another sample wafer.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2100, '2025-11-28 18:40:18', 2457, 'EMT', '', 'Today with SO Anurag we changed the sample wafer and continued with same \\\"Ox Gan etch post SiC via etch (2)\\\" recipe and fluctuation seen in HE and Table Rf and wafer wobbled.\\r\\nafter lunch load the sample wafer which was before cleaning the process chamber and ran  the \\\"Ox SiC trial 1 conductive pre-stable with apc position\\\" with chamber pressure at 3mtorr fluctuation seen in Table Rf helium pressure and wafer wobble, and at 5mtorr alarm trigger and error shown i.e. Table RF, RF-E6, Maximum reflected power exceeded alarm. we stop the process.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2095, '2025-11-28 20:05:04', 95, '', '>System checked by system owner and it was observed that mask & substrate focusing issue was reported but mask and substrate focusing properly.\\r\\n>User reported that there was misalignment but system owner checked first level & second level alignment and it was align properly. Images attached in the report.\\r\\n> User reported mask vacuum error but after checking system and placed mask in the system no error message pop up on screen', '>System checked by system owner and it was observed that mask & substrate focusing issue was reported but mask and substrate focusing properly.\\r\\n>User reported that there was misalignment but system owner checked first level & second level alignment and it was align properly. Images attached in the report.\\r\\n> User reported mask vacuum error but after checking system and placed mask in the system no error message pop up on screen', 'Hemant Kshirsagar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2095_0.docx', ''),
