(1866, '2025-12-01 10:54:16', 1173, '', '', '1) There was a leakage in the swagelok valve and N2 purge / vent teflon line inside the tool. Butterfly Valve has been replaced by Sandeep sir (facility) Pradeep sir (EMT).\\r\\n2) In Nano RTP total 4 runs completed:\\r\\n      1) N2 900sccm, 180 sec, 900 degree.\\r\\n      2) N2 900sccm, 180 sec + 180 sec + 180 sec at 900 degree for (3 runs).\\r\\n3) In Nano 2 RTP total 4 runs completed:\\r\\n      1) N2 900sccm, 180 sec, 900 degree.\\r\\n      2) N2 900sccm, 180 sec + 180 sec + 180 sec at 900 degree for (3 runs)\\r\\nAfter all processes, samples were given to Anjum madam for XPS.\\r\\nXPS was down so got the results lately.\\r\\nResult: N2 was not detected in processed Si wafer so suggested for another test run.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
