(1866, '2025-12-01 18:12:05', 1173, 'Process Team', '', '01/12/2025 update\\r\\n3 RCA cleaned quarter pieces taken from that \\r\\n1) 1st wafer: to measure native oxide for reference.\\r\\n2) 2nd wafer : Run was performed for 180 sec, N2 900 sccm, 900C.\\r\\n3) 3rd wafer : Run was performed for 180 sec, O2 900 sccm, 900C.\\r\\n\\r\\nResults of measured thickness:\\r\\n1) Native oxide : 0.81 nm,0.76 nm, 0.77nm.\\r\\nAvg thickness: 0.78nm\\r\\n2) N2 run sample : 3.52nm, 3.67nm, 3.52 nm.\\r\\nAvg thickness: 3.57nm.\\r\\n3) O2 run sample : 51.15nm, 51.45nm, 51.41 nm.\\r\\nAvg thickness: 51.34nm.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
