(2262, '2025-12-02 17:07:01', 279, 'EMT', '', 'PECVD\\r\\n1.Gas shower dip in BOE 6:1 solution for 2 hours\\r\\n2. Gas shower wash with DI water cleaned with N2\\r\\n3. Gas shower head fixed into process chamber\\r\\n4. Chamber cleaned with IPA\\r\\n5. Click on Low Vac\\r\\n6. After 20 min vacuum 4.55 E -02\\r\\n7. Low vac complete\\r\\n8. PECVD main valve opened\\r\\n9. Open SiH4, NH3, N2O and Ar/N2 valve one by one\\r\\n10. All four gas MFC set values Zero\\r\\n11. Chamber pressure 4.71E-02\\r\\n12. Chamber kept pump down for overnight', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
