(2052, '2025-12-08 16:34:09', 89, '', '', 'Updated by Shubham M:\\r\\n@Deepti Rukade mam, can we have one dummy moscap from ALD baseline runs, for looking into this matter. When I measured CV last time in proxima with karuna mam, it was working fine for the EE course work samples.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:35:30', 89, '', '', 'Updated by Bharat:\\r\\nMs Shreyasi. Kindly confirm whether the following setting was applied:\\r\\nIntegration Time Setup:\\r\\n• Mode: PLC with a suitable factor value (upto 5).', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:35:59', 89, '', '', 'Shreyasi replied:\\r\\nPLC and value 3.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:37:30', 89, '', '', 'Updated by Shubham:\\r\\nCv data is coming okay at 1MHz. The  reason for negative Y axis i am not sure, we might have to talk to keysight engineer.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2052_3.jpeg', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:38:04', 89, '', '', 'Comments from Prof VD:\\r\\n1 MHz can be limited by series resistance. This is incorrect frequency to test MOS CV, if it\\\'s being made baseline. Please keep it up 100 kH', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:38:22', 89, '', '', 'comment from Prof SL:\\r\\nAgreed. We can keep it at 100 kHz. In fact if you do a frequency dependent CV measurement you can see the series resistance effect', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:38:49', 89, '', '', 'reply from Shubham:\\r\\nYes sir, agreed, generally I do cv with frequency variations. \\r\\nBut I just wanted to check if the system was working or not. This was not a baseline sample, I borrowed it from a lab member for a quick check.\\r\\nWe should have some baseline samples followed by a baseline run in proxima/polaris like other tools for better tracking of the issues. Also, Karuna mam is already trained for both iv and cv in proxima.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:40:11', 89, '', '', 'Hanif replied: \\r\\nThe CV measurement problem is resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2052_7.jpeg', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:40:41', 89, '', 'Ask from Shubham:\\r\\nDid you do any troubleshooting? If yes please let us know, so that we can implement this in future.\\r\\n\\r\\nHanif Replied:\\r\\nI did calibration followed by switching off the B1500 and switching on again.\\r\\nI trained Nihal, he can resolve this issue if it occurs again. \\r\\nIf you need assistance, you can contact Nihal.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:41:27', 89, '', '', 'Hanif replied:\\r\\nThe whole trouble shooting process took one and half hours, the slot was booked for 2 hours from Prof Veeresh\\\'s project, but forgot to activate the slot\\r\\n@Deepti Rukade , if you think slot must be booked for this, please give me an approved request, I will book a dummy slot to compensate.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:42:36', 89, '', '', 'Hanif reply:\\r\\nHowever, I observed one important thing is that the curves are not coming smooth which used to be smooth earlier. \\r\\n\\r\\nOne probable reason could be the vibration due unbearable sound noise created by the pump!\\r\\n\\r\\n@Shubham Mahanti SL Group , please spend some time and try to understand the noise source and accordingly take the measure to nullify the noise.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Shubham reply for Hanif\\\'s question:\\r\\nThe pump issue has been raised in troubleshooting module by bharat. \\r\\nAlthough I don’t think the pump vibrations are reason for noisy data, maybe the reason is something else. \\r\\nEven though, i will keep this in mind and check.'),
(2443, '2025-12-08 16:43:28', 279, 'EMT', '', 'Boron precursor installed in port no. 3 in ALD non LL', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:43:41', 89, '', '', 'Shreyasi reply: for the CV measurement issue resolved from Hanif:\\r\\nThe pump issue has been raised in troubleshooting module by bharat. \\r\\nAlthough I don’t think the pump vibrations are reason for noisy data, maybe the reason is something else. \\r\\nEven though, i will keep this in mind and check.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnd discontinuity was coming like this as well. It was U NaN at these discontinuity points. (image attached)\\r\\n\\r\\nI did open calibration and phase compensation but after that also I was getting these errors.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:47:10', 89, '', '', 'Shubham\\\'s reply - for the comment from Hanif that the curves are not smooth:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe pump issue has been raised in troubleshooting module by bharat. \\r\\nAlthough I don’t think the pump vibrations are reason for noisy data, maybe the reason is something else. \\r\\nEven though, i will keep this in mind and check.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2438, '2025-12-08 16:48:40', 279, 'EMT', '', '1. Main electric power disconnected from the main panel.\\r\\n2. Cooling water in/out valve closed and cooling water both lines disconnected from the system.\\r\\n3. Nitrogen connection disconnected.\\r\\n4. Rotary pump electrical connection disconnected.\\r\\n5. Rotary pump SS bellows removed.\\r\\n6. High vacuum valve disconnected.\\r\\n7. Combination valve handle disconnected.\\r\\n8.  Lebel all parts.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2437, '2025-12-08 16:49:18', 279, 'EMT', '', '1. Main electric power disconnected from the main panel.\\r\\n2. Cooling water in/out valve closed and cooling water both lines disconnected from the system.\\r\\n3. Nitrogen connection disconnected.\\r\\n4. Rotary pump electrical connection disconnected.\\r\\n5. Rotary pump SS bellows removed.\\r\\n6. High vacuum valve disconnected.\\r\\n7. Combination valve handle disconnected.\\r\\n8.  Lebel all parts.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, '2025-12-08 16:49:28', 89, '', '', 'Request from Shreyasi:\\r\\nCan we have a CMU calibration training from Nihal for debugging in future?\\r\\n\\r\\nReply from Shubham:\\r\\nI already did cmu calibration before and during your slot yesterday still you had the issue, i dont think cmu calibration was reason for the error.\\r\\nBut I would also recommend to take a note of the processes performed so that we can track down issues easily.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2436, '2025-12-08 16:49:53', 279, 'EMT', '', '1. Main electric power disconnected from the main panel.\\r\\n2. Cooling water in/out valve closed and cooling water both lines disconnected from the system.\\r\\n3. Nitrogen connection disconnected.\\r\\n4. Rotary pump electrical connection disconnected.\\r\\n5. Rotary pump SS bellows removed.\\r\\n6. High vacuum valve disconnected.\\r\\n7. Combination valve handle disconnected.\\r\\n8.  Lebel all parts.', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
