(2435, '2025-12-08 18:04:20', 2515, 'EMT and Facility', '', 'MBE service corridor old chiller water connection removed and shifting service corridor. Cleaned the Old chiller area and using cable ties held the pipes.  HRXRD chiller shifted the MBE main corridor to the  service corridor. connected to the 10mm new hose pipe with isolation on HRXRD chiller supply and return connector. Chiller water Supply and Return hose pipe fitting to the cable tray and connected to the X-RAY Generator. HRXRD  system water hose pipe connected to the X-RAY Generator. HRXRD chiller installation and water pipe connected  to the system. HRXRD chiller power connection done by Pintu and Raj (Facility).', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2435_0.pdf', ''),
