(2389, '2025-12-08 18:33:40', 2457, 'EMT and Facility', '', 'Today (08-12-2025) after observation water flow error again pop up, so we again did the water line flushing of the tool, from the backside where in and out are connected also from the front side we open the water flow direction meter and clean the flow meter as particles where trap inside the floe meter.', 'Avinash, Pradeep sir(EMT), Raju sir (facility)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2389_2.jpeg', ''),
(2439, '2025-12-08 18:40:41', 2457, '', 'CDA solenoid valve not operating.', 'After bypassing the CDA line from the solenoid valve, in software Comp Air indicator is not turning into green means interlock is not getting the feedback after bypassing the CDA line from Solenoid valve to which it is suspected that the process chamber foreline pressure in not going below 590 Pa. After troubleshooting CDA solenoid valve it was observed solenoid valve is not getting the voltage supply of 22.80vdc.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2439_0.jpeg', ''),
