(2385, '2025-12-09 11:01:03', 89, '', 'The LL arm was stuck inside process chamber with the sample holder\\r\\nPosition of LL arm inside the process chamber was 510mm instead of 400 mm 450mm', 'It was found the sample holder has hit the chamber wall. \\r\\nLL arm unloading manually done with help of Anuj of video call\\r\\n\\r\\nBut the sample holder is inside the process chamber\\r\\nAlso the LL arm position was not initialized inside LL chamber', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'As this required engineer\\\'s help, Dr Pandu (Raith) was contacted for further help', '', '', 'After the LL arm was retracted to LL chamber manually, the position was showing 110mm instead of 2mm'),
