(2385, '2025-12-09 11:14:09', 89, '', '', 'Dec 5:\\r\\nSample load procedure started. But it could not be completed due to error \\\"it is not possible to drive to upper exchange position\\\" after the LL arm moved in.\\r\\n\\r\\nStop - and move robot arm manually out done in the \\\"Advanced Load Lock\\\" window.\\r\\nVAT closed. \\r\\nSample unloading done, completed without any error', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
