(2083, '2025-12-10 12:52:30', 89, '', '', 'Email was sent to vendor with the below queries:\\r\\n\\r\\nBelow are the queries from our side:\\r\\n1. The total space required for the system in the sheet is mentioned as 23inchX23inch. This space requirement includes system+precursors+precursor box+vacuum lines_etc..? Where will the pump be placed? We need the space required for the system, pump, maintenance around the system, etc.\\r\\n2. As per the PO, there is one precursor included. Details of this?\\r\\n3. O2 purity (ATOzone only): 91–95% O2 / N2 mix preferred (5–9% N2) or use oxygen concentrator - please clarify this\\r\\n4. Good Ground - Specs for ground value?\\r\\n5. Power - 15A socket and 15A MCb single phase - both are required?\\r\\n6. Send us System details - model number, manuals, etc\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease reply to the above queries after which we will fill the ALD facility checklist and send it to you.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Once we have the answers to our queries, the facility checklist document will be filled and sent to the vendor.\\r\\nSpace overview will be done by team heads', '', '', 'These queries were sent after the meeting with FIC & team heads done on Dec 9.'),
