(2536, '2025-12-10 17:58:21', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'MBE G-1 and G-2 inside lab and 1st floor all corridor and 1.1 and 1.2 inside lab fire extinguisher Monthly checking work.', 'Today afternoon time I checked ABC and Co2 type fire extinguisher (Gage, expiry date, HPT date etc) all FE working fine above following locations. Please find the attachments below. Also update in google sheet.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2536_0.docx', ''),
(2560, '2025-12-10 17:59:22', 2515, 'EMT', '', 'Turn ON the PC and check all connections. Turn ON the Main MCB. Then turn ON the HRXRD chiller. I have checked the HRXRD chiller display, showing low water level error. I am talking to Mr.  Sagar (HEXON chiller engineer). He suggested cleaning the ultrasonic sensor.\\r\\nTurning OFF the chiller MCB then opened the chiller top side cover then opened the tank. \\r\\nThen cleaned the ultrasonic sensor using lint free cloths. After cleaning  close the cover, tighten the screw and close the top side cover. Turn ON the MCB and check the display. No error showing on the display.  Mr. Sharad (HRXRD Engineer) turns ON the chiller flow using the software chiller flow showing 4.2lpm on the flow meter in the HRXRD  back side panel. Checked the all water connection, no leak detected in the connection and chiller working fine. HRXRD system installation and chiller testing completed from EMT side', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2040, '2025-12-10 18:01:57', 2495, 'EMT', 'checked and found the resistivity has come down to 12 ohms\\r\\nneed to replace filters', 'ordered and received new filters and procured filters from inventory and replaced them', 'Rhifa', 'Mr sameer', '9833855261', 'Very good', 'good', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'the DI water resistivity is back to 18 ohms issue is been resolved from EMT side');
