(2602, '2025-12-11 21:02:01', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Today Annex fround floor GLD panel PLC work.', 'Today, GLD testing and programming work was going on at the annex side. Today, GKS people checked all the hooters in Nano lab, Micro-2 lab, Nano main corridor, all the hooters were ringing. After that, we pressed all the emergency stop buttons and saw that the alarm was ringing. After that, we disconnected the GLD PH3 inside Micro-2 and connected the PH3 gas to the outside source and increased the pressure, then the pressure was shown and the alarm was ringing. same process doing in Nano lab inside and gas name is Sih4 also alram trigger and showing in GLD panel.\\r\\nall hooters are ringing and we need to add hooters in Nano2 inside,Nano-2 service corridor, Nano sr corridor and 2d lab inside. following labs we dont listen alarm.\\r\\nGas Emergency Button We have to install a new one in Nano2 Inside and 2D lab inside The Lab because there is no gas emergency button there.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2602_0.pptx', ''),
