(2644, '2025-12-12 20:04:34', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Nano new Building 1st floor and NCPRE lab GLD calibration and testing work going on by GKS vendor team.\\r\\nSpintronics Lab inside smoke detector checking work.\\r\\nmicro-2 wet chemistry lab hot plate monitor work.\\r\\nSafety round annex and new building evening time.\\r\\nHr portal update daily.\\r\\nSafety blog update daily.\\r\\nBMS desk duty', 'Today, after coming to the second shift, I went to check GLD with the GKS vendor people, and I saw that the GLD hooter was not ringing. The GKS people connected the hooter to the GLD panel from inside and tested it. The hooter of the GLD panel started ringing. After that, we checked the hooter under the Lab whose wire is in the DB service corridor, by opening the DB and short the wire, by continuity test the panel side wire, we gave proper connection to it and checked whether the hooter alarm starts ringing or not hooter are start ringing , the same process is done in ncpre and the alarm of ncpre main corridor starts ringing. Also when the emergency stop button is pressed, all the hooter alarms are ringing. Only the alarm of ncpre inside lab is not ringing.\\r\\n2. micro-2 wet chemistry lab 2 sample monitor work.\\r\\n3.Safety blog and hr portal update daily.\\r\\n4.spintronic lab inside sd checking status update in safety portal.\\r\\n5.BMS desk duty.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2532, '2025-12-12 20:46:49', 928, 'Process team', 'I have checked everything from software control and hardware control, there is no issue with the system.\\r\\nMaximum shifting 0.2um to 0.6um in overlay writing which is already mentioned in the baseline run.System calibration and uniform writing was proper.\\r\\nI have performed multiple sample for dose issue and uniformity issue, everything was proper.\\r\\nBaseline run was done successfully.', 'I have performed multiple sample for dose issue and uniformity issue, everything was proper.\\r\\nBaseline run was done successfully.\\r\\nI have attached pdf file for both baseline run as well as troubleshooting done by me, sample images for dose issue and development issues.\\r\\nNo issues found during run as well as during development.', 'Pankaj Kumar Gound', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '12-12-2025', '', '', 'uploads/2532_0.', 'From system end and process end, there is no issues.'),
(2538, '2025-12-13 08:46:50', 2465, 'Facility Pawan k. s.', 'Here is the deviation data sheet in attached file of 12 Dec. and found deviations in humidity and also temp. in labs , \\r\\nand this work will see weekly .  \\r\\nas in attached file all labs deviation data is updated.\\r\\nalso complaint has been logged about this issue need to look into this matter.\\r\\nand resolved issue.', 'Here is the deviation data sheet in attached file of 12 Dec. and found deviations in humidity and also temp. in labs , \\r\\nand this work will see weekly .  \\r\\nas in attached file all labs deviation data is updated.\\r\\nalso complaint has been logged about this issue need to look into this matter.\\r\\nand resolved issue.', 'Pawan kumar sahu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2538_3.png', 'NA'),
