(2649, '2025-12-13 19:12:43', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Today second shift with the help of housekeeping staff shubham we checked eye and body shower. first we checked micro-2 wet chemistry eye shower and after that body shower we checked, same process can doing in nano main corridor,7th floor main corridor,EC lab inside,1st floor main corridor.NCPRE we dont have access at the time of checking no one is there.', 'Today second shift with the help of housekeeping staff shubham we checking eye and body shower. first we checked micro-2 wet chemistry lab inside eye shower and body shower checking found water is clean. same process doing in nano, 7th floor main corridor,ec lab inside,1st floor main corridor. Also status update in safety portal body shower list. please find the attachments below.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2649_0.pptx', ''),
(2650, '2025-12-13 19:21:26', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1.) 1st floor near main lift side total 03 smoke detector, 1st floor main corridor we have 3 smoke detector, service lift side we have 2 smoke detector 01 is hooter plus smoke detector 01 is normal, 1st floor service corridor side we have 03 sd. total 13 smoke detector checked today in second shift.', 'Today second shift 1st floor main lift side smoke detector checking found sd no:-27/28/29 red light not blinking,  main corridor side 12 /13 all number smoke detector red light  not blinking. 14/15/16/17/18 all smoke detector red light blinking properly this sd location is main corridor and service lift side and service corridor side remains all sd working fine and status update in safety portal device list.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2650_0.jfif', ''),
(2651, '2025-12-13 19:29:10', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1.)1st floor service corridor side 1.2 toxic gas cabinet auto shut off valve connected or not checking work and status update work in safety portal and googel sheet.<br />\\r\\n2.) micro-2 wet chemistry lab hot plate monitor work.<br />\\r\\n3.) safety blog and Hr portal update daily.<br />\\r\\n4.) Data logger monitor work.<br />\\r\\n5.) BMS desk duty.', '1.) 1st floor service corridor side 1.2 toxic cabinet checking auto shut of valve connected or not found inside cabinet total 06 cylinder only 2 are connected and remains area not connected and status update in safety portal device list in comment section.\\r\\n2.) m-2 wet chemistry lab inside hot plate 2 sample monitor work 70degree.\\r\\n3.)Daily safety blog  and hr portal update.\\r\\n4.) data logger monitor work when pintu is working in Ec lab afternoon time.\\r\\n5.) BMS desk duty.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2651_0.jfif', ''),
