(2573, '2025-12-15 17:58:33', 2268, 'Process', 'Radiation leakage check was done by vendor in presence of SO and EMT. The detected leakage ranged between 0.09 µSv/h and 0.16 µSv/h, which is below the limit of 0.5 µSv/h, and it is safe to operate the system.', 'Baseline runs was done successfully along with other measurements. Radiation check was done by vendor in presence of SO nad EMT. Shifting report, baseline ppt and vendor report has been mailed to respective team heads.', 'Gopika , Vikas', 'Sharad', '-', 'Good', 'Vendor recommended some parts for purchase.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2663, '2025-12-16 00:42:55', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Annex ground floor all labs ( micro-1, old chemical storage room, new chemical storage room,UPS room, micro-2 wet chemistry lab, Nano,nano-lihto lab,Nano-2 inside lab) safety round taken and Nano new building 7th floor to MBE ground floor checking all corridor, service corridor, 09 fire panels, GLD panels, etc.', 'Annex ground floor checking all labs found some violation in micro-2 wet chemistry lab inside. I solve the issues, nano new building renovation work is going on so i cant raised violation, I prepared PPT please find the attachments below.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2663_0.pptx', ''),
(2664, '2025-12-16 00:46:43', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1). Nano inside lab checking Gas leakage detector status Total GLD area 07Nos.<br />\\r\\n2.) Nano service corridor and Nano ahu panel side smoke detector checking monthly work.<br />\\r\\n3.) Safety blog, trouble shooting module, and Hr portal update daily.<br />\\r\\n4.) BMS desk monitor work in night shift.', '1.) Nano inside I checked GLD and status update in safety portal device list in comment section also update in google drive sheet.\\r\\n2.) Nano sr corridor and nano AHU area SD red light blinking or not checking work done status update in safety portal device list in comment section.\\r\\n3.) Safety blog,hr portal, trouble shooting module upate daily.\\r\\n4.) BMS monitor work in night shift duty checking CCTV camera.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2664_0.jfif', ''),
(2583, '2025-12-16 09:21:24', 2521, 'Electrical facility', '1)New power connection and equipment earthing to be done in newly renovated EC lab. (Required 32 AMPS 3 Pole MCB & power board with switch and socket).\\r\\n\\r\\n2)Chiller water connection using PVC pipe and exhaust line arrangement to be done. \\r\\n.', '1)New power connection and equipment earthing done in newly renovated EC lab. \\r\\n2)32 AMPS 3 Pole MCB & spare power board with modular 32 amps MCB, 15 amps switch, 15 amps socket & indicator mounted on wall.', 'Raj ,Pintu, Swapnil', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', '32 AMP MCB with Power board provided, WE used old power board with switch and socket', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/2583_0.pptx', ''),
(2584, '2025-12-16 09:42:44', 2521, 'Electrical facility', 'New power connection and equipment earthing to be done in newly renovated EC lab. (Required 32 AMPS 3 Pole MCB & 18 modular power board with 15 amps switch and socket).\\r\\n\\r\\n2)Exhaust line arrangement to be done.', '1)New power connection and equipment earthing done in newly renovated EC lab. \\r\\n\\r\\n2)32 AMPS 3 Pole MCB & power board with 18 modular 32 amps MCB, 15 amps switch, 15 amps socket & indicator mounted on wall.', 'Raj ,Pintu, Swapnil', '', '', '', '', '18 power board -01 nos, modular 32 amps MCB-01 nos, 15 amps switch-5 nos, 15 amps socket-5 nos , indicator -01 nos,16 sq mm earthing cable -2 feet,', 'NA', '2 week', '', '1)New power connection and equipment earthing done in newly renovated EC lab. \\r\\n2)32 AMPS 3 Pole MCB & power board with 18 modular 32 amps MCB, 15 amps switch, 15 amps socket & indicator mounted .', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/2584_0.pptx', ''),
