(2575, '2025-12-16 10:39:30', 279, '', 'Micro 1 lab renovation System shifting from micro 1 lab to Micro 2\\r\\nBefore dismantling process team did one base line run.\\r\\nComparing the base line data with previous data, data is in specs go ahead from process team', '1. System shutdown by Pankaj.\\r\\n2. All communication cable removed with proper labelling\\r\\n3. Rotary pump connection removed.\\r\\n4. SS bellows removed.\\r\\n5. Cooling water valves closed from inside.\\r\\n6. Cooling water connection removed.\\r\\n6. System laptop power and communication connections removed.\\r\\n7. Gas panel all gases lines removed.\\r\\n8. Gas panel communication cables removed', 'Vinayak, Vikas and Mathadis', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2538, '2025-12-16 10:55:50', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'In attached file there is testo data logger deviation data for clean room from 13 dec. to 15 dec. \\r\\n\\r\\nin clean room there is some deviation seen in humidity and also in temprature.\\r\\nneed to look into this .', 'In attached file there is testo data logger deviation data for clean room from 13 dec. to 15 dec. \\r\\n\\r\\nin clean room there is some deviation seen in humidity and also in temprature.\\r\\nneed to look into this .', 'Pawan kumar sahu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2538_4.png', ''),
(2528, '2025-12-16 10:55:55', 279, 'EMT', 'As renovation work is planned in micro 1 lab, All evaporators shifting from micro 1 lab to EC lab. Before dismantling  the evaporators request to process team to do a base line runs and compare with previous data. After confirming from process team all three evaporators ready to dismantle', '1.Evaporator shut down as per SOP by SO\\r\\n2. Label all parts\\r\\n3. Cooling water values off\\r\\n4. Electric connection removed. \\r\\n5. Vacuum Pumps connections removed\\r\\n6. SS bellows removed from the system\\r\\n7. System is ready to move to respective lab\\r\\nAfter shifting tool following is the check list\\r\\n1. Tool electric power connections\\r\\n2. Tool cooling water lines\\r\\n3. Tool exhaust line\\r\\n4. After all facility tool reconnected as per the specifications\\r\\n5. Tool power ON\\r\\n6. Check the system is there any issues like cooling water leak, pirani, penning , turbo pump controller getting ON properly\\r\\n7. If all is fine start the system to check chamber rough vacuum and high vacuum testing and compare the data before dismantling.\\r\\n8. High vacuum data is same request to process to do base line run and update if thee any issue', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1868, '2025-12-16 10:57:34', 89, '', 'Reminders were sent to vendor for dates for installation of new Microscope\\r\\n                                                                                                                            .', 'Dec 10: Email received from vendor saying they can plan the installation in 1-2 days\\r\\nAfter discussion with DR, due to lab tools shifting work, the installation can be planned in the week of Dec 15   .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Inform the vendor for installation in the week of Dec 15', 'Pradeep', '', ''),
(1868, '2025-12-16 10:59:57', 89, '', 'Need to get dates from vendor for installation of new microscope in the week of Dec 15                                                                                                                    .', 'Dec 16: As per communication from vendor, the installation can be planned from Dec 17 (Wednesday)\\r\\nThis was discussed with DR & Ajit and dates were ok\\r\\nLocation decided Nano-2 lab next to slotbooking PC temporarily', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1868, '2025-12-16 11:01:58', 89, '', 'Dec 16: As per communication from vendor, the installation can be planned from Dec 17 (Wednesday)\\r\\nThis was discussed with DR & Ajit and dates were ok\\r\\nLocation decided Nano-2 lab next to slotbooking PC temporarily', 'Dec 17: The microscope engineer informed - due to his personal emergency, the installation planned from Dec 17 has to be postponed to further notice\\r\\nThe same has been informed to DR Ajit during morning meeting on Dec 17', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '09-01-2026', 'The installation can be planned in the first week of Jan 2026', '', '', ''),
(2429, '2025-12-16 11:03:58', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'Auto switch timer has been recived , in inventory.\\r\\nand for this plan has been made, i will start work for auto switch timer installation from monday , because of first need to service the dehumidifiers and after servicing done i will install with the on time and off time plan.', 'Auto switch timer has been recived , in inventory.\\r\\nand for this plan has been made, i will start work for auto switch timer installation from monday , because of first need to service the dehumidifiers and after servicing done i will install with the on time and off time plan.\\r\\n\\r\\nin attached file the details oof on time and off time is mentioned.', 'Pawan kumar sahu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2429_5.docx', ''),
(2514, '2025-12-16 11:07:02', 279, '', 'As micro yellow room  is going to renovation the developer bench will be shifting from micro yellow to 1.2 lab. Request to LIC to remove all the IPA, Acetone and Di water bottles from the developer bench', '1. Di water unit tap water valve closed\\r\\n2. Di water water lines and electrical connections disconnected.\\r\\n3. Di water unit removed from the developer bench\\r\\n4. Developer bench exhaust connection removed.\\r\\n5. Developer bench power connections removed.\\r\\n6. Developer bench and Di water unit shifted to 1.2 lab\\r\\nwork done on12/12/2025', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
