(2565, '2025-12-16 11:13:23', 726, '', 'Deviation in lab temperature humidity every 3 to 4 hour temperature and humidity spike. Observed the ahu pressure and lab pressure is decreasing ahu pressure is decrease from 50 to mm WC lab pressure is decreased from 6 mm of water to 4 MM of water, it means the ahu filter might be chocked,', 'Observed the ahu pressure and lab pressure is decreasing ahu pressure is decrease from 50 to mm WC lab pressure is decreased from 6 mm of water to 4 MM of water, it means the ahu filter might be chocked,', 'Amit/prashant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'AHU team is plan to increase the motor frequency from 40Hz to 45 Hz'),
(2654, '2025-12-16 11:21:27', 297, 'Electrical Team', 'Facility requirements for STSRIE .\\r\\nWater connection for turbo pump and tool- M1 Chiller Needs to be shifted to M2 lab and plan laying New water lines \\r\\nExhaust for rotary pump- Tap Exhaust from PIII system where old polymer was tap.\\r\\nCDA connection- Plan for CDA line \\r\\nProcess gases PN2, O2, Ar, SF6, CF4, CHF3. - Plan for keeping this cylinder', 'Renovation work of service Corridor is goin on. Once this work is completed we can plan for putting cylinders in corridor. Apart from this Clean room Panel are in bad condition which will be changed as per discussion with vishal on 15th dec', 'Sandeep Mane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '30-12-2025', 'Electrical Team can continue with electrical work and then Chiller team can plan for chiller location and piping work', 'omkar', '', ''),
(2645, '2025-12-16 12:00:22', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'Shifitng detail from Micro 1 lab and myr lab...\\r\\n1) Dielectric shift from  Micro 1 to BMS\\r\\n2) CMP shift from Micro 1to  DG scrap area\\r\\n3) Tubewasher shift from Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n4) Furnace 3 shift from Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n5) Furnace 4 shift from  Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n6) 2 nos. Desicator Rack shift from Micro 1 to 1.1 corridor\\r\\n7) MYR Chemical cabinet shift from MYR to N2 corridor\\r\\n8) Mask Rack shift from MYR to 1.1 Corridor\\r\\n9) Mask plate humidity control MYR NL\\r\\n10) development bench shift from  MYR to 1.2\\r\\n11) Chemical cabinet rack shift from chemistry room to N2 corridor\\r\\n12) used chemical rack shift from  M1 to NMPF\\r\\n13) U V ozone shift from M1 to  XPS M2 forklift\\r\\n14) Microscope shift from M1 to M2 below table\\r\\n15) PC slot booking 2 nos shift from M1 to EC\\r\\n16) Table PC shift from  M1 to EC\\r\\n17) XPS M2 forklift Rearrange within Lab\\r\\n18) M2 laminar Bench\\r\\n19) Purchase cupboard office 1.1 corridor\\r\\n20) Tool Spare cupboard\\r\\n21) old chemistery lab fridge shift to ec lab inventory\\r\\n22) CMP slurry shift from old chemistery to nmpf\\r\\nthese tools shifting has been done.', 'Shifitng detail from Micro 1 lab and myr lab...\\r\\n1) Dielectric shift from  Micro 1 to BMS\\r\\n2) CMP shift from Micro 1to  DG scrap area\\r\\n3) Tubewasher shift from Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n4) Furnace 3 shift from Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n5) Furnace 4 shift from  Micro 1 to DG scrap area\\r\\n6) 2 nos. Desicator Rack shift from Micro 1 to 1.1 corridor\\r\\n7) MYR Chemical cabinet shift from MYR to N2 corridor\\r\\n8) Mask Rack shift from MYR to 1.1 Corridor\\r\\n9) Mask plate humidity control MYR NL\\r\\n10) development bench shift from  MYR to 1.2\\r\\n11) Chemical cabinet rack shift from chemistry room to N2 corridor\\r\\n12) used chemical rack shift from  M1 to NMPF\\r\\n13) U V ozone shift from M1 to  XPS M2 forklift\\r\\n14) Microscope shift from M1 to M2 below table\\r\\n15) PC slot booking 2 nos shift from M1 to EC\\r\\n16) Table PC shift from  M1 to EC\\r\\n17) XPS M2 forklift Rearrange within Lab\\r\\n18) M2 laminar Bench\\r\\n19) Purchase cupboard office 1.1 corridor\\r\\n20) Tool Spare cupboard\\r\\n21) old chemistery lab fridge shift to ec lab inventory\\r\\n22) CMP slurry shift from old chemistery to nmpf\\r\\nthese tools shifting has been done.', 'Pawan kumar sahu+EMT person + process person + mathadies', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2645_1.docx', ''),
