(2715, '2025-12-19 01:24:46', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1.) Safety round annex and nano new building checking all safety device,staircase, service corridor etc.\\r\\n2.) 3rd floor smoke detector checking work all corridor area.\\r\\n3.) All form update daily.\\r\\n4.) BMS monitor work.', '01.) Safety round annex and ground floor service corridor,main corridor, checking safety decive,fire panels,smoke detector etc.\\r\\n02.) 3rd floor all corridor smoke detector red light blinking or not checking work status update in safety portal device list.\\r\\n03.) all form update daily.\\r\\n04.) BMS monitor work.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2715_0.jfif', ''),
(2699, '2025-12-19 13:05:15', 1173, '', 'Being LIC of Micro 1 and EC Lab, Micro 1 lab is not undergoing renovation for which all tools and lab stuffs were shifter to various decided locations. Involves coordination, helping and involved in shifting work, mail communication, informing etc.', '1)Desiccators shifting from Micro 1 lab to 1.1 corridor via all staff chain.\\r\\n2) Transferring remaining lab things from M1 to other places and EC Lab.\\r\\n3) EC Lab. Rearrangement of tables and computers and 1st dusting.\\r\\n4) used chemicals bottles shifting from chemical storage room to nano corridor rack.\\r\\n5) email communication to IT team for EC Lab biometric.\\r\\n6) coordination with Anurag for EC lab electroplating system connections, tool requirement from EMT & facility side & it\\\'s chemical. 1) In EC Lab, with process team, one person from EMT & facility and.cleaners help, complete 1st round of lab cleaning done.\\r\\n2) Tables arranged and on that computers, telephone cleaned and kept.\\r\\n3) For electroplating system, According to SO requirement, arranged Small table for his computer. He informed for mounting another switch board that facility did in presence of EMT person. 4)One godrej cupboard was shifted to EC lab with the help of mathadi and transferred all lab goods sorted, cleaned from small cupboard to Almira.kept consumables in the lab.\\r\\n5) Again all tools and lab cleaning done.\\r\\n6) Facility team was informed for their pending work.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
