(2711, '2025-12-19 19:18:57', 95, 'Process', 'Today Raith engineer was on phone call done troubleshooting for joystick X,Y Movement issue. He was suggested that laser used in laser interferometer degrades after 3 yesr oof installation. Last laser installed in system was june-2029 . Now it was 6 yaers we need to replaced it. He checked the XY moment which was working properly.', 'System checked joy stick moment in X,Y stage also checked. Stage controller also checked which was working properly. There needs to check the stage controller setting during the process and also check the system log files if any issue popup', 'System engineer', 'S.V Panduragaiha', '9972875733', 'Very good', 'System checked joy stick moment in X,Y stage also checked. Stage controller also checked which was working properly. There needs to check the stage controller setting during the process and also check the system log files if any issue popup', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
