(2750, '2025-12-20 00:12:06', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1.) Nano new building 7th to GR floor and Annex ground floor all lab inside,main corridor, service corridor,UPS Room, chemical cabinets,Wet bench, safety device checking,Main fire panels,GLD main panels, cylinder chain, etc.', 'Today night shift i start taking round nano new building 7th floor to ground floor, 7th floor all smoke detector are cover due to renovation work, 6th floor all safety device is working,5th floor also fire extinguisher today fixing in wall work done, all safety device are working, 4th floor renovation work is going on and all safety device is coverd, 3rd floor all 3 fire panel is in healthy mode and sd are working fine,NCPRE lab i dont have access, 1st floor all safety device is working along with fire panel and GLD panel, MBE main fire panel showing sd fault on display. annex side checking all labs inside, wet bench, chemical cabinets, gown ares,UPS room, fire panel,GLD panels, MCP, fire blankets,Cylinder chain, all corridor are free,ETC checking during safety rounds.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2751, '2025-12-20 00:16:40', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '1.) 2d Lab inside and Nano-2 inside lab GLD reading taken.\\r\\n2.) 3.2 and 4th floor main corridor,sr corridor, smoke detector checking work.\\r\\n3.) All form update daily.( Hr portal,trouble shooting module,Safety blog)\\r\\n4.) BMS desk duty.', '1.) 2d Lab inside and Nano-2 inside lab GLD reading taken and status update in safety portal device list in comment section and also update in google sheets.\\r\\n2.)3.2 and 4th floor main corridor,sr corridor, smoke detector checking work status update in safety portal device list in comment section .\\r\\n3.) All form update daily.\\r\\n4.) BMS desk duty in night shift.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2751_0.jfif', ''),
(1755, '2025-12-20 15:33:39', 788, 'Electrical', 'New power wiring shall be provided for the chiller. The electrical team shall install a 4-way distribution board (DB) complete with a 63A MCB incomer, including proper earthing and termination.............', 'After the AHU and electrical teams finalize the chiller panel position, the execution plan for the remaining works will be prepared. Electrical team made a required materials list which is attach. Also send the email for materials list on 17th Dec.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1755_3.xlsx', 'Email send on 17th Dec by Swapnil. Waiting for materials.'),
(1756, '2025-12-20 15:49:03', 788, 'Electrical', 'This scope of work covers the provision of new power wiring and electrical accessories for two air-conditioning units. New dedicated power wiring shall be routed from the nearest suitable distribution board to each AC unit.', 'After the AHU and electrical teams finalize the AC position, the execution plan for the remaining works will be prepared. The electrical team shall install two separate AC sockets, one for each air-conditioning unit. Each socket will be protected by 20A MCB incomer with timer. Electrical team made a required materials list which is attach. Also send the email for materials list on 17th Dec.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/1756_3.xlsx', 'Materials list email send on 17th Dec by Swapnil. \\r\\nWaiting for materials.'),
(2279, '2025-12-20 17:42:30', 788, 'Electrical', 'New grounding provision required due to no provision in EC lab.\\r\\nThis was required for human safety, tools safety and noise cancellation. Copper earth conductors of adequate size, as per applicable electrical standards, shall be used for grounding connections.', 'Planning: After search grounding pit or any strip of short path or nearest found in Spectroscopy lab. So prepared required materials list and send mail. \\r\\nExecute:  After materials received, Team were laying 16sqmm green wire with using cable tie and proper lugs and tit with nut bolts both side.', 'Pintu, Sanjay and Swapnil', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pintu Kr.', 'uploads/2279_0.docx', 'Work completed on 3rd Dec'),
(2752, '2025-12-20 23:06:45', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Annex side all ground floor checking ( micro-1 is under renovation work), all smoke detector working fine, MCP are blinking, all sash closed, wet bench no sample is expiry, all cylinder chain, Nano gown area fire panel showing one faults, GLD panels is ok. Nano new building MBE main fire panels showing one faults, 1st floor GLD panels is ok, 09 fire panels is in healthy mode. NOVEC is not connected, 4.1 lab under renovation work, all staircase and all corridor light is ON. all safety device working fine.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2753, '2025-12-20 23:14:24', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) 5th floor all corridor,5.1 inside lab,5.2 inside lab,5.3 inside lab, all smoke detector checking work. \\r\\n02.) Nano-2 service corridor GLD checking work.\\r\\n03.) All froms update daily.( Hr portal,safety blog,trouble shooting module.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty.', '01.) 5.1 inside lab sd number 160 to 164. 5.2 inside lab sd no 165 to 169, 5.3 inside lab sd no:- 170 to 175. all corridor side sd no 25 to 29. 2 hooter plus smoke detector near main lift and sr lift side sd no 23/28 all sd are working status update in safety portal device list in comment section.\\r\\n02.) Nano-2 service corridor GLD checking work  safety portal device list in comment section and also update in google drive sheet.\\r\\n03.) All froms update daily.( Hr portal,safety blog,trouble shooting module.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2753_0.jfif', ''),
(2754, '2025-12-21 23:16:29', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Annex side all ground floor checking ( micro-1 is under renovation work), all smoke detector working fine, MCP are blinking, all sash closed, wet bench no sample is expiry, all cylinder chain, Nano gown area fire panel showing one faults, GLD panels is ok. Nano new building MBE main fire panels showing one faults, 1st floor GLD panels is ok, 09 fire panels is in healthy mode. NOVEC is not connected, 4.1 lab under renovation work, all staircase and all corridor light is ON. all safety device working fine.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
