(2765, '2025-12-22 14:34:39', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'at the time of Ec lab tool shifting the magnet of bio-matric was removed for tool movement.\\r\\nand was not connected till the date - (19/12/2025)\\r\\nand also there magnet part was missing from the magnet assembly.', 'I checked the magnet assembly in ec lab but the part was missing so i check in inventory and found a old spare magnet and assemble it in magnet after the fixing check it , it is working and now biometric working fine.', 'Pawan kumar sahu + Omkar + Priyanka', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2765_0.mp4', 'Na'),
