(2758, '2025-12-22 17:17:37', 692, 'electrical facility', 'Planned preventive maintenance -\\r\\nUPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'Planned preventive maintenance -\\r\\nUPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'Sanjay', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'UPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated', 'swapnil', 'uploads/2758_0.pptx', ''),
(2667, '2025-12-22 17:30:46', 2515, 'EMT', 'I have downloaded the THERMAL EVAPORATOR Al (Aluminium) SOP on the IITBNF website, after downloading reading the SOP and preparing a new SOP on Thermal Evaporator Aluminium (Al).                       .', 'THERMAL EVAPORATOR Al (Aluminium)\\r\\nStandard Operating Procedure (SOP) for High Vacuum Testing. \\r\\nChecklist before turning ON the system \\r\\nTurn ON the Chiller.\\r\\nCheck the Availability of Liquid Nitrogen (LN2)\\r\\nWear Chemical resistant shoes while pouring Liquid Nitrogen.  \\r\\nWear Hairnet, Facemask and Gloves before operating the system.\\r\\nProcedure\\r\\nSwitch ON the main switch on the right side of the system. Switch ON the rotary pump by pressing the green push button on the main control panel. Switch ON the Pirani/Penning gauge controller. Open the combination valve to the backing position, wait till the vacuum reaches 5.0E -2mbar. Switch On the diffusion pump it will take about 45 min to reach desired temperature (45 minutes DP pump warm up  time). Change the combination valve from backing to roughing.  Liquid Nitrogen (LN2) needs to be poured into the LN2 trap before the HIVAC valve is opened. This ensures that DP oil vapors will condense without entering into the chamber. Open HIVAC Valve/ Gate valve (pull the lever towards the right side).\\r\\nWhen gauge head 2 shows 5.0E -2mbar, switch OFF pirani gauge and switch ON the penning gauge. Do not keep the penning gauge on for a longer time. Intermediate checking would be preferable. Wait till the penning gauge indicates vacuum less than 4.7E-6mbar.\\r\\nShutdown Procedure\\r\\nClose the HIVAC valve/Gate valve \\r\\nTurn OFF the Pirani gauge controller on the main control panel. Vent the chamber. Turn  OFF the Diffusion pump. Run the rotary pump for 30mins, till the DP cools down. Move the combination valve to the CLOSE position. Turn OFF the Rotary pump by pressing the red push button  on the main control panel. Turn OFF the main switch on the right side of the system.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2574, '2025-12-22 17:36:50', 2515, 'EMT & Process', 'Baseline run to be done by process team member SO Gopika ma\\\'am.                                                                                                                                                            .', 'Turn on the chiller and HRXRD tool  MCB. Turn on the PC setup switches. Open the software and ON the chiller and wait for the reduced temperature 23°C. Open the HRXRD door, Load the sample and close the door after loading the sample. Set the position and on the X-RAYS. the baseline test  run done SO Gopika ma\\\'am. Turn on the chiller and HRXRD tool  MCB. Turn on the PC setup switches. Open the software and ON the chiller and wait for the reduced temperature 23°C. Open the HRXRD door, Load the sample and close the door after loading the sample.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2764, '2025-12-23 10:02:32', 189, '', 'The AZ 4620 resist currently available in the cleanroom has passed its expiry date. I would be grateful if you could kindly arrange for the resist to be replaced. As I have just seen, the labelled INUP AZ4620 is low in volume, with only about 40–50 ml remaining. It is likely to be exhausted within four to five runs.', 'As discussed with the Professor, we would like to place an order for one fresh 1 L bottle of AZ P4620. It would be greatly appreciated if the details could be shared here so that we may proceed further.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Please use the bottle labelled INUP for now, we will remove the other one and check it.', '', '', ''),
(2768, '2025-12-23 14:43:05', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'Due to renovation work of myr .\\r\\nIITBNF Ethernet (internet) router power adopter supply was disconnected . This may be by EMD team .\\r\\nso there was no internet in bms room .\\r\\nneed to connect power supply for ethernet (internet) router power connection.', 'I checked the power supply and found no power in switch board so i connect power supply from another power extension board now the internet connection is established. \\r\\nthis work is done with the help of Sahid it team .', 'Pawan kumar sahu + Sahid', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2768_0.jpeg', ''),
