(2788, '2025-12-24 15:40:11', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'In 1.2 lab wet bench there was a complaint from Shahiroze (LIC) to no tap water in wet bench  so i checked it and found that there was a valve closed , i turned on it so water coming in wet bench and also there was water leakage in inlet pipeline and also leakage in drain pipe.\\r\\nin inlet pipe line the `coupling was cracked.', 'There was water leakage in inlet pipeline and also leakage in drain pipe. so Pawan and Abhay attend this issue and fix drain pipe with the upvc solvent . and in inlet pipe fix the push fit to wet bench and now the water is coming in wet bench.', 'Pawan kumar sahu and Abhay sawant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2788_0.mp4', 'Work has been done.'),
(2788, '2025-12-24 15:43:37', 2465, 'Facility Pawan kumar sahu', 'In 1.2 lab wet bench there was a complaint from Shahiroze (LIC) to no tap water in wet bench so i checked it and found that there was a valve closed , i turned on it so water coming in wet bench and also there was water leakage in inlet pipeline and also leakage in drain pipe.\\r\\nin inlet pipe line the `coupling was cracked.', 'There was water leakage in inlet pipeline and also leakage in drain pipe. so Pawan and Abhay attend this issue and fix drain pipe with the upvc solvent . and in inlet pipe fix the push fit to wet bench and now the water is coming in wet bench.', 'Pawan kumar sahu and abhay sawant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2788_1.mp4', 'Work has been done.'),
