(2803, '2025-12-26 20:20:00', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Safety round taken annex side MYR and M-1 renovation work is going on, Nano and nano litho lab is shut down due to safety reason, Nano-2 lab,micro-2,wet chemistry lab working fine, All labs safety device are working only nano gown area fire panel showing faults due to all MYR and M-1 lab safety device are disconnected, smoke detector,MCP,cyinder chain all safety device are woking fine,\\r\\nNano new building side MBE main fire panel showing faults, MBE AHU side painting work is going on, 4.1 lab inside renovation work is going on today, 7th floor terrace 3rd layer water proofing work is going on by the vendor,all light on after 06.00PM, all 09 safety device are in healthy mode, GLD in 1st floor is also working fine, due to renovation work is going on so many dust found in lab passage areas.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2804, '2025-12-26 20:26:30', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) 1.1 and 1.2 service corridor GLD reading Taken.\\r\\n02.) Nano service corridor auto shut off Valve connected or not checking work.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily.( HR portal,Safety blog,Troubleshooting Module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty.', '01.) 1.2 lab service corridor both are OFF also gas name is not mention i updated status in safety portal device list and also changed the colour green to red. 1.1 lab 02 are working one is showing faults F81, 03 are OFF, status update in safety portal device list in comment section.today clear service corridor of 1st floor GLD checking work.\\r\\n02.) Nano service corridor ALL auto shut off is not connected i update in safety protal device list, other section, all toxic gas i changed the working status due to auto shut of is not connected. all colour changed it to red when it is connected i changed the colour code into green.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily.( HR portal,Safety blog,Troubleshooting Module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2804_0.jfif', ''),
