(1662, '2025-12-26 20:42:10', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra, Ajay Mane,R.G', 'Annex side all ground floor labs, m-1,MYR, all corridor,UPS, m-2,wet chemistry lab,BMS,Nano lihto,Nano, Nano-2,nano UPS, Nano AHU, All ground floor corridor fire extinguisher are mounted on wall and inside lab we needs to purchase the stand, \\r\\nNano new Building 7th floor to ground Fire extinguishers need to be fix on the wall.', 'Annex side all ground floor labs, m-1,MYR, all corridor,UPS, m-2,wet chemistry lab,BMS,Nano lihto,Nano, Nano-2,nano UPS, Nano AHU, All ground floor corridor fire extinguisher are mounted on wall and inside lab we needs to purchase the stand, \\r\\nNano new Building 7th floor to ground floor all corridor FE abc and Co2 type fE fixing work done by FSO department. due to renovation work is going on some area FE lying on the floors ones renovation work completed safety team doing Fire extinguishers mounting work.', 'Prakash Mehra, Ajay Mane,R.G', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1658, '2025-12-26 20:48:22', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra, Ajay Mane,', 'Annex side all ground floor labs, m-1,MYR, all corridor,UPS, m-2,wet chemistry lab,BMS,Nano lihto,Nano, Nano-2,nano UPS, Nano AHU, All ground floor corridor and nano new building 7th floor to ground floor all Fire extinguisher needs to label.', 'Annex side ground floor all labs m-1 MYR,old chemical and new chemical,all corridor, m-2 , wet chemistry,BMS , nano and nano-2 corridor,service corridor, inside lab near UPS panels side, all fire extinguisher labelling work done. \\r\\nNano new building already work is done but due to renovation work label are removing and kept to safety cupboard ones renovation work completed safety team complete the labelling work also.', 'Prakash Mehra, Ajay Mane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2535, '2025-12-27 13:29:41', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Some high-pressure and low-pressure fire extinguishers were found in the attached building and the new building. These extinguishers will need to be replaced with new ones. All these extinguishers will need to be sent to the FSO department.', 'Low-pressure and high-pressure fire extinguishers were found in the annex and new building, totaling 12. I have prepared an Excel sheet; please see the attachment below. Also, a truck was supposed to come to pick up the extinguishers last week, but due to the driver\\\'s ill health, they were unable to arrive.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2535_0.xlsx', ''),
(1905, '2025-12-27 13:38:27', 2019, 'safety team', 'Annex and New building side we have eye and body shower location:- wet chemistry lab inside, Nano corridor,1st floor,NCPRE,EC lab,7th floor,7.1lab inside, all eye and body shower checking every 15 days.', 'Annex and new building eye and body shower needs to be changed beause of this Eye and body shower is too old, Nano corridor body shower leakage problem, 1st floor body shower leakage issue and needs to be mount in the wall, same issue in 7th floor.  complain also ldge to estate office he visit the lab but still no response.', 'safety team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1641, '2025-12-27 13:43:40', 2019, 'safety team', 'Annex side ground floor to 2nd floor all labs inside and all corridor side we kept ABC and CO2 type fire extinguisher same for nano new building ground floor to 7th floor we have ABC and CO2 type fire extinguisher.', 'Annex side ground floor to 2nd floor all labs inside and all corridor side we kept ABC and CO2 type fire extinguisher same for nano new building ground floor to 7th floor we have ABC and CO2 type fire extinguisher every month first and second week safety team checking fire extinguisher, expriy date, gage,indicator,HPT date and cleaning work.', 'safety team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1639, '2025-12-27 13:47:10', 2019, 'safety team', 'Annex and New building side we have eye and body shower location:- wet chemistry lab inside, Nano corridor,1st floor,NCPRE,EC lab,7th floor,7.1lab inside, all eye and body shower checking every 15 days.', 'Annex and new building eye and body shower needs to be changed beause of this Eye and body shower is too old, Nano corridor body shower leakage problem, 1st floor body shower leakage issue and needs to be mount in the wall, same issue in 7th floor. complain also ldge to estate office he visit the lab but still no response. safety team checking EBS after 15 days in afternoon time  and status update in safety portal device list.', 'safety team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2815, '2025-12-27 13:58:00', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane', 'Micro yellow room inside we have 3 smoke detector number:-47,48,49, 2 are in service corridor and 1 in MYR gown area SD no is 58, and Micro-1 inside we have 50,51,52,53,54,55, also we have inside lab hooters are there.', 'Micro yellow room inside we have 3 smoke detector number:-47,48,49, 2 are in service corridor and 1 in MYR gown area SD no is 58, and Micro-1 inside we have 50,51,52,53,54,55, all smoke detector and hooters are removed with the help of akshay  enterprise team due to renovation work is going on, MBE and annex main fire panels showing Faults on displays. after renovation work completed safety team working on it.', 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2816, '2025-12-27 14:10:12', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane,ajayB', 'Annex side ground floor renovation work is going on Micro yellow room and micro-1,old chemical storage room, inside lab we have ABC and Co2 type fire extinguisher both 2 fire extinguisher 1 abc and 1 CO2 which is removed right now also remove safety sign board.', 'Last firday renovation work is started in micro-1 and MYR room safety team Ajay mane, ajay belekar sir removing safety device like fire blankets, fire extinguisher,safety sign board,MCP sign board,emergency exit sign board all safety device and sign boards are removing work done,after After the renovation work is completed, the security team will put up the labels and all the safety equipment at the.', 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane,AjayB', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2817, '2025-12-27 14:21:07', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane', 'Nano New building 4.1 student room inside lab we have 4 smoke detector number 14,15,16,17, all smoke detector are cover by cape on temporary base due to renovation work is going on, safety team monitor the work.', 'Nano New building 4.1 student room inside lab we have 4 smoke detector number 14,15,16,17, all smoke detector are cover by temporary base due to renovation work is going on, also cover main corridor side smoke detector number 10,11,12 due to safety reason renovation work is going on so dust is there. after completed work we remove the smoke detector cover this work is done by with the help of akshy enterprise team.', 'Prakash Mehra,Ajay Mane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2818, '2025-12-27 16:49:40', 2019, 'prakash and chandu', 'Annex and New building checking eye and body shower with the help of chandu, location:- 7th floor,7.1 lab, NCPRE main corridor,EC lab,1st floor, Nano corridor,Wet chemistry lab inside, all ebs water checking clean or not.', 'Today afternoon me and chandu checking eye and body shower water clean or not status update in safety portal device list in comment section location:- 7th floor,7.1 lab, NCPRE main corridor,EC lab,1st floor, Nano corridor,Wet chemistry lab inside, all ebs working fine please find the attachments below.', 'prakash and chandu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2818_0.jfif', ''),
