(2083, '2025-12-29 11:55:12', 89, '', 'Email was sent to Elcamino for system details and technical documents.\\r\\nEmail subject: Re: ALD Installation Plan - PO 4300001493 (Atomic Layer Deposition System) 0110925IM0B00040 ..                                     .', 'Reply received from Elcamino:\\r\\n1. The total space required for the system in the sheet is mentioned as 23inchX23inch. This space requirement includes system+precursors+precursor box+vacuum lines_etc..? Where will the pump be placed? We need the space required for the system, pump, maintenance around the system, etc.\\r\\nAns: The  given size is of ALD system , Precursor is the attachment and does not need more space , if you want to keep the ALD on table . You can  keep the pump under the table. The given space in the excel sheet is the footprint of the system.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. As per the PO, there is one precursor included. Details of this?\\r\\nAns: You are right that one precursor is included and it  is to fill with H2O2\\r\\n\\r\\n3. O2 purity (ATOzone only): 91–95% O2 / N2 mix preferred (5–9% N2) or use oxygen concentrator - please clarify this\\r\\nAns: Either you can have the facility O2 line with above specified data or concentrator , both option will work.\\r\\n\\r\\n4. Good Ground - Specs for ground value?\\r\\nAns: The voltage between ground and neutral should be below 1V\\r\\n\\r\\n5. Power - 15A socket and 15A MCb single phase - both are required?\\r\\nAns: System is plug and play –  connect the MCB with socket and system will connect with  the socket\\r\\n\\r\\n6. Send us System details - model number, manuals, etc\\r\\nAns: Please find the attached manual', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2083_6.pdf', ''),
(2083, '2025-12-29 11:59:39', 89, 'Purchase', 'Dec 29: Purchase team is interacting with the OEM and freight forwarder for getting the system to IITB.\\r\\nEmail communication: Re: Documents to Freight Forwarder for IITB (SO_AS1816) – PO 4300001493 (Atomic Layer Deposition System) 0110925IM0B00040', 'As per email received from purchase team (Jomon) on Dec 29, the system is expected to land in Mumbai airport by Dec 31 2025. \\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"\\\" @ (Dipankar Sir & Lab officials), FYI, As per the itinerary mentioned in the AWB, the shipment will be landing at Mumbai Airport by 31.12.2025. Will check with Balmer Lawrie Team and update you when the shipment delivery at IITB will happen \\\"\\\"', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1899, '2025-12-29 12:16:06', 2521, 'Electrical facility', 'Outside dry bulb temperature in November and December month Decreases so Temp of lab goes below working temperature range. so needs to modify all 6 nos. DX set points and heater set point ............', 'We changed temperature set points for all DX unit is S1:23.0, S2:23.0, S3:23.5, S4:24, S5:24.5, S6:25.0.  Humidity setpoint is 55 percentage. and set heater temperature is 22.2\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter changes found temperature range is temp min-19.2 & temp max is 22.2', 'Swapnil', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'We changed temperature set points for all DX unit is S1:23.0, S2:23.0, S3:23.5, S4:24, S5:24.5, S6:25.0.  Humidity setpoint is 55 percentage. and set heater temperature is 22.2', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/1899_2.pdf', 'Attached Nano 2 Data logger for reference.\\r\\nAfter changes found temperature is within range . but humidity is spike after some equal interval of time up to 63.00 percentage.'),
(2840, '2025-12-29 12:18:30', 89, 'Facility', 'The complaint was received in the equipment troubleshooting module. As this is related to facility, the complaint has been made in the facility module. Complaint ID 2841                                                                .', 'Complaint logged in facility complaint by Pradeep Nyaupane 29 Dec 2025. Complaint ID: 2841 \\r\\nMiscellaneous	\\r\\n\\r\\nComplaint logged in the equipment troubleshooting module by Anjum Khan 29 Dec 2025:\\r\\nComplaint ID: 2840\\r\\nX-ray Photoelectron Spectroscopy CDA supply to the tool side is zero, it should be in the range of 0.5MPa but currently zero.\\r\\nAlso the main CDA gauge is showing zero. Please look into the issue .\\r\\n\\r\\nFacility team please look into this', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Please check the complaint ID 2841 in facility complaints for updates on this issue.\\r\\nIt is closed from equipment pending complaint'),
(2581, '2025-12-29 12:33:15', 89, 'EMT, Process, Facility', 'As discussed in the morning meeting, facility team would be installing the Autoswap manifold for the Ar line for ALD systems.\\r\\nThis work was planned for Dec 16-17 2025 and completed by Dec 17 5pm.      .', 'After the work completed by facility team, the system was handed over to EMT for evacuation and vacuum leak testing of the line. \\r\\nThe evacuation of the Ar, O2, N2 lines till regulator was done along with SO (Anjum). \\r\\nThe task was completed and system handed over to process team for further testing', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Checklist link from all the teams is as follows:\\r\\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1o85VwQiIPsBLRoQsrtlbRHtfqSqAAkTYaukDUaAaomI/edit?gid=0#gid=0'),
(1683, '2025-12-29 15:39:06', 89, '', 'Reminder email sent to Excel for Chamber pick up.                                                                                                                                                          .', 'Email received from Excel Instruments:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"due to lack of proper space unable to bring the system\\r\\nSpace is getting ready and few systems are being packed and shipped. Hope to pick up the system by 10th of Jan or so.\\r\\nplease bear with us\\\"', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '20-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
(2714, '2025-12-29 15:42:02', 89, 'Facility', 'It was observed SiH4 gas is not flowing. Other gases were flowing properly.  \\r\\n                                                                                                                                      .', 'Dec 18: On investigation,\\r\\nAs informed by Sandeep, the SOVs of GLD were activated due to which the gas flow was stopped. This may be the reason for not gas flow of SiH4.\\r\\nThe cause of this is not known. \\r\\nThe GLD panel reset has been done as informed by Sandeep\\r\\nSO to check the system and revert back', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2714, '2025-12-29 15:49:17', 89, 'EMT, Process, Facility', 'Dec 18: On investigation,\\r\\nAs informed by Sandeep, the SOVs of GLD were activated due to which the gas flow was stopped. This may be the reason for not gas flow of SiH4.\\r\\nThe cause of this is not known.\\r\\nThe GLD panel reset has been done as informed by Sandeep\\r\\nSO to check the system and revert back', 'Dec 19: Even after resetting the GLD panel, SiH4 gas was not flowing as reported by SO.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn further troubleshooting it was found the CDA pressure for the tool was below 5 bar, it should be ~6bar.\\r\\nChecked other tools in Nano lab and found CDA pressure for RTP 4.5bar, ALDs 5bar\\r\\n\\r\\nFacility team checked and found the regulator supplying CDA to Nano lab tools was adjusted to 5.5-6 bar due to which there was a drop. It was increased and adjusted to 7bar. \\r\\nNow ICPCVD CDA pressure is at 6bar\\r\\n\\r\\nSiH4 gas flow checked, it is working fine now-checked by SO', 'Pradeep, Hemant, Omkar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2714, '2025-12-29 16:09:13', 89, '', 'Troubleshooting Report is attached.                                                                                                                                                                     .', 'Troubleshooting Report is attached.                                                                                                                                                                     .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2714_2.doc', ''),
(1486, '2025-12-29 16:26:21', 89, '', 'Payment done - email sent by MMD on Dec 2 2025 to the vendor                                                                                                                                                          .', 'Email received about the shipment from OEM\\\'s local representative:\\r\\n\\r\\nSHIPPING NOTICE\\r\\n \\r\\nINVOICE NO. SPDX002244\\r\\nYOUR ORDER NO: 4500047319\\r\\n \\r\\nHAWB ILC30020906\\r\\nMAWB 21705272444\\r\\n \\r\\nPlease find attached a copy of shipping documents.\\r\\n \\r\\n1ST TG0677 / 16-Dec NRT-BKK ETD 16-Dec-25 17:30\\r\\n2ND TG0317 / 17-Dec BKK-BOM ETA 17-Dec-25 22:00', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Purchase team is following up with MMD and freight forwarder to get the material to IITB.', '', '', ''),
(1860, '2025-12-29 16:28:35', 89, '', 'All the 6 PCs have been received\\r\\nInstallation and testing of the new PCs from vendor is planned in this week\\r\\nAfter this, respective system software will be installed in these PCs and then connected to system', 'All the 6 PCs have been received\\r\\nInstallation and testing of the new PCs from vendor is planned in this week\\r\\nAfter this, respective system software will be installed in these PCs and then connected to system', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1904, '2025-12-29 16:40:38', 89, 'Purchase', 'Blind connector received on Dec 26 2025\\r\\nAs the lab was down for chiller issue till Dec 29, system is being turned ON on after clearance from facility & EMT team.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail sent to Ferrotec for troubleshooting help for checking the CARRERA using blind connector', 'Blind connector received on Dec 26 2025\\r\\nAs the lab was down for chiller issue till Dec 29, system is being turned ON on after clearance from facility & EMT team.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail sent to Ferrotec for troubleshooting help for checking the CARRERA using blind connector', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '09-01-2026', 'Once reply from OEM (Ferrotec) is received, testing of the CARRERA will be carried out.', '', '', ''),
(2587, '2025-12-29 16:57:14', 2521, 'Electrical facility', 'Utilities connection for Electroplating shifted from Micro 1 lab to EC lab\\r\\nOnce this is completed, EMT will start with reinstallation followed by checking by process team for baseline run.............', 'Electrical connection for Electroplating shifted from Micro 1 lab to EC lab has been provide.\\r\\nmaterial specification-\\r\\n18 Modular power board with 32 amps 2 pole modular MCB ,5 nos. switch , 5 nos. socket .', 'Raj ,Pintu, Swapnil', '', '', '', '', '18 Modular power board-1 nos with 32 amps 2 pole modular MCB -1 nos.,5 nos. switch , 5 nos. socket', 'NA', '2 week', '', 'Electrical power connection has been provide.\\r\\nmaterial specification-\\r\\n18 Modular power board with 32 amps 2 pole modular MCB ,5 nos. switch , 5 nos. socket .', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/2587_0.pptx', ''),
(2586, '2025-12-29 17:05:28', 2521, 'Electrical facility', 'Utilities connection for Thermal Evaporator Indium shifted from MBE lab 2 to EC lab\\r\\nOnce this is completed, EMT will start with reinstallation followed by checking by process team for baseline run....', 'Electrical connection for Thermal Evaporator Indium shifted from MBE lab 2 to EC lab has been provide, \\r\\nMaterial specification-\\r\\nLegrand Tempra Plug and socket- 32 AMPS -2 POLE MCB.\\r\\n...................', 'Raj ,Pintu, Swapnil', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'Electrical connection for Thermal Evaporator Indium shifted from MBE lab 2 to EC lab has been provide, \\r\\nMaterial specification-\\r\\nLegrand Tempra Plug and socket- 32 AMPS -2 POLE MCB', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/2586_0.pptx', ''),
(2756, '2025-12-29 18:30:06', 726, 'Ahu chiller team', 'During facility round, found water leakage in 1.1 Chiller pump no 2 from water supply line upvc fitting and tank water level get down every 2/3 hours. the issue is occurred on 17 December 2025, same informer in fic group and facility group.', 'Plan to fix the issue during AHU chiller preventive maintenance (PM) of 1.1 lab, PM schedule  made on 26 December to 28 December 2025, on urgent basis procure the material from local market. shutdown the ahu and chiller, removed the old upvc fitting and made new fitting after take chiller test run found no leakage and chiller working fine.', 'Prashant Amit raju', '', '', '', '', 'UPVC fittings', '3241', 'Same day', '29-12-2025', '', '', '', 'Chiller is working fine with no leakage'),
(2843, '2025-12-29 19:07:30', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Nano new building 7th floor main corridor cleaning work going on by vendor.6th floor service corridor painting work is going on by vendor,4.1 lab ceiling cement work and leveling work is going on, annex side MYR and M-1 lab inside renovation work is going by vendor, safety all device working fine, ANnex and new bldg main fire panel showing faults,GLD panels is ok, 09 Fire panels is in healthy mode.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2847, '2025-12-29 19:15:54', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) Nano-2 toxic gas cabinet checking work auto shut off valve connected or not.\\r\\n02.) work permit form, GLD, Auto shut off valve connected or not, google sheet update till date.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily,( HR portal,Safety blog,trouble shooting module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty, after 06.00PM monitor CCTV work.', '01.) Nano-2 sr corridor auto shut of valve checking 10 out of 01 only connected remains are not connected, safety portal status update in safety portal device list in comment section. all 09 toxic gas colours is changed with red one.\\r\\n02.)  work permit form, GLD, Auto shut off valve connected or not, eye and body shower, fire extinguisher all  google sheet update work done.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily,( HR portal,Safety blog,trouble shooting module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS monitor work.\\r\\n05.) 3.1 and NCPRE lab 2.1 and 2.2 I dont have bio metric access i mention in safety portal device list in comment section (Smoke detector and GLD.)\\r\\n06.) Today given lab access test in afternoon time in HR Office).', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2847_0.jfif', ''),
(2851, '2025-12-29 20:17:37', 2465, 'Facility Pawan K. S.', 'N2 plant new compressor overload trip issue Attend by vendor. \\r\\nNow it is in running condition also 4hour observation has been done..\\r\\nvendor check all the electrical power cable and oil level and also air filter.', 'N2 plant new compressor overload trip issue Attend by vendor. \\r\\nNow it is in running condition also 4hour observation has been done-vendor check all the electrical power cable and oil level and also air filter and found electrical reading found ok and top-up oil.\\r\\n\\r\\nalso here attached service report.', 'Pawan kumar sahu + Vendor', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'Na', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/2851_0.jpeg', ''),
