(1458, '2025-12-31 10:52:27', 89, 'Process', 'Due to tool relocations planned in the next week (Monday to Thursday Dec 2-4), EMT will be available after that.                                                                                                                     .', 'Email sent by EMT to process team head for planning the training schedule so that it is completed before Jan 7 2026                                                                                                         .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '16-01-2026', '', 'Ajit Kumar', '', ''),
(1486, '2025-12-31 10:58:46', 89, 'EMT', 'Email will be sent to IR tech engineer (Sharad) for installation of this part and testing                                                                                                                                  .', 'Email sent to HRXRD engineer Mr. Sharad on Dec 31 2025 for planning the installation of Shutter assembly (which was suspected to be the cause for PXL error) and the new X-Ray tube received.\\r\\n                                               .', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1904, '2025-12-31 13:11:00', 89, 'EMT', 'Spare dry pump (from 6 TEBE - MBE lab 2) was installed in Oerlikon system as the original pump of Oerlikon repair is awaited due to material waiting from the vendor, ETA is end of Feb 2026\\r\\n\\r\\nPump was connected and checked; vacuum is working and reached 2E-6 Torr', 'Spare dry pump (from 6 TEBE - MBE lab 2) was installed in Oerlikon system as the original pump of Oerlikon repair is awaited due to material waiting from the vendor, ETA is end of Feb 2026\\r\\n\\r\\nPump was connected and checked; vacuum is working and reached 2E-6 Torr', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1904, '2025-12-31 13:12:43', 89, '', 'Email was sent to Ferrotec for testing the CARRERA with the newly received blind connector. \\r\\nDue to Christmas and New Year Holidays, engineers are available after Jan 5 2026.                                                      .', 'In parallel, as the chamber vacuum is working fine now, SO (Kanchan) planned for cleaning the chamber with N2 gun and try the deposition (ebeam evaporation)\\r\\nFacility team installed N2 gun temporarily near Oerlikon system on Dec 29.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1904, '2025-12-31 13:14:46', 89, '', 'As per plan, kanchan cleaned the chamber using capton tape in the e beam filament cavity and below is the update                                                                                         .', 'Update from Kanchan:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe HV short issue in oerlikon has been resolved.\\r\\nThe cleaning was done in the electron gun filament cavity. Many metallic flakes were found in the cavity (images attached for reference). \\r\\nThis cavity is not easily accessible and cant be cleaned with vacuum pump either. N2 gun was not used as I had cleaned it with the help of thermal tape and wanted to check the system one more time before using the N2 gun.\\r\\nSuccessful test run for Ti (10nm) and Ni(15nm) was completed today.', 'Kanchan', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2849, '2025-12-31 14:41:25', 2515, 'EMT and Facility', 'After the PM from Facility team, water flushing request from process team for 1.1 lab tools                                                                                                                  .', 'Checked the water inlet and outlet water connection on the tool. Facility team member Amit ji closed the water valve the water supply on the tool. Using lint free cloths covered the wiring side area. Removed tool side inlet and outlet water pipe. With the help of an N2 gun done the water line flushing from the tool side.  After cleaning closed water inlet and outlet tool pipe connection. Turn ON the valve and also called Amit ji Facility turn ON the water supply.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad, Rhifa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2849_0.pdf', ''),
(2880, '2025-12-31 16:39:16', 89, '', 'The issue was raised by email by Kanchan on Dec 4 2025 to Dr. Pandu.\\r\\nEmail subject: IITB Mumbai Voyager Serial No: 3-000-872: Recipe manager issue                                                              .', 'Dec 5: Received reply from Dr. Pandu, they are working on this and getting support from Oleksiy:\\r\\n\\r\\nEmial: Sorry for the late reply. I have requested feedback from Oleksiy. I will get back as soon as possible on this.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2880, '2025-12-31 16:39:57', 89, '', 'Dec 5: Received reply from Dr. Pandu, they are working on this and getting support from Oleksiy:\\r\\n\\r\\nEmial: Sorry for the late reply. I have requested feedback from Oleksiy. I will get back as soon as possible on this.', 'Dec 9: Reply from Dr. Pandu received, to send the log files.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail: \\r\\nPlease send me the  log files (system monitor, Pattern Generator log files and dump file) for the dates you faced the issue. Also send me the recipe file so that we can run it.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2880, '2025-12-31 16:41:09', 89, '', 'Dec 9: Reply from Dr. Pandu received, to send the log files.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail:\\r\\nPlease send me the log files (system monitor, Pattern Generator log files and dump file) for the dates you faced the issue. Also send me the recipe file so that we can run it.', 'Further reply from Dr. Pandu:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs you mentioned the error pops up even when consistency test run, you may generate the fresh log files and dump files.                                    \\r\\n               .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2880, '2025-12-31 16:42:07', 89, '', 'Further reply from Dr. Pandu:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs you mentioned the error pops up even when consistency test run, you may generate the fresh log files and dump files.                                                 \\r\\n.', 'Kanchan sent the log files to Dr. Pandu.\\r\\nEmail saying:\\r\\nPlease find attached the debug and log files for today after the issue occurred during running the pattern consistency check. The debug file was created immediately after the issue occurred, before reconnecting the pattern generator. The gds file and the recipe file used to run pattern consistency check is also included. Some images showing the successful execution of pattern consistency check before using the recipe manager is also included for reference.\\r\\nAlso, it seems that the raith backup tool is not creating the backup with the program stuck at 0%. Could you please look into it as well. The few more images are aslo attached for your reference.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2880_3.7z', ''),
(2880, '2025-12-31 16:43:09', 89, '', 'Kanchan sent the log files to Dr. Pandu.rnEmail saying:rnPlease find attached the debug and log files for today after the issue occurred during running the pattern consistency check. The debug file was created immediately after the issue occurred, before reconnecting the pattern generator. The gds file and the recipe file used to run pattern consistency check is also included. Some images showing the successful execution of pattern consistency check before using the recipe manager is also included for reference.rnAlso, it seems that the raith backup tool is not creating the backup with the program stuck at 0%. Could you please look into it as well. The few more images are aslo attached for your reference.', 'Dec 10: Email from Anjum:\\r\\nToday \\\"the Raith backup tool not creating the backup with the program stuck at 0% \\\" issue has been resolved by Pandu Sir along with Venkat Sir. Also they have taken the backup files for further troubleshooting.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2707, '2025-12-31 16:51:31', 89, 'Process', 'SO checked the tool along with Raith engineer (remotely) and the update is in the complaint IF 2711 under closed complaint of process.                                                                       .', 'SO checked the tool along with Raith engineer (remotely) and the update is in the complaint IF 2711 under closed complaint of process.                                                                       .', 'Hemant', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2767, '2025-12-31 16:59:19', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'As reported by the user Gun Vacuum is at a higher side: more that 2.5E-9 mbar\\r\\n                                                                                                                                           .', 'AHU and chiller PM was planned during Dec 29-30 2025\\r\\nSystem was started by SO (Hemant) after the PM work completed by facility team.\\r\\nOnce the system vacuum reached 1.19E-9 mbar and Gun vacuum reached 4.81E-9 mbar, overnight Gun bake out procedure was started along with EMT team', 'Hemant, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '31-12-2025', '', '', '', ''),
(2767, '2025-12-31 17:01:45', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'Update for the Gun vacuum after gun bake out is in the action taken column                                  \\r\\n                                                                                                                    .', 'After overnight Gun bakeout was done, the vacuum details are as follows:\\r\\nSystem Vacuum: 4.33 E-6 mbar\\r\\nGun Vacuum: 8.38 E-10 mbar                                                         \\r\\n                           .', 'Hemant, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2879, '2025-12-31 17:04:27', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'SO requested for Gun Bake out after the system was started after AHU and chiller PM of Nano & Nano Litho labs.:\\r\\n\\r\\nSystem vacuum reached to 2e-6 mbar and gun vacuum reached to 5.8e-9mbar We want to do over night gun bake out to achieved vacuum in the range e-9 mbar. Please assign EMT team member for this', 'AHU and chiller PM was planned during Dec 29-30 2025rnSystem was started by SO (Hemant) after the PM work completed by facility team.rnOnce the system vacuum reached 1.19E-6 mbar and Gun vacuum reached 4.81E-9 mbar, overnight Gun bake out procedure was started along with EMT team', 'Hemant, Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '31-12-2025', '', '', '', ''),
(2879, '2025-12-31 17:04:53', 89, '', 'Update for the Gun vacuum after gun bake out is in the action taken column                                  \\r\\n                                                                                                                    .', 'After overnight Gun bakeout was done, the vacuum details are as follows:\\r\\nSystem Vacuum: 4.33 E-6 mbar\\r\\nGun Vacuum: 8.38 E-10 mbar                                                         \\r\\n                           .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2879, '2025-12-31 17:14:09', 89, '', 'Update for the Gun vacuum after gun bake out is in the action taken column                                  \\r\\n                                                                                                                    .', 'After overnight Gun bakeout was done, the vacuum details are as follows:\\r\\nSystem Vacuum: 4.33 E-6 mbar\\r\\nGun Vacuum: 8.38 E-10 mbar                                                         \\r\\n                           .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2879_2.doc', 'Report is attached'),
(1868, '2025-12-31 17:17:05', 89, '', 'Email received from the vendor:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs discussed earlier, we are ready to proceed with the microscope installation. \\r\\n\\r\\nOur Senior Application Engineer, Mr. G. Pavan Kumar, is available to visit your lab.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe kindly request you to please confirm a convenient date for the installation as per your schedule. \\r\\n\\r\\nWe are comfortable proceeding with 1-2 days’ prior notice, which will help us plan the visit accordingly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you for your support and cooperation.', 'IITB reply for this:\\r\\nWe may plan the installation in the week of January 7-9 2026.\\r\\nWe will discuss with our team and get back to you on the date of installation. Meanwhile please let us know if the said time is ok for you', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1868, '2025-12-31 17:17:43', 89, '', 'IITB reply for this:\\r\\nWe may plan the installation in the week of January 7-9 2026.\\r\\nWe will discuss with our team and get back to you on the date of installation. Meanwhile please let us know if the said time is ok for you', 'Reply from vendor:\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you for your update.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe proposed installation timeline of 7–9 January 2026 is convenient for us, and we are comfortable proceeding within this period. \\r\\n\\r\\nKindly let us know the final confirmed date once it is decided from your end so that we can plan accordingly.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe look forward for your confirmation', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2655, '2025-12-31 17:22:27', 89, 'Process', 'Issue reported by Anjum by email to Raith engineer:\\r\\nSunject: IITB Mumbai Voyager Serial No: 3-000-872: Issue focusing on calibration sample\\r\\n\\r\\nToday while focusing on the calibration sample it was observed that the particle which was focused shifted while continuous scanning.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe tried moving to the faraday cup on holder but could not locate the faraday cup even at a field of view of 500um.\\r\\nVenkat Sir was also available online. Request you to please look into the issue.', 'Reply from Anjum after the troubleshooting was done by Dr. Pandu remotely:\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you for resolving the issue and during this troubleshooting process we got to know that the sample holder was not placed correctly which  caused the issue.\\r\\nAs recommended we will make sure that the platen is loaded correctly and is in the proper position to avoid such instances.', 'Anjum', 'Dr. Pandu', 'Raith India', 'Good', 'Good', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1869, '2025-12-31 17:26:32', 89, '', 'Reminder email sent to purchase team to check with the vendor for delivery date of the new hot plates                                                                                                    .', 'Reminder email sent to purchase team to check with the vendor for delivery date of the new hot plates                                                                                                    .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1904, '2025-12-31 17:27:31', 89, '', 'Update from Kanchan:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe HV short issue in oerlikon has been resolved.\\r\\nThe cleaning was done in the electron gun filament cavity. Many metallic flakes were found in the cavity (images attached for reference).\\r\\nThis cavity is not easily accessible and cant be cleaned with vacuum pump either. N2 gun was not used as I had cleaned it with the help of thermal tape and wanted to check the system one more time before using the N2 gun.\\r\\nSuccessful test run for Ti (10nm) and Ni(15nm) was completed today.', 'Reply from EMT:\\r\\n\\r\\nThank you Kanchan Ji for the update.\\r\\nLet\\\'s do a few more Ti and other metals dummy process runs to condition the chamber for a longer time to check the proper functioning and stability of the HV unit (CARRERA & Genius)\\r\\n\\r\\nIt will be good if a photo & video of \\\"deposition start-during process-end of process\\\" is recorded for future reference.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
