(2657, '2026-01-02 14:47:02', 2495, 'EMT', 'After Facility connections done by facility team - power, exhaustrnCr/Au vacuum test was donern rn\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n                                                                                                                       .', 'Time \\r\\nVacuum \\r\\nStatus\\r\\n\\r\\n4:37\\r\\n>1000mbar \\r\\nRotary pump ON, Backing ON\\r\\n\\r\\n5:28 \\r\\n3.8E -2\\r\\nRough valve ON \\r\\n\\r\\n5:31\\r\\n5.0E -2\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n5:36\\r\\n4,6E -2\\r\\nBacking valve On, DP ON \\r\\n\\r\\n5:52\\r\\n1.3E -1\\r\\nRoughing ON \\r\\n\\r\\n5:53\\r\\n5.0E -2\\r\\nBacking ON\\r\\n\\r\\n5:53\\r\\n2.2e -4\\r\\nGate valve open\\r\\n\\r\\n6:14\\r\\n5.7E -5 \\r\\n=\\r\\n6:25\\r\\n5.0E -5\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n6;28\\r\\n4.5E -6 \\r\\nProcess chamber is is High vacuum\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter opening gate valve 4.4E -6 mbar high vacuum reached in 35 minutes \\r\\nAfter turning ON the DP pump 4.4E -6 mbar high vacuum reached in 52 minutes \\r\\nRough vacuum reached in 48 minutes', 'Rhifa, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2844, '2026-01-02 15:12:05', 2457, 'EMT and Facility', 'after ahu and chiller pm work complete by facility team, did water line flushing.                                                                                                                                          \\r\\n .', '1. System was already turned off the SO, so after PM work of AHU and Chiller was complete, we started with the water line flushing.rn2. Amit sir from facility turned off the inlet and outlet valves of the water line connection.rn3. we removed inlet and outlet water connection one by one from total 5 water connections.rn4. With CDA connections, apply cda flow to inlet side and water flush the line from tool side through outlet side.rn5. repeated same steps with other water line connections.rn6. Completed the water line flushing, told facility member amit sir to open the both outlet first and then inlet water valves.rn7. After water flushing, Shipla turned on the tool.', 'Avinash and Raj.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2845, '2026-01-02 15:15:37', 2457, 'EMT and Facility', 'after ahu and chiller pm work complete by facility team, did water line flushing.                                                                                                                                                                                                                     .', '1. System was already turned off by the SO. 2. So after PM work of AHU and Chiller was complete, we started with the water line flushing. 3. Amit sir from facility turned off the inlet and outlet valves of the water line connection. 4. we removed inlet and outlet water line connection . 5. With CDA connection, apply cda flow to inlet side and water flush the line from tool side through outlet side.rn5. Completed the water line flushing, told facility member Amit sir to open the both outlet first and then inlet water valves.rn7. After water flushing, SO turned on the tool.', 'Avinash and Ami sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2889, '2026-01-02 15:24:46', 726, 'AHU & Chiller Team', 'Water leakage issue seen in ALL LL outlet  manifold line valve, reported by Anjum madam on 31 December 2025. ...........................................................................................', 'Checked and found water leakage from manifold outlet line valve, closed the main valve from manifold, disconnect the water pipe from valve which is leakage. and connect to the another valve which is already in spare.', 'Amit/Abhay', '', '', '', '', 'No', '', '', '02-01-2026', '', '', 'uploads/2889_0.docx', 'Issue has been resolved and report has been attached.'),
(2085, '2026-01-02 15:46:03', 89, '', 'The existing PC is Win XP, and we tried to connect the internet and were able to connect with wifi dongle,  but the network group PCs are not visible. \\r\\nTried again with the LAN connection, but the same issue of network group PCs not visible faced.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Olympus PC needs to be upgraded to Win 7 or higher version for the data transfer enabling.', 'The existing PC is Win XP, and we tried to connect the internet and were able to connect with wifi dongle,  but the network group PCs are not visible. \\r\\nTried again with the LAN connection, but the same issue of network group PCs not visible faced.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Olympus PC needs to be upgraded to Win 7 or higher version for the data transfer enabling.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2578, '2026-01-02 15:50:18', 726, 'AHU and chiller team', 'During night shift staff daily round, lab pressure is drop and spike in temperature and humidity, inform in fic group and facility group, the reason pressure drop is ahu filter is chocked, send the ahu shutdown request to team head, further action will be taken after shutdown approval.', 'Take preventive maintenance ( PM ) shutdown of AHU and chiller, note all parameter, Room pressure, AHU pressure, VFD frequency, Current reading of blower heater and compressors, lab temperature  humidity, removed supply return filters and install new filters which is already kept in store, after completion of PM, run the ahu now lab pressure is increase 4 mm of water to  6 mm of water.', 'Facility team', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Issue has been resolved'),
(1869, '2026-01-02 16:07:10', 89, 'Purchase', 'Email from Jomon to the vendor on Jan 1 2026:\\r\\nWaiting for the update for delivery of  PO 4500047802 (Hot Plate Purchase)\\r\\nPlease respond to our mail, tried to call on the given landline numbers, but nobody is answering\\r\\nKindly update the delivery status.', 'Vendor has replied saying the hot plates will be delivered by 3rd week of Feb 2026.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail subject: RE: Hot Plate Purchase\\r\\n\\\"\\\" Sorry for the delayed reply. \\r\\nWe will try to deliver the material by the 3rd week of feb 2026. \\\"\\\"', 'Jomon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '27-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
(1867, '2026-01-02 16:11:34', 89, '', 'Email was sent to Minita for clarification regarding the issue raised.\\r\\nEmail subject:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"There is a complaint raised in the equipment troubleshooting module by you as follows:\\r\\nThis complaint has been pending for a very long time. I am not able to understand what action needs to be taken from the EMT side. Please let us know, accordingly EMT will work on it.\\\"', 'Reply from Minita:\\r\\n\\r\\nDear Sir,\\r\\nI thought spacers needed to be procured but it was resolved. Runs were performed using cleaned Quartz wafers as spacers.   \\r\\n                                                   .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'This issue is closed'),
