(2861, '2026-01-02 16:53:16', 2515, 'EMT', 'Servicing of General Purpose Spinner                                                                                                                                                                     .', 'Turned off the power supply and disconnected the power cord. Removed the vacuum line, CDA line, and drain line. Shifted the spinner from the Nano Litho Lab to the BMS room. Opened the spinner lid and removed the dirty aluminum foil. Removed the chuck and the thermal tape from the spinner. Cleaned the chuck using IPA, scrub pad, and a lint-free cloth. Cleaned the internal side area of the spinner. Cleaned the vacuum valve assembly. Opened the bottom cover and cleaned the sensor-side connector. After cleaning, reassembled all the parts properly. Shifted the spinner back from the BMS room to the Nano Litho Lab. Connected the vacuum line, CDA line, and drain line, then connected the power cord. Turn ON the power supply. Spinner display ON but showing vacuum issue. Checked the vacuum pump and found a faulty wire connection and vacuum line on the diaphragm pump side in the Nano Lab service corridor. Checked correct cable and testing by DMM. It was showing 230VAC. Vacuum line testing by CDA pressure. Corrected the wire connection and vacuum line, then turned ON the power supply again. The vacuum pump started working properly.\\r\\nTested a dummy sample by Hemant Sir and confirmed that the spinner is working fine.  Inform SO Hemant Sir for using.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2861_0.pdf', ''),
(2533, '2026-01-02 17:12:55', 2312, '', 'AC servicing done of following labs\\r\\n1. micro 1 caste AC -2\\r\\n2. old wet chemistry lab window AC - 2\\r\\n3. micro ups room spilt AC - 2\\r\\n4. chemical store room spilt AC - 2\\r\\n5. Nano ups room spilt AC - 3\\r\\nAC servicing done by vendor of all labs', 'Vendor has came to AC servicing on this following dates\\r\\n10, 11, 12, 16 December 2025 \\r\\nThey checking all the electrical parameter \\r\\ncleaned filters of AC indoor body  \\r\\ncheck Amp \\r\\nOutdoor unit cleaned \\r\\nchecked line pressure', 'vendor', 'Kailash refrigeration', 'NA', 'Satisfactory', 'NA', '', '', '', '', '', 'Tejas Advilkar', '', ''),
