(2512, '2026-01-05 12:37:44', 2312, 'Facility Team', 'When vendor was came for RO ( reverse osmosis water ) plant servicing and troubleshooting he  observe membrane is chocked he was replaced membrane and also set the auto back wash setting in every 8hrs after running then he was give us training on how to operate RO plant ? and How it\\\'s work  then we note the point and discuss with all the team member and decided we have to make SOP for RO plant', '1.Turn ON the main supply of RO plant .\\r\\n2.Check Tap water tank before start the RO Plant  ( If Tap water empty Don’t turn ON the RO plant).\\r\\n3.If Tap water tank is full Turn ON the valve .\\r\\n4.Then Press the Power button ( which is on display).\\r\\n5.Check the Tap water pressure on pressure gauge ( which connected on flow line of tap water line )\\r\\n Action take by vendor \\r\\n1. Check all the Electrical parameter \\r\\n2.Replaced cartage filter \\r\\n3. Replaced membrane \\r\\n4.Set auto back wash \\r\\n5.Set water pressure as 200 LPH to 250 LPH', 'Tejas Advilkar', 'Shree Engineers', 'NA', 'Good', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'NA', 'Tejas Advilkar', '', 'NA'),
