(1882, '2026-01-05 17:05:35', 726, 'Ahu Chiller team', 'After new pump installation in the 1.1 chiller the pump pressure should be above 6 bar as per CNP company specification. but we get minimum 4 bar which not sufficient to run the instrument of 1.1 lab.', 'discussed with team and plan to replace the solenoid valve of both pump and all upvc fittings. send request to inventory for material procurement, after material material received take chiller shutdown and replaced the solenoid valve with upvc valve and all upvc fittings. after replacing faulty part the pump pressure increase 4 bar to 6 bar.', 'Prashant/Amit/rajendra khanvilkar', '', '', '', '', 'upvc fittings', '3200', '1 day', '05-01-2026', '', '', '', 'Both pump is working fine after replaced the valve and upvc fittings.'),
(1883, '2026-01-05 17:16:34', 726, 'AHU & Chiller team', 'During preventive maintenance (PM) of ahu found one heater is gone bad  informed by electrical team, heater has been bypass for time being due to unavailability of heater stock. ......................', 'Take preventive maintenance (PM) of AHU chiller, shutdown the ahu  removed bypass and installed the new heater and take test of heater its working fine. ...............................................', 'Abhay/pintu/omkar', '', '', '', '', 'Heater', '2000', '', '05-01-2026', '', '', '', 'Work has been done.'),
