(1898, '2026-01-05 17:40:40', 1786, 'Gas Team', 'Due to Nano Ar. ALD cylinders use frequently and changing time consume almost one day. So we decided to connect two cylinders parallel. After checking and availability of changeover panel of nano-2 Oxygen changeover. So We installed in nano-1 Ar. ALD.  ( If one cylinder goes empty then automatic change in other cylinder without decrease line pressure.)', 'Due to Nano Ar. ALD cylinders use frequently and changing time consume almost one day. So we decided to connect two cylinders parallel. After checking and availability of changeover panel of nano-2 Oxygen changeover. So We installed in nano-1 Ar. ALD.  ( If one cylinder goes empty then automatic change in other cylinder without decrease line pressure.)\\r\\nWe installed 5 cylinders rack also with support.', 'Arvind & Chandrakant', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', '', '', 'uploads/1898_6.pptx', ''),
(2938, '2026-01-05 17:43:18', 2521, 'FACILITY', 'Planned preventive maintenance -05/01/26\\r\\nUPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) to be updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'Planned preventive maintenance -05/01/26\\r\\nUPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'Pintu kumar', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'UPS daily reading for NANO 1 UPS, New Building UPS 1, New Building UPS 2, MICRO UPS output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated in log', 'swapnil', 'uploads/2938_0.pptx', ''),
(2667, '2026-01-05 18:11:02', 2515, 'EMT', 'I have downloaded the THERMAL EVAPORATOR Al (Aluminium) SOP on the IITBNF website, after downloading reading the SOP and preparing a new SOP on Thermal Evaporator Aluminium (Al)                                    .', 'THERMAL EVAPORATOR Al (Aluminium) Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for High Vacuum Testing ON EMT side. Please refer to the attached report below                                                             .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2667_1.pdf', ''),
