(2941, '2026-01-05 23:43:15', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Annex side Micro-1 and MYR renovation work going on safety device is temporary remove from the lab, micro-2 and wet chemistry, BMS,Nano,Nano-litho,Nano-2 inside Smoke detector, Fire extinguisher, Main fire panel showing 34 faults, New building MBE side fire panel showing 34 faults in display,New bldg 1st floor to 3rd floor 9 fire panels is in healthy mode,GLD panel is also working, 4th floor renovation work is going on all table and chair lying on main corridor center side. due to renovation work Annex and new bldg side so many dust found in the sraircase,passage area and around the bldg, so many materials lying on BMS desk side needs to be arranged  properly.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2942, '2026-01-05 23:48:09', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) Nano new building 7th floor,7.1,7.2,all corridor, 6th floor all corridor,5th floor all corridor fire extinguisher checking work.\\r\\n02.) Nano gown,Nano-2 inside lab smoke detector checking work.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily.\\r\\n04.BMS desk duty.', '01.) Nano new building 7th floor,7.1,7.2,all corridor, 6th floor all corridor,5th floor all corridor fire extinguisher checking work and found some Fire extinguisher gage is low pressuer needs to be replaced with new one all low and over pressure ABC type FE needs to be remove from the labs.\\r\\n02.) Nano gown area SD no:-01 and 02. Nano-2 inside lab SD no 3/4/5/6 all sd red light is blinking fine and all are working in status. safety portal also update the jan month 2026 status images also attached in the comment section list.\\r\\n03.) All form update daily.( HR portal,Safety blog,troubleshooting module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty night shift checking CCTV camera)', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2942_0.jfif', ''),
(2937, '2026-01-06 09:20:31', 279, 'EMT', 'During troubleshooting it was observed that there is cooling water leak from the crucible rotation shaft.                                                                                       .            .', '1. System power off\\r\\n2. Cooling water lines valves closed from the manifold\\r\\n3. Cleaned the cooling water for top flange\\r\\n4. Disconnected the crucible assembly from process chamber\\r\\n5. Open the gear shaft cleaned the gear shaft and replace the center \\\'O\\\' ring with new one.\\r\\n6. Assembled the shaft to the crucible rotator\\r\\n7. Cooling water valve open to check the leak is rotating shaft.\\r\\n8.No leak in rotating shaft.\\r\\n9. Chamber pumped down for rough vacuum', 'Vinayak and Mr. Shrish', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2937_0.jpeg', ''),
(2801, '2026-01-06 09:35:36', 279, 'EMT', '1. Edwards  (iXH100) dry pump during burning smell coming from the pump observed by Anjum\\r\\n2. Pump main power off\\r\\n3. Cooling water valves closed.                 .              .         .              .', '1. New AL system shut down \\r\\n2. Mail Edwards Engineer Mr.Kunal Gogle give all details about the dry pump.\\r\\n3. Mr.Kunal Ghogle replied due to Christmas vacation our techcians were on holiday we will visit IITB after 5th January', 'EMT team and Anjum', 'Mr. Kunal Gogle', 'Mob. 8956198838', 'Good', 'Waiting for his replay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2939, '2026-01-06 10:13:38', 89, 'EMT', 'Please refer to complaint ID 2902 for the update on this issue.\\r\\nThis issue is being closed from EMT side as it is a repeated issue logged\\r\\n                                                                                                                            .', 'Already logged issue for the same complaint:\\r\\n\\r\\nAnjum Khan 02 Jan 2026 Complaint ID: 2902	ALD (Non LL)	\\r\\n\\r\\nALD Non LL Dry pump is not available as it is connected to new ALD for the evacuation of H2S gas .', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2591, '2026-01-06 10:48:02', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'It was reported by Shubhankar that the gate valve is not opening during RIE process run (auto run command)\\r\\nWhen checked the system, found there was an active alarm (alarm button red)                                           .', 'When checked the system, found there was an active alarm (alarm button red)     \\r\\n\\r\\nThe alarm resetting was done and tried to pump all the chambers. Low vac completed for PECVD, LL, RIE chambers.\\r\\n\\r\\nAuto run for RIE started and the process run was completed successfully', 'Pradeep, Shubhankar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2591_0.jpeg', 'Issue resolved. \\r\\nThe alarm button was active that\\\'s why it did not move further'),
(2591, '2026-01-06 10:49:23', 89, '', 'Image attached for the recipe run                                                                                                                                                                      .', 'Image attached for the recipe run                                                                                                                                                                      .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2591_1.jpeg', 'Issue was resolved on Dec 11 2025'),
(2658, '2026-01-06 10:56:10', 279, '', '4 Target DUC 400 burning smell coming out from the turbo pump controller.                                                 .                             .                                                            .', '1. Controller main power off.\\r\\n2. Controller power and communications cables removed.\\r\\n3. Disconnected the controller from the system.\\r\\n4. Turbo pump top cover opened by Vikas,\\r\\n5. Turbo controller repairing done Turbo controller check after repair along with Pfeiffer engineer Mr. Rajendra Sahu.\\r\\n6. Opening all the screws on the controller, I observed the fuse (6.3A/250V) and varistor (TVR 20431) was burned .\\r\\nThis work done on 1st January', 'Vikas and Mr. Rajendra Sahu', 'Mr. Rajendra Sahu', 'Mob number - 7337399345', 'Good', 'Mr. Rajendra Sahu suggested to buy the new controller.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2814, '2026-01-06 11:01:35', 788, 'Electrical', 'Weekly Diesel Generator trail to be done and fill checklist in electrical facility reading log -Engine Started &amp; Engine Stopped date and time, Engine oil pressure, Engine coolant Temp, Engine battery Voltage, Engine Run Time, Maintenance Alarm, Generator voltage-(L1+N,<br />\\r\\nL2+N,L3+N),Generator voltage-(L1+L2,L2+L3,L3+L1),Generator Frequency, Generator Current, Generator Earth Current, Generator Load [L1 (KW), L2 (KW), L3 (KW)], Generator Load-(L1 %,,L2 %,L3 %), Generator load Total (KW%), Generator load Total (KVA%), Generator power factor ,Generator Load KVAr (L1 (kvar) ,L2 (kvar),L3 (kvar)), Generator Load KVAr (Total KVAr%),Generator Load KWH Phase sequence, Active Config, Main voltage , Status , On Load ,AMP, Engine Speed, Generator Load.  Testing Done.', 'Weekly Diesel Generator trail to be done and fill checklist in electrical facility reading log -Engine Started &amp; Engine Stopped date and time, Engine oil pressure, Engine coolant Temp, Engine battery Voltage, Engine Run Time, Maintenance Alarm, Generator voltage-(L1+N,<br />\\r\\nL2+N,L3+N),Generator voltage-(L1+L2,L2+L3,L3+L1),Generator Frequency, Generator Current, Generator Earth Current, Generator Load [L1 (KW), L2 (KW), L3 (KW)], Generator Load-(L1 %,,L2 %,L3 %), Generator load Total (KW%), Generator load Total (KVA%), Generator power factor ,Generator Load KVAr (L1 (kvar) ,L2 (kvar),L3 (kvar)), Generator Load KVAr (Total KVAr%),Generator Load KWH Phase sequence, Active Config, Main voltage , Status , On Load ,AMP, Engine Speed, Generator Load.  Testing Done and found all OK.', 'Pintu & Sanjay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Online data filled'),
(2787, '2026-01-06 11:06:32', 788, 'Electrical', 'Planned preventive maintenance - Critical tools grounding (Resistance-ohms & leakage current-mA) of below tools to be Checked & updated in electrical facility reading log.\\r\\nMICRO 1 Lab- XRD System, EVOSEM System,\\r\\nMICRO 1 YELLOW ROOM- STSRIE ,OERLIKON SYSTEM ,\\r\\nMICRO 2 Lab - XPS Set Up,\\r\\nNANO 1 LAB -ATC Sputter, Orion Sputter, ALD, ALD Load Lock, ICPCVD, RTP, Elipso meter ,New ALD,\\r\\nNANO LITHO LAB-RAITH, DSA,\\r\\nNANO 2 LAB-DRIE, NMPF Sputter, NMPF RTP, MTJ Sputter, New PECVD , Plasma Asher , Raith Voyager ,Cobra ,\\r\\nMBE LAB -MBE 1-Subho Sir System , MBE 2 - Laha Sir System, MBE 3 - SSM Sir System, MBE 4 - Subho Sir System - New ,\\r\\n1.1&1.2 Lab - New Bldg -PDS , 1.1 RIE , Nano RIE, Plasma Asher, Ar-Ion Milling System, Ar Annnealing System, AJA System, RTP 2 (1.2 Lab), RTP 1 (1.2 Lab), ICPRIE (DIA) , Decktat XT,\\r\\nCHAR 2 LAB- DYNACOOL PPMS Set Up. Critical tools grounding completed.', 'Planned preventive maintenance - Critical tools grounding (Resistance-ohms & leakage current-mA) of below tools to be Checked & updated in electrical facility reading log.\\r\\nMICRO 1 Lab- XRD System, EVOSEM System,\\r\\nMICRO 1 YELLOW ROOM- STSRIE ,OERLIKON SYSTEM ,\\r\\nMICRO 2 Lab - XPS Set Up,\\r\\nNANO 1 LAB -ATC Sputter, Orion Sputter, ALD, ALD Load Lock, ICPCVD, RTP, Elipso meter ,New ALD,\\r\\nNANO LITHO LAB-RAITH, DSA,\\r\\nNANO 2 LAB-DRIE, NMPF Sputter, NMPF RTP, MTJ Sputter, New PECVD , Plasma Asher , Raith Voyager ,Cobra ,\\r\\nMBE LAB -MBE 1-Subho Sir System , MBE 2 - Laha Sir System, MBE 3 - SSM Sir System, MBE 4 - Subho Sir System - New ,\\r\\n1.1&1.2 Lab - New Bldg -PDS , 1.1 RIE , Nano RIE, Plasma Asher, Ar-Ion Milling System, Ar Annnealing System, AJA System, RTP 2 (1.2 Lab), RTP 1 (1.2 Lab), ICPRIE (DIA) , Decktat XT,\\r\\nCHAR 2 LAB- DYNACOOL PPMS Set Up. Critical tools grounding completed.', 'Pintu', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Pintu', '', 'Data filled in online sheet.'),
