(2216, '2026-01-06 11:34:22', 279, 'EMT', 'Beam is not in the center of the crucible\\r\\n.                   .                       .                        .                                             .                                             .', '1. After reconnecting the crucible assembly\\r\\n2. Base plate alignment done.\\r\\n3. Chamber pumped down for high vacuum\\r\\n4. Beam position checked by Minita but still the beam in out of center\\r\\n5. Chamber vented, base plate shifted towards front side.\\r\\n6. Chamber pumped down at high vacuum beam alignment check beam is in center into the  crucible', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Request to Minta to check the beam on all crucibles'),
(2445, '2026-01-06 11:41:32', 279, 'EMT', 'Opening all the screws on the controller, I observed the fuse (6.3A/250V) and varistor (TVR 20431) was burned .       .                                                                  .                 .', 'The faulty DCU controller was repaired successfully and the controller working condition.\\r\\nThe system high vacuum testing will be done on 6th Jan  2026 .                              .                               .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2615, '2026-01-06 11:50:48', 279, 'EMT', 'NH3 gas high reflected power issue was there\\r\\nNeed to check the RF matching unit network.                                     .\\r\\n                                           .                          .  .', '1. System power of as per SOP\\r\\n2. Check RF matching unit power and control cables as tightened properly.\\r\\n3. Check RF matching unit Load/ Tune parameters\\r\\n4. System power ON\\r\\n5. Opened NH3 gas valve\\r\\n6. Did one plasma test run using NH3 gas 300w with keeping precursor valve close for 50 cycles \\r\\n7. Test run done complete without high reflected power issue', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2958, '2026-01-06 12:04:04', 726, 'AHU chiller team', 'Water leakage from EC Lab water chiller manifold of 4 target e beam, the root cause of leakage is larger jublee clip 3/4 inch due to this the pipe to jublee clip alignment mismatch and water leakage occurred.', 'Complaint raised by EMT team vinayak, checked and found water leakage due to larger jublee clip, arrange material from facility stock , shutdown the chiller, tools is already shutdown due to no process. removed old jublee clip and apply 1/2 inch jublee clip and no leakage observed.', 'Abhay sawant/Amit', '', '', '', '', 'Already in facility stock', 'NA', '', '06-01-2026', '', '', 'uploads/2958_0.pptx', 'Work is completed'),
(2795, '2026-01-06 12:06:24', 279, 'EMT', 'Burning smell coming from the pump, need to check the pump inner parts.                                          .                    .                                             .                                 .', '1. After Prof. Lodha approval ALD non LL dry pump uninstalled and connected to New ALD system. \\r\\n2. Pump suction, exhaust and cooling water connection connected to pump.\\r\\n3. Pump switch ON for testing working fine \\r\\n4. Existing pump mail send to Edwards Engg. Mr. Kunal Ghogle\\r\\n4. The door closer error on software because of this system software not able to getting ON.\\r\\n5. Email to ALD support', 'Vinayak, Anjum', 'Mr. Choi for Door closer error, Mr.Kunal Ghogle for Edwards dry pump', 'ALD SUPPORT', 'Good', 'Waiting for the replay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
