(2964, '2026-01-06 17:04:08', 2017, '', 'New buildng all floors ceiling green led safety direction sign boards are hanging & non working, need to remove. as it can be fall on someone head and injury can happen. For precautionary purposes need to remove it.', 'New buildng all floors ceiling green led safety direction sign boards are hanging & non working, need to remove.  - with help of Ajay belekarji we have uninstalled it and handed over to sukhdev to keep it in the store. now there is no chances of any injury due to hanging green led safety direction sign boards. 09nos', 'Ajay Mane & Ajay Belekar', '', '', '', '', 'yes', 'na', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2964_0.jpeg', ''),
(2590, '2026-01-06 17:16:10', 2495, 'EMT', 'checked the connection in 1.2 lab  shifted Micro yellow room DI plant to 1.2 lab  \\r\\n                                                                                                                        \\r\\n                                       .', 'The Shifting was lead by Vinayak sir, \\r\\nthe wet bench was shifting and connections were done by facility team\\r\\nwater connection was done by Vinayak sir\\r\\nthe power connection was done by Rhifa \\r\\nthe DI water plant is dispensing water( working fine),', 'Rhifa, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2862, '2026-01-06 17:35:35', 2495, 'EMT', 'spinner found very dirty , resist was stick to the sides of the spinner\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n                                                                                                                                 .', 'disconnected the spinner by disconnecting its vacuum and exhaust connections . brought it to bms room . opened the spinner lid and removed the foil . cleaned the sides with IPA, lint free cloth, scotch bright .leaned the chuck with Acetone and Scotch bright . opened the CDA line and cleaned using IPA and lint free .opened the spinner backside and cleaned the vacuum line . reassembled the the spinner . reinstalled it in Nano litho lab by connecting the power connection , exhaust line , cda line . with help of hemant sir did a test run the spinner is working fine .', 'Rhifa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2965, '2026-01-06 17:35:52', 2017, '', 'Visual inspection to be done &amp; details to be updated in troubleshooting module - smoke detector,MCP,Fire blanket, Spill kit,Fire Extinguisher &amp; label checking. New building GF &amp; Annex GF,1st,2nd flr, Renovation work checking at Micro 1 lab, 4th floor, 7th floor, 1st floor.', 'safety round up from 7th floor to ground floor at new bldg, annexe bldg 2nd floor to ground floor. checking new bldg fire panel, annexe bldg fire panel, GLD panel.\\r\\nChecking M1,M2,old chemical storage room,chemical storage room,M1 ahu room,Wet chemistry lab, M2,Nano service corridor, M1 service corridor, Nano ups room,M1ups room,N2plant,MBE AHU room, MBE service corridor.\\r\\nMonitering BMS room & Nano fire panel, GLD panel,New bldg fire panel.\\r\\nCCTV checking', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2965_0.pdf', ''),
(2861, '2026-01-06 17:39:34', 2515, 'EMT', 'Servicing of General Purpose Spinner                                                                                                                                                                         .', 'Turned off the power supply and disconnected the power cord. Removed the vacuum line, CDA line, and drain line. Shifted the spinner from the Nano Litho Lab to the BMS room. Opened the spinner lid and removed the dirty aluminum foil. Removed the chuck and the thermal tape from the spinner. Cleaned the chuck using IPA, scrub pad, and a lint-free cloth. Cleaned the internal side area of the spinner. Cleaned the vacuum valve assembly. Opened the bottom cover and cleaned the sensor-side connector. After cleaning, reassembled all the parts properly. Shifted the spinner back from the BMS room to the Nano Litho Lab. Connected the vacuum line, CDA line, and drain line, then connected the power cord. Turn ON the power supply. Spinner display ON but showing vacuum issue. Checked the vacuum pump and found a faulty wire connection and vacuum line on the diaphragm pump side in the Nano Lab service corridor. Checked correct cable and testing by DMM. It was showing 230VAC. Vacuum line testing by CDA pressure. Corrected the wire connection and vacuum line, then turned ON the power supply again. The vacuum pump started working properly. Tested a dummy sample by Hemant Sir and confirmed that the spinner is working fine. Inform SO Hemant Sir for using.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2861_1.pdf', ''),
(2906, '2026-01-06 17:39:52', 2495, 'EMT', 'Someone has used Spinner in 1.2 lab and not cleaned at all\\r\\n                                                                                                  \\r\\n                                            .', 'Someone has used Spinner in 1.2 lab and not cleaned at all, even the chuck is not cleaned which may cause clog and may not hold samples, hence performed a simple test with Shahiroz ma\\\'am run the spinner is working fine and required vacuum is obtained.', 'Rhifa , Shahiroz maam', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2906, '2026-01-06 17:43:03', 2495, 'EMT', 'Someone has used Spinner in 1.2 lab and not cleaned at all\\r\\n\\r\\n                                                                                                                                            .', 'Someone has used Spinner in 1.2 lab and not cleaned at all, even the chuck is not cleaned which may cause clog and may not hold samples, hence performed a simple test  run with Shahiroz mam the spinner is working fine and required vacuum is obtained.', 'Rhifa , Shahiroz maam', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2960, '2026-01-06 17:48:07', 726, 'AHU Chiller', 'Water leakage from ALD LL water manifold in Nano 1 lab, and water seen under the carpet near Rapid Thermal Process (RTP) tool, complaint raised by anjum maam on date 5 December 2026...................', 'ALD system shutdown by SO, Closed the main valve from nano main manifold, removed the faulty valve and blocked the faulty valve port, turned on the main valve and checked the leakage, keep under observation for 30 minute after inform SO.', 'Abhay/Amit', '', '', '', '', '1/2\\\" brass block', 'Already in facility Stock', 'NA', '06-01-2026', '', '', 'uploads/2960_0.pptx', 'Work has been done.'),
(2956, '2026-01-06 18:42:12', 2457, 'EMT', 'New ALD Gas panel door interlock issue.                                                                                                                                                                                          .', '1. As per mail from ALD engineer it was suggested to bypass the gas panel door interlock by shorting pin 3 and 4.\\r\\n2. after bypassing gas panel door signal turns to green indicating door is closed after shorting the 3rd and 4th pins.\\r\\n3. shorted 5th and 6th pin to reset the alarm.\\r\\n4. alarm gone as we short the 5th and 6h pin.\\r\\n5. added insulation tape to cover the pins.\\r\\n6. Door interlock cable kept separated.\\r\\n7. system kept on pumping.\\r\\n8. System owner (SO) ran headspace purge recipe.\\r\\n9. headspace purge recipe done and system is working fine.', 'Pradeep sir and Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'SO ran one headspace purge recipe and system is working fine.'),
(2656, '2026-01-06 20:10:33', 2495, 'EMT', 'After Facility connections done by facility team - power, exhaust Cr/Au vacuum test was done\\r\\n                                                                                                             \\r\\n.', 'Please refer to the attached document                                                                                                                                                                                              .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2656_2.pdf', ''),
(2815, '2026-01-07 00:19:35', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Micro yellow room inside we have 3 smoke detector number:-47,48,49, 2 are in service corridor and 1 in MYR gown area SD no is 58, and Micro-1 inside we have 50,51,52,53,54,55, also we have inside lab hooters are there.', 'Today Nigth shift also update the status of Smoke detector in safety portal device list, All smoke detector colour is Red ( not working) Green is for working. due to renovation work is going on MYR and M-1,old chemical storage room side, temporary base Smoke detector are removing work done by akshy team, also we can checked that Sd colour is changed in safety portal. please find the attachments belows.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2815_1.pptx', ''),
(2967, '2026-01-07 00:26:37', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) 4th floor and 3rd floor Fire extinguisher ( ABC and CO2 )monthly checking work.\\r\\n02.) Micro-1/MYR lab inside and Micro-2, wet chemistry lab, main corridor,HSK staff, smoke detector checking work.\\r\\n03.) ALL form update daily. ( HR portal,safety blog,troubleshooting module update.)\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty in night shift.', '01.) 4th floor corridor side and 3rd floor near hose box side I checked FE abc and CO2 type I found some extinguisher is low pressure and fews are near by high pressure, all this type of FE needs to be hand over to FSo departments. every floor one or two ABC type FE is going to be discards due to low and over pressure.\\r\\n02.) Today night shift i update the status of smoke detector in MYR and M-1 lab due to renovation work is going on i changed smoke detector colour ( Red means not working) ones work is completed safety team fixed back the smoke detector at the place i changed the status to green, M-2, main corridor,wet chemistry lab, HSk staff, all smoke detector are working fine and also status update in safety portal device list. please find the attachments below.\\r\\n03.) ALL form update daily. ( HR portal,safety blog,troubleshooting module update.)\\r\\n04.)  BMS desk duty in night shift.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2967_0.pptx', ''),
(2966, '2026-01-07 00:35:43', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'today night shift i checked Annex side main fire panel near nano gown area its showing 34 faults in display, all faults is for MYR and M-1 lab, m-2 lab and wet chemistry lab chemical cabinets are off, sash is closed, GLD few are working fews are OFF, Same for Nano and nano litho , Nano-2 inside lab, Auto shut off valve are still not connected in few cabinets, Gld panels needs to be program all GLD disable mode needs to be in active mode, Nano new building main fire panel showing same 34 faults,\\r\\n1st floor GLD panels also showing some card faults, 4.1 and 7th floor renovation work is going on and sd are cover by taped, ground floor to 3rd floor total 09 fire panel is in healthy mode, All Novec cylindre needs to be connected, 4th floor all material found in passage area, 7th floor so many dust found in all corridor and staircase side, 7th floor,5th floor.4th floor.1st floor back side staircase is block by materials needs to be removed,\\r\\nMBE AHU side Micro-2 emergency exit door is block by materials needs to be removed.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
