(2963, '2026-01-07 10:46:20', 297, 'sandeep', 'This ticket  has been discussed in todays Morning Meeting. \\r\\nConcern was raised saying, once olympus is shifted there will be no space for emergency door to open.  Shahizore need to check if emergency door can be opened after olympus shifting.', 'Pintu has been assigned this task. Wet bench needs to be aligned followed by power connection exhaust connection tap water RO water PN2 supply needs to be provided                                                          .', 'sandeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '21-01-2026', '', 'pintu', '', ''),
