(2961, '2026-01-07 12:05:44', 89, 'EMT', 'The issue was reported by Prabhat on call. \\r\\nOn checking the system is was found the RIE chamber low vac (5e-2 Torr) was not reached. SO aborted and tried to do the pumping again, still did not work\\r\\n    .', 'Troubleshooting done as follows:\\r\\n1. Aborted the pumping\\r\\n2. Chamber vent was done\\r\\n3. Pump down chamber\\r\\n3. Again chamber vent was done\\r\\n4. Chamber pump down\\r\\nStill the issue was not resolved.\\r\\nSo RIE chamber shut down command through software done and started Low Vac, completed within a couple of mins (5E-2 Torr - low vac)\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue resolved from EMT side.', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Shubhankar and Prabhat Prajapati were present during the troubleshooting\\r\\n\\r\\nWork completed on Jan 6 2026'),
(2956, '2026-01-07 12:11:25', 89, 'EMT', '1. As per mail from ALD engineer it was suggested to bypass the gas panel door interlock by shorting pin 3 and 4.\\r\\n2. after bypassing gas panel door signal turns to green indicating door is closed after shorting the 3rd and 4th pins.\\r\\n3. shorted 5th and 6th pin to reset the alarm.\\r\\n4. alarm gone as we short the 5th and 6h pin.\\r\\n5. added insulation tape to cover the pins.\\r\\n6. Door interlock cable kept separated.\\r\\n7. system kept on pumping.\\r\\n8. System owner (SO) ran headspace purge recipe.\\r\\n9. headspace purge recipe done and system is working fine.', 'The issue of Gas Panel Interlock error was resolved and the chamber pump down, headspace purge was done by the Mamta & Mansi.\\r\\nAfter that H2S gas evacuation has been done.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe reported issue has been resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor the Dry Pump issue, please refer to the complaint ID 2801 / 2795', 'Pradeep, Avinash', 'ALD support', 'ALDSUPPORT@veeco.com', 'Very good', 'NA', '', '', '', '28-02-2026', 'The sensor quotation sent by ALD support. Cost is USD 285 for 2nos.\\r\\nPurchase form filled.', '', '', 'Purchase team to process PO for the same.'),
