(1868, '2026-01-07 12:37:04', 89, 'EMT', 'Installation of the New Microscope is planned on Jan 8 2026\\r\\nEmail has been sent to the vendor with the plan of action from vendor\\\'s side and preparation from IITBNF side\\r\\n\\r\\nAs per our understanding the following will be done:\\r\\n1. Microscope will be delivered on the same day Jan 8 2026\\r\\n2. It will be unpacked and installed by the Application Engineer\\r\\n3. Microscope installation, qualification, calibration, etc will be done\\r\\n4. Training to IITBNF team will be done for operation, basic calibration and initial level troubleshooting\\r\\n5. IITBNF team will do handson operation and do sample measurements\\r\\n\\r\\nPreparation from IITBNF side:\\r\\n1. Table for the Microscope and PC\\r\\n2. PC for installing the Microscope PC with Win 10\\r\\n3. Power socket for Microscope (1no), PCs (2nos)', 'Checklist and planning from IITBNF team was sent to all the team heads as below:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs per our understanding the following will be done:\\r\\n1. Microscope will be delivered on the same day Jan 8 2026\\r\\n2. It will be unpacked and installed by the Application Engineer\\r\\n3. Microscope installation, qualification, calibration, etc will be done\\r\\n4. Training to IITBNF team will be done for operation, basic calibration and initial level troubleshooting\\r\\n5. IITBNF team will do handson operation and do sample measurements\\r\\n\\r\\nPreparation from IITBNF side:\\r\\n1. Table for the Microscope and PC\\r\\n2. PC for installing the Microscope PC with Win 10\\r\\n3. Power socket for Microscope (1no), PCs (2nos)', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '09-01-2026', 'All team heads to work on the action plan', '', '', ''),
