(2940, '2026-01-09 11:10:09', 2521, 'Electrical facility', 'New building UPS 1 (MBE UPS) is generating abnormal fan noise and vibration during the operation, observed 1 nos.8 inch and 2 nos. 3 inch fans were not working. also we observed 4 nos 8 inch fans have vibration and there is nominal noise coming from UPS 1 transformer.', '1)UPS abnormal fan was replaced on dated 02/01/26 with spare old UPS fan. Now there is  no any fan abnormalities.\\r\\nHowever, after restarting the UPS, the system is frequently displaying the “Internal Fault 30” alarm.\\r\\n\\r\\n2)As discussed with the Riello UPS service engineer, the issue is suspected to be related to the system control card and DSP card, which may require replacement.\\r\\n\\r\\n3)UPS is working in normal operation.\\r\\n\\r\\n4)The Riello UPS engineer will visit 06/01/26 to inspect the system in detail and identify the exact root cause of the issue, and to confirm the requirement for card replacement.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease find attached field service report for your reference and suspected card picture.', 'Omkar & Pintu, sanjay', 'Riello india pvt limited', 'Mohan-7290027838\\r\\nKIrappa-9820055934', 'Good', 'The Riello UPS engineer will visit 06/01/26 to inspect the system in detail and identify the exact root cause of the issue, and to confirm the requirement for card replacement.', 'Used UPS old spare fan', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'UPS abnormal fan was replaced on dated 02/01/26 with spare old UPS fan.', 'Swapnil', 'uploads/2940_0.jpg', 'The Riello UPS engineer will visit 06/01/26 to inspect the system in detail and identify the exact root cause of the issue, and to confirm the requirement for card replacement.'),
