(3054, '2026-01-09 14:57:05', 726, 'AHU and Chiller Team', '1) Reduce downtime of all AHUs. \\r\\n2) Reduce downtime of all Chillers.\\r\\n3) AHU Chiller preventive maintenance of every 3 Month\\r\\n4) Clean room validation ( particle count, filter integrated test, room 5) Pressure balancing) every 3 month\\r\\n6) PPMS New Chiller Installation.\\r\\n7) Micro 1 Chiller Installation in M2 Lab.\\r\\n8) Tower AC Installation in Micro 2 Lab.\\r\\n9) Maintain Lab temperature & humidity\\r\\n10) Maintain data logger to monitor lab temperature & humidity\\r\\n11) Goal is to increase more work done internally by team asp in 12) light of budget.\\r\\n13) Preparation of PM report.\\r\\n14) Documentation of AHU & chiller related troubleshooting SOPs\\r\\n15) Support in all Facility & Lab related tasks as and when require Upcoming Plan. \\r\\n16) Support and planning of new facility tools \\r\\n17) Managing spare part inventory for critical time like- AHU chiller\\r\\n18) Drier, expansion valve IR reading every month.\\r\\n19) Chiller shed planning of which chiller have required.\\r\\n20) Support in making new clean room micro 1 & micro yellow room.\\r\\n21) Nano Lab AHU outdoor unit replacement.\\r\\n22) Tools water filters replacement.', '1) Reduce downtime of all AHUs. \\r\\n2) Reduce downtime of all Chillers.\\r\\n3) AHU Chiller preventive maintenance of every 3 Month\\r\\n4) Clean room validation ( particle count, filter integrated test, room 5) Pressure balancing) every 3 month\\r\\n6) PPMS New Chiller Installation.\\r\\n7) Micro 1 Chiller Installation in M2 Lab.\\r\\n8) Tower AC Installation in Micro 2 Lab.\\r\\n9) Maintain Lab temperature & humidity\\r\\n10) Maintain data logger to monitor lab temperature & humidity\\r\\n11) Goal is to increase more work done internally by team asp in 12) light of budget.\\r\\n13) Preparation of PM report.\\r\\n14) Documentation of AHU & chiller related troubleshooting SOPs\\r\\n15) Support in all Facility & Lab related tasks as and when require Upcoming Plan. \\r\\n16) Support and planning of new facility tools \\r\\n17) Managing spare part inventory for critical time like- AHU chiller\\r\\n18) Drier, expansion valve IR reading every month.\\r\\n19) Chiller shed planning of which chiller have required.\\r\\n20) Support in making new clean room micro 1 & micro yellow room.\\r\\n21) Nano Lab AHU outdoor unit replacement.\\r\\n22) Tools water filters replacement.', 'AHU Team', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '09-01-2026', '', '', '', 'AHU Chiller Team goal is set for 2026.'),
