(3020, '2026-01-09 17:53:05', 2457, 'EMT', 'ICPRIE New Rough vacuum is done\\r\\nNow high vacuum testing needs to be done, But Turbo Pump controller having issues, giving error (E698) and warning(F007).                                                  .', 'ICPRIE New turbo pump update.\\r\\n\\r\\n1.  Removed the power cable of the turbo controller and took it out.\\r\\n2.  Remove the connections from the PCB and clean it with IPA and Lint-free.\\r\\n3. Apply some heat through the heat gun.\\r\\n4. Check the voltage outside before connecting it to the system.\\r\\n5. Connected it back to the system.\\r\\n6. Waited for 10 minutes to observe the E698, no error occurred.\\r\\n7. Open the PN2 valve.\\r\\n8. Turn on the turbo.\\r\\n9. No warning (F007) has been observed.\\r\\n10. Turbo at full speed 630 Hz in 6 minutes and current 1.25A\\r\\n11. Click on MPE to see the penning gauge vacuum and it was 1.52E-5 mbar.\\r\\n12. Open the VSK valve of the Load Lock chamber and it was 22 Pa in 3 minutes from 503 Pa.', 'Avinash and Pradeep sir and Pfeiffer Engineer Rajendra sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3020_0.jpeg', 'Turbo controller working fine and no issue observed.'),
(3060, '2026-01-09 17:54:03', 1173, '', '1) 1st run was completed with parameters of 900 sccm O2, 900 degree, 90 sec , quarter Si wafer. \\r\\n2)  2nd run was completed with parameters of 900 sccm O2, 900 degree, 120 sec , quarter Si wafer.                                                      .', '1) 1st run was completed with parameters of 900 sccm O2, 900 degree, 90 sec , quarter Si wafer. \\r\\n2)  2nd run was completed with parameters of 900 sccm O2, 900 degree, 120 sec , quarter Si wafer.                                                               .', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Slot completed'),
(3045, '2026-01-09 17:54:15', 279, 'EMT', 'White powder forming in PECVD process chamber.                                          .                                    .                                .                                    .             .', '1. Process chamber N2 purging done.\\r\\n2. Process chamber vented.\\r\\n3. Removed gas shower\\r\\n4. Gas shower dip in H2S 6;1 solution by Shubankar\\r\\n5. The PECVD gas shower  head deep in chemical for two days as per Ajit sir\\r\\n6. Chamber pumped down', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3045_0.jpeg', ''),
