(3081, '2026-01-09 18:00:11', 2378, '', 'inventory listing of the Godrej cupboard was continued in first half. in second half, we had general discussion about Proxima tools action item for me with SOs and Deepti Madam. \\r\\nthen, after meeting, started to list issues reported in offline logbook of Proxima tool (1-5-25 onwards)', 'inventory listing of the Godrej cupboard was continued in first half. in second half, we had general discussion about Proxima tools action item for me with SOs and Deepti Madam. \\r\\nthen, after meeting, started to list issues reported in offline logbook of Proxima tool (1-5-25 onwards)', 'karuna Nyaupane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'inventory list and logbook issue sheet are shared with respective people'),
(3046, '2026-01-09 18:04:34', 2457, 'EMT', 'To find the leak in the Process chamber connected gas lines.                                                                                                                                                        .', 'ICPRIE NEW todays update.\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Closed the throttle valve.\\r\\n2. Turn off the turbo pump.\\r\\n3. Waited for turbo to decrease to 0 Hz from 620 Hz.\\r\\n4. Closed the VVV valve.\\r\\n5. Removed the VCR blank flange from Left and Right side of the process chamber \\r\\n6. Let the chamber vent.\\r\\n7. Connected back the N2 gas line to the Left and Right side of the process chamber.\\r\\n8. Block the gas line with female VCR fitting which was connected to the high pressure diaphragm sealed valve.\\r\\n9. After lunch I will check whether there is a leak in the N2 gas lines connected to the process chamber.\\r\\n10. Before turning off the turbo pump vacuum was 1.4E-5 mbar.\\r\\n11. Opened the VVV valve and throttle valve, MVV pressure is fine 15 Pa compared to previous pressure which was to be 611 Pa.\\r\\n12. Gas line till high pressure diaphragm valve is ok, no leaks.\\r\\n13. MVV - 14.6 Pa.\\r\\n14. Turn ON the turbo.\\r\\n15. Turbo at full speed 630Hz.\\r\\n16.  Penning gauge - 1.48E-5mbar.', 'Avinash and Pradeep sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3046_0.jpeg', 'Blocked the gas line till high pressure diaphragm  valve with VCR blank flange and check the MVV forleine pressure and it was Ok also check the high vacuum and it was also Ok.'),
