(3047, '2026-01-09 19:34:33', 2457, 'EMT and Process', 'Training on PDS tool as per update SOP with Shilpa ji and Minita ji.                                                                                                                                    .', 'On 08-01-2026, Thursday\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Went to 1.1 lab on PDS Tool.\\r\\n2. taken the softcopy of the updated SOP with me.\\r\\n3. before starting the process, Process chamber vacuum was 5.20E-5 Torr.\\r\\n4. Started the process as per updated SOP.\\r\\n5. At 6th step, \\\"c\\\" point about the gas flow, when shilpa ji set the PH3 gas flow to 60 sccm, present value was not showing 60 sccm, to which chamber pressure was also fluctuating.\\r\\n6.  she has a concerns that, she has to assume it by pressure value that the gas is introduce or not.\\r\\n7. I have cleared her that we have issues with the MFC fluctuations and with baratron gauge.\\r\\n8. We continued with the process and set the source power, adjust the APC position and set Bias power.\\r\\n9. Used the stopwatch to count the time for the process.\\r\\n10. after running the manually set recipe, plasma strike and wafer broke inside the process chamber.\\r\\n11. We stop the process.\\r\\n12. Shilpa ji has some queries and doubt regarding to chamber pressure and APC position mode and MFC fluctuation to which i told her we have to look into the external gauge as baratron gauge is not working and mail has bee sent to OEM.\\r\\n13. Shilpa ji will mail regarding to the queries she had.', 'Avinash and Shilpa ji and Minita ji.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3047, '2026-01-09 20:00:37', 2457, 'EMT and Process', 'Training on PDS tool as per update SOP with Shilpa ji and Minita ji.                                                                                                                                                  .', 'Today 09-01-2025, Friday\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Today plans was to clean the Process chamber and Load Lock chamber as sample wafer was broken while in process.\\r\\n2. Closed the gate valve manually.\\r\\n3. Turned off the turbo pump manually.\\r\\n4. Manually vented the Process chamber by purging the PN2 gas to process chamber 20 times. for eg:- purging the PN2 gas and then opening the rough valve of the process chamber to remove the toxic gases, repeated this step for 20 times.\\r\\n5. again purge the PN2 gas into the process chamber until the external gauge controller showed the 720 mbar, to open the process chamber lid.\\r\\n6. g\\r\\nGauge controller reach to 720 mbar and we, opened the process chamber lid.\\r\\n7.  removed the broken sample wafer with tweezer and collected it in lint-free cloth..\\r\\n8. Started cleaning the process chamber and Load Lock chamber with Vacuum cleaner, IPA, Scoth-brite  and Lint-free cloth.\\r\\n9. Once done with the cleaning of the both the chambers.\\r\\n10. Closed both the chamber lids.\\r\\n11. Kept the Load Lock chamber for Low vacuum, Low vacuum completed.\\r\\n12. kept the process chamber for pumping manually by taking the rough vacuum>opening the gate valve and turning on the turbo pump.\\r\\n13. Achieved high vacuum 8.49E-5 Torr in 17 minutes.\\r\\n14. Told Shilpa ji and Minita ji to start with the training but they were not able to follow the current updated SOP.\\r\\n15. They ask for the New Updated SOP as Ajit sir as mailed about it.', 'Avinash and Shilpa ji and Minita ji.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3042, '2026-01-09 20:05:02', 2457, 'EMT and Process', 'While doing the manually updated SOP runs sample wafer got broke inside the process chamber.                                                                                                                 .', 'PDS Tool.\\r\\nToday 09-01-2025, Friday\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Today plans was to clean the Process chamber and Load Lock chamber as sample wafer was broken while in process.\\r\\n2. Closed the gate valve manually.\\r\\n3. Turned off the turbo pump manually.\\r\\n4. Manually vented the Process chamber by purging the PN2 gas to process chamber 20 times. for eg:- purging the PN2 gas and then opening the rough valve of the process chamber to remove the toxic gases, repeated this step for 20 times.\\r\\n5. again purge the PN2 gas into the process chamber until the external gauge controller showed the 720 mbar, to open the process chamber lid.\\r\\n6. Gauge controller reach to 720 mbar and we, opened the process chamber lid.\\r\\n7.  removed the broken sample wafer with tweezer and collected it in lint-free cloth..\\r\\n8. Started cleaning the process chamber and Load Lock chamber with Vacuum cleaner, IPA, Scoth-brite  and Lint-free cloth.\\r\\n9. Once done with the cleaning of the both the chambers.\\r\\n10. Closed both the chamber lids.\\r\\n11. Kept the Load Lock chamber for Low vacuum, Low vacuum completed.\\r\\n12. kept the process chamber for pumping manually by taking the rough vacuum>opening the gate valve and turning on the turbo pump.\\r\\n13. Achieved high vacuum 8.49E-5 Torr in 17 minutes.\\r\\n14. Told Shilpa ji and Minita ji to start with the training but they were not able to follow the current updated SOP.\\r\\n15. They ask for the New Updated SOP as Ajit sir as mailed about it.', 'Avinash and Shilpa ji and Minita ji.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3052, '2026-01-09 20:08:58', 2457, 'EMT', 'Turbo controller issue giving error (E698) and warning(F007) issue while checking high vacuum.                                                                                                                                     .', 'ICPRIE New turbo pump update.\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Removed the power cable of the turbo controller and took it out.\\r\\n2. Remove the connections from the PCB and clean it with IPA and Lint-free.\\r\\n3. Apply some heat through the heat gun.\\r\\n4. Check the voltage outside before connecting it to the system.\\r\\n5. Connected it back to the system.\\r\\n6. Waited for 10 minutes to observe the E698, no error occurred.\\r\\n7. Open the PN2 valve.\\r\\n8. Turn on the turbo.\\r\\n9. Turbo at full speed 630 Hz in 6 minutes and current 1.25A', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3052_0.jpeg', ''),
(3052, '2026-01-09 20:16:12', 2457, 'EMT', 'High vacuum check.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             .', '1. After turbo controller error and warning issue resolved.\\r\\n2. kept the process chamber for pumping high vacuum.\\r\\n3. achieved high vacuum 1.52E-5 mbar in 22 minutes.\\r\\n4. turbo speed - 630 Hz.\\r\\n5. turbo current - 1.28 A.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3052_1.jpeg', ''),
(3052, '2026-01-09 20:21:37', 2457, 'EMT', 'Gas Line check.                                                                                                                                                                                         .', 'ICPRIE NEW.\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Closed the throttle valve.\\r\\n2. Turn off the turbo pump.\\r\\n3. Waited for turbo to decrease to 0 hz from 620 Hz.\\r\\n4. Closed the VVV valve.\\r\\n5. Removed the VCR blank flange from Left and Right side of the process chamber \\r\\n6. Let the chamber vent.\\r\\n7. Connected back the N2 gas line to the Left and Right side of the process chamber.\\r\\n8. Block the gas line with female VCR fitting which was connected to the high pressure diaphragm sealed valve.\\r\\n9. After lunch I will check weather there is a leak in the N2 gas lines connected to the process chamber.\\r\\nBefore turning off the turbo pump vacuum was 1.4E-5 mbar.\\r\\n10. Opened the VVV valve and throttle valve, MVV pressure is fine 15 Pa compared to previous pressure which was to be 611 Pa.\\r\\n11. Gas line till high pressure diaphragm valve is ok, no leaks.\\r\\n12. MVV - 14.6 Pa.\\r\\n13. Turn ON the turbo.\\r\\n14. Turbo at full speed 630Hz.\\r\\n15. Penning gauge - 1.48E-5mbar.\\r\\n16. Kept the Process chamber for high vacuum.\\r\\n17. Before turning off the turbo high vacuum was 1.47E-5 mbar.\\r\\n18. Throttle valve close.\\r\\n19. Turbo turned off.\\r\\n20. VVV valve close.', 'Avinash and Pradeep sir.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3095, '2026-01-09 23:06:47', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'In Night shift Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Today night shift when i was in safety round all labs and floor found still materials lying on the floor, BMS room emergency exit door block, Safety table upper side wires,tape,and so many material found, near SCBA side found IT team camera and wires needs to be remove from the area, BMS room needs to be clean.annex and new building side found so many dust in staircase side and main corridor area where renovation work is going on. 9 fire panels is in healthy mode, main fire panel showing faults in display. so many passbox is full by materials needs be remove from the passbox.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3095_0.pptx', ''),
