(3104, '2026-01-10 23:14:20', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'In Night shift Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Today night shift when i was in safety round i found 7.1 lab inside all cylinder not chain and dust on the floor, i update PPT, annex and new building safety device working fine, all 09 fire panel is in healthy mode. All sash are closed, chemical cabinet door are closed, UPS room battery 100%,,cylinder are chain, emergency exit door space are open, GLD panel working fine.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3104_0.pptx', ''),
(3105, '2026-01-10 23:19:03', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) 2D lab inside GLD checking work.\\r\\n\\r\\n02.) Ec lab and MCl server room smoke detector checking work.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.) All from update work daily.( Hr portal,safety blog,troubleshooting module update).\\r\\n\\r\\n04.)BMS desk duty in night shift.', '01.) 2D lab inside GLD are OFF H2 and H2s gas both found OFF status update in safety portal device list ( previous month H2S working right now its was off) I update status in portal and also colour change to red its means not working.\\r\\n\\r\\n02.) Ec lab and MCl server room smoke detector checking work done status update in safety portal device list comment section all Sd are working fine.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.)All from update work daily.( Hr portal,safety blog,troubleshooting module update).\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n04.) BMS desk duty in night shift.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
