(3109, '2026-01-11 23:49:22', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'In Night shift Safety round annex and new building all labs, chemical cabinet door checking open or not, wet bench sample expiry checking,safety device checking, all fire panels,GLD panels,cylinder chain,smoke detector,etc.', 'Today night shift i found that Annex side entrance door side many dust coming from the main door side i capture the image please find the attachments below. ground floor labs all safety device are working fine and no sample is expiry, all chemical cabinets are closed, sash are closed, tools are working fine, only Nano lab DI water tank showing error A10 is showing on display of Di water tank. \\r\\nNano new building side both main fire panel showing 34 faults due to safety device are dissconnected in MYR and M-1 lab, both GLD panels working fine but so many device still not active, Auto shut off valve not connected, remains safety device working fine.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3109_0.jfif', ''),
