(3111, '2026-01-12 00:06:32', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', '01.) all form update daily.( HR portal,safety blog, Troubleshooting module,)\\r\\n\\r\\n02.) BMS desk duty in night shift.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.) Di water tank provide to student in nano litho lab.\\r\\n\\r\\n04.) Help to raju sir to update PPMS chiller report in trouble shooting module today night shift.', '01.) all form update daily work done.( HR portal,safety blog, Troubleshooting module,)\\r\\n\\r\\n02.)BMS desk duty in night shift checking CCVT camera.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.)  from micro-2 wet chemistry lab provide 2 bottel DI water to student in  Nano litho lab for there process used please find the images below.\\r\\n\\r\\n04.) I help to Facility team Raju sir updating  troubleshooting module', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3111_0.jfif', ''),
