(3044, '2026-01-13 18:13:17', 189, 'Process team', 'She has sent us the SEM images on 12th Jan and the dimensions of the features are as follows:\\r\\nFeature size -- Ellipse size (d1=95nm, d2=135nm) and spacing between two ellipses = 236nm. \\r\\nNo, this is not the first time; I have observed this merging 4–5 times.', 'We have replied asking her further details:\\r\\n1. Sample details used for these patterning\\r\\n2. Resist and Dose used for the patterning\\r\\n3. GDS file.\\r\\nThe SEM image is attached below', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'After receiving the details, we will perform the same pattering by ourselves to validate the issue.', 'Anjum', 'uploads/3044_1.docx', ''),
