(3121, '2026-01-14 10:29:28', 2457, 'EMT and Oxford Engineers', 'Helium (He) leak and RF fluctuation in 3mtorr recipe \\\"Ox SiC trial conductive clamping pre-stable\\\".    .', '1.With Oxford engineers.\\r\\n2. Stop process chamber pumping.\\r\\n3. Stop load lock pumping.\\r\\n4. Vented process chamber.\\r\\n5. Started the process chamber cleaning with scotch brite, lint free clothes and IPA.\\r\\n6. Cleaned the chamber lid with scotch brite, Lint free clothes and IPA.\\r\\n7. As process chamber low side was hard coated with the layers.\\r\\n8. Cleaned the low side of process chamber with little amount of ACETONE and scotch brite and IPA. (We use little amount of ACETONE, because it may cause o ring to loose strengthens and take chamber a little bit more time for pumping).\\r\\n9. After cleaning the lid and walls of the low side of the process chamber).\\r\\n10. Cleaned the outer ring and  sacrificial ring\\\'s inner side and outer side with scotch brite, IPA and Lint-free cloth.\\r\\n11. After cleaning, arranged the sacrificial ring and outer ring to its position and aligned the sacrificial ring properly with respective ESC.\\r\\n12. Then, Oxford engineer manual check the position of the wafer with respective to ESC while both the chamber lid was opened.\\r\\n13. Tried this 2-3 times manually checking of the position of the wafer with respective to the ESC while both the chambers lid was opened.\\r\\n14. After checking, set the alignment of the wafer and ESC fix and close both the lids.\\r\\n15. Kept the chamber for pumping.\\r\\n16. After lunch, we calibrate the capacitance nanometer gauge/baratron gauge.\\r\\n17. As Oxford engineer notice there is a increase in the He pressure i.e. 100-120 mtorr.\\r\\n18. He started with the zeroing calibration of the capacitance', 'Avinash and Sateesh ji, Aakash ji and Anurag', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3121_0.docx', 'Results:- after zeroing the gauge and ESC time increased to 10sec from 8sec no fluctuation seen.'),
(3086, '2026-01-14 12:13:51', 89, 'IT', 'Email was sent to IT team to look into this issue on Jan 13 2026\\r\\n                                  .', 'As per email from IT team, the issue has been resolved by Priyanka on Jan 13 2026\\r\\nSO to check the same and report back if it is not working', 'Priyanka', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
