(1868, '2026-01-14 14:19:38', 2495, 'EMT and Facility', 'Installation of the High Magnification Optical Microscope in IITBNF lab                                                             .', 'The engineer arrived and delivered the package at 9:00 AM on 8th January 2026. After unboxing, the microscope was shifted to the Nano-2 Lab for installation.\\r\\nThe engineer then started the assembly of the microscope. Switch board connection was done by facility team.  A computer and CPU were brought from the office for the microscope installation. The microscope was connected to the PC, and the required software was downloaded and installed on the system.\\r\\nAfter software installation, the engineer carried out the calibration of the microscope. Once the calibration process was completed, the engineer provided a detailed explanation of the microscope operation and usage procedure to the process team( Pankaj sir, Shilpa mam)', 'Rhifa , Raj', 'Pavan kumar', '8309275866', 'Good', '.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3128, '2026-01-14 14:27:49', 2521, 'FACILITY', 'UPS daily reading for NB UPS-1 output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) to be updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'The link to the document is : https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1JzWzABbYlmJwyZl4nRzvyuCuScwx_MMytbTbcHudCLE/edit?usp=sharing', 'SANJAY & omkar', '', '', '', '', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'UPS daily reading for NB UPS-1 output load (%VA) ,System temperature (TS), Rectifier temperature(TR), Invertor temperature(TI) updated in electrical facility reading log.', 'swapnil', '', ''),
