(3116, '2026-01-14 14:43:13', 2495, 'EMT and Facility', 'for SiN deposition in ICPCVD.There was SiH4 gas flow error popup. It has been checked from facility side cylinder is Open and valve inside the lab is also open. checked and found the CDA pressure is dropped to 5.6 bar( should be 6 bar ) requested facility team to increase the cda pressure , after that checked and found the cda pressure is back to 6 bar, hemant sir tried performing a test run with SiN set at 5sccm and started the process ,CDA pressure dropped from 6 bar to 5.6 bar hence decreasing the SiN flow', 'for SiN deposition in ICPCVD.There was SiH4 gas flow error popup. It has been checked from facility side cylinder is Open and valve inside the lab is also open. checked and found the CDA pressure is dropped to 5.6 bar( should be 6 bar ) requested facility team to increase the cda pressure , after that checked and found the cda pressure is back to 6 bar, hemant sir tried performing a test run with SiN set at 5sccm and started the process ,CDA pressure dropped from 6 bar to 5.6 bar hence decreasing the SiN flow', 'Rhifa, Arvind (facility)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
