(3178, '2026-01-15 12:15:10', 2457, 'EMT and Oxford Engineers', 'Helium (He) leak and RF fluctuation in 3mtorr recipe \\\"Ox SiC trial conductive clamping pre-stable\\\"..', 'DRIE-SIC COBRA update.\\r\\nDay 3\\r\\nToday 14-01-2026\\r\\n\\r\\n1.	First, we check the leak up rate of the process chamber and it was ok with 0.139 mTorr/min.\\r\\n 2.	Loaded the dummy sample.\\r\\n3.	Ran \\\"Ox O2 clean/warmup recipe\\\" for 25 minutes.\\r\\n•	He - 1.8sccm, table RF - 0.7w(50w).\\r\\n•	No, He and Table RF fluctuation seen.\\r\\n     4.	On dummy sample.\\r\\n5.	Ran 3 mtorr \\\"Ox SiC trial 1 conductive clamping pre-stable original\\\" for 1hr30 minutes.\\r\\n•	For Cl2, Ar,\\r\\nHe - 1.5sccm, table RF - 1.0w(100w)\\r\\n•	For Sf6, O2\\r\\nHe - 2.3-3 sccm, Table RF - 4.8w(500w)\\r\\n•	Wafer was stable.\\r\\n   6.	Unloading the sample wafer.\\r\\n7.	Loading new wafer with a new sample and run the 3 mtorr \\\"Ox SiC trial1 conductive clamping pre-stable original\\\" for 1hr30 minutes.\\r\\n8.	After this run we can change the N2 cylinder.\\r\\nAfter lunch.\\r\\n9.	Anurag prepared a new sample wafer.\\r\\n 10.	Ran 3 mtorr \\\"Ox SiC trial1 conductive clamping pre-stable original\\\" for 1hr30 minutes.\\r\\n•	at the main etch step,\\r\\nFor Sf6, O2\\r\\nHe - 3.0sccm-1.5sccm, table RF - 4.8w-4.3w(500w).\\r\\n•	No, He and Table RF fluctuation seen.\\r\\n•	Wafer was stable.\\r\\n   11.	After completion of the recipe.\\r\\n12.	Arvind sir (Facility team) replaced the N2 cylinder with a new cylinder.\\r\\n13.	Given direct connection of the N2 cylinder to the system.\\r\\n    14.	Set the regulator to 8.5psi i.e. 71.7 sccm.\\r\\n 15.	Handed over the System to Anurag for further Silicon carbide and Gan etch process.', 'Avinash, Oxford engineers and anurag', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3178_0.docx', 'Result: - Today with oxford engineers and with their process engineer we ran the 2 cycles of actual recipe 3 mtorr \\\"Ox SiC trial1 conductive clamping pre-stable original\\\" for 1hr30 minutes and it was stable, no wafer wobbling seen.'),
(3169, '2026-01-15 16:02:02', 2514, '', 'Lots of old wafer samples, EMT and facility-related material, CDs, old cleanroom books, desiccators, mask plates, wafer boxes of diff. size.', 'All Si waste has been put into Si waste dustbin, record of  every item which can be stored in inventory or given to EMT/facility has been kept and labelled. Kept in carboard boxes. Discarded items are kept in white gunny bags. Desiccators and mask plate boxes are shifted to 1.1/1.2 corridor.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
