(2971, '2026-01-16 18:17:53', 279, 'EMT', 'White powder observed on the gas shower plate.                         .                .              .', 'PECVD gas shower plate cleaning update\\r\\n1. Gas shower plate dip in BOI 6:1 solution for 4 hours\\r\\n2. After 4 hours of gas shower wash with di water, still some cleaning required\\r\\n3. Gas shower dip in IPA for 2 hours\\r\\n4. After 2 hours the gas shower was clean with di  water\\r\\n5. After cleaning it was observed that the some of the holes were block\\r\\n6. Gas shower head shown to Pradeep sir Ajit Sir and dipti mam\\r\\n7. Dipti mam suggests using a stove pin for cleaning the holes\\r\\n8. I request house keeping staff Mr. Shubham to go outside main gate by permission of Dipti mam\\r\\n9. Mr. Shubham bought the stove pin but was not able to clean the holes.\\r\\n10. After cleaning the gas shower plate plate was fixed in the PECVD chamber\\r\\n11. Chamber pump down for Low vacuum.\\r\\n12. Argon 100 sccm MFC replaced wit 500 sccm MFC \\r\\n13. System vacuum and observation', 'Vinayak and Shubankar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3243, '2026-01-16 18:32:08', 279, '', 'White powder observed on the gas shower plate.                          .          .                          .', 'PECVD gas shower plate cleaning update\\r\\n1. Gas shower plate dip in BOI 6:1 solution for 4 hours\\r\\n2. After 4 hours of gas shower wash with di water, still some cleaning required\\r\\n3. Gas shower dip in IPA for 2 hours\\r\\n4. After 2 hours the gas shower was clean with di water\\r\\n5. After cleaning it was observed that the some of the holes were block\\r\\n6. Gas shower head shown to Pradeep sir Ajit Sir and dipti mam\\r\\n7. Dipti mam suggests using a stove pin for cleaning the holes\\r\\n8. I request house keeping staff Mr. Shubham to go outside main gate by permission of Dipti mam\\r\\n9. Mr. Shubham bought the stove pin but was not able to clean the holes.\\r\\n10. After cleaning the gas shower plate plate was fixed in the PECVD chamber\\r\\n11. Chamber pump down for Low vacuum.\\r\\n12. Argon 100 sccm MFC replaced wit 500 sccm MFC\\r\\n13. System vacuum and observation', 'Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
