(3248, '2026-01-19 18:02:49', 2515, 'EMT and Process', 'Vent the chamber. Open chamber and found O ring is misplace. Cleaned O ring using IPA and lint free cloths. O ring connected properly and closed the chamber. Then turn ON the rotary pump, observing vacuum, vacuum reach 5.00mtorr in 39 minutes. Turn OFF the rotary pump and remove the bellow on pump side. Connected pump side external gauge and turn ON the rotary pump, observing vacuum, vacuum reach- 1.5E-3mbar in 7 minutes. Again turn OFF the rotary pump disconnected external gauge and connected bellow in the original position. Open the tool side bellow and connected external gauge. Observing vacuum reach 5.4E-3mbar in 12 minutes. Again  disconnected external gauge and connected bellow in the tool.', 'Vent the chamber. Open chamber and found O ring is misplace. Cleaned O ring using IPA and lint free cloths. O ring connected properly and closed the chamber. Then turn ON the rotary pump, observing vacuum, vacuum reach 5.00mtorr in 39 minutes. Turn OFF the rotary pump and remove the bellow on pump side. Connected pump side external gauge and turn ON the rotary pump, observing vacuum, vacuum reach- 1.5E-3mbar in 7 minutes. Again turn OFF the rotary pump disconnected external gauge and connected bellow in the original position. Open the tool side bellow and connected external gauge. Observing vacuum reach 5.4E-3mbar in 12 minutes. Again  disconnected external gauge and connected bellow in the tool.', 'Vikas Nishad , Vinayak Sir , Shubhankar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3294, '2026-01-19 18:51:36', 2457, 'EMT', '4-TEBE, source controller display issue.                                                                                                                                                                                                         .', 'Action taken: -\\r\\n* Checked the voltage supply of 25 pin D-type connector pins as per manual.\\r\\n* With respect to 13 pin ground, check the pin no \\r\\n9th pin -(-12vdc).\\r\\n25th pin - (11vdc).\\r\\n* Then, check the contact of the power switch with continuity and it was Ok.\\r\\n* Checked the display\\\'s ribbon cable, with respective ground(2nd) pin, check the pin no 1(0vdc), it should be 5vdc as per pin diagram.\\r\\n* Check the output voltage supply of the voltage regulator IC (LM7805) to which voltage is passing to pin  no 1 of the display\\\'s ribbon cable.\\r\\n* And it was showing 0vdc on the output terminal and 0vdc on the input terminal.\\r\\n* In the manual it is mentioned that LM7805 voltage regulator IC input pin get supply from the 23 pin D connector.\\r\\n\\r\\nObservation:- \\r\\n* checked the voltage supply of each pins of the C6 D connector from the E-beam power supply side.\\r\\n* And pin no 23 is not getting any supply to which it is not carrying forward the input voltage to LM7805 IC.\\r\\n*  To which it is not carrying out the voltage supply to display\\\'s pin no 1.\\r\\n* We have to open the E-beam power supply side panel to trace the pin 23,24 supply line connection.', 'Avinash, Vinayak sir and Vikas.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3294_0.docx', ''),
(3300, '2026-01-19 19:29:27', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Annex and New building checking renovation work,safety device checking, sample date expiry,chemical cabinets checking,fire extinguisher, GLD monitor,fire panels,ETC.', 'Annex and new building renovation work is going on 7th floor emergency door and 7.1 and 7.2 door fixing work done, 4.1 lab renovation work is going on and M-1 and MYR renovation work is going on. GLD monitor work afternoon time only nano and nano-2 toxic gas is On, fire panels showing 34 faults,remains all safety device are working fine.\\r\\nwet chemistry lab evening time sash open i closed the sash.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
