(2533, '2026-01-20 11:37:19', 726, 'Facility team', 'AC servicing done of following labs\\r\\n1. micro 1 caste AC -2\\r\\n2. old wet chemistry lab window AC - 2\\r\\n3. micro ups room spilt AC - 2\\r\\n4. chemical store room spilt AC - 2\\r\\n5. Nano ups room spilt AC - 3\\r\\nAC servicing done by vendor of all labs \\r\\nthis all AC servicing done by IIT they are not provided reports', 'Vendor has came to AC servicing on this following dates\\r\\n10, 11, 12, 16 December 2025\\r\\nThey checking all the electrical parameter\\r\\ncleaned filters of AC indoor body\\r\\ncheck Amp\\r\\nOutdoor unit cleaned\\r\\nchecked line pressure\\r\\nthis all AC servicing done by IIT they are not provided reports', 'Tejas Advilkar', 'IIT kailash refrigeration', 'NA', 'Satisfactory', 'this all AC servicing done by IIT they are not provided reports', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '', 'NA', 'Tejas Advilkar', '', 'NA'),
(3101, '2026-01-20 11:37:22', 2268, 'process', 'As per our standard baseline recipe, the development time for LOR 3B + PPR (S1813) at 130 dose is 20 secs. You have developed for only 16 secs, may be this is the reason for under development of your sample. We have done the baseline of this month and the  LOR + PPR  samples are properly developed in 20 secs. You can try developing your samples to 20 secs and kindly let us know about the results.', 'As per our standard baseline recipe, the development time for LOR 3B + PPR (S1813) at 130 dose is 20 secs. You have developed for only 16 secs, may be this is the reason for under development of your sample. We have done the baseline of this month and the  LOR + PPR  samples are properly developed in 20 secs. You can try developing your samples to 20 secs and kindly let us know about the results.', 'Gopika Suresh', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
