(1521, '2026-01-20 12:04:34', 297, 'sandeep', 'Email from Hexon has come which states: \\r\\nPlatform has been made as per similar system previously provided. We made this system bigger by 12” to accommodate some change that were required to cater the flow pressure requirement from 1st floor to the instrument room.\\r\\nSo please make those changes in shed and base as per the dimensions of this system which is already with you.', 'Standard Power supply cable provided with chiller is 8 Mtr  2 qty 3 core 4sq mm long but requirement is 25 mtr.\\r\\nBelow cables will be arranges by us and bring during installation.\\r\\n4 core 4sq mm-----30 mtr\\r\\n3 core 4sq mm------30 mtr', 'Sandeep Mane', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Chiller platform and chiller stand needs to be modified', 'prashant', '', ''),
