(3324, '2026-01-20 16:38:53', 1173, '', 'Sample was loaded on 16/01/2026, \\r\\n1) Rouging vacuum 5xE-2 mbar took 24 minutes to reach as it used to take earlier. \\r\\n2) High Vacuum ON at 05:21 pm on 16/01/2026, 5xE-6 mbar reached at 03:00 am on 17/01/2026. It took 10hr. 20min.(Since it was after office hour, @Ajit Kumar and night duty staff helped to monitor the vacuum)\\r\\n3) On 19/01/2026 to initiate a deposition run. noticed No power in the Electron beam power supply and Source controller.\\r\\n]4) Issue has been reported and EMT is looking into it. Placed a complaint in the equipment troubleshooting module as well.', 'Sample was loaded on 16/01/2026, \\r\\n1) Rouging vacuum 5xE-2 mbar took 24 minutes to reach as it used to take earlier. \\r\\n2) High Vacuum ON at 05:21 pm on 16/01/2026, 5xE-6 mbar reached at 03:00 am on 17/01/2026. It took 10hr. 20min.(Since it was after office hour, @Ajit Kumar and night duty staff helped to monitor the vacuum)\\r\\n3) On 19/01/2026 to initiate a deposition run. noticed No power in the Electron beam power supply and Source controller.\\r\\n]4) Issue has been reported and EMT is looking into it. Placed a complaint in the equipment troubleshooting module as well.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Troubleshooting is going on.'),
