(3254, '2026-01-20 16:42:12', 1173, '', 'After troubleshooting on 4TEBE, EMT was informed to check the system by a test run.\\r\\n1) Informed facility to turn ON chiller to turn ON system.\\r\\n2) The system turned ON.\\r\\n3) Ti target and Si wafer loaded \\r\\n4) The substrate shutter issue was noticed (close & open command was not proper)\\r\\n so I informed Vinayak sir. He tried to fix it but it didn\\\'t happen. (Added in troubleshooting module)\\r\\n5) Rouging vacuum 5xE-2 mbar took 24 minutes to reach as it used to take earlier. \\r\\n6) sample and Target is loaded, leaving the system for high vacuum 5xE-6 mbar', 'After troubleshooting on 4TEBE, EMT was informed to check the system by a test run.\\r\\n1) Informed facility to turn ON chiller to turn ON system.\\r\\n2) The system turned ON.\\r\\n3) Ti target and Si wafer loaded \\r\\n4) The substrate shutter issue was noticed (close & open command was not proper)\\r\\n so I informed Vinayak sir. He tried to fix it but it didn\\\'t happen. (Added in troubleshooting module)\\r\\n5) Rouging vacuum 5xE-2 mbar took 24 minutes to reach as it used to take earlier. \\r\\n6) sample and Target is loaded, leaving the system for high vacuum 5xE-6 mbar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
