(3248, '2026-01-20 18:20:46', 2515, 'EMT, Process', 'white powder under the base on the 3 pin holder in the process chamber                                                                                                                                              .', 'Vent the chamber and Opened chamber. Up the 3 pin by software and found white powder under the base on the 3 pin holder. Cleaned the white powder using IPA and Lint free clothes and using software set Down position for 3 pin and closed the chamber. Turn ON the low vacuum, vacuum reaches 5.0E-2torr in 4 minutes. Plasma test done by Shilpa ma’am. vacuum issue resolved and inform SO Shilpa ma\\\'am/ Shubhankar.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad, Shilpa, Shubhankar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3248_1.pdf', ''),
