(3294, '2026-01-20 19:00:07', 2457, 'EMT', '4-TEBE, source controller display issue.                                                                                                                  .', 'Source controller issue.\\r\\n\\r\\n* It was observed that the vacuum interlock led was not activated when giving power to the source controller.\\r\\n*  Inspected the vacuum sensor cable and found 2 pins have gone inside to which it is not connected properly to the connector.\\r\\n* Removed the 4 pin DIN mini male connector cover and aligned the 2 pins which were gone inside.\\r\\n* Connected back the sensor cable to the source controller and turned ON E-beam power supply.\\r\\n* Still no indication on vacuum Led.\\r\\n* while removing the vacuum sensor cable it was observed that the connector\\\'s pin track is damaged.\\r\\n* Tomorrow the first thing in the morning is to join the track and check it.', 'Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3294_1.docx', ''),
