(3287, '2026-01-21 11:13:45', 2495, 'EMT', 'Nano litho hot plate not functioning. The display not showing any value this was reported by user    .', 'bought it to bms room tried to turn it on but it was not function hence first checked the power cord which was found working properly hence checked the fuse and found one fuse broken so changed it with a new 5a fuse and tried to turn it on still the hot plate was not working hence opened the backside pannel and found the power connector was not working so replaced it with a spare and turned it on the hot plate was now working handed it back to hemant sir after which he checked it and found the hot plate working fine, power connector purchase request is being made', 'Rhifa, Vinayak', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
