(3388, '2026-01-21 17:44:23', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Annex and New building checking renovation work,safety device checking, sample date expiry,chemical cabinets checking,fire extinguisher, GLD monitor,fire panels,ETC.', 'Today I taken safety round 02.00PM and evening time 06.40PM 7th floor Door Hardware ,glass,ETC fixing work is going on in afternoon time 7.1,7.2 lab, 4.1 lab cemeting work is going on,M-1 and MYR construction work is going on, I prepare PPT please find the attachments below, all safety device are working fine, GLD screen monitor work afternoon time.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3388_0.pptx', ''),
(3389, '2026-01-21 17:48:34', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Safety checklist monthly.\\r\\n\\r\\n01.)4th floor main corridor and 2.1 and 2.2 inside lab smoke detector checking work status update in safety portal device list.\\r\\n\\r\\n02.) 2.1 and 2.2 GLD checking work.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.) Estate worker coming from eye and body shower checking.', '01.) 4th floor main corridor and 2.1 and 2.2 inside lab smoke detector checking work status update in safety portal device list.\\r\\n\\r\\n02. )2.1 and 2.2 GLD checking work status update in safety portal device list. ALL GLD checking work completed and also update in google sheet we can also check the sheet in google drive.\\r\\n\\r\\n03.) Estate Office vendor checking eye and body shower and complain forward to her supervisor MR Amit sir.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3389_0.jfif', ''),
