(3396, '2026-01-21 20:01:41', 95, 'Process Team', 'Raith-150 Z axis moment issue not resolved yesterday. Today with engineer online call we have tried further troubleshooting', 'Z axis moved without sample holder at upper exchange position it was moving. When we load the sample holder and tried the same it was stucking inbetween. This repeats many times', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
