(3018, '2026-01-22 13:18:29', 928, 'Process', 'Multiple samples checked for development issue along with LOR3B+S1813 samples, no issue found during development.', 'Though there is no issue during development still 2\\\" PPR Spinner (DSA)  has been replaced by 1.2 lab AZ PPR Spinner.', 'Pankaj Kumar Gound', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'No issue found.', '', 'uploads/3018_3.docx', 'As per discussion with User, User was not having any issue after reported this issue.'),
(3018, '2026-01-22 13:24:51', 928, '', 'Checked Multiple Samples, no issue found during development.\\r\\nUser was not having any issue after raising this issue.', 'Baseline Run done successfully.\\r\\nChecked multiple sample along with LOR PPR.\\r\\nDevelopment was successful.\\r\\nTough there is no issue found during the development still DSA AZ PPR spinner has replaced with 1.2 lab AZ PPR Spinner.', 'Pankaj Kumar Gound', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'User was not having any issue after raising this issue.'),
(3264, '2026-01-22 15:14:48', 928, 'Process', 'Both the spinner tested with multiple samples, no issue found during the run, Thickness measurements done with profilometer.\\r\\nIt is near about 1 um  for both the Spinner', 'Though no issue found in any of these spinner still we have replaced the spinner as per user request.\\r\\nWe have replaced DSA  AZ PPR Spinner with 1.2 lab AZ PPR Spinner.', 'Pankaj Kumar Gound', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3264_1.docx', 'User can run the recipe in AZ PPR Spinner let us know the feedback.'),
(3385, '2026-01-22 15:20:18', 2515, 'EMT', 'The spinner vacuum line chuck holder was blocked with resist. The diaphragm pump did not create a good vacuum.', 'Cleaned chuck and chuck holder using acetone and lint free cloths.\\r\\nnew diaphragm pump installed and testing done. Spinner working fine and vacuum value showing 18 on display. Infromed SO Pankaj Sir for using. please see the attached service report.', 'Vikas Kumar Nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3385_0.pdf', ''),
(3304, '2026-01-22 16:05:03', 1173, '', 'Due to place constraint, TMAH etching processes become difficult to do due to spin coater and hotplate which are kept inside the TMAH wet bench in wet chemistry Lab so It has been decided that\\r\\n1) With the help of EMT, spin coater and hotplate will keep inside cupboard of TMAH wet bench when not in use.\\r\\n2) If any user wants to use the spin-coater and hot plate, the user needs to send an email one day in advance so that the temporary setup can be done with the help of the EMT team.\\r\\n3) Once the spin coater and hot plate requirement is completed, it will be again kept into the cupboard of the TMAH wet bench.', 'On 21/01/2026, in presence of user Himanshu and EMT, a Spincoater along with pump and hot plate has been kept inside the cupboard of TMAH wet bench and also explained the required connections which needs to be done.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
