(3141, '2026-01-28 12:02:28', 89, '', 'Email was received from Dr. Deepti with action item to EMT:\\r\\nEMT to come up with the plan to facilitate these gases in the chamber along with MFC', 'As per discussion (Deepti, Sandeep, Ajit, Pradeep), \\r\\nBelow is the possibility as per the request received: \\r\\n\\r\\n1. PN2 is available as a purge gas for the PH3 & B2H6 gas lines which passes through the MFC. So N2 can be used\\r\\n\\r\\n2. For He, the PN2 cylinder can be removed and He cylinder can be connected.\\r\\n\\r\\nThere may be longer pumping time required for He gas usage as compared to N2 gas.', 'Team heads', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
