(3547, '2026-01-28 18:14:13', 2457, 'EMT', 'Request from Mamta ji to install Molybedenum Precursor.                                                                                                                                                   .', 'Went to Nano 1 Lab with Pradeep sir to take the eyes on and hands on training on precursor change.\\r\\nMamta ji (SO) did head space purge before changing the precursor.\\r\\nPradeep sir removed the precursor and changed it, Now port 3: TMA and Port 5 has HF precursor. \\r\\nAfter installing new precursor SO did a head space purge again to remove any trap air.', 'Pradeep sir and Avinash', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(3525, '2026-01-28 18:33:07', 2515, 'EMT', 'The Chuck and Chuck holder were blocked due to resist. Spinner vacuum line pipe broken from the vacuum valve side.', 'The power cord cable was disconnected . Removed the vacuum line, CDA line, and drain line. Shifted the spinner from the Nano Litho Lab to the BMS room. Opened the spinner lid and removed the chuck and chuck holder. Cleaned the chuck and chuck holder using IPA,  lint-free cloth. Checked the vacuum line and found a pipe broken from the teflon ferrule fitting (vacuum valve side). Open the teflon ferrule fitting and cutting broken pipe . Assembled teflon ferrule fitting and connected the vacuum valve side. Turn ON the power and check the vacuum. The spinner is working fine and the vacuum is showing value 21. The issue is  resolved. Inform SO Hemant sir for using spinner. please see the attached EMT service report.', 'Vikas nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3525_0.pdf', ''),
(2224, '2026-01-28 19:56:01', 928, '', 'Chrome mask optimization is done.There is issue with resist on mask.\\r\\nDevelopment is unsuccessful after mask writing in optimized timing, Chrome etching is successful but while etching resist in Acetone, mask gone bad.', 'Chrome mask optimization is done.There is issue with resist on mask.\\r\\nDevelopment is unsuccessful after mask writing in optimized timing, Chrome etching is successful but while etching resist in Acetone, mask gone bad.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2224_2.pdf', ''),
(3238, '2026-01-28 20:00:58', 928, '', 'Imaging done successfully but during resist etching in Acetone, whole mask gone bad within few second.', 'Imaging done successfully but during resist etching in Acetone, whole mask gone bad within few second.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
