(3617, '2026-01-28 22:24:56', 2465, 'Facility Team Pawan kumar s.', 'At the date of 28 January time ( 01:30 am )in night , n2 plant low pressure alarm triggered, i checked immediately and found there was pipe cracked also push fit was cracked.', 'After the found leakage in pipe immediately closed pressure valve and changed pipe as well as push fit.\\r\\nalso in parallel i swap another stand by plant for backup. after that i reseat alarm and in cda tank pressure checked found pressure 100psi.\\r\\nthis all activity done with the help of prakash and on call Arvind R.', 'Pawan kumar sahu', '', '', '', '', 'pipe and push fit', 'na', 'na', '', '', 'Pawan kumar sahu', 'uploads/3617_0.jpeg', 'Plant working fine .'),
(3613, '2026-01-28 23:08:53', 2019, 'Prakash, Pawan,Arvind.', 'yesterday Night shift N2 Plant alarm trigger due to Rupturing pipe BMS monitor system start ringing. I Help to Facility team.', 'Yesterday Around 01.30AM Date:-28/01/2026 BMS room N2 plant monitor system start ringing, Me and Pawan going inside N2 plant and checking and found issue and arvind is in Call, we found pipe is Rupturing, with the help of cutter cut the ruptruing pipe and fixed back to place, we observe countinue gas pressue gauge and indicators, After few Mints again new issue is created gas pushfit is fallen down due to high pressure we chaned new pushfit and buypass plant A to B, after 10/15 Mints gas pressure start increasing and alarm is reset checked all nano and nano-2, 1.1 tools no alarm is coming, everything is fine. Please find the images below.', 'Prakash, Pawan,Arvind.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3613_0.jfif', ''),
(3614, '2026-01-28 23:13:49', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Annex and New building checking renovation work, safety device checking, sample date expiry, chemical cabinets checking, fire extinguisher, GLD monitor, fire panels, ETC.', 'nano new building and annex side found violation i prepare PPT please find the attachments below remains labs and safety device working fine.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3614_0.pptx', ''),
