(3101, '2026-01-30 12:28:19', 2268, 'process', 'As per our standard baseline recipe, the development time for LOR 3B + PPR (S1813) at 130 dose is 20 secs. You have developed for only 16 secs, may be this is the reason for under development of your sample. We have done the baseline of this month and the LOR + PPR samples are properly developed in 20 secs. You can try developing your samples to 20 secs and kindly let us know about the results.', 'As per our standard baseline recipe, the development time for LOR 3B + PPR (S1813) at 130 dose is 20 secs. You have developed for only 16 secs, may be this is the reason for under development of your sample. We have done the baseline of this month and the LOR + PPR samples are properly developed in 20 secs. You can try developing your samples to 20 secs and kindly let us know about the results.', 'Gopika Suresh', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
