(3659, '2026-01-30 15:41:53', 2312, 'Facility Team', 'During the IR gun liquid filter drier readings taking i was found drier is chocked of compressor no.4 I was discussed with Prashant sir and Amit sir and then we decided we have replaced the drier with new drier', 'sending mail to Sandeep sir for inventory approval of Drier then take drier from inventory then we are going replaced the drier then turn off the main MCB of compressor no.4 then we closed the valve of discharge line then dismantle old drier and replaced the new drier then take leaking testing properly and found there is no leak then we start the AHU compressor no.4 and it\\\'s working properly \\r\\nIR readings of Drier before replace \\r\\ninlet - 46.4\\r\\nDrier - 47.8\\r\\noutlet - 28.4\\r\\n\\r\\nIR Readings of drier After replaced \\r\\nInlet- 40.8\\r\\nDrier- 42.5\\r\\nOutlet- 45.7', 'Tejas Advilkar , Prashant Manjrekar sir', '', '', '', '', 'Drier-DMH-305F', 'NA', 'NA', '30-01-2026', 'NA', 'Tejas Advilkar', 'uploads/3659_0.jpeg', 'NA'),
