(3724, '2026-02-01 18:43:48', 89, '', 'This request has been sent to SO to check and update as per below details:\\r\\n\\r\\nPradeep Nyaupane 01 Feb 2026 Complaint ID: 3736	\\r\\nUV-Ozone Cleaner_7.1 Lab	\\r\\n\\r\\nThere is a complaint logged as per below details. Request SO to let us know on this.', 'This request has been sent to SO to check and update as per below details:\\r\\n\\r\\nPradeep Nyaupane 01 Feb 2026 Complaint ID: 3736	\\r\\nUV-Ozone Cleaner_7.1 Lab	\\r\\n\\r\\nThere is a complaint logged as per below details. Request SO to let us know on this.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Rhifa to follow up on this with the SO and do the needful from EMT side.', '', '', ''),
