(3715, '2026-02-01 18:54:01', 89, 'EMT, Process', 'The MFC value was stuck at 23 even with the flow was set to 0 sccm.\\r\\n                                        .', 'The MFC value was stuck at 23 sccm even when no set point was given. Evacuation at this flow was done and checked, no change in chamber pressure was seen which means the value shown is an error.\\r\\n\\r\\nRemoved the MFC cable and refixed it and checked, the error value is now resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nChecked by Shubhankar and Dinesh Rotake', 'Pradeep', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Dr. Ajit was also involved during the troubleshooting'),
