(3572, '2026-02-01 19:04:30', 89, '', 'As updated by Aaquib:\\r\\nInitially, on the gas stabilization step, He flow was around 10-12sccm.\\r\\n\\r\\nBut as the strike 1 step started, He flow increased, and so does the reflection power. It gave the error of He excess flow.', 'After contacting Oxford engineer, the following updates were done by Aaquib:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe He flow has been changed by Sateesh.\\r\\nRest all the  parameters are the same.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe standard recipe gave He flow error,while the edited one ran smoothly.', 'Aaquib', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
