(3738, '2026-02-01 19:44:02', 2161, '', 'Weekly Diesel Generator trail to be done and fill checklist in electrical facility reading log -Engine Started &amp; Engine Stopped date and time, Engine oil pressure, Engine coolant Temp, Engine battery Voltage, Engine Run Time, Maintenance Alarm, Generator voltage-(L1+N,<br />rnL2+N,L3+N),Generator voltage-(L1+L2,L2+L3,L3+L1),Generator Frequency, Generator Current, Generator Earth Current, Generator Load [L1 (KW), L2 (KW), L3 (KW)], Generator Load-(L1 %,,L2 %,L3 %), Generator load Total (KW%), Generator load Total (KVA%), Generator power factor ,Generator Load KVAr (L1 (kvar) ,L2 (kvar),L3 (kvar)), Generator Load KVAr (Total KVAr%),Generator Load KWH Phase sequence, Active Config, Main voltage , Status , On Load ,AMP, Engine Speed, Generator Load. Testing Done. all Parameter Found Ok', 'Weekly Diesel Generator trail to be done and fill checklist in electrical facility reading log -Engine Started &amp; Engine Stopped date and time, Engine oil pressure, Engine coolant Temp, Engine battery Voltage, Engine Run Time, Maintenance Alarm, Generator voltage-(L1+N,<br />rnL2+N,L3+N),Generator voltage-(L1+L2,L2+L3,L3+L1),Generator Frequency, Generator Current, Generator Earth Current, Generator Load [L1 (KW), L2 (KW), L3 (KW)], Generator Load-(L1 %,,L2 %,L3 %), Generator load Total (KW%), Generator load Total (KVA%), Generator power factor ,Generator Load KVAr (L1 (kvar) ,L2 (kvar),L3 (kvar)), Generator Load KVAr (Total KVAr%),Generator Load KWH Phase sequence, Active Config, Main voltage , Status , On Load ,AMP, Engine Speed, Generator Load. Testing Done. all Parameter Found Ok', 'omkar Khedekar', '', '', '', '', 'Na', 'Na', 'Na', '', '', '', 'uploads/3738_0.xlsx', 'Dg Working Fine'),
(1486, '2026-02-01 19:47:44', 89, '', 'New shutter and X-Ray tube installation done on Jan 5 2026\\r\\nBut the PXL error is still there as reported by SO after checking the tool for 1 week (updated on Jan 15 by SO - Gopika)', 'Email has been sent to Mr. Sharad on Jan 16 2026\\r\\n\\r\\nJan 17: Reply from Sharad:\\r\\nAfter replacing the shutter unit, the shutter-related issue has been resolved. However, regarding the PXL error, as suggested earlier, the MHPS needs to be replaced.\\r\\n\\r\\nJust to confirm, please share the log files collected on the PC. I will forward them to Rigaku for further review.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
