(1995, '2026-02-01 19:55:58', 89, '', 'Email was sent about the update on this on Jan 16 2026:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"\\\" The data transfer from system PCs to another location can be started from next week.\\r\\nAt first we can start with the access to only process team members, and get feedback for 2 weeks, and later decide on how to open it for users.\\r\\n\\r\\n@ Deepti, please let us know if this is ok, or any other suggestions. \\\"\\\"', 'Email was sent about the update on this on Jan 16 2026:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"\\\" The data transfer from system PCs to another location can be started from next week.\\r\\nAt first we can start with the access to only process team members, and get feedback for 2 weeks, and later decide on how to open it for users.\\r\\n\\r\\n@ Deepti, please let us know if this is ok, or any other suggestions. \\\"\\\"', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '06-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
