(2083, '2026-02-01 20:07:05', 89, '', 'Jan 23: Email received from vendor:\\r\\nHello Ma\\\'am,\\r\\nThis is to inform your that the \\r\\nDate and Place of Expiry of the LC is 10-05-2026  Negotiating Bank\\r\\n\\r\\nSince the payment terms are 100% through LC 90% against delivery and 10% after installation, the installation needs to be completed comfortably within the LC validity so there isn\\\'t an issue for the payment. Kindly note this and allow us to complete the installation. If our engineer needs to visit again we can work it out during his next visit as he usually visit at least twice in a year\\r\\n\\r\\nIf for any reason installation is delayed, please remit the balance 10% amount as it is covered under LC. We will ensure that the installation is done whenever you are ready. \\r\\n\\r\\nRegards,\\r\\nASHER VINOD H\\r\\nManager - Technical Sales \\r\\nEL CAMINO TECHNOLOGIES PVT.LTD\\r\\nMobile: +91-9606028704\\r\\nTel: +91-80-23640503', 'Jan 23: Email received from vendor:\\r\\nHello Ma\\\'am,\\r\\nThis is to inform your that the \\r\\nDate and Place of Expiry of the LC is 10-05-2026  Negotiating Bank\\r\\n\\r\\nSince the payment terms are 100% through LC 90% against delivery and 10% after installation, the installation needs to be completed comfortably within the LC validity so there isn\\\'t an issue for the payment. Kindly note this and allow us to complete the installation. If our engineer needs to visit again we can work it out during his next visit as he usually visit at least twice in a year\\r\\n\\r\\nIf for any reason installation is delayed, please remit the balance 10% amount as it is covered under LC. We will ensure that the installation is done whenever you are ready. \\r\\n\\r\\nRegards,\\r\\nASHER VINOD H\\r\\nManager - Technical Sales \\r\\nEL CAMINO TECHNOLOGIES PVT.LTD\\r\\nMobile: +91-9606028704\\r\\nTel: +91-80-23640503', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Deepti', '', ''),
