(1458, '2026-02-03 17:49:39', 2457, 'EMT, Process', 'Training on PDS tool as per update SOP with Shilpa ji and Minita ji.                                                                .', 'On 08-01-2026, Thursdayrnrn1. Went to 1.1 lab on PDS Tool.rn2. taken the softcopy of the updated SOP with me.rn3. before starting the process, Process chamber vacuum was 5.20E-5 Torr.rn4. Started the process as per updated SOP.rn5. At 6th step, &quot;c&quot; point about the gas flow, when shilpa ji set the PH3 gas flow to 60 sccm, present value was not showing 60 sccm, to which chamber pressure was also fluctuating.rn6. she has a concerns that, she has to assume it by pressure value that the gas is introduce or not.rn7. I have cleared her that we have issues with the MFC fluctuations and with baratron gauge.rn8. We continued with the process and set the source power, adjust the APC position and set Bias power.rn9. Used the stopwatch to count the time for the process.rn10. after running the manually set recipe, plasma strike and wafer broke inside the process chamber.rn11. We stop the process.rn12. Shilpa ji has some queries and doubt regarding to chamber pressure and APC position mode and MFC fluctuation to which i told her we have to look into the external gauge as baratron gauge is not working and mail has bee sent to OEM.rn13. Shilpa ji will mail regarding to the queries she had.', 'Avinash (EMT) and Shilpa ji and Minita ji(Process)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Shilpa ji has some queries and doubt regarding to chamber pressure and APC position mode and MFC fluctuation to which i told her we have to look into the external gauge as baratron gauge is not working and mail has bee sent to OEM. Shilpa ji will mail regarding to the queries she had.'),
(1458, '2026-02-03 17:50:54', 2457, 'EMT and Process', 'Training on PDS tool as per update SOP with Shilpa ji and Minita ji.                                                                 .', 'Today 09-01-2025, Fridayrnrn1. Today plans was to clean the Process chamber and Load Lock chamber as sample wafer was broken while in process.rn2. Closed the gate valve manually.rn3. Turned off the turbo pump manually.rn4. Manually vented the Process chamber by purging the PN2 gas to process chamber 20 times. for eg:- purging the PN2 gas and then opening the rough valve of the process chamber to remove the toxic gases, repeated this step for 20 times.rn5. again purge the PN2 gas into the process chamber until the external gauge controller showed the 720 mbar, to open the process chamber lid.rn6. grnGauge controller reach to 720 mbar and we, opened the process chamber lid.rn7. removed the broken sample wafer with tweezer and collected it in lint-free cloth..rn8. Started cleaning the process chamber and Load Lock chamber with Vacuum cleaner, IPA, Scoth-brite and Lint-free cloth.rn9. Once done with the cleaning of the both the chambers.rn10. Closed both the chamber lids.rn11. Kept the Load Lock chamber for Low vacuum, Low vacuum completed.rn12. kept the process chamber for pumping manually by taking the rough vacuum&gt;opening the gate valve and turning on the turbo pump.rn13. Achieved high vacuum 8.49E-5 Torr in 17 minutes.rn14. Told Shilpa ji and Minita ji to start with the training but they were not able to follow the current updated SOP.rn15. They ask for the New Updated SOP as Ajit sir as mailed about it.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Told Shilpa ji and Minita ji to start with the training but they were not able to follow the current updated SOP. They ask for the New Updated SOP as Ajit sir as mailed about it.'),
