(3779, '2026-02-04 11:44:59', 89, '', 'As updated by VOYAGER engineer, he will visit in the next week to look into the issue of UPS\\r\\nTill then the tool can be used as lab UPS will provide backup to the tool', 'Email from Raith engineer:\\r\\n\\r\\nAs of now the system is backed up by your lab UPS  and hence it can be used as it is.  As soon as possible I will visit and check what is the reason for the issue.  For this we need to turn OFF the system completely and check the UPS\\r\\n1) by restarting it\\r\\n2) Check for any issue with batteries/ connections in the battery pack.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '20-02-2026', '', '', '', ''),
