(1871, '2026-02-04 13:25:36', 89, '', 'As discussed with Prof Dipankar, Deepti & Pradeep, Susceptor purchase is to be done for AS ONE 100 system.\\r\\n2 new previously ordered susceptor for AS ONE 150 is available.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis purchase is on hold for sometime till we get a confirmation from Elcamino / Annealsys on the contamination issue.\\r\\n\\r\\nReminder email sent to Asher Vinod (Elcamino) for confirming about contamination from Annealsys.', 'As discussed with Prof Dipankar, Deepti & Pradeep, Susceptor purchase is to be done for AS ONE 100 system.\\r\\n2 new previously ordered susceptor for AS ONE 150 is available.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis purchase is on hold for sometime till we get a confirmation from Elcamino / Annealsys on the contamination issue.\\r\\n\\r\\nReminder email sent to Asher Vinod (Elcamino) for confirming about contamination from Annealsys.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Discussed with Deepti before sending reminder email about the contamination to Asher Vinod. \\r\\nEmail subject: IITB - Susceptor Requirement - For AS150 and AS100\\r\\n\\r\\nReminder sent on Feb 2026'),
