(2085, '2026-02-04 13:29:50', 89, '', 'Olympus Microscope camera and software with new PC is planned from Feb 16-19 2026.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter this is done, there will be no issue of data transfer as both the option of CD write and online data transfer will be available.', 'Olympus Microscope camera and software with new PC is planned from Feb 16-19 2026.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter this is done, there will be no issue of data transfer as both the option of CD write and online data transfer will be available.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '20-02-2026', '', '', '', 'This issue has been pending for long to close as the reported issue gets resolved after restarting the PC.\\r\\nAlso for working on the Olympus Microscope upgrade, there was no other Microscope available. Now Nano 2 new Microscope is available, hence upgrade is planned.'),
