(3784, '2026-02-04 17:21:46', 89, '', 'As reported, the N2 value is stuck at 23 even when the set value is 0sccm.\\r\\n                         .', 'The MFC is suspected to be faulty.\\r\\nPreviously the same issue (of N2/Ar MFC value is stuck at 23sccm) was reported. At that time, the MFC cable was removed and reinstalled & the issue was resolved.\\r\\n\\r\\nBut since the same issue is again repeated, the MFC is suspected to be faulty.\\r\\n\\r\\nReplaced the Ar MFC with O2 MFC (200sccm) from O2 line and installed another 100sccm Ar MFC in spare\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter replacement the issue is resolved.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
