(3784, '2026-02-04 17:33:29', 89, '', 'Regarding the process pressure, the set value is 0.06 Torr for SF6=20 SCCM and N2=5 SCCM, the actual process pressure 0.085\\r\\n\\r\\nHence, informed Dr. Dinesh to set the process pressure to 0.085 as there may be software error due to difference in the set & actual process pressure', 'Regarding the process pressure, the set value is 0.06 Torr for SF6=20 SCCM and N2=5 SCCM, the actual process pressure 0.085\\r\\n\\r\\nHence, informed Dr. Dinesh to set the process pressure to 0.085 as there may be software error due to difference in the set & actual process pressure', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
