(2567, '2026-02-05 04:29:00', 726, 'AHU Chiller Team', 'Checked and found the nano 1 air shower air flow is very low, due to hepa filter being blocked     .', 'Discussed in the coordination meeting to blackout the system of nano and nano litho lab for 1 hour 9 am to 10 PM, step by step troubleshooting.\\r\\n1) Switched off the air shower\\r\\n2) Removed both side front panels\\r\\n3) Checked if any broken or damaged parts \\r\\n4) Start the airshower and took FPM Reading, no reading showing\\r\\n5) Removed hepa filter and started the airshower and took FPM reading, showing above 4000 FPM,\\r\\n6) Cleaned the air shower with a wet cloth.\\r\\n7) Bypass the hepa filter because the motor will get damaged if the air circulation does not happen, and run the air shower.\\r\\n8) The filter needs to be procured.', 'Abhay/Amit/omkar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/2567_4.jfif', 'Hepa filter needs to be procured.'),
(3475, '2026-02-05 04:42:55', 726, 'AHU Chiller Team', 'The following material list has been sent to team head for approval. Work will start soon once the material is received.', 'All the materials are in UPVC.\\r\\n1) 1/2 inch pipe -35 MTR\\r\\n2)1 inch MTA ( brass thread) - 2 nos\\r\\n3) 3/4 inch MTA ( brass thread) - 2 nos\\r\\n4) 1 inch* 1/2 inch Reducer - 2 nos\\r\\n5) 3/4 inch * 1/2 inch reducer - 2 nos\\r\\n6) Elbow 1/2 inch - 24 nos\\r\\n7)1/2 inch union - 4 nos\\r\\n8)1/2 inch UPVC ball valve - 2 nos\\r\\n9) 1/2 inch coupling - 10 nos\\r\\n10) 1 inch pipe - 1 MTR\\r\\n11) 3/4 inch pipe - 1 MTR\\r\\n12) UPVC solvent 500grm - 1 bottle', 'Prashant/Abhay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'The material list has been sent for approval.'),
