(3828, '2026-02-06 09:18:54', 2495, 'EMT', 'Remove the vacuum gauges connected to the right side of the furnace. Disconnect the rotary pump vacuum line. Loosen and open the glass tube holding plate bolts on both the left and right sides of the furnace. Carefully remove the g lass tube. Remove the cylindrical chamber. Remove the furnace heater and thermocouple from the furnace assembly. Open the furnace base plate bolts and remove the furnace from the CVD bench. Disconnect the controller wire and the thermocouple wire connected to the furnace.', 'Remove the vacuum gauges connected to the right side of the furnace. Disconnect the rotary pump vacuum line. Loosen and open the glass tube holding plate bolts on both the left and right sides of the furnace. Carefully remove the g lass tube. Remove the cylindrical chamber. Remove the furnace heater and thermocouple from the furnace assembly. Open the furnace base plate bolts and remove the furnace from the CVD bench. Disconnect the controller wire and the thermocouple wire connected to the furnace. All dismantled parts are handed over to Sera ji', 'Rhifa ,Vikas nishad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3828_0.pdf', ''),
(3938, '2026-02-06 11:40:30', 2527, 'Process', 'checking the training materials accessibility via online and the loading time of the EBL tool is high or too high due to the larger size', 'As per my observation and personal checking, all the training content are accessible online. \\r\\n\\r\\nFew training video with large training time like \\r\\n\\r\\n      1) MYR1 - for ML3 - duration more then 3 + 2  hr \\r\\n\\r\\n      2) EBL Voyger - Training video 1, duration more then 43 hr \\r\\n\\r\\n   are taking time to get loaded based on available internet speed and the other training video of EBL Voyger (http://10.107.103.3/moodle/TRAINING/voyager.php ) are not getting loaded.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll other training materials are accessible online. \\r\\n\\r\\nSince process team concentrate mostly for the process development and tools operation, So I am forwarding it to IT team to take a look into the possible resolution for it \\r\\n\\r\\n@ Priynaka Kindly check if we can look into the root cause to resolve the issue. ', 'Dr. Ajit Kumar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'request forwarded to IT team to check and find the solution', 'Priynaka Bhole', '', ''),
