(3837, '2026-02-06 14:58:03', 1787, 'Facility team', 'There was a complaint from lab user - 2D lab AC in DR1 (the new AC, Blue Star) is not cooling properly kindly check.', 'We check inner and out door unit and found ac working ok .\\r\\nbut cooling issue is until . ac is under warranty and recently installed by EMD . Complaint raised to iitb complaint portal and complaint no.  347873', 'Prashant M.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Prashant M.', 'uploads/3837_0.jpeg', ''),
