(3530, '2026-02-06 15:10:59', 1787, 'Facility team', 'The present chiller is not sufficient capacity of cooling water of 5th floor instruments, water temperature is increasing during the process, chiller is working on full load.', 'Lab user nitin patil suggest us for 5 TR chiller installation we call vendor for visit they visit and inspect site. vendor will send details and quotation for PHE chiller with out water tank and with out secondary pump .', 'Prashant M.', 'Wel-tech refrigeration', '9819945138', 'Satisfactory', 'waiting for quotation and details also specification .', '', '', '', '', '', 'Prashant M.', '', ''),
