(1520, '2026-02-06 15:17:25', 1787, 'Facility team', 'The PPMS lab condition is very bad ( civil structure damaged ), because of this, the chiller installation work has been kept on hold until the next update.	The PPMS lab condition is very bad ( civil structure damaged ), because of this, the chiller installation work has been kept on hold until the next update.		Work on Hold\\r\\n27 Jan 2026 02:43 PM\\r\\nPrashant Manjarekar	New Ac from EMD ( Electrical Maintenance Division) has received on Friday 24 January 2026, and kept in inventory room. PPMS lab renovation work is in progress, after renovation work finish ac installation installation will perform', 'The PPMS lab condition is very bad ( civil structure damaged ), because of this, the chiller installation work has been kept on hold until the next update.	The PPMS lab condition is very bad ( civil structure damaged ), because of this, the chiller installation work has been kept on hold until the next update.		Work on Hold\\r\\n27 Jan 2026 02:43 PM\\r\\nPrashant Manjarekar	New Ac from EMD ( Electrical Maintenance Division) has received on Friday 24 January 2026, and kept in inventory room. PPMS lab renovation work is in progress, after renovation work finish ac installation installation will perform', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Prashant M.', '', 'Plan has been changed , after room renovation ac will install by vendor.'),
(1521, '2026-02-06 15:22:24', 1787, 'Facility team', 'PPMS chiller, Plate form extension work, MS Stand extension work and old chiller dismantling work has been completed, New chiller kept on stand remaining work is in progress.', 'PPMS chiller, Plate form extension work, MS Stand extension work and old chiller dismantling work has been completed, New chiller kept on stand remaining work is in progress.', '', 'Hexon chiller', '9323141868', 'Satisfactory', 'na', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'ppms lab is in under renovation . so this unit will shift to spintronics lab and chiller also will shift . required new civil platform. new plan has been submitted to sandeep sir with plan  and checklist.'),
