(3973, '2026-02-06 20:41:01', 2019, 'Prakash Mehra', 'Nano new Building 4th floor due to new tube light insatlation work is going on by EMD vendor Around 05.59PM fire alarm trigger 4th floor main lift side hooter plsu smoke detector L02/D009.', 'When Fire Alarm is trigger I turn On BMS room Alarm after that I checked Main fire panel and find out the location. 4th floor main lift lobby, I visit the side and found 4th floor new tubelight installation work is going on by EMD, I muted the hooter switch and slient the main fire panel press eight time 1 and enter, after that i go up and taken images for active smoke detector and removed the SD, clean it by N2 gun, Reset the main fire panel, EMD team work is completed after that i fixed back the Smoke detector. fire panel is working fine, Turn ON the main hooter switch new building, and start preparing fire incident report today evening. Please find the attachments below.', 'Prakash Mehra', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'uploads/3973_0.pdf', ''),
